msgid "The %language translation file is not available at the translation server. <a href=\":url\">Choose a different language</a> or select English and translate your website later."
msgstr "在翻譯伺服器上找不到 %language 語言的翻譯檔。<a href=\":url\">請選擇不同的語言</a>或先選擇英語之後再來翻譯您的網站。"

