msgid "The Breakpoint module keeps track of the height, width, and resolution breakpoints where a responsive design needs to change in order to respond to different devices being used to view the site. This module does not have a user interface. For more information, see the <a href=\":docs\">online documentation for the Breakpoint module</a>."
msgstr "「岔斷點」模組可追蹤回應式設計需要變更的高度、寬度和解析度岔斷點，以回應用來檢視網路的各種裝置。此模組沒有使用者介面。如需相關資訊，請參閱<a href=\":docs\">「岔斷點」模組的線上文件</a>。"

msgid "Terminology"
msgstr "術語"

msgid "Breakpoint"
msgstr "分界點 (Breakpoint)"

msgid "A breakpoint separates the height or width of viewports (screens, printers, and other media output types) into steps. For instance, a width breakpoint of 40em creates two steps: one for widths up to 40em and one for widths above 40em. Breakpoints can be used to define when layouts should shift from one form to another, when images should be resized, and other changes that need to respond to changes in viewport height or width."
msgstr "岔斷點會將檢視區（螢幕、印表機及其他媒體輸出類型）的高度或寬度拆成各個步驟。例如，寬度岔斷點 40em 會建立兩個步驟：一個用於最多 40em 的寬度，另一個用於超過 40em 的寬度。岔斷點可用來定義何時應該將佈置的形式轉換成另一形格式、何時應該調整影像大小，以及為了回應檢視區高度或寬度變更而需要的其他變更。"

msgid "Media query"
msgstr "媒體查詢"

msgid "<a href=\":w3\">Media  queries</a> are a formal way to encode breakpoints. For instance, a width breakpoint at 40em would be written as the media query \"(min-width: 40em)\". Breakpoints are really just media queries with some additional meta-data, such as a name and multiplier information."
msgstr "<a href=\":w3\">媒體查詢</a>是將岔斷點編碼的正式方式。例如，寬度岔斷點 40em 可以寫成媒體查詢 \"(min-width: 40em)\"。岔斷點實際上只是媒體查詢，再加上一些額外的 meta 資料，例如名稱及乘數資訊。"

msgid "Resolution multiplier"
msgstr "解析度乘數"

msgid "Resolution multipliers are a measure of the viewport's device resolution, defined to be the ratio between the physical pixel size of the active device and the <a href=\"http://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Device_independent_pixel\">device-independent pixel</a> size. The Breakpoint module defines multipliers of 1, 1.5, and 2; when defining breakpoints, modules and themes can define which multipliers apply to each breakpoint."
msgstr "解析度乘數用於測量檢視區的裝置解析度，定義為作用中裝置的實體像素大小及<a href=\"http://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Device_independent_pixel\">與裝置無關的像素</a>大小之間的比例。「岔斷點」模組定義的乘數為 1、1.5 和 2；定義岔斷點時，模組和佈景主題可以定義要套用至每一個岔斷點的乘數。"

msgid "Breakpoint group"
msgstr "分界點 (Breakpoint) 群組"

msgid "Breakpoints can be organized into groups. Modules and themes should use groups to separate out breakpoints that are meant to be used for different purposes, such as breakpoints for layouts or breakpoints for image sizing."
msgstr "Breakpoints (中斷點) 可以組織成幾個不同的群組，模組與主題可以利用群組來為不同的使用目的獨立出專有的中斷點，例如版面 (layouts) 用的中斷點，或是影像大小用的中斷點。"

msgid "Defining breakpoints and breakpoint groups"
msgstr "定義岔斷點及岔斷點群組"

msgid "Modules and themes can use the API provided by the Breakpoint module to define breakpoints and breakpoint groups, and to assign resolution multipliers to breakpoints."
msgstr "模組和佈景主題可以使用「岔斷點」模組提供的 API 來定義岔斷點及岔斷點群組，以及指派解析度乘數給岔斷點。"

msgid "Manages breakpoints and breakpoint groups for responsive designs."
msgstr "管理回應式設計的岔斷點和岔斷點群組。"

msgid "The CKEditor 5 module provides a highly-accessible, highly-usable visual text editor and adds a toolbar to text fields. Users can use buttons to format content and to create semantically correct and valid HTML. The CKEditor module uses the framework provided by the <a href=\":text_editor\">Text Editor module</a>. It requires JavaScript to be enabled in the browser. For more information, see the <a href=\":doc_url\">online documentation for the CKEditor 5 module</a> and the <a href=\":cke5_url\">CKEditor 5 website</a>."
msgstr "CKEditor 5 模組提供高可存取、高可用性視覺化文字編輯器，並將工具列新增至文字欄位。 使用者可以使用按鈕來格式化內容，並且建立語意正確且有效的 HTML。 CKEditor 模組使用<a href=\":text_editor\">「文字編輯器」模組</a>所提供的架構。 它要求在瀏覽器中啟用 JavaScript。 如需相關資訊，請參閱 <a href=\":doc_url\">CKEditor 5 模組的線上說明文件</a>和 <a href=\":cke5_url\">CKEditor 5 網站</a>。"

msgid "Enabling CKEditor 5 for individual text formats"
msgstr "針對個別文字格式啟用 CKEditor 5"

msgid "CKEditor 5 has to be enabled and configured separately for individual text formats from the <a href=\":formats\">Text formats and editors page</a> because the filter settings for each text format can be different. For more information, see the <a href=\":text_editor\">Text Editor help page</a> and <a href=\":filter\">Filter help page</a>."
msgstr "必須針對來自<a href=\":formats\">文字格式和編輯器頁面</a>的個別文字格式分別啟用及配置 CKEditor 5，因為每一種文字格式的過濾器設定都可能不同。 如需相關資訊，請參閱<a href=\":text_editor\">「文字編輯器」說明頁面</a>和<a href=\":filter\">「過濾器」說明頁面</a>。"

msgid "Configuring the toolbar"
msgstr "設定工具列"

msgid "When CKEditor 5 is chosen from the <em>Text editor</em> drop-down menu, its toolbar configuration is displayed. You can add and remove buttons from the <em>Active toolbar</em> by dragging and dropping them. Separators and rows can be added to organize the buttons."
msgstr "從<em>文字編輯器</em>下拉功能表中選擇 CKEditor 5 時，會顯示其工具列配置。 您可以透過拖放按鈕來新增及移除<em>作用中工具列</em>中的按鈕。 可以新增分隔字元和列來組織按鈕。"

msgid "Filtering HTML content"
msgstr "過濾 HTML 內容"

msgid "Unlike other text editors, plugin configuration determines the tags and attributes allowed in text formats using CKEditor 5. If using the <em>Limit allowed HTML tags and correct faulty HTML</em> filter, this filter's values will be automatically set based on enabled plugins and toolbar items."
msgstr "與其他文字編輯器不同，外掛程式配置會使用 CKEditor 5 來決定文字格式所容許的標籤和屬性。 如果使用<em>限制容許的 HTML 標籤並更正錯誤的 HTML</em> 過濾器，則會根據已啟用的外掛程式及工具列項目自動設定此過濾器的值。"

msgid "Toggling between formatted text and HTML source"
msgstr "在格式化文字與 HTML 原始碼之間切換"

msgid "If the <em>Source</em> button is available in the toolbar, users can click this button to disable the visual editor and edit the HTML source directly. After toggling back, the visual editor uses the HTML tags allowed via plugin configuration (and not explicity disallowed by filters) to format the text. Tags not enabled via plugin configuration will be stripped out of the HTML source when the user toggles back to the text editor."
msgstr "如果工具列中有<em>原始碼</em>按鈕可用，使用者可以按一下此按鈕以停用視覺化編輯器，然後直接編輯 HTML 原始碼。 在切換回後，視覺化編輯器會使用透過外掛程式配置所容許的 HTML 標籤（過濾器未明確禁止）來格式化文字。 當使用者切換回文字編輯器時，將從 HTML 原始檔中刪除未透過外掛程式配置啟用的標籤。"

msgid "Developing CKEditor 5 plugins in Drupal"
msgstr "在 Drupal 中開發 CKEditor 5 外掛程式"

msgid "See the <a href=\":dev_docs_url\">online documentation</a> for detailed information on developing CKEditor 5 plugins for use in Drupal."
msgstr "如需開發 CKEditor 5 外掛程式以在 Drupal 中使用的詳細資訊，請參閱<a href=\":dev_docs_url\">線上說明文件</a>"

msgid "Accessibility features"
msgstr "協助工具特性"

msgid "The built in WYSIWYG editor (CKEditor 5) comes with a number of accessibility features. CKEditor 5 comes with built in <a href=\":shortcuts\">keyboard shortcuts</a>, which can be beneficial for both power users and keyboard only users."
msgstr "內建 WYSIWYG 編輯器 (CKEditor 5) 隨附許多協助工具特性。 CKEditor 5 隨附內建<a href=\":shortcuts\">鍵盤快速鍵</a>，這對電源使用者及僅使用鍵盤的使用者都有好處。"

msgid "Generating accessible content"
msgstr "產生可存取的內容"

msgid "HTML tables can be created with table headers and caption/summary elements."
msgstr "HTML 表格可使用表格標頭和標題/摘要元素來建立。"

msgid "Alt text is required by default on images added through CKEditor (note that this can be overridden)."
msgstr "依預設，透過 CKEditor 新增的影像上需要有 Alt 文字（請注意，這是可置換的）。"

msgid "Semantic HTML5 figure/figcaption are available to add captions to images."
msgstr "HTML5 figure/figcaption 語意可用來新增影像的標題。"

msgid "To support multilingual page content, CKEditor 5 can be configured to include a language button in the toolbar."
msgstr "為了支援多語言頁面內容，CKEditor 5 可以配置成在工具列中包含語言按鈕。"

msgid "Migrating an Existing Text Format to CKEditor 5"
msgstr "將現有文字格式移轉至 CKEditor 5"

msgid "When switching an existing text format to use CKEditor 5, an automatic process is initiated that helps text formats switching to CKEditor 5 from CKEditor 4 (or no text editor) to do so with minimal effort and zero data loss."
msgstr "當切換現有的文字格式以使用 CKEditor 5 時，會起始自動處理程序，以協助文字格式從 CKEditor 4（或沒有文字編輯器）切換至 CKEditor 5，從而盡可能減少工作，且不會遺失任何資料。"

msgid "This process is designed for there to be no data loss risk in switching to CKEditor 5. However some of your editor's functionality may not be 100% equivalent to what was available previously. In most cases, these changes are minimal. After the process completes, status and/or warning messages will summarize any changes that occurred, and more detailed information will be available in the site's logs."
msgstr "此處理程序設計為在切換至 CKEditor 5 時不會有資料流失風險。 不過，部分編輯器的功能可能沒有先前可用功能的 100%。 在大部分情況下，這些變更是很小的。 在處理程序完成之後，狀態及/或警告訊息將彙總所發生的任何變更，並在網站的日誌中提供更詳細的資訊。"

msgid "CKEditor 5 will attempt to enable plugins that provide equivalent toolbar items to those used prior to switching to CKEditor 5. All core CKEditor 4 plugins and many popular contrib plugins already have CKEditor 5 equivalents. In some cases, functionality that required contrib modules is now built into CKEditor 5. In instances where a plugin does not have an equivalent, no data loss will occur but elements previously provided via the plugin may need to be added manually as HTML via source editing."
msgstr "CKEditor 5 將嘗試啟用外掛程式，這些外掛程式提供的工具列項目與切換至 CKEditor 5 之前使用的工具列項目相等。 所有核心 CKEditor 4 外掛程式及許多熱門的 contrib 外掛程式都已具有 CKEditor 5 對等項目。 在某些情況下，需要 contrib 模組的功能現在已建置在 CKEditor 5 中。 在外掛程式沒有對等項目的情況下，不會發生資料流失，但先前透過外掛程式提供的元素可能需要透過來源編輯手動新增為 HTML。"

msgid "Additional migration considerations for text formats with restricted HTML"
msgstr "具有受限 HTML 之文字格式的其他移轉考量"

msgid "The “Allowed HTML tags\" field in the “Limit allowed HTML tags and correct Faulty HTML\" filter is now read-only"
msgstr "「限制容許的 HTML 標籤和正確的錯誤 HTML」過濾器中的「容許的 HTML 標籤」欄位現在是唯讀的"

msgid "This field accurately represents the tags/attributes allowed by a text format, but the allowed tags are based on which plugins are enabled and how they are configured. For example, enabling the Underline plugin adds the &lt;u&gt; tag to “Allowed HTML tags\"."
msgstr "此欄位精確地代表文字格式所容許的標籤/屬性，但容許的標籤是根據啟用的外掛程式及其配置方式而定。 例如，啟用「下劃線」外掛程式會將 &lt;u&gt; 標籤新增至「容許的 HTML 標籤」。"

msgid "The &lt;p&gt; and &lt;br &gt; tags will be automatically added to your text format."
msgstr "&lt;p&gt; 和 &lt;br &gt; 標籤將會自動新增至文字格式。"

msgid "CKEditor 5 requires the &lt;p&gt; and &lt;br &gt; tags to achieve basic functionality. They will be automatically added to “Allowed HTML tags\" on formats that previously did not allow them."
msgstr "CKEditor 5 需要 &lt;p&gt; 和 &lt;br &gt; 標籤才能實現基本功能。 在先前不容許它們的格式上，它們會自動新增至「容許的 HTML 標籤」。"

msgid "Tags/attributes that are not explicitly supported by any plugin are supported by Source Editing"
msgstr "「來源編輯」支援任何外掛程式未明確支援的標籤/屬性"

msgid "When a necessary tag/attribute is not directly supported by an available plugin, the \"Source Editing\" plugin is enabled. This plugin is typically used for by passing the CKEditor 5 UI and editing contents as HTML source. In the settings for Source Editing, tags/attributes that aren't available via other plugins are added to Source Editing's \"Manually editable HTML tags\" setting so they are supported by the text format."
msgstr "當可用的外掛程式不直接支援必要的標籤/屬性時，會啟用「來源編輯」外掛程式。 此外掛程式通常用於傳遞 CKEditor 5 使用者介面並將內容編輯為 HTML 來源。 在「來源編輯」的設定中，無法透過其他外掛程式使用的標籤/屬性會新增至「來源編輯」的「手動可編輯 HTML 標籤」設定，以便文字格式可支援它們。"

msgid ""
"With CKEditor 5 this is a\n"
"          read-only field. The allowed HTML tags and attributes are determined\n"
"          by the CKEditor 5 configuration. Manually removing tags would break\n"
"          enabled functionality, and any manually added tags would be removed by\n"
"          CKEditor 5 on render."
msgstr ""
"使用 CKEditor 5，這是\n"
"唯讀欄位。 容許的 HTML 標籤和屬性是\n"
"由 CKEditor 5 配置決定。 手動移除標籤會中斷\n"
"已啟用的功能，並且在呈現時，CKEditor 5 會移除\n"
"所有手動新增的標籤。"

