msgid "To maintain the capabilities of this text format, <a target=\"_blank\" href=\":ck_migration_url\">the CKEditor 5 migration</a> did the following:"
msgstr "為了維護此文字格式的功能，<a target=\"_blank\" href=\":ck_migration_url\">CKEditor 5 移轉</a>執行了下列動作："

msgid "To maintain the capabilities of this text format, the CKEditor 5 migration did the following:"
msgstr "為了維護此文字格式的功能，CKEditor 5 移轉執行了下列動作："

msgid "Enabled these plugins: (%plugins)."
msgstr "已啟用這些外掛程式：(%plugins)。"

msgid "Added these tags/attributes to the Source Editing Plugin's <a target=\"_blank\" href=\":source_edit_url\">Manually editable HTML tags</a> setting: @tag_list"
msgstr "已將這些標籤/屬性新增至「來源編輯外掛程式」的<a target=\"_blank\" href=\":source_edit_url\">手動可編輯 HTML 標籤</a>設定：@tag_list"

msgid "Added these tags/attributes to the Source Editing Plugin's Manually editable HTML tags setting: @tag_list"
msgstr "已將這些標籤/屬性新增至「來源編輯外掛程式」的「手動可編輯 HTML 標籤」設定：@tag_list"

msgid "Additional details are available <a target=\"_blank\" href=\":dblog_url\">in your logs</a>."
msgstr "<a target=\"_blank\" href=\":dblog_url\">在您的日誌中</a>會提供其他詳細資料。"

msgid "Additional details are available in your logs."
msgstr "您可以在日誌中取得其他詳細資料。"

msgid "Updating to CKEditor 5 added support for some previously unsupported tags/attributes."
msgstr "更新至 CKEditor 5 已新增對部分先前不支援的標籤/屬性的支援。"

msgid "A plugin introduced support for the following:"
msgstr "外掛程式引進了對下列項目的支援："

msgctxt "Ckeditor 5 tag list"
msgid "for"
msgstr "for"

msgid "The <em>Source Editing</em> plugin was enabled to support tags and/or attributes that are not explicitly supported by any available CKEditor 5 plugins."
msgstr "已啟用<em>原始碼編輯</em>外掛程式，以支援任何可用 CKEditor 5 外掛程式未明確支援的標籤及/或屬性。"

msgid "The CKEditor 4 button %button does not have a known upgrade path. If it allowed editing markup, then you can do so now through the Source Editing functionality."
msgstr "CKEditor 4 按鈕 %button 沒有已知的升級路徑。 如果容許編輯標記，您現在可以透過「原始碼編輯」功能來執行此動作。"

msgid "The %cke4_plugin_id plugin settings do not have a known upgrade path."
msgstr "%cke4_plugin_id 外掛程式設定沒有已知的升級路徑。"

msgid "The CKEditor 5 plugin %button has a configurable subset of elements, but does not have a known upgrade path to configure that subset to match your text format. Hence it is now using its default configuration."
msgstr "CKEditor 5 外掛程式 %button 具有可配置的元素子集，但是沒有已知的升級路徑可將該子集配置成符合您的文字格式。 因此，它現在使用其預設配置。"

msgid "The CKEditor 5 migration enabled the following plugins to support tags that are allowed by the %text_format text format: %enabling_message_content. The text format must be saved to make these changes active."
msgstr "CKEditor 5 移轉已啟用下列外掛程式，以支援 %text_format 文字格式所容許的標籤：%enabling_message_content。 必須儲存文字格式，才能啟用這些變更。"

msgid "The following tags were permitted by the %text_format text format's filter configuration, but no plugin was available that supports them. To ensure the tags remain supported by this text format, the following were added to the Source Editing plugin's <em>Manually editable HTML tags</em>: @unsupported_string. The text format must be saved to make these changes active."
msgstr "%text_format 文字格式的過濾器配置允許下列標籤，但沒有可用的外掛程式支援它們。 為了確保此文字格式仍支援標籤，已將下列內容新增至「原始碼編輯」外掛程式的<em>手動可編輯的 HTML 標籤</em>：@unsupported_string。 必須儲存文字格式，才能啟用這些變更。"

msgid "The CKEditor 5 migration process enabled the following plugins to support specific attributes that are allowed by the %text_format text format: %enabled_for_attributes_message_content."
msgstr "CKEditor 5 移轉處理程序已啟用下列外掛程式，以支援 %text_format 文字格式所容許的特定屬性：%enabled_for_attributes_message_content。"

msgid "As part of migrating to CKEditor 5, it was found that the %text_format text format's HTML filters includes plugins that support the following tags, but not some of their attributes. To ensure these attributes remain supported, the following were added to the Source Editing plugin's <em>Manually editable HTML tags</em>: @missing_attributes. The text format must be saved to make these changes active."
msgstr "在移轉至 CKEditor 5 的過程中，發現 %text_format 文字格式的 HTML 過濾器包括支援下列標籤的外掛程式，但不包括其部分屬性。 為了確保這些屬性仍受支援，下列內容已新增至「程式碼編輯」外掛程式 <em>手動可編輯 HTML 標籤</em>：@missing_attributes。 必須儲存文字格式，才能啟用這些變更。"

msgid "As part of migrating the %text_format text format to CKEditor 5, the following tag(s) were added to <em>Limit allowed HTML tags and correct faulty HTML</em>, because they are needed to provide fundamental CKEditor 5 functionality : @missing_tags. The text format must be saved to make these changes active."
msgstr "在將 %text_format 文字格式移轉至 CKEditor 5 的過程中，新增了下列標籤以<em>限制容許的 HTML 標籤並更正錯誤 HTML</em>，因為需要它們才能提供基本 CKEditor 5 功能：@missing_tags。 必須儲存文字格式，才能啟用這些變更。"

msgid "The tag %tags;"
msgid_plural "The tags %tags;"
msgstr[0] "標籤 %tags；"

msgid "This attribute: %attributes;"
msgid_plural "These attributes: %attributes;"
msgstr[0] "這些屬性：%attributes；"

msgid "These are the alignment types that will appear in the alignment dropdown."
msgstr "這些是將出現在對齊方式下拉清單中的對齊方式類型。"

msgid "Programming languages"
msgstr "程式設計語言"

msgid "A list of programming languages that will be provided in the \"Code Block\" dropdown. Enter one value per line, in the format key|label. Example: php|PHP."
msgstr "將在「程式碼區塊」下拉清單中提供的程式設計語言清單。 每行輸入一個值，採用索引鍵|標籤格式。 範例：php | PHP。"

msgid "These are the headings that will appear in the headings dropdown. If a heading is not chosen here, it does not necessarily mean the corresponding tag is disallowed in the text format."
msgstr "以下標題將出現在標題下拉清單中。 如果未在這裡選擇標題，則不一定表示文字格式中不允許對應的標籤。"

msgid "Allow the user to resize images"
msgstr "容許使用者調整影像大小"

msgid "Language list"
msgstr "語系列表"

msgid "United Nations' official languages"
msgstr "聯合國的官方語言"

msgid "All @count languages"
msgstr "全部 @count 種語言"

msgid "The list of languages to show in the language dropdown. The basic list will only show the <a href=\":url\">six official languages of the UN</a>. The extended list will show all @count languages that are available in Drupal."
msgstr "語言下拉清單中顯示的語言清單。基本清單只會顯示<a href=\":url\">六種 UN 官方語言</a>。延伸清單會顯示 Drupal 中可用的全部 @count 種語言。"

msgid "Allow the user to reverse an ordered list"
msgstr "容許使用者反轉排序清單"

msgid "Allow the user to specify the start index of an ordered list"
msgstr "容許使用者指定排序清單的起始索引"

msgid "Allow the user to override the default view mode"
msgstr "容許使用者置換預設檢視模式"

msgid "Add or select media"
msgstr "新增或選取媒體"

msgid "Manually editable HTML tags"
msgstr "手動可編輯的 HTML 標籤"

msgid "A list of HTML tags that can be used while editing source. It is only necessary to add tags that are not already supported by other enabled plugins. For example, if \"Bold\" is enabled, it is not necessary to add the <code>&lt;strong&gt;</code> tag, but it may be necessary to add <code>&lt;dl&gt;&lt;dt&gt;&lt;dd&gt;</code> in a format that does not have a definition list plugin, but requires definition list markup."
msgstr "可在編輯原始檔時使用的 HTML 標籤清單。 只需要新增其他已啟用外掛程式尚未支援的標籤。 例如，如果啟用 f \"Bold\"，則不需要新增 <code>&lt;strong&gt;</code> 標籤，但是可能需要以沒有定義清單外掛程式但需要定義清單標記的格式新增 <code>&lt;dl&gt;&lt;dt&gt;&lt;dd&gt;</code>。"

msgid "A list of classes that will be provided in the \"Style\" dropdown. Enter one or more classes on each line in the format: element.classA.classB|Label. Example: h1.title|Title. Advanced example: h1.fancy.title|Fancy title.<br />These styles should be available in your theme's CSS file."
msgstr "將在「樣式」下拉清單中提供的類別清單。 請在每一行中輸入一個以上類別，格式為：element.classA.classB|Label。 範例：h1.title|Title。 進階範例：h1.fancy.title|Fancy 標題。<br />這些樣式應該在佈景主題的 CSS 檔案中提供。"

msgid "Check <a href=\":handbook\">this handbook page</a> for details about compatibility issues of contrib modules."
msgstr "如需 contrib 模組相容性問題的詳細資料，請參閱<a href=\":handbook\">此手冊頁面</a>。"

msgid "CKEditor 5 toolbar configuration"
msgstr "CKEditor 5 工具列配置"

msgid "Press the down arrow key to add to the toolbar."
msgstr "按下移鍵以新增至工具列。"

msgid "Move this button in the toolbar by pressing the left or right arrow keys. Press the up arrow key to remove from the toolbar."
msgstr "按左移鍵或右移鍵，即可在工具列中移動此按鈕。 按上移鍵以從工具列中移除。"

msgid "Toolbar items"
msgstr "工具列項目"

msgid "CKEditor 5 plugin settings"
msgstr "CKEditor 5 外掛程式設定"

msgid "Invalid toolbar value."
msgstr "工具列值無效。"

msgid "The migration of %text_format to CKEditor 5 has been saved."
msgstr "已儲存 %text_format 至 CKEditor 5 的移轉。"

msgctxt "Validation"
msgid "CKEditor 5 element"
msgstr "CKEditor 5 元素"

msgid "The following tag is not valid HTML: %provided_element."
msgstr "下列標籤不是有效的 HTML：%provided_element。"

msgid "The following tag is missing the required attribute <code>@required_attribute_name</code>: <code>@provided_element</code>."
