msgid "fields"
msgstr "欄位"

msgid "The Configuration Manager module provides a user interface for importing and exporting configuration changes between installations of your website in different environments. Configuration is stored in YAML format. For more information, see the <a href=\":url\">online documentation for the Configuration Manager module</a>."
msgstr "「配置管理程式」模組提供使用者介面，讓您在不同環境的網站安裝之間可匯入及匯出配置變更。配置是以 YAML 格式儲存。如需相關資訊，請參閱<a href=\":url\">「配置管理程式」模組的線上文件</a>。"

msgid "Exporting the full configuration"
msgstr "匯出完整配置"

msgid "You can create and download an archive consisting of all your site's configuration exported as <em>*.yml</em> files on the <a href=\":url\">Export</a> page."
msgstr "您可以在<a href=\":url\">匯出</a>頁面上建立及下載保存檔，其中包含整個網站的配置（匯出為 <em>*.yml</em> 檔）。"

msgid "Importing a full configuration"
msgstr "匯入完整配置"

msgid "You can upload a full site configuration from an archive file on the <a href=\":url\">Import</a> page. When importing data from a different environment, the site and import files must have matching configuration values for UUID in the <em>system.site</em> configuration item. That means that your other environments should initially be set up as clones of the target site. Migrations are not supported."
msgstr "您可以在<a href=\":url\">匯入</a>頁面上從保存檔中上傳完整網站配置。從不同環境匯入資料時，網站和匯入檔案的 <em>system.site</em> 配置項目中必須有相符的 UUID 配置值。這示您的其他環境最初就應該設定為目標網站的翻版。不支援移轉。"

msgid "Synchronizing configuration"
msgstr "同步配置"

msgid "You can review differences between the active configuration and an imported configuration archive on the <a href=\":synchronize\">Synchronize</a> page to ensure that the changes are as expected, before finalizing the import. The Synchronize page also shows configuration items that would be added or removed."
msgstr "在結束匯入之前，您可以在<a href=\":synchronize\">同步化</a>頁面上，檢閱作用中配置與匯入的配置保存檔之間的差異，以確保變更符合預期。「同步化」頁面也會顯示將要新增或移除的配置項目。"

msgid "Exporting a single configuration item"
msgstr "匯出單一配置項目"

msgid "You can export a single configuration item by selecting a <em>Configuration type</em> and <em>Configuration name</em> on the <a href=\":single-export\">Single export</a> page. The configuration and its corresponding <em>*.yml file name</em> are then displayed on the page for you to copy."
msgstr "您可以在<a href=\":single-export\">單一匯出</a>頁面上選取<em>配置類型</em>和<em>配置名稱</em>，以匯出單一配置項目。然後，頁面上就會顯示配置及其對應的 <em>*.yml 檔名</em>供您複製。"

msgid "Importing a single configuration item"
msgstr "匯入單一配置項目"

msgid "You can import a single configuration item by pasting it in YAML format into the form on the <a href=\":single-import\">Single import</a> page."
msgstr "您可以在<a href=\":single-import\">單一匯入</a>頁面上，以 YAML 格式將單一配置項目貼到表單中，以匯入此項目。"

msgid "Compare the configuration uploaded to your sync directory with the active configuration before completing the import."
msgstr "在完成匯入之前，請比較已上傳至 sync 目錄的配置與作用中的配置。"

msgid "Export and download the full configuration of this site as a gzipped tar file."
msgstr "將此網站的完整配置匯出並下載為經過 gzip 壓縮的 Tar 檔。"

msgid "Upload a full site configuration archive to the sync directory. It can then be compared and imported on the Synchronize page."
