msgid "Provide a simple link to the user contact page."
msgstr "提供一個簡單連結至使用者聯絡資訊頁。"

msgid "The Contact module allows visitors to contact registered users on your site, using the personal contact form, and also allows you to set up site-wide contact forms. For more information, see the <a href=\":contact\">online documentation for the Contact module</a>."
msgstr "「聯絡」模組讓訪客可以利用個人聯絡表單，以聯絡您網站上已登錄的使用者，還讓您可以設定整體網站聯絡表單。如需相關資訊，請參閱<a href=\":contact\">「聯絡」模組的線上文件</a>。"

msgid "Using the personal contact form"
msgstr "使用個人聯絡表單"

msgid "Site visitors can email registered users on your site by using the personal contact form, without knowing or learning the email address of the recipient. When a site visitor is viewing a user profile, the viewer will see a <em>Contact</em> tab or link, which leads to the personal contact form. The personal contact link is not shown when you are viewing your own profile, and users must have both <em>View user information</em> (to see user profiles) and <em>Use users' personal contact forms</em> permission to see the link. The user whose profile is being viewed must also have their personal contact form enabled (this is a user account setting); viewers with <em>Administer users</em> permission can bypass this setting."
msgstr "網站造訪者可以利用個人聯絡表單，將電子郵件寄給您網站上已登錄的使用者，而不需要知道或記住收件者的電子郵件位址。當網站造訪者檢視使用者設定檔時，檢視者會看到<em>聯絡</em>欄標或鏈結，以前往個人聯絡表單。當您檢視自己的設定檔時，不會出現個人聯絡鏈結，使用者必須具有<em>檢視使用者資訊</em>（用來查看使用者設定檔）和<em>利用使用者的個人聯絡表單</em>權限，才能看到此鏈結。正被檢視設定檔的使用者也必須啟用其個人聯絡表單（這是使用者帳戶設定）；具有<em>管理使用者</em>權限的檢視者可以略過此設定。"

msgid "Configuring contact forms"
msgstr "設定聯絡表單"

msgid "On the <a href=\":contact_admin\">Contact forms page</a>, you can configure the fields and display of the personal contact form, and you can set up one or more site-wide contact forms. Each site-wide contact form has a machine name, a label, and one or more defined recipients; when a site visitor submits the form, the field values are sent to those recipients."
msgstr "在<a href=\":contact_admin\">「聯絡表單」頁面</a>上，您可以配置個人聯絡表單的欄位和顯示，還可以設定一個以上整體網站聯絡表單。每一個整體網站聯絡表單都有機器名稱、標籤，以及一個以上已定義的收件者；當網站造訪者提交表單時，會將欄位值傳送給那些收件者。"

msgid "Linking to contact forms"
msgstr "連結至聯絡表單"

msgid "One site-wide contact form can be designated as the default contact form. If you choose to designate a default form, the <em>Contact</em> menu link in the <em>Footer</em> menu will link to it. You can modify this link from the <a href=\":menu-settings\">Menus page</a> if you have the Menu UI module installed. You can also create links to other contact forms; the URL for each form you have set up has format <em>contact/machine_name_of_form</em>."
msgstr "您可以將一個整體網站聯絡表單指定為預設聯絡表單。如果您選擇指定預設表單，則<em>標底</em>功能表中的<em>聯絡</em>功能表鏈結會鏈結至預設表單。如果您已安裝「功能表使用者介面」模組，則可以從<a href=\":menu-settings\">「功能表」頁面</a>修改此鏈結。您也可以建立鏈結來指向其他聯絡表單；您設定的每一個表單都有格式為 <em>contact/machine_name_of_form</em> 的 URL。"

msgid "Adding content to contact forms"
msgstr "將內容新增至聯絡表單"

msgid "From the <a href=\":contact_admin\">Contact forms page</a>, you can configure the fields to be shown on contact forms, including their labels and help text. If you would like other content (such as text or images) to appear on a contact form, use a block. You can create and edit blocks on the <a href=\":blocks\">Block layout page</a>, if the Block module is installed."
msgstr "從<a href=\":contact_admin\">「聯絡表單」頁面</a>中，您可以配置要顯示在聯絡表單上的欄位，包括其標籤及說明文字。如果還想在聯絡表單上顯示其他內容（例如文字或影像），請使用區塊。如果已安裝「區塊」模組，您可以在<a href=\":blocks\">「區塊佈置」頁面</a>上建立及編輯區塊。"

