msgid "The Content Moderation module allows you to expand on Drupal's \"unpublished\" and \"published\" states for content. It allows you to have a published version that is live, but have a separate working copy that is undergoing review before it is published. This is achieved by using <a href=\":workflows\">Workflows</a> to apply different states and transitions to entities as needed. For more information, see the <a href=\":content_moderation\">online documentation for the Content Moderation module</a>."
msgstr "「內容控管」模組可讓您擴充 Drupal 內容的「未發佈」及「已發佈」狀態。它可讓您擁有已發佈的即時版本，但同時又擁有在發佈之前正在檢閱的個別工作副本。這是透過下列方式達成的：使用<a href=\":workflows\">工作流程</a>將不同狀態及轉移根據需要套用至實體。如需相關資訊，請參閱<a href=\":content_moderation\">「內容控管」模組的線上文件</a>。"

msgid "Applying workflows"
msgstr "套用工作流程"

msgid "Content Moderation allows you to apply <a href=\":workflows\">Workflows</a> to content, content blocks, and other <a href=\":field_help\" title=\"Field module help, with background on content entities\">content entities</a>, to provide more fine-grained publishing options. For example, a Basic page might have states such as Draft and Published, with allowed transitions such as Draft to Published (making the current revision \"live\"), and Published to Draft (making a new draft revision of published content)."
msgstr "「內容控管」可讓您將<a href=\":workflows\">工作流程</a>套用至內容、內容區塊及其他<a href=\":field_help\" title=\"具有內容實體背景的欄位模組說明\">內容實體</a>，以提供更精細的發佈選項。 例如，「基本」頁面可能具有「草稿」及「已發佈」等狀態，並容許進行「草稿」到「已發佈」（使現行修訂「生效」）以及「已發佈」到「草稿」（對已發佈內容進行新的草稿修訂）等等的轉移。"

msgid "Moderating content"
msgstr "控管內容"

msgid "You can view a list of content awaiting moderation on the <a href=\":moderated\">moderated content page</a>. This will show any content in an unpublished state, such as Draft or Archived, to help surface content that requires more work from content editors."
msgstr "您可以在<a href=\":moderated\">控管內容頁面</a>上檢視正在等待控管的內容清單。這將顯示處於未發佈狀態（如「草稿」或「已保存」）的所有內容，以協助顯現需要從內容編輯器執行更多工作的內容。"

msgid "Configure Content Moderation permissions"
msgstr "配置內容控管權限"

msgid "Each transition is exposed as a permission. If a user has the permission for a transition, they can use the transition to change the state of the content item, from Draft to Published."
msgstr "每一個轉移都會公開為一項權限。如果使用者具有轉移權限，則可使用轉移將內容項目的狀態從「草稿」變更為「已發佈」。"

