msgid "The Field UI module provides an administrative user interface (UI) for managing and displaying fields. Fields can be attached to most content entity sub-types. Different field types, widgets, and formatters are provided by the modules enabled on your site, and managed by the Field module. For background information and terminology related to fields and entities, see the <a href=\":field\">Field module help page</a>. For more information about the Field UI, see the <a href=\":field_ui_docs\">online documentation for the Field UI module</a>."
msgstr "「欄位使用者介面」模組提供管理使用者介面 (UI)，用來管理及顯示欄位。欄位可以附加至大部分的內容實體子類型。不同欄位類型、小組件和格式製作程式是由網站已啟用的模組提供，而且由「欄位」模組管理。如需欄位和實體的相關背景資訊及術語，請參閱<a href=\":field\">「欄位」模組說明頁面</a>。如需「欄位使用者介面」的相關資訊，請參閱<a href=\":field_ui_docs\">「欄位使用者介面」模組的線上文件</a>。"

msgid "Creating a field"
msgstr "建立欄位"

msgid "On the <em>Manage fields</em> page for your entity type or sub-type, you can add, configure, and delete fields for that entity type or sub-type. Each field has a <em>machine name</em>, which is used internally to identify the field and must be unique across an entity type; once a field is created, you cannot change the machine name. Most fields have two types of settings. The field-level settings depend on the field type, and affect how the data in the field is stored. Once they are set, they can no longer be changed; examples include how many data values are allowed for the field and where files are stored. The sub-type-level settings are specific to each entity sub-type the field is used on, and they can be changed later; examples include the field label, help text, default value, and whether the field is required or not. You can return to these settings by choosing the <em>Edit</em> link for the field from the <em>Manage fields</em> page."
msgstr "在實體類型或子類型的<em>管理欄位</em>頁面上，您可以新增、配置及刪除該實體類型或子類型的欄位。每一個欄位都有<em>機器名稱</em>，在內部用來識別欄位，而且在實體類型中必須是唯一的；建立欄位之後，您就無法變更機器名稱。大部分欄位會有兩種設定。欄位層次設定取決於欄位類型，並影響如何儲存欄位中的資料。設定之後即無法再變更；例如，欄位容許的資料值數目及檔案的儲存位置。子類型層次設定為使用該欄位的每一個實體子類型所特有，而且稍後可以進行變更；例如，欄位標籤、說明文字、預設值，以及是否為必要欄位。您可以從<em>管理欄位</em>頁面選擇欄位的<em>編輯</em>鏈結，以回復成這些設定。"

msgid "Re-using fields"
msgstr "重複使用欄位"

msgid "Once you have created a field, you can use it again in other sub-types of the same entity type. For instance, if you create a field for the article content type, you can also use it for the page content type, but you cannot use it for content blocks or taxonomy terms. If there are fields available for re-use, after clicking <em>Add field</em> from the <em>Manage fields</em> page, you will see a list of available fields for re-use. After selecting a field for re-use, you can configure the sub-type-level settings."
msgstr "建立欄位之後，您就可以在相同實體類型的其他子類型中再次使用此欄位。 例如，如果您為文章內容類型建立欄位，則也可以將它用於頁面內容類型，但無法將其用於內容區塊或分類架構術語。 從<em>管理欄位</em>頁面按一下<em>新增欄位</em>之後，如果有可重複使用的欄位，您會看到要重複使用的可用欄位清單。 選取要重複使用的欄位之後，您可以配置子類型層次設定。"

msgid "Configuring field editing"
msgstr "配置欄位編輯"

msgid "On the <em>Manage form display</em> page of your entity type or sub-type, you can configure how the field data is edited by default and in each form mode. If your entity type has multiple form modes (on most sites, most entities do not), you can toggle between the form modes at the top of the page, and you can toggle whether each form mode uses the default settings or custom settings in the <em>Custom display settings</em> section. For each field in each form mode, you can select the widget to use for editing; some widgets have additional configuration options, such as the size for a text field, and these can be edited using the Edit button (which looks like a wheel). You can also change the order of the fields on the form. You can exclude a field from a form by choosing <em>Hidden</em> from the widget drop-down list, or by dragging it into the <em>Disabled</em> section."
msgstr "在實體類型或子類型的<em>管理表單顯示</em>頁面上，您可以配置依預設及在每一個表單模式下如何編輯欄位資料。如果實體類型有多個表單模式（在大部分網站上，大多數實體都沒有），您可以在頁面頂端切換表單模式，也可以在<em>自訂顯示設定</em>區段中，將每一個表單模式切換為是使用預設值還是自訂設定。對於每一個表單模式下的每一個欄位，您可以選取要用於編輯的小組件；部分小組件具有其他配置選項，例如文字欄位的大小，您可以使用「編輯」按鈕（看起來像輪子）來編輯這些選項。您也可以變更表單上的欄位順序。如果要從表單中排除欄位，您可以從小組件下拉清單中選擇<em>隱藏</em>，或將欄位拖曳至<em>已停用</em>區段。"

msgid "Configuring field display"
msgstr "配置欄位顯示"

msgid "On the <em>Manage display</em> page of your entity type or sub-type, you can configure how each field is displayed by default and in each view mode. If your entity type has multiple view modes, you can toggle between the view modes at the top of the page, and you can toggle whether each view mode uses the default settings or custom settings in the <em>Custom display settings</em> section. For each field in each view mode, you can choose whether and how to display the label of the field from the <em>Label</em> drop-down list. You can also select the formatter to use for display; some formatters have configuration options, which you can edit using the Edit button (which looks like a wheel). You can also change the display order of fields. You can exclude a field from a specific view mode by choosing <em>Hidden</em> from the formatter drop-down list, or by dragging it into the <em>Disabled</em> section."
msgstr "在實體類型或子類型的<em>管理顯示</em>頁面上，您可以配置依預設及在每一個檢視模式下如何顯示每一個欄位。如果實體類型有多個檢視模式，您可以在頁面頂端切換檢視模式，也可以在<em>自訂顯示設定</em>區段中，將每一個檢視模式切換為是使用預設值還是自訂設定。對於每一個檢視模式下的每一個欄位，您可以從<em>標籤</em>下拉清單中，選擇是否及如何顯示欄位的標籤。您也可以選取要用於顯示的格式製作程式；部分格式製作程式具有配置選項，您可以使用「編輯」按鈕（看起來像輪子）來編輯這些選項。您也可以變更欄位的顯示順序。如果要從特定檢視模式中排除欄位，您可以從格式製作程式下拉清單中選擇<em>隱藏</em>，或將欄位拖曳至<em>已停用</em>區段。"

msgid "Configuring view and form modes"
msgstr "配置檢視模式及表單模式"

msgid "You can add, edit, and delete view modes for entities on the <a href=\":view_modes\">View modes page</a>, and you can add, edit, and delete form modes for entities on the <a href=\":form_modes\">Form modes page</a>. Once you have defined a view mode or form mode for an entity type, it will be available on the Manage display or Manage form display page for each sub-type of that entity."
msgstr "您可以在<a href=\":view_modes\">「檢視模式」頁面</a>上，新增、編輯及刪除實體的檢視模式，也可以在<a href=\":form_modes\">「表單模式」頁面</a>上，新增、編輯及刪除實體的表單模式。定義實體類型的檢視模式或表單模式之後，該實體的每一個子類型的「管理顯示」或「管理表單顯示」頁面上就會出現此模式。"

msgid "Listing fields"
msgstr "列出欄位"

msgid "There are two reports available that list the fields defined on your site. The <a href=\":entity-list\" title=\"Entities field list report\">Entities</a> report lists all your fields, showing the field machine names, types, and the entity types or sub-types they are used on (each sub-type links to the Manage fields page). If the <a href=\":views\">Views</a> and <a href=\":views-ui\">Views UI</a> modules are enabled, the <a href=\":views-list\" title=\"Used in views field list report\">Used in views</a> report lists each field that is used in a view, with a link to edit that view."
msgstr "您可以利用下列兩種報告來列出您網站上定義的欄位清單。<a href=\":entity-list\" title=\"Entities field list report\">實體</a>報告會列出所有欄位，顯示欄位機器名稱、類型及使用欄位的實體類型或子類型（每一個子類型都會鏈結至「管理欄位頁面」）。如果<a href=\":views\">視圖</a>和<a href=\":views-ui\">視圖使用者介面</a>模組已啟用，則<a href=\":views-list\" title=\"Used in views field list report\">在視圖中使用</a>報告會列出視圖中使用的每一個欄位，並附上鏈結來編輯該視圖。"

