msgstr "已調整影像大小以符合容許的寬度上限（%width 個像素）。已調整大小的影像新尺寸為 %new_widthx%new_height 個像素。"

msgid "The image exceeds the maximum allowed dimensions and an attempt to resize it failed."
msgstr "影像超出容許的維度上限，且嘗試調整其大小失敗。"

msgid "The resized image is too small. The minimum dimensions are %dimensions pixels and after resizing, the image size will be %widthx%height pixels."
msgstr "已調整大小的影像太小。尺寸下限為 %dimensions 個像素，而在調整大小之後，影像大小將為 %widthx%height 個像素。"

