msgstr "大部分生僻字元都可直接輸入，沒有任何問題。"

msgid "If you do encounter problems, try using HTML character entities. A common example looks like &amp;amp; for an ampersand &amp; character. For a full list of entities see HTML's <a href=\":html-entities\">entities</a> page. Some of the available characters include:"
