msgstr "所有HTML文件都以純文字顯示。"

msgid "Only images hosted on this site may be used in &lt;img&gt; tags."
msgstr "&lt;img&gt; 標籤中只能使用此網站所管理的影像。"

msgid "Restrict images to this site"
msgstr "限於此網站的影像"

msgid "Disallows usage of &lt;img&gt; tag sources that are not hosted on this site by replacing them with a placeholder image."
msgstr "不允許使用未在此網站上進行管理的 &lt;img&gt; 標籤來源，以預留位置影像取而代之。"

msgid "Lazy load images"
msgstr "延遲載入影像"

msgid "Instruct browsers to lazy load images if dimensions are specified. Use in conjunction with and place after the 'Track images uploaded via a Text Editor' filter that adds image dimensions required for lazy loading. Results can be overridden by <code>&lt;img loading=&quot;eager&quot;&gt;</code>."
msgstr "如果指定尺寸，則指示瀏覽器延遲載入影像。 與「透過文字編輯器上傳的追蹤影像」過濾器結合使用，並放置在該過濾器之後，該濾鏡會新增延遲載入所需的影像尺寸。 <code>&lt;img loading=&quot;eager&quot;&gt;</code> 可以置換結果。"

msgid "Missing filter. All text is removed"
msgstr "遺失過濾器. 所有文字已被移除"

msgid "Missing filter plugin: %filter."
msgstr "遺失過濾器外掛: %filter."

msgid "Provides a fallback for missing filters. Do not use."
msgstr "為遺失的過濾器提供一個備用. 不要使用它."

msgid "Maximum link text length"
msgstr "連結文字的最大長度"

msgid "characters"
msgstr "字元"

msgid "URLs longer than this number of characters will be truncated to prevent long strings that break formatting. The link itself will be retained; just the text portion of the link will be truncated."
msgstr "比這個數值還要長的網址將會被截斷，以免過長的字串破壞格式。這個連結本身會被保留，只有顯示的文字會被截斷。"

msgid "Web page addresses and email addresses turn into links automatically."
msgstr "網頁和電子郵件地址自動轉換為連結。"

msgid "Convert URLs into links"
msgstr "轉換 URLs 為連結"

msgid "Format ID."
msgstr "格式 ID"

msgid "The name of the format."
msgstr "格式的名稱。"

msgid "Whether the format is cacheable."
msgstr "格式是否可快取。"

msgid "The role IDs which can use the format."
msgstr "可使用格式的角色 ID。"

msgid "The filters configured for the format."
msgstr "為格式配置的過濾器。"

msgid "The status of the format"
msgstr "格式的狀態"

msgid "The weight of the format"
msgstr "格式的加權"

msgid "Text Formats"
msgstr "文字格式"

msgid "Forum"
msgstr "討論區"

msgid "Forum content"
msgstr "討論區內容"

msgid "The content ID of the forum index entry."
msgstr "討論區索引項目的內容 ID。"

msgid "The content title."
msgstr "內容標題。"

msgid "Has taxonomy term ID"
msgstr "具有分類架構術語 ID"

msgid "Display content if it has the selected taxonomy terms."
msgstr "如果內容含有選取的分類架構術語，則顯示內容。"

msgid "Uncategorized"
msgstr "未歸類別"

msgid "Has taxonomy term"
msgstr "具有分類架構術語"

msgid "Term"
msgstr "分類詞"

msgid "The date the content was posted."
msgstr "內容的張貼日期。"

msgid "Sticky"
msgstr "置頂"

msgid "Whether or not the content is sticky."
msgstr "內容是否置頂。"

msgid "Not sticky"
msgstr "未置頂"

msgid "Whether or not the content is sticky. To list sticky content first, set this to descending."
msgstr "內容是否固定住。若要最先列出固定住的內容，請設為遞減。"

msgid "The number of comments a node has."
msgstr "節點所擁有的回應數。"

msgid "The Forum module lets you create threaded discussion forums with functionality similar to other message board systems. In a forum, users post topics and threads in nested hierarchies, allowing discussions to be categorized and grouped."
msgstr "「討論區」模組讓您可以建立主題式討論區，功能與其留言板系統類似。在討論區中，使用者可以在巢狀階層中張貼主題和討論串，以容許將討論進行分類和分組。"

msgid "The Forum module adds and uses a content type called <em>Forum topic</em>. For background information on content types, see the <a href=\":node_help\">Node module help page</a>."
msgstr "「討論區」模組可新增和使用一個稱為<em>討論區主題</em>的內容類型。如需內容類型的背景資訊，請參閱<a href=\":node_help\">「節點」模組說明頁面</a>。"

msgid "A forum is represented by a hierarchical structure, consisting of:"
msgstr "討論區以階層式結構表示，由下列項目組成："

msgid "<em>Forums</em> (for example, <em>Recipes for cooking vegetables</em>)"
msgstr "<em>討論區</em>（例如，<em>蔬菜料理食譜</em>）"

msgid "<em>Forum topics</em> submitted by users (for example, <em>How to cook potatoes</em>), which start discussions."
msgstr "由發起討論的使用者提交的<em>討論區主題</em>（例如，<em>如何料理馬鈴薯</em>）。"

msgid "Threaded <em>comments</em> submitted by users (for example, <em>You wash the potatoes first and then...</em>)."
msgstr "由使用者提交的主題式<em>評論</em>（例如，<em>先清洗馬鈴薯，然後...</em>）。"

msgid "Optional <em>containers</em>, used to group similar forums. Forums can be placed inside containers, and vice versa."
msgstr "選用<em>儲存器</em>，用來組合類似的討論區。討論區可以放在儲存器內，反之亦然。"

msgid "For more information, see the <a href=\":forum\">online documentation for the Forum module</a>."
msgstr "如需相關資訊，請參閱<a href=\":forum\">「討論區」模組的線上文件</a>。"

msgid "Setting up the forum structure"
msgstr "設定討論區結構"

msgid "Visit the <a href=\":forums\">Forums page</a> to set up containers and forums to hold your discussion topics."
msgstr "請造訪<a href=\":forums\">「討論區」頁面</a>來設定儲存器及討論區，以保留討論主題。"

msgid "Starting a discussion"
msgstr "建立一個討論"

msgid "The <a href=\":create-topic\">Forum topic</a> link on the <a href=\":content-add\">Add content</a> page creates the first post of a new threaded discussion, or thread."
msgstr "<a href=\":content-add\">新增內容</a>頁面上的<a href=\":create-topic\">討論區主題</a>鏈結會建立新主題式討論（或討論串）的第一篇貼文。"

msgid "Navigating in the forum"
msgstr "在討論區中導覽"

msgid "Enabling the Forum module provides a default <em>Forums</em> menu link in the Tools menu that links to the <a href=\":forums\">Forums page</a>."
msgstr "啟用「討論區」模組會在「工具」功能表中提供預設<em>討論區</em>功能表鏈結，可鏈結至<a href=\":forums\">討論區頁面</a>。"

msgid "Moving forum topics"
msgstr "移動論壇主題"

msgid "A forum topic (and all of its comments) may be moved between forums by selecting a different forum while editing a forum topic. When moving a forum topic between forums, the <em>Leave shadow copy</em> option creates a link in the original forum pointing to the new location."
msgstr "一個討論區主題 (及其全部回應)在編輯討論區主題時可以藉由選擇一個不同的討論區後可以在討論區之間被移動。當移動一個討論區主題時 ，<em>保留卷影副本</em>選項會在原始討論區建置一個連結指向新的位置。"

msgid "Locking and disabling comments"
msgstr "鎖定和停用回應"

msgid "Selecting <em>Closed</em> under <em>Comment settings</em> while editing a forum topic will lock (prevent new comments on) the thread. Selecting <em>Hidden</em> under <em>Comment settings</em> while editing a forum topic will hide all existing comments on the thread, and prevent new ones."
msgstr "當編輯一個論壇版型時選擇<em>回應設置</em>下的<em>關閉</em>選項會將版型鎖定 (阻止發佈新回應)。選擇<em>回應設置</em>下的<em>隱藏</em>會隱藏版型的所有回應並阻止新回應的發佈。"

msgid "Forums contain forum topics. Use containers to group related forums."
msgstr "討論版包含討論版主題。 請使用分區將相關的討論版進行分組。"

msgid "More help"
msgstr "更多幫助"

msgid "Use containers to group related forums."
msgstr "請使用分區將相關的討論版進行分組。"

msgid "A forum holds related forum topics."
msgstr "論壇包含相關的論壇主題。"

msgid "Adjust the display of your forum topics. Organize the forums on the <a href=\":forum-structure\">forum structure page</a>."
msgstr "調整討論區主題的顯示。請在<a href=\":forum-structure\">「討論區結構」頁面</a>上組織討論區。"

msgid "This is the designated forum vocabulary. Some of the normal vocabulary options have been removed."
msgstr "這是特別設計的討論區主分類。一些一般的主分類選項已經被移除。"

msgid "Leave shadow copy"
msgstr "保留副本"

msgid "If you move this topic, you can leave a link in the old forum to the new forum."
msgstr "如果您移動此主題，可以在舊討論版留下一個連結到新討論版。"

msgid "This topic has been moved"
msgstr "已移動此主題"

msgid "No new posts"
msgstr "沒有新文章"

msgid "New posts"
msgstr "最新文章"

msgid "Hot topic, new comments"
msgstr "熱門主題, 新回應"

msgid "Hot topic"
msgstr "熱門主題"

msgid "Normal topic"
msgstr "一般主題"

msgid "Closed topic"
msgstr "關閉主題"

msgid "Sticky topic"
msgstr "頂置話題"

