msgstr "討論區葉節點"

msgid "The item %forum is a forum container, not a forum. Select one of the forums below instead."
msgstr "%forum 是一個討論分區。請在該分區裡選擇一個討論版。"

msgid "Topics"
msgstr "主題"

msgid "Posts"
msgstr "文章"

msgid "Last post"
msgstr "最新文章"

msgid "By @author @time ago"
msgstr "作者 @author，@time 前"

msgid "Getting Started"
msgstr "開始使用"

msgid "Follow these steps to set up and start using your website:"
msgstr "按照下列步驟開始建立及使用您的網站："

msgid "<strong>Configure your website</strong> Once logged in, visit the <a href=\":admin\">Administration page</a>, where you may <a href=\":config\">customize and configure</a> all aspects of your website."
msgstr "<strong>配置網站</strong> 登入之後，請造訪<a href=\":admin\">「管理」頁面</a>，您可以在此頁面<a href=\":config\">自訂及配置</a>網站的所有層面。"

msgid "<strong>Enable additional functionality</strong> Next, visit the <a href=\":modules\">Extend page</a> and enable modules that suit your specific needs. You can find additional modules at the <a href=\":download_modules\">Drupal.org modules page</a>."
msgstr "<strong>啟用其他功能</strong>，接下來，請訪問<a href=\":modules\">「延伸」頁面</a>，並配合您的特定需求來啟用模組。您可以在 <a href=\":download_modules\">Drupal.org 模組頁面</a>尋找其他模組。"

msgid "<strong>Customize your website design</strong> To change the \"look and feel\" of your website, visit the <a href=\":themes\">Appearance page</a>. You may choose from one of the included themes or download additional themes from the <a href=\":download_themes\">Drupal.org themes page</a>."
msgstr "<strong>自訂網站設計</strong> 若要變更網站的「外觀與操作方式」，請造訪<a href=\":themes\">「外觀」頁面</a>。您可以選擇其中一個內含的佈景主題，或從 <a href=\":download_themes\">Drupal.org 佈景主題頁面</a>下載其他佈景主題。"

msgid "<strong>Start posting content</strong> Finally, you may <a href=\":content\">add new content</a> to your website."
msgstr "<strong>開始張貼內容</strong> 最後，您可以<a href=\":content\">新增內容</a>至您的網站。"

msgid "For more information, refer to the help listed on this page or to the <a href=\":docs\">online documentation</a> and <a href=\":support\">support</a> pages at <a href=\":drupal\">drupal.org</a>."
msgstr "如需相關資訊，請參閱此頁面上列出的說明，或 <a href=\":drupal\">drupal.org</a> 上的<a href=\":docs\">線上文件</a>和<a href=\":support\">支援</a>頁面。"

msgid "The Help module generates <a href=\":help-page\">Help reference pages</a> to guide you through the use and configuration of modules, and provides a Help block with page-level help. The reference pages are a starting point for <a href=\":handbook\">Drupal.org online documentation</a> pages that contain more extensive and up-to-date information, are annotated with user-contributed comments, and serve as the definitive reference point for all Drupal documentation. For more information, see the <a href=\":help\">online documentation for the Help module</a>."
msgstr "「說明」模組會產生<a href=\":help-page\">「說明」參考頁面</a>來引導您逐步完成使用和配置模組，並提供附有頁面層次說明的「說明」區塊。參考頁面是 <a href=\":handbook\">Drupal.org 線上文件</a>頁面的起點，包含更豐富和最新的資訊，並附有使用者提出的評論，可視為所有 Drupal 文件的決定性參照標準。如需相關資訊，請參閱<a href=\":help\">「說明」模組的線上文件</a>。"

msgid "Providing a help reference"
msgstr "提供一個說明參照"

msgid "The Help module displays explanations for using each module listed on the main <a href=\":help\">Help reference page</a>."
msgstr "「說明」模組可顯示主要<a href=\":help\">「說明」參考頁面</a>上列出的每一個模組的使用說明。"

msgid "Providing page-specific help"
msgstr "提供頁面專屬說明"

msgid "Page-specific help text provided by modules is displayed in the Help block. This block can be placed and configured on the <a href=\":blocks\">Block layout page</a>."
msgstr "模組提供的頁面專屬說明文字會顯示在「說明」區塊中。您可以在<a href=\":blocks\">「區塊佈置」頁面</a>上放置及配置此區塊。"

msgid "Help"
msgstr "Help"

msgid "Generates help pages and provides a Help block with page-level help."
msgstr "產生說明頁面，並提供含有頁面層次說明的「說明」區塊。"

msgid "Reference for usage, configuration, and modules."
msgstr "使用、設定及模組參考說明。"

msgid "There is currently nothing in this section."
msgstr "此區段目前沒有內容。"

msgid "This module is experimental. <a href=\":url\">Experimental modules</a> are provided for testing purposes only. Use at your own risk."
msgstr "這是實驗性模組。<a href=\":url\">實驗性模組</a>僅供測試用途。您必須自行承擔使用風險。"

msgid "No help is available for module %module."
msgstr "沒有模組 %module 的說明。"

msgid "@module administration pages"
msgstr "@module 管理頁面"

msgid "Module overviews"
msgstr "模組概觀"

msgid "Module overviews are provided by modules. Overviews available for your installed modules:"
msgstr "模組概觀由模組提供。已安裝模組可用的概觀："

msgid "The Help Topics module adds module- and theme-provided help topics to the module overviews from the core Help module. If the core Search module is enabled, these topics are also searchable. For more information, see the <a href=\":online\">online documentation for the Help Topics module</a>."
msgstr "「說明主題」模組從核心「說明」模組中，將模組所提供及佈景主題所提供的說明主題新增至模組概觀。如果核心「搜尋」模組已啟用，則這些主題也會變成可搜尋項目。如需相關資訊，請參閱<a href=\":online\">「說明主題」模組的線上文件</a>。"

msgid "Viewing help topics"
msgstr "檢視說明主題"

msgid "The top-level help topics are listed on the main <a href=\":help_page\">Help page</a>. Links to other topics, including non-top-level help topics, can be found under the \"Related\" heading when viewing a topic page."
msgstr "最上層說明主題列在主要<a href=\":help_page\">說明頁面</a>上。在檢視主題頁面時，可以在「相關主題」標題下找到其他主題的鏈結，包括非最上層說明主題。"

msgid "Providing help topics"
msgstr "提供說明主題"

msgid "Modules and themes can provide help topics as Twig-file-based plugins in a project sub-directory called <em>help_topics</em>; plugin meta-data is provided in YAML front matter within each Twig file. Plugin-based help topics provided by modules and themes will automatically be updated when a module or theme is updated. Use the plugins in <em>core/modules/help_topics/help_topics</em> as a guide when writing and formatting a help topic plugin for your theme or module."
msgstr "模組和佈景主題可在稱為 <em>help_topics</em> 的專案子目錄中，以 Twig 檔案型外掛程式提供說明主題；外掛程式 meta 資料會在每一個 Twig 檔案內的 YAML 前頁中提供。當模組或佈景主題更新時，將自動更新由模組及佈景主題所提供的外掛程式型說明主題。在撰寫及格式化佈景主題或模組的說明主題外掛程式時，請使用 <em>core/modules/help_topics/help_topics</em> 中的外掛程式作為指引。"

msgid "Translating help topics"
msgstr "翻譯說明主題"

msgid "The title and body text of help topics provided by contributed modules and themes are translatable using the <a href=\":locale_help\">Interface Translation module</a>. Topics provided by custom modules and themes are also translatable if they have been viewed at least once in a non-English language, which triggers putting their translatable text into the translation database."
msgstr "可使用<a href=\":locale_help\">介面翻譯模組</a>來翻譯提供的模組和佈景主題所提供的說明主題的標題和內文文字。如果已至少以非英文語言檢視自訂模組和佈景主題提供的主題一次，則會觸發將其可翻譯的文字放入翻譯資料庫中。"

msgid "Configuring help search"
msgstr "配置說明搜尋"

msgid "To search help, you will need to install the core Search module, configure a search page, and add a search block to the Help page or another administrative page. (A search page is provided automatically, and if you use the core Claro administrative theme, a help search block is shown on the main Help page.) Then users with search permissions, and permission to view help, will be able to search help. See the <a href=\":search_help\">Search module help page</a> for more information."
msgstr "若要搜尋說明，您需要安裝核心搜尋模組、配置搜尋頁面，並將搜尋區塊新增至「說明」頁面或另一個管理頁面。 （會自動提供搜尋頁面，如果您使用核心 Claro 管理佈景主題，則會在主要「說明」頁面上顯示說明搜尋區塊。） 然後，具有搜尋許可權以及檢視說明之許可權的使用者就可以搜尋說明。 如需相關資訊，請參閱<a href=\":search_help\">搜尋模組說明頁面</a>。"

msgid "See the <a href=\":help_page\">Help page</a> for more topics."
msgstr "有關其他主題，請參閱<a href=\":help_page\">說明頁面</a>。"

msgid "Help Topics"
msgstr "說明主題"

msgid "Displays help topics provided by themes and modules."
msgstr "顯示佈景主題和模組提供的說明主題。"

msgid "Help search"
msgstr "說明搜尋"

msgid "Viewing Drupal announcements"
msgstr "檢視 Drupal 公告"

msgid "What are Drupal announcements?"
msgstr "何謂 Drupal 公告？"

msgid "A feed of announcements about the Drupal project and Drupal Association programs."
msgstr "Drupal 專案及 Drupal 關聯程式的公告資訊來源。"

msgid "The purpose of this feed is to provide a channel for outreach directly to Drupal site owners. This content must be highly relevant to site owners interests, serve the strategic goals of the project, and/or promote the sustainability of the project and the Drupal Association."
msgstr "此資訊來源的目的是提供一個直接聯絡 Drupal 網站擁有者的管道。 此內容必須與網站擁有者的興趣高度相關，為專案的策略目標提供服務，及/或促進專案及 Drupal Association 的可持續性。"

msgid "The module sources its content from a JSON feed generated from <a href=\"https://www.drupal.org/about/announcements\">here</a>. The governance policy for the content is documented <a href=\"https://www.drupal.org/node/3274085\">here</a>."
msgstr "模組會從<a href=\"https://www.drupal.org/about/announcements\">這裡</a>產生的 JSON 資訊來源取得其內容。 內容的控管原則在<a href=\"https://www.drupal.org/node/3274085\">這裡</a>記載。"

msgid "How can I see the Announcements in my site?"
msgstr "如何在我的網站中看到公告？"

msgid "If you have the toolbar module enabled, you will see a direct link to them in the toolbar. If the toolbar module is not enabled, the content can always be accessed in the <em>@actions_link</em> page."
msgstr "如果您已啟用工具列模組，則會在工具列中看到指向它們的直接鏈結。 如果未啟用工具列模組，則一律可以在 <em>@actions_link</em> 頁面中存取內容。"

msgid "Who can see the Announcements?"
msgstr "誰能看到公告？"

msgid "Users with the <em>@permissions_link</em> permission can view Drupal announcements."
msgstr "具有 <em>@permissions_link</em> 許可權的使用者可以檢視 Drupal 公告。"

msgid "Announcement module overview"
msgstr "公告模組概觀"

msgid "Ban visitors from one or more IP addresses from accessing and viewing your site."
msgstr "禁止來自一或多個 IP 位址的訪客存取及檢視您的網站。"

msgid "In the <em>Manage</em> administrative menu, navigate to <em>Configuration</em> &gt; <em>People</em> &gt; <em>@ban_link</em>"
msgstr "在<em>管理</em>管理功能表中，導覽至<em>配置</em> &gt; <em>人員</em> &gt; <em>@ban_link</em>"

msgid "Enter an <em>IP address</em> and click <em>Add</em>."
msgstr "輸入 <em>IP 位址</em>，然後按一下<em>新增</em>。"

msgid "You should see the IP address you entered listed under <em>Banned IP addresses</em>. Repeat the above steps to ban additional IP addresses."
msgstr "您應該會看到您輸入的 IP 位址列在<em>禁止的 IP 位址</em>之下。可重複上述步驟來禁止其他的 IP 位址。"

msgid "Configuring a previously-placed block"
msgstr "配置先前放置的區塊"

msgid "Configure the settings of a block that was previously placed in a region of a theme."
msgstr "配置先前放置在佈景主題區域中的區塊之設定。"

msgid "In the <em>Manage</em> administrative menu, navigate to <em>Structure</em> &gt; <em>@layout_link</em>."
msgstr "在<em>管理</em>管理功能表中，導覽至<em>結構</em> &gt; <em>@layout_link</em>。"

msgid "Click the name of the theme that contains the block."
msgstr "按一下包含該區塊的佈景主題之名稱。"

msgid "Optionally, click <em>Demonstrate block regions</em> to see the regions of the theme."
msgstr "選擇性地按一下<em>示範區塊區域</em>，以查看佈景主題的區域。"

msgid "If you only want to change the region where a block is located, or the ordering of blocks within a region, drag blocks to their desired positions and click <em>Save blocks</em>."
msgstr "如果您只想要變更區塊所在的區域或區域內的區塊排序，請將區塊拖曳至想要的位置，然後按一下<em>儲存區塊</em>。"

msgid "If you want to change additional settings, find the region where the block you want to update is currently located, and click <em>Configure</em> in the line of the block description."
msgstr "如果您要變更其他設定，請尋找您要更新的區塊目前所在的區域，然後按一下區塊說明行中的<em>配置</em>。"

msgid "Edit the block's settings. The available settings vary depending on the module that provides the block, but for all blocks you can change:"
msgstr "編輯區塊的設定。可用的設定視提供區塊的模組而有所不同，但對於所有區塊，您可以變更的項目如下："

msgid "<em>Block title</em>: The heading for the block on your site -- for some blocks, you will need to check the <em>Override title</em> checkbox in order to enter a title"
msgstr "<em>區塊標題</em>：您網站上區塊的標題 -- 對於某些區塊而言，您需要勾選<em>置換標題</em>勾選框，才能輸入標題"

msgid "<em>Display title</em>: Check the box if you want the title displayed"
msgstr "<em>顯示標題</em>：如果您要顯示標題，請勾選此框"

msgid "<em>Visibility</em>: Add conditions for when the block should be displayed"
msgstr "<em>可見性</em>：新增顯示區塊的條件"

msgid "<em>Region</em>: Change the theme region the block is displayed in"
msgstr "<em>區域</em>：變更顯示區塊的佈景主題區域"

msgid "Click <em>Save block</em>."
msgstr "按一下<em>儲存區塊</em>。"

msgid "Managing blocks"
msgstr "管理區塊"

msgid "What are blocks?"
msgstr "何謂區塊？"

msgid "Blocks are boxes of content rendered into an area, or region, of a web page of your site. Blocks are placed and configured specifically for each theme."
msgstr "區塊是指呈現在您網站的網頁之區域中的內容方框。區塊的放置及配置隨每一個佈景主題而定。"

msgid "What are content blocks?"
msgstr "何謂內容區塊？"

msgid "Content blocks are blocks whose content you can edit. You can define one or more <em>block types</em>, and attach fields to each block type. Content blocks can be placed just like blocks provided by other modules."
msgstr "內容區塊是您可以編輯其內容的區塊。 您可以定義一個以上的<em>區塊類型</em>，並將欄位附加至每一個區塊類型。 內容區塊的放置方式可以像其他模組提供的區塊一樣。"

msgid "What is the block description?"
msgstr "何謂區塊說明？"

msgid "The block description is an identification name for a block, which is shown in the administrative interface. It is not displayed on the site."
msgstr "區塊說明是區塊的識別名稱，此名稱會顯示在管理介面中。它不顯示在網站上。"

msgid "What is the block title?"
msgstr "何謂區塊標題？"

msgid "The block title is the heading that is optionally shown to site visitors when the block is placed in a region."
msgstr "區塊標題是當區塊放置在區域中時，選擇性地顯示給網站造訪者的標題。"

msgid "Overview for managing blocks"
msgstr "管理區塊的概觀"

msgid "The <em>Block</em> module allows you to place blocks in regions of your installed themes, and configure block settings. The <em>Block Content</em> module allows you to manage block types and content blocks. See the related topics listed below for specific tasks."
msgstr "<em>區塊</em>模組可讓您將區塊放置在已安裝之佈景主題的區域中，並配置區塊設定。 <em>區塊內容</em>模組可讓您管理區塊類型及內容區塊。 如需瞭解特定作業，請參閱下列相關主題。"

msgid "<a href=\"https://www.drupal.org/docs/user_guide/en/blocks-chapter.html\">Blocks chapter of the User Guide</a>"
msgstr "<a href=\"https://www.drupal.org/docs/user_guide/en/blocks-chapter.html\">使用手冊的區塊章節</a>"

msgid "Placing a block"
msgstr "放置區塊"

msgid "Place a block into a theme's region."
msgstr "將區塊放置到佈景主題的區域中。"

msgid "In the <em>Manage</em> administrative menu, navigate to <em>Structure</em> &gt; @layout_link."
msgstr "在<em>管理</em>管理功能表中，導覽至<em>結構</em> > @layout_link。"

msgid "Click the name of the theme that you want to place the block in."
msgstr "按一下您要放置區塊的佈景主題名稱。"

msgid "Find the region where you want the block, and click <em>Place block</em> in that region. A modal dialog will pop up."
msgstr "尋找您要區塊所在的區域，然後按一下該區域中的<em>放置區塊</em>。將蹦現限制模式的對話框。"

msgid "Find the block you want to place and click <em>Place block</em>. A <em>Configure block</em> modal dialog will pop up."
msgstr "尋找您要放置的區塊，然後按一下<em>放置區塊</em>。將蹦現<em>配置區塊</em>限制模式的對話框。"

msgid "Configure the block and click <em>Save block</em>; see @configure_topic for configuration details."
msgstr "配置區塊並按一下<em>儲存區塊</em>；如需配置詳細資料，請參閱 @configure_topic。"

msgid "Creating a content block"
msgstr "建立內容區塊"

msgid "Create a content block, which can later be placed on the site."
msgstr "建立內容區塊，稍後可以放在網站上。"

msgid "In the <em>Manage</em> administrative menu, navigate to <em>Content</em>."
msgstr "在「<em>管理</em>」管理功能表中，導覽至<em>內容</em>。"

msgid "Open the @library_link tab."
msgstr "開啟 @library_link 標籤。"

msgid "Click <em>Add content block</em>. If you have more than one block type defined on your site, click the name of the type you want to create."
msgstr "按一下<em>新增內容區塊</em>。 如果您在網站上定義了多個區塊類型，請按一下您要建立的類型名稱。"

msgid "Enter a description of your block (to be shown to administrators) and the body text for your block."
msgstr "輸入區塊的說明（要顯示給管理者）以及區塊的內文文字。"

msgid "Defining a block type"
msgstr "定義區塊類型"

msgid "Define a block type and its fields."
msgstr "定義區塊類型及其欄位。"

msgid "In the <em>Manage</em> administrative menu, navigate to <em>Structure</em> &gt; <em>@types_link</em>."
msgstr "在「<em>管理</em>」管理功能表中，導覽至<em>結構</em> &gt; <em>@types_link</em>。"

msgid "Click  <em>Add block type</em>."
msgstr "按一下<em>新增區塊類型</em>。"

msgid "Enter a label for this block type (shown in the administrative interface). Optionally, edit the automatically-generated machine name or the description."
msgstr "輸入此區塊類型的標籤（顯示在管理介面中）。 選擇性地編輯自動產生的機器名稱或說明。"

msgid "Click <em>Save</em>. You will be returned to the <em>Block types</em> page."
msgstr "按一下<em>儲存</em>。您將回到<em>區塊類型</em>頁面。"

msgid "Click <em>Manage fields</em> in the row of your new block type, and add the desired fields to your block type."
msgstr "按一下新區塊類型列中的<em>管理欄位</em>，並將所要的欄位新增至您的區塊類型。"

msgid "Optionally, click <em>Manage form display</em> or <em>Manage display</em> to change the editing form or field display for your block type."
msgstr "選擇性地按一下<em>管理表單顯示</em>或<em>管理顯示</em>，以變更區塊類型的編輯表單或欄位顯示畫面。"

msgid "Managing books"
msgstr "管理書籍"

msgid "What is a book?"
msgstr "何謂書籍？"

msgid "A book is a structured group of content pages, arranged in a hierarchical structure called a <em>book outline</em>. A book hierarchy can be up to nine levels deep, and a book can include <em>Book page</em> content items or other content items. Every book has a default book-specific navigation block, which contains links that lead to the previous and next pages in the book and to the level above the current page in the book's structure."
msgstr "書籍是內容頁面的結構化群組，以一種稱為<em>書籍大綱</em>的階層式結構排列。書籍階層最多可達到九層的深度，且書籍可以包括<em>書籍頁面</em>內容項目或其他內容項目。每一本書都有預設的書籍專用導覽區塊，其中包含的鏈結可指向書籍的前一頁及下一頁，以及指向書籍結構中現行頁面上方的層次。"

msgid "What are the permissions for books?"
msgstr "書籍的許可權有哪些？"

msgid "The following permissions are needed to create and manage books; see @user_overview_topic and its related topics for more about permissions."
msgstr "建立及管理書籍需要下列權限；如需權限的相關資訊，請參閱 @user_overview_topic 及其相關主題。"

msgid "Allows users to add new books to the site."
msgstr "讓使用者可以將新書籍新增至網站。"

msgid "Add content and child pages to books and manage their hierarchies"
msgstr "將內容和子頁面新增至書籍及管理其階層"

msgid "Allows users to add configured types of content to existing books."
msgstr "讓使用者可以將已配置的內容類型新增至現有書籍。"

msgid "Allows users to add <em>any</em> type of content to a book, use the book overview administration page, and rearrange the pages of a book from the book outline page."
msgstr "容許使用者將<em>任何</em>類型的內容新增至書籍、使用書籍概觀管理頁面，並從書籍大綱頁面重新排列書籍的頁面。"

msgid "Administer site configuration (in the System module section)"
msgstr "管理網站配置（在系統模組區段中）"

msgid "Allows users to do many site configuration tasks, including configuring books. This permission has security implications."
msgstr "讓使用者可以執行許多網站配置作業，包括配置書籍。此許可權有安全疑慮。"

msgid "Allows users to click the <em>printer-friendly version</em> link to generate a printer-friendly display of the page, which includes pages below it in the book outline."
msgstr "可讓使用者按一下<em>友善列印版本</em>鏈結，以產生頁面的友善列印顯示畫面，其中包括書籍大綱中在它下面的頁面。"

msgid "<em>Book page</em> content permissions (in the Node module section)"
msgstr "<em>書籍頁面</em>內容權限（在節點模組區段中）"

msgid "Like other content types, the <em>Book page</em> content type has separate permissions for creating, editing, and deleting a user's own and any content items of this type."
msgstr "與其他內容類型一樣，對於建立、編輯及刪除使用者自己的及此類型的任何內容項目，<em>書籍頁面</em>內容類型具有不同的權限。"

msgid "Book management is handled by the core Book module. The topics listed below will help you create, edit, and configure books."
msgstr "書籍管理由核心書籍模組處理。下列主題將協助您建立、編輯及配置書籍。"

msgid "Adding content to a book"
msgstr "將內容新增至書籍"

msgid "Add content"
msgstr "新增內容"

msgid "Add a page to an existing book."
msgstr "將頁面新增至現有書籍。"

msgid "In the <em>Manage</em> administrative menu, navigate to <em>Content</em> &gt; <em>@node_add_link</em> &gt; <em>Book page</em>. If you have configured additional content types that can be added to books, you can substitute a different content type for <em>Book page</em>; see @configuring_topic for more information."
msgstr "在<em>管理</em>管理功能表中，導覽至<em>內容</em> &gt; <em>@node_add_link</em> &gt; <em>書籍頁面</em>。 如果您已配置可新增至書籍的其他內容類型，則可以使用不同的內容類型來替代<em>書頁</em>；如需詳細資訊，請參閱 @configuring_topic。"

msgid "Enter a title for the page and some text for the body of the page."
msgstr "輸入頁面的標題，並輸入一些文字作為頁面內文。"

msgid "In the vertical tabs area, click <em>Book Outline</em>. Select the book you want to add the page to in the <em>Book</em> select list. If you want to insert this page into the book hierarchy, also select the desired parent page in the <em>Parent item</em> select list."
msgstr "在垂直標籤區域中，按一下<em>書籍大綱</em>。在<em>書籍</em>選取清單中選取您要新增頁面的書籍。如果您要將此頁面插入書籍階層中，也請在<em>母項項目</em>選取清單中選取想要的母項頁面。"

msgid "Select the desired weight for the page in the <em>Weight</em> select list (pages with the same parent item are ordered from lowest to highest weight)."
msgstr "在<em>加權</em>選取清單中，選取頁面的所要加權（具有相同母項項目的頁面，其排序是從最低到最高加權）。"

msgid "Click <em>Save</em> to add the page to the book."
msgstr "按一下<em>儲存</em>，將頁面新增至書籍。"

msgid "Configuring books"
msgstr "配置書籍"

msgid "Configure settings related to books."
msgstr "配置與書籍相關的設定。"

msgid "In the <em>Manage</em> administrative menu, navigate to <em>Structure</em> &gt; <em>Books</em> &gt; <em>@settings_link</em>."
msgstr "在<em>管理</em>管理功能表中，導覽至<em>結構</em> &gt; <em>書籍</em> &gt; <em>@settings_link</em>。"

msgid "Check all of the content types that you would like to use as book pages in the <em>Content types allowed in book outlines</em> field."
msgstr "在<em>書籍大綱容許的內容類型</em>欄位中勾選您要用作書籍頁面的所有內容類型。"

msgid "In the <em>Content type for the Add child page link</em> field, select the content type that will be created from the <em>Add child page</em> link on a book page."
msgstr "在<em>新增子頁面鏈結的內容類型</em>欄位中，選取要從書籍頁面的<em>新增子頁面</em>鏈結建立的內容類型。"

msgid "Click <em>Save configuration</em>."
msgstr "按一下<em>儲存配置</em>。"

msgid "Creating a book"
msgstr "建立書籍"

msgid "Create a new book."
msgstr "建立新書籍。"

msgid "In the <em>Manage</em> administrative menu, navigate to <em>Content</em> &gt; <em>Add content</em> &gt; <em>Book page</em>. If you have configured additional content types that can be added to books, you can substitute a different content type for <em>Book page</em>."
msgstr "在<em>管理</em>管理功能表中，導覽至<em>內容</em> &gt; <em>新增內容</em> &gt; <em>書籍頁面</em>。如果您已配置可新增至書籍的其他內容類型，您可以用不同的內容類型替換<em>書籍頁面</em>。"

msgid "Enter a title for the book, and if desired, some text for the body of the book's title page."
msgstr "輸入書籍的標題，如有想要，也可輸入一些文字作為書籍標題頁面的內容。"

msgid "In the vertical tabs area, click <em>Book Outline</em>. Select <em>- Create a new book -</em> from the <em>Book</em> select list."
msgstr "在垂直標籤區域中，按一下<em>書籍大綱</em>。從<em>書籍</em>選取清單中選取 <em>- 建立新的書籍 -</em>。"

msgid "Click <em>Save</em> to create the book."
msgstr "按一下<em>儲存</em>以建立書籍。"

msgid "Changing the outline of a book"
msgstr "變更書籍的大綱"

msgid "Change the order and titles of pages within a book."
msgstr "變更書籍內頁面的順序和標題。"

msgid "Click <em>Edit order and titles</em> for the book you would like to change."
msgstr "對您想要變更的書籍按一下<em>編輯順序及標題</em>。"

msgid "Drag the book pages to the desired order."
msgstr "將書籍頁面拖曳至想要的順序。"

msgid "If desired, enter new text for one or more of the page titles within the book."
msgstr "如果需要，請為書籍內的一或多個頁面標題輸入新文字。"

msgid "Click <em>Save book pages</em>."
msgstr "按一下<em>儲存書籍頁面</em>。"

msgid "Managing height, width, and resolution breakpoints"
msgstr "管理高度、寬度及解析度岔斷點"

msgid "What are breakpoints?"
msgstr "何謂岔斷點？"

msgid "Breakpoints are the point at which your site's content will respond to provide the user with the best possible layout to consume the information. A breakpoint separates the height or width of viewports (screens, printers, and other media output types) into steps. For instance, a width breakpoint of 40em creates two steps: one for widths up to 40em and one for widths above 40em. Breakpoints can be used to define when layouts should shift from one form to another, when images should be resized, and other changes that need to respond to changes in viewport height or width."
msgstr "岔斷點是您網站內容的回應點，以提供使用者取用資訊的最適合佈置。岔斷點會將檢視區（螢幕、印表機及其他媒體輸出類型）的高度或寬度拆成各個步驟。例如，寬度岔斷點 40em 會建立兩個步驟：一個用於最多 40em 的寬度，另一個用於超過 40em 的寬度。岔斷點可用來定義何時應該將佈置的形式轉換成另一形式、何時應該調整影像大小，以及為了回應檢視區高度或寬度變更而需要的其他變更。"

msgid "What are media queries?"
msgstr "何謂媒體查詢？"

msgid "Media  queries are a formal way to encode breakpoints. For instance, a width breakpoint at 40em would be written as the media query \"(min-width: 40em)\". Breakpoints are really just media queries with some additional meta-data, such as a name and multiplier information."
msgstr "媒體查詢是編碼岔斷點的正式方式。例如，寬度岔斷點 40em 可以寫成媒體查詢 \"(min-width: 40em)\"。岔斷點實際上只是媒體查詢，再加上一些額外的 meta 資料，例如名稱及乘數資訊。"

msgid "What are resolution multipliers?"
msgstr "何謂解析度乘數？"

msgid "What is a breakpoint group?"
msgstr "何謂岔斷點群組？"

msgid "Managing breakpoints and breakpoint groups overview"
msgstr "管理岔斷點和岔斷點群組概觀"

msgid "The <em>Breakpoint</em> module allows you to define breakpoints and breakpoint groups in YAML files. Modules and themes can use the API provided by the <em>Breakpoint</em> module to define breakpoints and breakpoint groups, and to assign resolution multipliers to breakpoints."
msgstr "<em>岔斷點</em>模組讓您可以在 YAML 檔案中定義岔斷點和岔斷點群組。模組和佈景主題可以使用<em>岔斷點</em>模組提供的 API 來定義岔斷點和岔斷點群組，並指派解析乘數給岔斷點。"

msgid "Working with breakpoints in Drupal 8"
msgstr "在 Drupal 8 中使用岔斷點"

msgid "W3C standards for media queries"
msgstr "媒體查詢的 W3C 標準"

msgid "Configuring comments"
msgstr "配置評論"

msgid "Configure a content entity type/subtype to allow commenting, using a comment type that you have configured. See @content_structure_topic for more about content entities and fields, and @comment_type_topic to configure a comment type."
msgstr "使用您配置的評論類型來配置內容實體類型/子類型，以容許評論。 如需內容實體和欄位的相關資訊，請參閱 @content_structure_topic；若要配置評論類型，請參閱 @comment_type_topic。"

msgid "Who can configure comments?"
msgstr "誰可以配置評論？"

msgid "In order to follow these steps, the Field UI module must be installed. You'll need the Comment module's <em>@comment_permissions_link</em> permission, in order to change comment settings for a comment field. You'll also need to have the appropriate permission for adding fields to the entity type or subtype that the comments are attached to. For example, to add a comment field to content items provided by the Node module, you would need the Node module's <em>Administer content types</em> permission."
msgstr "為了遵循這些步驟，必須安裝「欄位使用者介面」模組。 您將需要「評論」模組的 <em>@comment_permissions_link</em> 權限，才能變更評論欄位的評論設定。 您還需要擁有適當的權限，以將欄位新增至附加評論的實體類型或子類型。 例如，若要將評論欄位新增至「節點」模組提供的內容項目，您需要「節點」模組的<em>管理內容類型</em>權限。"

msgid "Follow the steps in the related <em>Adding a field to an entity sub-type</em> topic to add a field of type <em>Comments</em> to the desired entity type or sub-type."
msgstr "遵循<em>將欄位新增至實體子類型</em>相關主題中的步驟，將類型為<em>評論</em>的欄位新增至所需的實體類型或子類型。"

msgid "On the first field settings page, choose the <em>Comment type</em> to use for this entity type or sub-type. You'll also notice that the <em>Allowed number of values</em> field cannot be changed for comment fields."
msgstr "在第一個欄位設定頁面上，選擇要用於此實體類型或子類型的<em>評論類型</em>。 您也會注意到無法變更評論欄位的<em>容許的值數目</em>欄位。"

msgid "On the next field settings page, enter the desired settings for the comment field:"
msgstr "在下一個欄位設定頁面上，輸入評論欄位的所需設定："

msgid "<em>Threading</em>: whether or not the comments are collected by threads, with people able to reply to particular comments instead of to the content entity itself."
msgstr "<em>執行緒作業</em>：評論是否由執行緒來收集，其中人員可以回覆特定評論，而不是內容實體本身。"

msgid "<em>Comments per page</em>: the maximum number of comments displayed on one page (a pager will be added if you exceed this limit)."
msgstr "<em>每頁評論數</em>：一頁上顯示的最大評論數（如果超出此限制，則會新增一頁）。"

msgid "<em>Anonymous commenting</em>: whether or not anonymous commenters are allowed or required to leave contact information with their comments (only applies if anonymous users have permission to post comments)."
msgstr "<em>匿名評論</em>：是否容許或要求匿名評論者在其評論中留下聯絡資訊（只有在匿名使用者有權張貼評論時才適用）。"

msgid "<em>Show reply form on the same page as comments</em>: whether the comment reply form is displayed on the same page as the comments. If this is not selected, clicking <em>Reply</em> will open a new page with the reply form."
msgstr "<em>在與評論相同的頁面上顯示回覆表單</em>：評論回覆表單是否顯示在與評論相同的頁面上。 如果未選取此項，則按一下<em>回覆</em>就會開啟包含回覆表單的新頁面。"

msgid "<em>Preview comments</em>: whether previewing comments before submission is <em>Required</em>, <em>Optional</em>, or <em>Disabled</em>."
msgstr "<em>預覽評論</em>：提交前的預覽評論為<em>必要</em>、<em>選用</em>，還是<em>已停用</em>。"

msgid "<em>Default value</em>: each individual entity has its own comment settings, but here you can set defaults for the comment settings for this entity type or subtype. The comment settings values are:"
msgstr "<em>預設值</em>：每一個個別實體都有自己的評論設定，但在這裡您可以為此實體類型或子類型設定評論設定的預設值。 評論設定值如下："

msgid "<em>Open</em>: comments are allowed."
msgstr "<em>已開啟</em>：容許評論。"

msgid "<em>Closed</em>: past comments remain visible, but no new comments are allowed."
msgstr "<em>已關閉</em>：仍然可以看到過去的評論，但不容許任何新評論。"

msgid "<em>Hidden</em>: past comments are hidden, and no new comments are allowed."
msgstr "<em>隱藏</em>：已隱藏過去的評論，而且不容許任何新評論。"

msgid "Online documentation for content comment settings"
msgstr "用於內容評論設定的線上文件"

msgid "Creating a comment type"
msgstr "建立評論類型"

msgid "Create a new comment type. See @comment_overview_topic for information about comments and comment types."
msgstr "建立新的評論類型。 如需評論及評論類型的相關資訊，請參閱 @comment_overview_topic。"

msgid "Who can create a comment type?"
msgstr "誰可以建立評論類型？"

msgid "Users with the <em>@comment_permissions_link</em> permission (typically administrators) can create comment types."
msgstr "擁有 <em>@comment_permissions_link</em> 權限的使用者（通常是管理者）可以建立評論類型。"

msgid "In the <em>Manage</em> administrative menu, navigate to <em>Structure</em> &gt; <em>@comment_types_link</em>."
msgstr "在<em>管理</em>管理功能表中，導覽至<em>結構</em> > <em>@comment_types_link</em>。"

msgid "Click <em>Add comment type</em>."
msgstr "按一下<em>新增評論類型</em>。"

msgid "In the <em>Label</em> field, enter a name for the comment type, which is how it will be listed in the administrative interface."
msgstr "在<em>標籤</em>欄位中，輸入評論類型的名稱，這就是其在管理介面中列出的樣子。"

msgid "In the <em>Target entity type</em> field, select the entity type to be commented on. See @content_structure_topic for more about content entities and fields."
msgstr "在<em>目標實體類型</em>欄位中，選取要評論的實體類型。 如需內容實體和欄位的相關資訊，請參閱 @content_structure_topic。"

msgid "Click <em>Save</em>. The comment type will be created."
msgstr "按一下<em>儲存</em>。 即會建立評論類型。"

msgid "Optionally, if you have the core Field UI module installed you can follow the steps in the related topics to add fields to the new comment type, set up the editing form, and configure the display."
msgstr "如果您已安裝「欄位使用者介面」核心模組，則您可以選擇性地遵循相關主題中的步驟，將欄位新增至新的評論類型、設定編輯表單，以及配置顯示畫面。"

msgid "Disabling comments"
msgstr "停用評論"

msgid "Turn off commenting for a particular entity (see @content_structure_topic for more about content entities and fields). Note that if you want to turn off commenting for all entities of an entity type or subtype, you will need to edit the field settings for the comment field; see @comment_config_topic for more about configuring the comment field."
msgstr "針對特定實體關閉評論（如需內容實體和欄位的相關資訊，請參閱 @content_structure_topic）。 請注意，如果您要針對實體類型或子類型的所有實體關閉評論，則需要編輯評論欄位的欄位設定；如需配置評論欄位的相關資訊，請參閱 @comment_config_topic"

msgid "Who can disable comments?"
msgstr "誰可以停用評論？"

msgid "You will need the <em>@comment_permissions_link</em> permission in order to disable commenting. You will also need permission to edit the entity that the comments are on."
msgstr "您將需要 <em>@comment_permissions_link</em> 權限，才能停用評論。 您還需要編輯已啟用評論之實體的權限。"

msgid "Find the entity you want to disable comments for, and edit it. For example, to turn off comments on a content item, you could find it by navigating in the <em>Manage</em> administrative menu to <em>Content</em>, filtering to find the content item, and clicking <em>Edit</em>."
msgstr "尋找您要停用其評論的實體，然後加以編輯。 例如，若要關閉對內容項目的評論，透過在<em>管理</em>管理功能表中導覽至<em>內容</em>，過濾以尋找內容項目，然後按一下<em>編輯</em>，即可找到該設定。"

msgid "Under <em>Comment settings</em>, select the desired comment setting:"
msgstr "在<em>評論設定</em>下，選取所需的評論設定："

msgid "Save the entity."
msgstr "儲存實體。"

msgid "Moderating comments"
msgstr "控管評論"

msgid "Decide which comments are shown on the website."
msgstr "決定將哪些評論顯示在網站上。"

msgid "Who can moderate comments?"
msgstr "誰可以控管評論？"

msgid "Users with the <em>@comment_permissions_link</em> permission (typically administrators) can moderate comments. You will also need the <em>Access the Content Overview page</em> permission from the Node module (if it is installed) to navigate to the comment management page."
msgstr "擁有 <em>@comment_permissions_link</em> 權限的使用者（通常是管理者）可以控管評論。 您也需要「節點」模組（如果已安裝的話）中的<em>存取內容概觀頁面</em>權限，以導覽至評論管理頁面。"

msgid "In the <em>Manage</em> administrative menu, navigate to <em>Content</em> &gt; <em>@comment_published_link</em>. A list of all comments is shown."
msgstr "在<em>管理</em>管理功能表中，導覽至<em>內容</em> > <em>@comment_published_link</em>。 即會顯示所有評論的清單。"

msgid "To unpublish comments, select one or more comments by checking the boxes on the left side (right side in right-to-left languages). Then select <em>Unpublish comment</em> from the <em>Action</em> select list and click <em>Apply to selected items</em>. If you select the <em>Delete comment</em> action, you can instead delete the unwanted  comments."
msgstr "若要取消發佈評論，請勾選左側的方框（由右至左語言為右側）以選取一個以上的評論。 接著從<em>動作</em>選取清單中選取<em>取消發佈評論</em>，然後按一下<em>套用至選定項目</em>。 如果您選取<em>刪除評論</em>動作，則可以改為刪除不想要的評論。"

msgid "To change the content of a comment click <em>Edit</em> from the dropdown button for a particular comment."
msgstr "若要變更評論的內容，請從特定評論的下拉按鈕中按一下 <em>編輯</em>。"

msgid "To publish comments that are not yet visible on the website, navigate to the <em>@comment_unpublished_link</em> tab. Select one or more comments by checking the boxes on the left side (right side in right-to-left languages). Then select <em>Publish comment</em> from the <em>Action</em> select list and click <em>Apply to selected items</em>."
msgstr "若要發佈尚未顯示在網站上的評論，請導覽至 <em>@comment_unpublished_link</em> 標籤。 勾選左側（由右至左語言為右側）的方框，以選取一個以上的評論。 接著從<em>動作</em>選取清單中選取<em>發佈評論</em>，然後按一下<em>套用至選定項目</em>。"

msgid "Online documentation for moderating comments"
msgstr "用於控管評論的線上文件"

msgid "Managing comments"
msgstr "管理評論"

msgid "What is a comment?"
msgstr "何謂評論？"

msgid "A comment is a piece of content, typically posted by a website visitor, which provides discussion or commentary on other content like blog posts and news articles. Comments are a type of content entity, and can have fields that store text, HTML markup, and other data. Comments are attached to other content entities via Comment fields. See @content_structure_topic for more about content entities and fields."
msgstr "評論是一種內容片段，通常由網站造訪者張貼，提供其他內容（例如：部落格文章及新聞文章）的討論或評論。 評論是內容實體的類型，可以包含儲存文字、HTML 標記及其他資料的欄位。 評論會透過「評論」欄位附加到其他內容實體。 如需內容實體和欄位的相關資訊，請參閱 @content_structure_topic。"

msgid "What is a comment type?"
msgstr "何謂評論類型？"

msgid "Comments are divided into <em>comment types</em>, which are the entity sub-types for the comment entity type. Each comment type has its own fields and its own form and display settings; each type can be used to comment on a single entity type. You can set up different comment types for different commenting purposes on your web site; for example, you might set up a comment type for recipes that has fields \"How did it taste?\" and \"Did the instructions work?\", and another comment type for blog entries that has only a generic comment body field."
msgstr "評論分成<em>數個評論類型</em>，這些評論類型是評論實體類型的實體子類型。 每一個評論類型都有自己的欄位與自己的表單和顯示設定；每一種類型都可以用來評論單一實體類型。 您可以在網站上針對不同的評論目的設定不同的評論類型；例如，您可以為包含「味道如何？」和「說明有用嗎？」欄位的食譜設定某種評論類型，並為僅包含一般評論內文欄位的部落格文章設定另一種評論類型。"

msgid "What is moderation?"
msgstr "何謂控管？"

msgid "<em>Moderation</em> is a workflow where comments posted by some users on your site are verified before being published, to prevent spam and other bad behavior. The core software provides basic moderation functionality: you can configure permissions so that new comments posted by some user roles start as unpublished until a user with a different role reviews and publishes them. Contributed modules provide additional moderation and spam-reduction functionality, such as requiring untrusted users pass a CAPTCHA test before submitting comments and letting community members flag comments as possible spam. See @users_overview_topic for more about users, permissions, and roles."
msgstr "<em>控管</em>是一種工作流程，在發佈之前，會先驗證網站上某些使用者所張貼的評論，以防止出現垃圾郵件及其他不良行為。 核心軟體提供基本的控管功能：您可以配置權限，使某些使用者角色所張貼的新評論一開始時保持不發佈，直到具有不同角色的使用者檢閱並發佈這些評論為止。 提供的模組提供額外的控管和垃圾郵件減量功能，例如要求未授信使用者在提交評論之前通過 CAPTCHA 測試，並讓社群成員將這些評論標示為可能的垃圾郵件。 如需使用者、權限及角色的相關資訊，請參閱 @users_overview_topic。"

msgid "Overview of managing comments"
msgstr "管理評論的概觀"

msgid "The core Comment module provides the following functionality:"
msgstr "「評論」核心模組提供下列功能："

msgid "Posting comments"
msgstr "張貼評論"

msgid "Creating comment types; the core Field UI module allows you to attach fields to comment types and attach comment reference fields to other entities so that people can comment on them."
msgstr "建立評論類型；「欄位使用者介面」核心模組可讓您將欄位附加至評論類型，並將評論參照欄位附加至其他實體，供人員對其進行評論。"

msgid "Configuring commenting"
msgstr "配置評論"

msgid "Moderating comments as discussed above"
msgstr "如上所述控管評論"

msgid "See the related topics listed below for specific tasks."
msgstr "請參閱下列關於特定作業的相關主題。"

msgid "Exporting your complete site configuration"
msgstr "匯出完整網站配置"

msgid "Create and download an archive containing all your site's configuration, exported as YAML files. See @config_overview_topic for more information about configuration."
msgstr "建立及下載包含所有網站配置的保存檔（匯出為 YAML 檔）。 如需配置的相關資訊，請參閱 @config_overview_topic。"

msgid "In the <em>Manage</em> administrative menu, navigate to <em>Configuration</em> &gt; <em>Development</em> &gt; <em>Configuration synchronization</em> &gt; <em>@export_link</em>."
msgstr "在<em>管理</em>管理功能表中，導覽至<em>配置</em> &gt; <em>開發</em> &gt; <em>配置同步化</em> &gt; <em>@export_link</em>。"

msgid "Click <em>Export</em> and save the archive file."
msgstr "按一下<em>匯出</em>並儲存保存檔。"

msgid "Export a single configuration item to a file. See @config_overview_topic for more information about configuration."
msgstr "將單一配置項目匯出至檔案。 如需配置的相關資訊，請參閱 @config_overview_topic。"

msgid "In the <em>Manage</em> administrative menu, navigate to <em>Configuration</em> &gt; <em>Development</em> &gt; <em>Configuration synchronization</em> &gt; <em>Export</em> &gt; <em>@single_export_link</em>."
msgstr "在<em>管理</em>管理功能表中，導覽至<em>配置</em> &gt; <em>開發</em> &gt; <em>配置同步化</em> &gt; <em>匯出</em> &gt; <em>@single_export_link</em>。"

msgid "Select the <em>Configuration type</em> that you want to export, and then select the specific <em>Configuration name</em> to export."
msgstr "選取您要匯出的<em>配置類型</em>，然後選取要匯出的特定<em>配置名稱</em>。"

msgid "Use your browser to copy the text in the box marked <em>Here is your configuration</em> to the clipboard."
msgstr "使用瀏覽器將標示為<em>這裡是您的配置</em>的方框中之文字複製到剪貼簿。"

msgid "Paste the copied text into a plain-text editor on your computer or other device, and save it using the suggested file name below the text box."
msgstr "將複製的文字貼在電腦或其他裝置上的純文字編輯器中，並使用文字框下方的建議檔名來儲存它。"

msgid "Importing your complete site configuration"
msgstr "匯入完整網站配置"

msgid "Import the complete configuration of your site from an archive file, such as one that was previously exported (see @export_full_topic). See @config_overview_topic for more information about configuration."
msgstr "從保存檔匯入網站的完整配置，例如先前匯出的保存檔（請參閱 @export_full_topic）。 如需配置的相關資訊，請參閱 @config_overview_topic。"

msgid "In the <em>Manage</em> administrative menu, navigate to <em>Configuration</em> &gt; <em>Development</em> &gt; <em>Configuration synchronization</em> &gt; <em>@import_link</em>."
msgstr "在<em>管理</em>管理功能表中，導覽至<em>配置</em> &gt; <em>開發</em> &gt; <em>配置同步化</em> &gt; <em>@import_link</em>。"

msgid "Browse to find the <em>Configuration archive</em> that you want to import."
msgstr "瀏覽以尋找您要匯入的<em>配置保存檔</em>。"

msgid "Click <em>Upload</em>. Your configuration archive will be unpacked and placed in the configuration synchronization directory, and you will be redirected to the <em>Synchronize</em> page."
msgstr "按一下<em>上傳</em>。您的配置保存檔將會解壓縮並放置在配置同步化目錄中，且您將重新導向至<em>同步化</em>頁面。"

msgid "Review the differences between your uploaded configuration and the active configuration, if any, and click <em>Import all</em> to import the changes."
msgstr "檢閱已上傳配置與作用中配置之間的差異，如果有的話，請按一下<em>全部匯入</em>以匯入變更。"

msgid "Import a single configuration item in YAML format, such as one that was previously exported (see @export_single_topic). See @config_overview_topic for more information about configuration."
msgstr "匯入 YAML 格式的單一配置項目，例如先前匯出的配置項目（請參閱 @export_single_topic）。 如需配置的相關資訊，請參閱 @config_overview_topic。"

msgid "In the <em>Manage</em> administrative menu, navigate to <em>Configuration</em> &gt; <em>Development</em> &gt; <em>Configuration synchronization</em> &gt; <em>Import</em> &gt; <em>@single_import_link</em>."
msgstr "在<em>管理</em>管理功能表中，導覽至<em>配置</em> &gt; <em>開發</em> &gt; <em>配置同步化</em> &gt; <em>匯入</em> &gt; <em>@single_import_link</em>。"

msgid "Select the <em>Configuration type</em> that you want to import."
msgstr "選取您要匯入的<em>配置類型</em>。"

msgid "On your computer or other device, copy the YAML-format configuration that you want to import to the clipboard."
msgstr "在電腦或其他裝置上，將您要匯入的 YAML 格式配置複製到剪貼簿。"

msgid "Paste the clipboard text into the box labeled <em>Paste your configuration here</em>."
msgstr "將剪貼簿文字貼在標示為<em>請在這裡貼上您的配置</em>的方框中。"

msgid "Click <em>Import</em>."
msgstr "按一下<em>匯入</em>。"

msgid "Translating configuration"
msgstr "翻譯配置"

msgid "Translate your site configuration to another language. See @language_add_topic if you need to add a new language."
msgstr "將網站配置翻譯成另一種語言。 如果您需要新增語言，請參閱 @language_add_topic。"

msgid "In the <em>Manage</em> administrative menu, navigate to <em>Configuration</em> &gt; <em>Region and language</em> &gt; <em>@config_translation_link</em>."
msgstr "在「<em>管理</em>」管理功能表中，導覽至<em>配置</em> &gt; <em>地區和語言</em> &gt; <em>@config_translation_link</em>。"

msgid "Find either the configuration entity type or the simple configuration item that you want to translate in the <em>Label</em> column of the list. Click <em>List</em> under <em>Operations</em> for a configuration entity, or <em>Translate</em> for simple configuration. (See @config_overview_topic to learn more about types of configuration and configuration entities.)"
msgstr "在清單的<em>標籤</em>直欄中，尋找您要翻譯的配置實體類型或簡式配置項目。 若為配置實體，請按一下<em>作業</em>下的<em>清單</em>，若為簡式配置，則按一下<em>翻譯</em>。 （請參閱 @config_overview_topic 以進一步瞭解配置和配置實體的類型。）"

msgid "For configuration entities, find the specific entity that you want to translate on the next page, and click <em>Translate</em> under <em>Operations</em>."
msgstr "對於配置實體，請在下一頁找到您要翻譯的特定實體，然後按一下<em>作業</em>下的<em>翻譯</em>。"

msgid "Enter translations for the translatable text fields for the configuration item, and save."
msgstr "為配置項目的可翻譯文字欄位輸入翻譯，然後儲存。"

msgid "Managing the fields of contact forms"
msgstr "管理聯絡表單欄位"

msgid "Add, remove, or rearrange the fields on personal and site-wide contact forms."
msgstr "新增、移除或重新排列個人及網站層面聯絡表單上的欄位。"

msgid "What are the fields on contact forms?"
msgstr "聯絡表單上有哪些欄位？"

msgid "Both personal and site-wide contact forms will always have <em>Subject</em> and <em>Message</em> fields. You can add additional fields for users to fill out if desired. Note that if you want to display other content on a form page, such as text or images, you can use a content block."
msgstr "個人及網站層面聯絡表單將一律具有<em>主旨</em>及<em>訊息</em>欄位。 如有需要，您可新增其他欄位以讓使用者填寫。 請注意，如果您想要在表單頁面上顯示其他內容（例如：文字或影像），則可以使用內容區塊。"

msgid "In the <em>Manage</em> administrative menu, navigate to <em>Structure</em> &gt; <em>@contact_link</em>."
msgstr "在<em>管理</em>管理功能表中，導覽至<em>結構</em> &gt; <em>@contact_link</em>。"

msgid "Click <em>Manage fields</em> for the form you want to change the fields of, and add or remove one or more fields on the form."
msgstr "針對您要變更其欄位的表單按一下<em>管理欄位</em>，然後在表單上新增或移除一個以上的欄位。"

msgid "Click <em>Manage form display</em> to change the order or configuration of the fields on the form."
msgstr "按一下<em>管理表單顯示</em>，以變更表單上欄位的順序或配置。"

msgid "Configuring personal contact forms"
msgstr "配置個人聯絡表單"

msgid "Account settings"
msgstr "帳號設定"

msgid "Permissions"
msgstr "權限"

msgid "Configure personal contact forms for registered users on the website."
msgstr "為網站上的已登錄使用者配置個人聯絡表單。"

msgid "In the <em>Manage</em> administrative menu, navigate to <em>Configuration</em> &gt; <em>People</em> &gt; <em>@config_link</em>."
msgstr "在<em>管理</em>管理功能表中，導覽至<em>配置</em> &gt; <em>人員</em> &gt; <em>@config_link</em>。"

msgid "In the <em>Contact settings</em> section, check/uncheck the box to enable/disable the contact form for new user accounts."
msgstr "在<em>聯絡設定</em>區段中，勾選/取消勾選為新的使用者帳戶啟用/停用聯絡表單。"

msgid "In the <em>Manage</em> administrative menu, navigate to <em>People</em> &gt; <em>@permission_link</em>."
msgstr "在<em>管理</em>管理功能表中，導覽至<em>人員</em> &gt; <em>@permission_link</em>。"

msgid "Verify that permissions are correct for your site's roles, including the generic <em>Anonymous user</em> and <em>Authenticated user</em>. In order to use personal contact forms, users need both <em>View user information</em> (in the <em>User</em> section, which enables them to view user profiles) and <em>Use users' personal contact forms</em> (in the <em>Contact</em> section, which enables them to use contact forms if they can view user profiles)."
msgstr "驗證網站角色（包括一般<em>匿名使用者</em>及<em>已鑑別使用者</em>）的許可權是否正確。為了使用個人聯絡表單，使用者需要同時具有<em>檢視使用者資訊</em>（在<em>使用者</em>區段中，可讓他們檢視使用者設定檔）及<em>利用使用者的個人聯絡表單</em>（在<em>聯絡</em>區段中，可他們在能夠檢視使用者設定檔時使用聯絡表單）許可權。"

msgid "Click <em>Save permissions</em>."
msgstr "按一下<em>儲存許可權</em>。"

msgid "The contact form will always have <em>Subject</em> and <em>Message</em> fields. If you want to add more fields, follow the steps in @adding_fields_topic."
msgstr "聯絡表單一律具有<em>主旨</em>和<em>訊息</em>欄位。 如果您要新增更多欄位，請遵循 @adding_fields_topic 中的步驟。"

msgid "Creating a new contact form"
msgstr "建立新的聯絡表單"

msgid "Create a new site-wide contact form."
msgstr "建立新的網站層面聯絡表單。"

msgid "Click <em>Add contact form</em>."
msgstr "按一下<em>新增聯絡表單</em>。"

msgid "Fill in the <em>Label</em> (title) for the form, <em>Recipients</em>, and optionally the other settings."
msgstr "填寫表單的<em>標籤</em>（標題）、<em>收件者</em>，並選擇性地填寫其他設定。"

msgid "Click <em>Save</em>. You should see your new contact form in the table, along with a link to view it."
msgstr "按一下<em>儲存</em>。您應該在表格中看到新的聯絡表單，以及用於檢視它的鏈結。"

msgid "Managing contact forms"
msgstr "管理聯絡表單"

msgid "What are contact forms?"
msgstr "何謂聯絡表單？"

msgid "There are two different types of contact forms provided by the core Contact module: personal contact forms, which allow users to contact other users on the site, and site-wide contact forms, which allow users to contact site managers or administrators. A site can have more than one site-wide contact form; each has its own fields to fill out, recipients, and URL; you can also change the fields that are shown on personal contact forms."
msgstr "核心「聯絡」模組提供兩種不同類型的聯絡表單：個人聯絡表單（可讓使用者聯絡網站上的其他使用者）及網站層面聯絡表單（可讓使用者聯絡網站管理員或管理者）。一個網站可以具有多個網站層面聯絡表單；每個表單皆具有要填寫的專屬欄位、收件者及 URL；您也可以變更個人聯絡表單上顯示的欄位。"

msgid "Site visitors can email registered users on your site by using the personal contact form, without knowing or learning the email address of the recipient. When a user with the correct permissions is viewing another user's profile, the viewer will see a <em>Contact</em> tab or link, which leads to the personal contact form if the user whose profile is being viewed has their personal contact form enabled (this is a user account setting)."
msgstr "網站造訪者可以利用個人聯絡表單，將電子郵件寄給您網站上已登錄的使用者，而不需要知道或記住收件者的電子郵件位址。在具有正確許可權的使用者檢視其他使用者的設定檔時，如果正在檢視其設定檔的使用者已啟用其個人聯絡表單（這是使用者帳戶設定），則檢視者會看到用於前往個人聯絡表單的<em>聯絡</em>標籤或鏈結。"

msgid "Contact form management tasks"
msgstr "聯絡表單管理作業"

msgid "See the related topics below for specific tasks."
msgstr "如需瞭解特定作業，請參閱下面的相關主題。"

msgid "Setting a default contact form"
msgstr "設定預設聯絡表單"

msgid "Set a site-wide contact form to be the default contact form (the form that is shown on the <em>/contact</em> URL)."
msgstr "將網站層面聯絡表單設定為預設聯絡表單（在 <em>/contact</em> URL 上顯示的表單）。"

msgid "Click <em>Edit</em> for the site-wide form you want to be the default."
msgstr "針對您要設定為預設值的網站層面表單按一下<em>編輯</em>。"

msgid "Check <em>Make this the default form</em> and click <em>Save</em>."
msgstr "勾選<em>將此表單設定為預設表單</em>，然後按一下<em>儲存</em>。"

msgid "Moving content between workflow states"
msgstr "在工作流程狀態之間移動內容"

msgid "Change the workflow state of a particular entity. See @workflows_overview_topic for an overview of workflows, and @content_structure_topic for an overview of content entities."
msgstr "變更特定實體的工作流程狀態。 如需工作流程的概觀，請參閱 @workflows_overview_topic；如需內容實體的概觀，請參閱 @content_structure_topic。"

msgid "Who can change workflow states?"
msgstr "誰可以變更工作流程狀態？"

msgid "Users with <em>content moderation permissions</em> can change workflow states. There are separate permissions for each transition. See Permissions &gt; <em>@content_moderation_permissions_link</em> to configure content moderation permissions."
msgstr "具有<em>內容控管許可權</em>的使用者可以變更工作流程狀態。 每個轉移需要不同的許可權。 請參閱許可權 > <em>@content_moderation_permissions_link</em>，以配置內容控管許可權。"

msgid "Find the entity that you want to moderate in either the content moderation view page, if you created one, or the appropriate administrative page for managing that type of entity (such as the administration page for content items; see @content_link)."
msgstr "在內容控管視圖頁面（如果已建立該頁面的話）或用於管理該實體類型的對應管理頁面（例如：內容項目的管理頁面；請參閱 @content_link）中尋找您要控管的實體。"

msgid "Click <em>Edit</em> to edit the entity."
msgstr "按一下<em>編輯</em>以編輯實體。"

msgid "At the bottom of the page, select the new workflow state under <em>Change to:</em> and click <em>Save</em>."
msgstr "在頁面底端的<em>變更為：</em>下方選取新的工作流程狀態，然後按一下<em>儲存</em>。"

msgid "Configuring workflows"
msgstr "配置工作流程"

msgid "Administer workflows"
msgstr "管理工作流程"

msgid "Workflows"
msgstr "工作流程"

msgid "Create or edit a workflow with various workflow states (for example <em>Concept</em>, <em>Archived</em>, etc.) for moderating content. See @workflows_overview_topic for more information on workflows."
msgstr "使用各種工作流程狀態（例如<em>概念</em>、<em>已保存</em>等）來建立或編輯工作流程，以控管內容。 如需工作流程的相關資訊，請參閱 @workflows_overview_topic。"

msgid "Who can configure a workflow?"
msgstr "誰可以配置工作流程？"

msgid "Users with <em>workflows permissions</em> (typically administrators) can configure workflows. See Permissions &gt; <em>@workflows_permissions_link</em> to configure workflows permissions."
msgstr "具有<em>工作流程許可權</em>的使用者（通常是管理者）可以配置工作流程。 請參閱許可權 > <em>@workflows_permissions_link</em>，以配置工作流程許可權。"

msgid "Make a plan for the new workflow:"
msgstr "為新的工作流程擬定計劃："

msgid "Decide which workflow states you need; for example, <em>Concept</em>, <em>Review</em>, and <em>Final</em>."
msgstr "決定您需要的工作流程狀態；例如，<em>概念</em>、<em>檢閱</em>及<em>最終</em>。"

msgid "Decide on the settings for each state:"
msgstr "決定每種狀態的設定："

msgid "<em>Label</em>: the state name"
msgstr "<em>標籤</em>：狀態名稱"

msgid "<em>Published</em>: if checked, when content reaches this state it will be made visible on the site (to users with permission)."
msgstr "<em>已發佈</em>：如果已勾選，則當內容達到此狀態時，即會使其在網站上可見（針對具有許可權的使用者）。"

msgid "<em>Default revision</em>: if checked, when content reaches this state it will become the default revision of the content; published content is automatically the default revision."
msgstr "<em>預設修訂</em>：如果已勾選，則當內容達到此狀態時，即會變成內容的預設修訂；已發佈的內容會自動成為預設修訂。"

msgid "Decide which state content should be created in."
msgstr "決定應該建立哪種狀態的內容。"

msgid "Decide on the list of allowed transitions between states. For example, you might want a transition between <em>Concept</em> and <em>Review</em>. Each transition has a label; for example, the Concept to Review transition might be labeled \"Review concept\"."
msgstr "決定容許的狀態之間轉移清單。例如，您可能想要在<em>概念</em>與<em>檢閱</em>之間進行轉移。每個轉移各有一個標籤；例如，「概念至檢閱」轉移可能會標示為「檢閱概念」。"

msgid "Decide which roles should have permissions to make each transition; see @user_overview_topic for an overview of roles and permissions."
msgstr "決定哪些角色應具有進行每項轉移的權限；如需角色和權限的概觀，請參閱 @user_overview_topic。"

msgid "Decide which <em>entity types</em> and subtypes the workflow should apply to. Only entity types that support revisions are possible to define workflows for. See @content_structure_topic for more information on content entities and fields."
msgstr "決定應套用工作流程的<em>實體類型</em>和子類型。 只能為支援修訂的實體類型定義工作流程。 如需內容實體和欄位的相關資訊，請參閱 @content_structure_topic。"

msgid "To implement your plan, in the <em>Manage</em> administrative menu, navigate to <em>Configuration</em> &gt; <em>Workflow</em> &gt; <em>@workflows_link</em>. A list of workflows is shown, including the default workflow <em>Editorial</em> that you can adapt."
msgstr "若要實作方案，請在「<em>管理</em>」管理功能表中，導覽至<em>配置</em> &gt; <em>工作流程</em> &gt; <em>@workflows_link</em>。 即會顯示工作流程清單，其中包括您可以調整的預設工作流程 <em>Editorial</em>。"

msgid "Click <em>Add workflow</em>."
msgstr "按一下<em>新增工作流程</em>。"

msgid "Enter a name in the <em>Label</em> field, select <em>Content moderation</em> from the <em>Workflow type</em> field, and click <em>Save</em>."
msgstr "在<em>標籤</em>欄位中輸入名稱，從<em>工作流程類型</em>欄位中選取<em>內容控管</em>，然後按一下<em>儲存</em>。"

msgid "Verify that the <em>States</em> list matches your planned states. You can add missing states by clicking <em>Add a new state</em>. You can edit or delete states by clicking <em>Edit</em> or <em>Delete</em> under <em>Operations</em> (if the <em>Delete</em> option is not available, you will first need to delete any <em>Transitions</em> to or from this state)."
msgstr "驗證<em>狀態</em>清單是否符合您計劃的狀態。按一下<em>新增狀態</em>即可新增遺漏的狀態。在<em>作業</em>下方按一下<em>編輯</em>或<em>刪除</em>即可編輯或刪除狀態（如果<em>刪除</em>選項無法使用，則需要先刪除從此狀態來回進行的任何<em>轉移</em>）。"

msgid "Verify that the <em>Transitions</em> list matches your plan. You can add missing transitions by clicking <em>Add a new transition</em>. You can edit or delete transitions by clicking <em>Edit</em> or <em>Delete</em> under <em>Operations</em>."
msgstr "驗證<em>轉移</em>清單是否符合您的計劃。按一下<em>新增轉移</em>即可新增遺漏的轉移。在<em>作業</em>下方按一下<em>編輯</em>或<em>刪除</em>即可編輯或刪除轉移。"

msgid "Under <em>This workflow applies to:</em>, find the entity type that you want this workflow to apply to, such as Content revisions, Content block revisions, or Taxonomy term revisions. Click <em>Select</em>."
msgstr "在<em>此工作流程套用至：</em>下，尋找您要套用此工作流程的實體類型，例如內容修訂、內容區塊修訂或分類架構術語修訂。 按一下<em>選取</em>。"

msgid "Check the entity subtypes that you want to apply the workflow to. For example, you might choose to apply your workflow to the <em>Page</em> content type, but not to <em>Article</em>."
msgstr "勾選您要套用工作流程的實體子類型。例如，您可能會選擇將工作流程套用至<em>頁面</em>內容類型，但不套用至<em>文章</em>。"

msgid "Under <em>Workflow settings</em>, select the <em>Default moderation state</em> for new content."
msgstr "在<em>工作流程設定</em>下方，選取新內容的<em>預設控管狀態</em>。"

msgid "Click <em>Save</em> to save your workflow."
msgstr "按一下<em>儲存</em>以儲存工作流程。"

msgid "Follow the steps in @user_permissions_topic to assign permissions for each transition to roles. The permissions are listed under the <em>@content_moderation_permissions_link</em> section; there is one permission for each transition in each workflow."
msgstr "遵循 @user_permissions_topic 中的步驟，將每項轉移的權限指派給角色。 許可權會列在 <em>@content_moderation_permissions_link</em> 區段下；每一個工作流程中的每一個轉移都有一個許可權。"

msgid "Optionally (recommended), create a view for your custom workflow, to provide a page for content editors to see what content needs to be moderated. You can do this if the Views UI module is installed, by following the steps in the related <em>Creating a new view</em> topic listed below under <em>Related topics</em>. When creating the view, under <em>View settings</em> &gt; <em>Show</em>, select the revision data type you configured the workflow for, and be sure to display the <em>Workflow State</em> field in your view."
msgstr "選擇性地（建議）建立自訂工作流程的視圖，以為內容編輯器提供頁面，用於查看需要控管的內容。如果已安裝「視圖 UI」模組，則可遵循<em>相關主題</em>下方所列相關<em>建立新視圖</em>主題中的步驟來執行此動作。建立視圖時，在<em>視圖設定</em> &gt; <em>顯示</em>下方，請選取您針對其配置工作流程的修訂資料類型，並務必在視圖中顯示<em>工作流程狀態</em>欄位。"

msgid "Configuring content language settings and translation"
msgstr "配置內容語言設定和翻譯"

msgid "Configure language and translation settings for one or more content entity types (see @content_structure_topic for an overview of content entities). To do this, you must have at least two languages configured. Afterwards, you will have a <em>Translate</em> operation available for your content entities, either as a tab or link when you are viewing or editing content, or on content administration pages."
msgstr "配置一個以上內容實體類型的語言和翻譯設定（如需內容實體的概觀，請參閱 @content_structure_topic）。 若要執行此作業，您必須至少已配置兩種語言。 之後，就出現可用於內容實體的<em>翻譯</em>作業，當您檢視或編輯內容時可作為標籤或鏈結提供，在內容管理頁面上也可以進行存取"

msgid "In the <em>Manage</em> administrative menu, navigate to <em>Configuration</em> &gt; <em>Region and language</em> &gt; <em>@translation_settings_link</em>."
msgstr "在「<em>管理</em>」管理功能表中，導覽至<em>配置</em> &gt; <em>地區和語言</em> &gt; <em>@translation_settings_link</em>。"

msgid "Under <em>Custom language settings</em>, find the content entity types that should have customized language settings on your site. Check the box next to each one. A section will appear below the list with settings for that entity type."
msgstr "在<em>自訂語言設定</em>下，尋找應該在網站上具有自訂語言設定的內容實體類型。 勾選每一個類型旁邊的方框。 清單下方會顯示一個區段，其中包含該實體類型的設定。"

msgid "For each entity type you checked, in the settings section below check the boxes for each entity sub-type that should be <em>Translatable</em> on your site. If the entity type does not have sub-types, there is just one check box for the entity type as a whole."
msgstr "針對您勾選的每一個實體類型，在下面的設定區段中，對網站上應該<em>可翻譯</em>的每一個實體子類型勾選其方框。 如果實體類型沒有子類型，整個實體類型就只有一個勾選框。"

msgid "For each entity type or subtype, select the <em>Default language</em>. Also, if you want to have languages other than the default available when you create content, check <em>Show language selector on create and edit pages</em>."
msgstr "針對每一個實體類型或子類型，選取<em>預設語言</em>。 此外，如果您要在建立內容時使用預設語言以外的其他語言，請勾選<em>在建立及編輯頁面上顯示語言選取器</em>。"

msgid "For each <em>Translatable</em> type or sub-type, look through the list of fields for the type or sub-type, and verify that only the fields that should be translatable are checked. For example, you would probably want to translate a <em>Title</em> field, but you might not want to translate a <em>Start date</em> field."
msgstr "針對每一個<em>可翻譯</em>的類型或子類型，請查看類型或子類型的欄位清單，並驗證只勾選了應該可翻譯的欄位。 例如，您可能想要翻譯<em>標題</em>欄位，但不想翻譯<em>開始日期</em>欄位。"

msgid "Click <em>Save configuration</em> when all of your changes are complete."
msgstr "當所有變更都完成時，請按一下<em>儲存配置</em>。"

msgid "Using contextual links"
msgstr "使用環境定義鏈結"

msgid "Use contextual links to access administrative tasks without navigating the administrative menu."
msgstr "使用環境定義鏈結來存取管理作業，而不需導覽管理功能表。"

msgid "What are contextual links?"
msgstr "何謂環境定義鏈結？"

msgid "<em>Contextual links</em> give users with the <em>Use contextual links</em> permission quick access to administrative tasks related to areas of non-administrative pages. For example, if a page on your site displays a block, the block would have a contextual link that would allow users with permission to configure the block. If the block contains a menu or a view, it would also have a contextual link for editing the menu links or the view. Clicking a contextual link takes you to the related administrative page directly, without needing to navigate through the administrative menu system."
msgstr "<em>環境定義鏈結</em>為使用者提供<em>使用環境定義鏈結</em>許可權，讓他們能夠快速存取與非管理頁面區域相關的管理作業。例如，如果網站上的頁面顯示區塊，則區塊會有環境定義鏈結，讓具有許可權的使用者配置區塊。如果區塊包含功能表或視圖，它也會有環境定義鏈結，用於編輯功能表鏈結或視圖。按一下環境定義鏈結會直接將您帶至相關的管理頁面，而不需要導覽一遍管理功能表系統。"

msgid "Make sure that the core Contextual Links module is installed, and that you have a role with the <em>Use contextual links</em> permission. Optionally, make sure that a toolbar module is installed (either the core Toolbar module or a contributed module replacement)."
msgstr "請確定已安裝核心「環境定義鏈結」模組，且您具有<em>使用環境定義鏈結</em>許可權的角色。選擇性地確定已安裝工具列模組（核心「工具列」模組或「提供的模組取代項目」）。"

msgid "Visit a non-administrative page on your site, such as the home page."
msgstr "造訪您網站上的非管理頁面，例如首頁。"

msgid "Locate a block or another area on the page that you want to edit or configure."
msgstr "在頁面上尋找您要編輯或配置的區塊或其他區域。"

msgid "Make the contextual links button visible by hovering your mouse over that area in the page. In most themes, this button looks like a pencil and is placed in the upper right corner of the page area (upper left for right-to-left languages), and hovering will also temporarily outline the affected area. Alternatively, click the contextual links toggle button on the right end of the toolbar (left end for right-to-left languages), which will make all contextual link buttons on the page visible until it is clicked again."
msgstr "將滑鼠移至頁面中的該區域上，以顯示「環境定義鏈結」按鈕。在大部分佈景主題中，此按鈕很像一支鉛筆，被放在頁面區域的右上角（如果是右至左語言，則位於左上方），將滑鼠移至上面也會暫時顯示受影響區域的輪廓。或者，按一下工具列右側的環境定義鏈結切換按鈕（如果是由右至左語言，則位於左側），這會在頁面上顯示所有環境定義鏈結按鈕，直到重新按一下為止。"

msgid "While the contextual links button for the area of interest is visible, click the button to display the list of links for that area. Click a link in the list to visit the corresponding administrative page."
msgstr "當感興趣區域的環境定義鏈結按鈕顯示時，請按一下按鈕，以顯示該區域的鏈結清單。按一下清單中的鏈結，以造訪對應的管理頁面。"

msgid "Complete your administrative task and save your settings, or cancel the action. You should be returned to the page you started from."
msgstr "完成管理作業並儲存設定，或取消動作。您應該回到您原本開始的頁面。"

msgid "Changing the appearance of your site"
msgstr "變更網站的外觀"

msgid "What is a theme?"
msgstr "何謂佈景主題？"

msgid "A <em>theme</em> is a set of files that define the visual look and feel of your site. The core software and modules that run on your site determine which content (including HTML text and other data stored in the database, uploaded images, and any other asset files) is displayed on the pages of your site. The theme determines the HTML markup and CSS styling that wraps the content. Several basic themes are supplied with the core software; additional <em>contributed themes</em> can be downloaded separately from the <a href=\"https://www.drupal.org/project/project_theme\">Download &amp; Extend page on drupal.org</a>, or you can create your own theme."
msgstr "<em>佈景主題</em>是一組檔案，其定義您網站的視覺化外觀與操作方式。執行在您網站上的核心軟體和模組將決定什麼內容（包括 HTML 文字和儲存在資料庫中的其他資料）顯示在您網站的頁面上。佈景主題決定包裝內容的 HTML 標記和 CSS 樣式。核心軟體有提供數個基本佈景主題；其他<em>提供的佈景主題</em>可以從  <a href=\"https://www.drupal.org/project/project_theme\">drupal.org 上的「下載 &amp; 延伸」頁面</a>個別下載，或者，您也可以建立自己專屬的佈景主題。"

msgid "What is a base theme?"
msgstr "何謂基本佈景主題？"

msgid "A base theme is a theme that is not meant to be used directly on a site, but instead acts as a scaffolding for building other themes. The core Stable 9 theme is one example; other base themes can be downloaded from the <a href=\"https://www.drupal.org/project/project_theme\">Download &amp; Extend page on drupal.org</a>."
msgstr "基本佈景主題並是要直接使用在網站上的佈景主題，而是用來作為建置其他佈景主題的鷹架。 核心「穩定 9」佈景主題是一個範例；其他基本佈景主題可以從 <a href=\"https://www.drupal.org/project/project_theme\"> drupal.org</a> 下載。"

msgid "What is a layout?"
msgstr "何謂佈置？"

msgid "A <em>layout</em> is a template that defines where blocks and other pieces of content should be displayed. The core Layout Discovery module allows modules and themes to register layouts, and the core Layout Builder module provides a visual interface for placing fields and blocks in layouts for entity sub-types and individual entity items (see @content_structure_topic for more on entities and fields)."
msgstr "<em>佈置</em>是一種範本，用來定義應該顯示區塊和其他內容片段的位置。 「佈置探索」核心模組可讓模組和佈景主題登錄佈置，「佈置建置器」核心模組則提供視覺化介面，以在實體子類型和個別實體項目的佈置中放置欄位和區塊（如需實體和欄位的相關資訊，請參閱 @content_structure_topic）。"

msgid "Changing site appearance overview"
msgstr "變更網站外觀概觀"

msgid "The main way to change the overall appearance of your site is to switch the default theme. The core Layout Builder and Layout Discovery modules allow you to define layouts for your site's content, and the core Breakpoint module helps themes change appearance for different-sized devices. See the related topics listed below for specific tasks."
msgstr "變更網站整體外觀的主要方式是切換預設佈景主題。 核心「佈置建置器」和「佈置探索」模組可讓您定義網站內容的佈置，而核心「岔斷點」模組可協助佈景主題變更不同大小的裝置之外觀。 如需瞭解特定作業，請參閱下列相關主題。"

msgid "Extending and Customizing Your Site chapter in the User Guide"
msgstr "使用手冊中的「延伸和自訂網站」章節"

msgid "Theming Drupal 8"
msgstr "Drupal 8 設定佈景主題"

msgid "Managing and deploying configuration"
msgstr "管理及部署配置"

msgid "What is the configuration system?"
msgstr "何謂配置系統？"

msgid "The configuration system provides the ability for administrators to customize the site, and to move and synchronize configuration changes between development sites and the live site. It does this in 2 ways:"
msgstr "配置系統可讓管理者自訂網站，並在開發網站與即時網站之間移動及同步化配置變更。它會以 2 種方式執行此動作："

msgid "Providing storage for configuration"
msgstr "提供用於配置的儲存體"

msgid "Providing a process in which configuration changes can be imported and exported between instances of the same site; for example, from \"dev\" to \"staging\" to \"live\""
msgstr "提供在其中可於相同網站的實例之間匯入及匯出配置變更的程序；例如，從「開發」到「暫置」，再到「即時」"

msgid "What is configuration data?"
msgstr "何謂配置資料？"

msgid "Configuration data describes settings that define how your site behaves or is displayed. For example, when a site administrator updates settings using an administrative form, these settings are stored as configuration data. Configuration data describes settings as simple as a site name and as complex as a view or image style."
msgstr "配置資料可說明用於定義網站行為或顯示方式的設定。例如，在網站管理者使用管理表單更新設定時，這些設定會儲存為配置資料。配置資料可說明像網站名稱一樣簡單，以及像視圖或影像樣式一樣複雜的設定。"

msgid "What kinds of configuration are there?"
msgstr "配置有哪些類型？"

msgid "Active configuration"
msgstr "作用中的配置"

msgid "Active configuration is the current working configuration of a site. Storage of active configuration is defined by the site, and resides in the database by default."
msgstr "作用中的配置是網站的現行工作配置。作用中配置的儲存體是由網站定義，且依預設會位於資料庫中。"

msgid "A simple configuration item is a group of settings, such as the settings for a module or theme. Each simple configuration item has its own unique structure."
msgstr "簡式配置項目是一組設定，如模組或佈景主題的設定。每個簡式配置項目皆具有其專屬的唯一結構。"

msgid "Configuration entities"
msgstr "配置實體"

msgid "Configuration entities are user-defined configuration items grouped by type, such as views, image styles, and content types. Each configuration entity within a type has a similar structure."
msgstr "配置實體是依類型分組的使用者定義配置項目，如視圖、影像樣式及內容類型。一種類型內的每個配置實體皆具有類似的結構。"

msgid "Default configuration"
msgstr "預設設定"

msgid "Default configuration can be defined by a module, theme, or installation profile in its <em>config/install</em> or <em>config/optional</em> directories. Configuration is provided in YAML files (file extension .yml); YAML is a human-readable data serialization standard that is used by the core software for several purposes. Once the default configuration has been imported into the site's active configuration (through installing the extension), that configuration is owned by the site, not the extension. This means that future updates of the extension will not override the site's active configuration for that extension."
msgstr "預設配置可以由模組、佈景主題或安裝設定檔在其 <em>config/install</em> 或 <em>config/optional</em> 目錄中定義。配置會以 YAML 檔（副檔名為 .yml）提供；YAML 是人類可讀的資料序列化標準，可供核心軟體用於多種用途。一旦已將預設配置匯入網站的作用中配置（透過安裝延伸），則該配置是由網站（而非延伸）擁有。這表示延伸的未來更新項目不會置換該延伸的網站作用中配置。"

msgid "What is configuration synchronization?"
msgstr "何謂配置同步化？"

msgid "Configuration synchronization is the process of exporting and importing configuration to keep configuration synchronized between different versions of a site; for example, between a development site and the live site."
msgstr "配置同步化是匯出及匯入配置以在網站不同版本之間保持配置同步化的程序；例如，在開發網站與即時網站之間。"

msgid "Each site has unique identifier, also called a <em>UUID</em>, which identifies the site to the system in any instance of the site, as long as the site instances have been reproduced as clones (cloning is when the codebase and database are copied to create a new site instance). When site instances are cloned, a \"dev\" instance of the site has the same UUID as the \"live\" instance. When site instances share the same UUID, configuration can be exported from one instance to another."
msgstr "每個網站皆具有唯一 ID（亦稱為 <em>UUID</em>），可用於向該網站任何實例中的系統識別該網站，只要已將這些網站實例重新產生為複本即可（複製作業是指複製程式碼庫及資料庫以建立新的網站實例）。複製網站實例時，網站的「開發」實例將具有與「即時」實例相同的 UUID。在網站實例共用相同 UUID 時，即可將配置從一個實例匯出至另一個實例。"

msgid "The following list contains terms and concepts related to configuration synchronization:"
msgstr "下列清單包含與配置同步化相關的術語及概念："

msgid "Exported configuration"
msgstr "匯出的配置"

msgid "When configuration is exported, the active configuration is exported as a set of files in YAML format. When using the <em>Configuration synchronization</em> administrative UI, configuration can be exported as a full-export or single-item archive. This archive can then be imported into the destination site instance."
msgstr "匯出配置時，會將作用中配置匯出為 YAML 格式的檔案集。使用<em>配置同步化</em>管理 UI 時，可以將配置匯出為完整匯出或單一項目保存檔。然後，即可將此保存檔匯入目的地網站實例。"

msgid "Imported configuration"
msgstr "匯入的配置"

msgid "Imported configuration is configuration that has been exported from another instance of the site (the \"source\") and is now being imported into another site instance (the \"destination\"), thereby updating its active configuration to match the imported configuration data set."
msgstr "匯入的配置是指已從網站的另一個實例（「來源」）匯出，現在正要匯入另一個網站實例（「目的地」）的配置，因此會更新其作用中配置以符合匯入的配置資料集。"

msgid "Configuration sync directory"
msgstr "配置同步目錄"

msgid "The configuration sync directory location is set in the site's <em>settings.php</em> file. When configuration is exported, the active configuration is exported and described in YAML files which are stored in the configuration sync directory. After the first export, the system compares the site's active configuration with the configuration data in the sync directory and will only export active configuration items that are different than their counterparts in the sync directory."
msgstr "配置同步目錄位置是在網站的 <em>settings.php</em> 檔中設定。匯出配置時，將會匯出作用中配置，並在儲存於配置同步目錄的 YAML 檔中對其進行說明。在第一次匯出之後，系統會將網站的作用中配置與同步目錄中的配置資料進行比較，並僅匯出與同步目錄中其對應項目不同的作用中配置項目。"

msgid "Managing configuration overview"
msgstr "管理配置概觀"

msgid "Configuration management tasks, such as exporting or importing configuration and synchronizing configuration, can be done either through the administrative UI provided by the core Configuration Manager module or a command-line interface (CLI) tool. Defining a configuration sync directory path other than the default value requires read/write access to the site's <em>settings.php</em> file."
msgstr "透過核心「配置管理程式」模組所提供的管理 UI 或指令行介面 (CLI) 工具，即可執行配置管理作業，如匯出或匯入配置以及同步化配置。定義除預設值以外的配置同步目錄路徑，需要對網站 <em>settings.php</em> 檔的讀寫存取權。"

msgid "Most modules and themes also provide settings forms for updating the configuration they provide. See the related topics listed below for specific tasks."
msgstr "大部分模組及佈景主題也會提供設定表單來更新它們提供的配置。如需瞭解特定作業，請參閱下列相關主題。"

msgid "<a href=\"https://www.drupal.org/docs/8/configuration-management/workflow-using-drush\">Configuration management: Workflow using Drush</a>"
msgstr "<a href=\"https://www.drupal.org/docs/8/configuration-management/workflow-using-drush\">配置管理：使用 Drush 的工作流程</a>"

msgid "<a href=\"https://www.drupal.org/docs/user_guide/en/understanding-data.html\">Concept: Types of Data article in the Drupal User Guide</a>"
msgstr "<a href=\"https://www.drupal.org/docs/user_guide/en/understanding-data.html\">Drupal 使用手冊中的「概念：資料類型」文章</a>"

msgid "<a href=\"https://www.drupal.org/docs/user_guide/en/install-dev-sites.html\">Concept: Development Sites article in the Drupal User Guide</a>"
msgstr "<a href=\"https://www.drupal.org/docs/user_guide/en/install-dev-sites.html\">Drupal 使用手冊中的「概念：開發網站」文章</a>"

msgid "<a href=\"https://www.drupal.org/docs/user_guide/en/install-dev-making.html\">Making a Development Site article in the Drupal User Guide</a>"
msgstr "<a href=\"https://www.drupal.org/docs/user_guide/en/install-dev-making.html\">Drupal 使用手冊中的「建立開發網站」文章</a>"

msgid "Managing content structure"
msgstr "管理內容結構"

msgid "What types of data does a site have?"
msgstr "網站有哪些資料類型？"

msgid "There are four main types of data. <em>Content</em> is the information (text, images, etc.) meant to be displayed to website visitors. <em>Configuration</em> is data that defines how the content is displayed; some configuration (such as field labels) may also be visible to site visitors. <em>State</em> is temporary data about the state of your site, such as the last time the system <em>cron</em> jobs ran. <em>Session</em> is a subset of State information, related to users' interactions with the site, such as site cookies and whether or not they are logged in."
msgstr "資料有四種主要類型。<em>內容</em>是要顯示給網站造訪者的資訊（文字、影像等）。<em>配置</em>是定義內容要如何顯示的資料；部分配置（例如欄位標籤）也可以顯示給網站造訪者。<em>狀態</em>是關於您網站狀態的暫用資料，例如系統 <em>cron</em> 工作執行的前次時間。<em>階段作業</em>是狀態資訊的子集，與使用者跟網站的互動相關，例如網站 Cookie，以及他們是否已登入。"

msgid "What is a content entity?"
msgstr "何謂內容實體？"

msgid "A <em>content entity</em> (or more commonly, <em>entity</em>) is an item of content data, which can consist of text, HTML markup, images, attached files, and other data. Content entities are grouped into <em>entity types</em>, which have different purposes and are displayed in very different ways on the site. Most entity types are also divided into <em>entity sub-types</em>, which are divisions within an entity type to allow for smaller variations in how the entities are used and displayed. For example, the <em>Content item</em> entity type that stores page-level content is divided into <em>content type</em> sub-types; the <em>Content block</em> entity type has <em>block types</em>; but the <em>User</em> entity type (for user profile information) does not have sub-types."
msgstr "<em>內容實體</em>（或更常用的<em>實體</em>）是內容資料項目，可包含文字、HTML 標記、影像、附加檔案及其他資料。 內容實體分組為<em>實體類型</em>，其用途不同，且會以非常不同的方式顯示在網站上。 大部分實體類型也會分成<em>實體子類型</em>，它們是實體類型中的分區，以容許在如何使用及顯示實體的方式中有較小的變異。 例如，儲存頁面層次內容的<em>內容項目</em>實體類型可區分為<em>內容類型</em>子類型；<em>內容區塊</em>實體類型具有<em>區塊類型</em>；但<em>使用者</em>實體類型（用於使用者設定檔資訊）沒有子類型。"

msgid "What is a field?"
msgstr "何謂欄位？"

msgid "Within entity items, the data is stored in individual <em>fields</em>, each of which holds one type of data, such as formatted or plain text, images or other files, or dates. Fields can be added by an administrator on entity sub-types, so that all entity items of a given entity sub-type have the same collection of fields available, and they can be single-valued or multiple-valued. When you create or edit entity items, you are specifying the values for the fields on the entity item."
msgstr "在實體項目內，資料會儲存在個別的<em>欄位</em>中，每一個欄位保留一種類型的資料，例如格式化或純文字、影像或其他檔案或日期。管理者可以在實體子類型上新增欄位，因此給定的實體子類型的所有實體項目都具有相同的可用欄位集合，且它們可以是單值或多值。當您建立或編輯實體項目時，您會指定實體項目上欄位的值。"

msgid "What is a reference field?"
msgstr "何謂參照欄位？"

msgid "A <em>reference field</em> is a field that stores a relationship between an entity and one or more other entities, which may belong to the same or different entity type. For example, a <em>Content reference</em> field on a content type stores a relationship between one content item and one or more other content items."
msgstr "<em>參照欄位</em>是儲存實體與一或多個其他實體之間關係的欄位，這些實體可能屬於相同或不同的實體類型。例如，某內容類型上的<em>內容參照</em>欄位儲存一個內容項目與一或多個其他內容項目之間的關係。"

msgid "What field types are available?"
msgstr "可用的欄位類型有哪些？"

msgid "The following field types are provided by the core system and core modules (many more are provided by contributed modules):"
msgstr "下列欄位類型由核心系統和核心模組提供（提供的模組可提供更多）："

msgid "Boolean, Number (provided by the core system): Stores true/false values and numbers"
msgstr "布林、數字（由核心系統提供）：儲存 true/false 值和數字"

msgid "Comment (provided by the core Comment module): Allows users to add comments to an entity"
msgstr "評論（由核心評論模組提供）：容許使用者將評論新增至實體"

msgid "Date, Timestamp (Datetime module): Stores dates and times"
msgstr "日期、時間戳記（日期時間模組）：儲存日期和時間"

msgid "Date range (Datetime range module): Stores time/date periods with a start and an end"
msgstr "日期範圍（日期時間範圍模組）：儲存開始和結束的時間/日期期間"

msgid "Email (core system): Stores email addresses"
msgstr "電子郵件（核心系統）：儲存電子郵件位址"

msgid "Link (Link module): Stores URLs and link text"
msgstr "鏈結（鏈結模組）：儲存 URL 和鏈結文字"

msgid "List (Options module): Stores values chosen from pre-defined lists, where the values can be numbers or text; see section below for more on list fields."
msgstr "清單（「選項」模組）：儲存從預先定義的清單中選擇的值，其中的值可以是數字或文字；如需清單欄位的相關資訊，請參閱下面的小節。"

msgid "Reference (core system): Stores entity references; see section above"
msgstr "參照（核心系統）：儲存實體參照；請參閱上方的小節"

msgid "Telephone (Telephone module): Stores telephone numbers"
msgstr "電話（電話模組）：儲存電話號碼"

msgid "Text (Text module): Stores formatted and unformatted text; see section below for more on text fields."
msgstr "文字（「文字」模組）：儲存格式化及未格式化的文字；如需文字欄位的相關資訊，請參閱下面的小節。"

msgid "What settings are available for List field types?"
msgstr "清單欄位類型有哪些可用的設定？"

msgid "List fields associate pre-defined <em>keys</em> (or value codes) with <em>labels</em> that the user sees. For example, you might define a list field that shows the user the names of several locations, while behind the scenes a location code is stored in the database. Each list field type corresponds to one type of stored key. For example, a <em>List (integer)</em> field stores integers, while the <em>List (text)</em> field stores text strings. Once you have chosen the field type, the main setting for a list field is the <em>Allowed values</em> list, which associates the keys with the labels."
msgstr "清單欄位會將預先定義的<em>索引鍵</em>（或值代碼）與使用者看到的<em>標籤</em>相關聯。例如，您可能會定義向使用者顯示數個位置名稱的清單欄位，而在背景中會將位置碼儲存在資料庫中。每個清單欄位類型皆對應於一種類型的已儲存索引鍵。例如，<em>清單（整數）</em>欄位會儲存整數，而<em>清單（文字）</em>欄位會儲存字串。一旦已選擇欄位類型，清單欄位的主要設定便是<em>容許的值</em>清單，它會將索引鍵與標籤相關聯。"

msgid "What types of Text fields are available?"
msgstr "文字欄位有哪些可用的類型？"

msgid "There are several types of text fields, with different characteristics. Text fields can be either <em>plain</em> or <em>formatted</em>: plain text fields do not contain HTML, while formatted fields can contain HTML and are processed through <em>text filters</em> (these are provided by the core Filter module; if you have that module enabled, see the related topic below on filters for more information). Text fields can also be regular-length (with a limit of 255 characters) or <em>long</em> (with a very large character limit), and long formatted text fields can include a <em>summary</em> attribute. All possible combinations of these characteristics exist as text field types; for example, <em>Text (plain)</em> and <em>Text (formatted, long, with summary)</em> are two examples of text field types."
msgstr "文字欄位有數種類型，且具有不同的性質。文字欄位可以是<em>純文字</em>或<em>格式化</em>：純文字欄位不包含 HTML，而格式化欄位可以包含 HTML，且會透過<em>文字過濾器</em>（這些過濾器是由核心「過濾器」模組提供；如果您已啟用該模組，請參閱下面的過濾器相關主題以取得相關資訊）進行處理。文字欄位也可以是一般長度（限制為 255 個字元）或<em>長</em>（具有非常大的字元限制），且長格式化文字欄位可以包含<em>摘要</em>屬性。這些性質的所有可能的組合皆會作為文字欄位類型而存在；例如，<em>文字（純文字）</em>及<em>文字（格式化、長、含摘要）</em>是文字欄位類型的兩個範例。"

msgid "What is a formatter?"
msgstr "何謂格式製作程式？"

msgid "A <em>formatter</em> is a way to display a field; most field types offer several types of formatters, and most formatters have settings that further define how the field is displayed. It is also possible to completely hide a field from display, and you have the option of showing or hiding the field's label when it is displayed."
msgstr "<em>格式製作程式</em>是顯示欄位的一種方式；大部分欄位類型提供數種類型的格式製作程式，而且大部分格式製作程式都具有設定，能進一步定義欄位的顯示方式。也可以完全隱藏欄位不顯示，而且您可以選擇在顯示欄位時選擇要顯示或隱藏該欄位的標籤。"

msgid "What is a widget?"
msgstr "何謂小組件？"

msgid "A <em>widget</em> is a way to edit a field. Some field types, such as plain text single-line fields, have only one widget available (in this case, a single-line text input field). Other field types offer choices for the widget; for example, single-valued <em>List</em> fields can use a <em>Select</em> or <em>Radio button</em> widget for editing. Many widget types have settings that further define how the field can be edited."
msgstr "<em>小組件</em>是編輯欄位的一種方式。部分欄位類型（例如純文字單行欄位）只有一個小組件可用（在此情況下，是指單行文字輸入欄位）。 其他欄位類型提供小組件的選擇；例如，單值<em>清單</em>欄位可以使用<em>選取</em>或<em>圓鈕</em>小組件來進行編輯。許多小組件類型都有設定能進一步定義如何編輯欄位。"

msgid "Managing content structure overview"
msgstr "管理內容結構概觀"

msgid "Besides the field modules listed in the previous section, there are additional core modules that you can use to manage your content structure:"
msgstr "除了上一節列出的欄位模組外，還有其他核心模組，您可以用來管理內容結構："

msgid "The core Node, Comment, Content Block, Custom Menu Links, User, File, Image, Media, Taxonomy, and Contact modules all provide content entity types."
msgstr "核心「節點」、「註解」、「內容區塊」、「自訂功能表鏈結」、「使用者」、「檔案」、「影像」、「媒體」、「分類架構」及「聯絡人」模組都會提供內容實體類型。"

msgid "The core Field UI module provides a user interface for managing fields and their display on entities."
msgstr "核心「欄位使用者介面」模組提供使用者介面來管理欄位及其在實體上的顯示方式。"

msgid "The core Layout Builder module provides a more flexible user interface for configuring the display of entities."
msgstr "核心「佈置建置器」模組提供更彈性的使用者介面來配置實體的顯示方式。"

msgid "The core Filter, Responsive Image, and Path modules provide settings and display options for entities and fields."
msgstr "核心「過濾器」、「回應式影像」和「路徑」模組提供實體和欄位的設定和顯示選項。"

msgid "Depending on the core and contributed modules that you currently have installed on your site, the related topics below and other topics listed on the main help page (see @help_link) will help you with tasks related to content structure."
msgstr "視您目前已在網站上安裝的核心及提供的模組而定，下列相關主題以及主要說明頁面上列出的其他主題（請參閱 @help_link）將會會協助您處理與內容結構相關的作業。"

msgid "<a href=\"https://www.drupal.org/docs/user_guide/en/understanding-data.html\">Concept: Types of Data topic in the User Guide</a>"
msgstr "<a href=\"https://www.drupal.org/docs/user_guide/en/understanding-data.html\">使用手冊中的「概念：資料類型」主題</a>"

msgid "<a href=\"https://www.drupal.org/docs/user_guide/en/planning-chapter.html\">Planning your Site chapter in the User Guide</a>"
msgstr "<a href=\"https://www.drupal.org/docs/user_guide/en/planning-chapter.html\">使用手冊中的「規劃網站」章節</a>"

msgid "<a href=\"https://www.drupal.org/docs/user_guide/en/structure-reference-fields.html\">Concept: Reference Fields topic in the User Guide</a>"
msgstr "<a href=\"https://www.drupal.org/docs/user_guide/en/structure-reference-fields.html\">使用手冊中的「概念：參照欄位」主題</a>"

msgid "Running and configuring cron"
msgstr "執行及配置 cron"

msgid "Cron"
msgstr "Cron"

msgid "Configure your system so that cron will run automatically."
msgstr "配置系統，讓 cron 自動執行。"

msgid "What are cron tasks?"
msgstr "何謂 cron 作業？"

msgid "To ensure that your site and its modules continue to function well, a group of administrative operations should be run periodically. These operations are called <em>cron</em> tasks, and running the tasks is known as <em>running cron</em>. Depending on how often content is updated on your site, you might need to run cron on a schedule ranging from hourly to weekly to keep your site running well."
msgstr "為了確保您的網站及其模組繼續運作良好，應該定期執行一組管理作業。這些作業稱為 <em>cron</em> 作業，而執行這些作業稱為<em>執行 cron</em>。視網站上更新內容的頻率而定，您可能需要以每小時到每週的排程執行 cron，讓您的網站運作良好。"

msgid "What options are available for running cron?"
msgstr "您可以使用哪些選項來執行 cron？"

msgid "If the core Automated Cron module is installed, your site will run cron periodically, on a schedule you can configure."
msgstr "如果已安裝核心「自動化 Cron」模組，則您的網站會依您可以配置的排程來定期執行 cron。"

msgid "You can set up a task on your web server to visit the <em> cron URL</em>, which is unique to your site, on a schedule."
msgstr "您可以在 Web 伺服器上設定作業，依排程造訪您的網站所特有的 <em>cron URL</em>。"

msgid "You can also run cron manually, but this is not the recommended way to make sure it is run periodically."
msgstr "您也可以手動執行 cron，但不建議這麼做，因為這樣無法確保定期執行。"

msgid "In the <em>Manage</em> administration menu, navigate to <em>Configuration</em> &gt; <em>System</em> &gt; <em>@cron_link</em>. Note the <em>Last run</em> time on the page."
msgstr "在<em>管理</em>管理功能表中，導覽至<em>配置</em> &gt; <em>系統</em> &gt; <em>@cron_link</em>。 請注意頁面上的<em>前次執行</em>時間。"

msgid "If you want to run cron right now, click <em>Run cron</em> and wait for cron to finish."
msgstr "如果您想要立即執行 cron，請按一下<em>執行 cron</em>，然後等待 cron 完成。"

msgid "If you have a way to configure tasks on your web server, copy the link where it says <em>To run cron from outside the site, go to</em>. Set up a task to visit that URL on your desired cron schedule, such as once an hour or once a week. (On Linux-like servers, you can use the <em>wget</em> command to visit a URL.) If you configure an outside task, you should uninstall the Automated Cron module."
msgstr "如果您有方法在 Web 伺服器上配置作業，請複製指出<em>若要從網站外執行 cron，請跳至</em>的鏈結。設定作業來依您所要的 cron 排程造訪 URL，例如一小時一次，或一週一次。（在類似 Linux 的伺服器上，您可以使用 <em>wget</em> 指令來造訪 URL。）如果您配置外部作業，則應該將「自動化 Cron」模組解除安裝。"

msgid "If you are not configuring an outside task, and you have the core Automated Cron module installed, select a schedule for automated cron runs in <em>Cron settings</em> &gt; <em>Run cron every</em>. Click <em>Save configuration</em>."
msgstr "如果您未配置外部作業，且已安裝核心「自動化 Cron」模組，請在 <em>Cron 設定</em> &gt; <em>執行 cron 的時間間隔</em>中選取自動化 cron 執行的排程。按一下<em>儲存配置</em>。"

msgid "<a href=\"https://www.drupal.org/docs/user_guide/en/security-cron-concept.html\">Concept: Cron in the User Guide</a>"
msgstr "<a href=\"https://www.drupal.org/docs/user_guide/en/security-cron-concept.html\">使用手冊中的「概念：Cron」</a>"

msgid "<a href=\"https://www.drupal.org/docs/user_guide/en/security-cron.html\">Configuring Cron Maintenance Tasks in the User Guide</a>"
msgstr "<a href=\"https://www.drupal.org/docs/user_guide/en/security-cron.html\">使用手冊中的「配置 Cron 維護作業」</a>"

msgid "Extending and modifying your site functionality"
msgstr "擴充及修改網站功能"

msgid "What is a module?"
msgstr "何謂模組？"

msgid "A <em>module</em> is a set of PHP, JavaScript, and/or CSS files that extends site features and adds functionality. A set of <em>Core modules</em> is distributed as part of the core software download. Additional <em>Contributed modules</em> can be downloaded separately from the <a href=\"https://www.drupal.org/project/project_module\">Download &amp; Extend page on drupal.org</a>."
msgstr "<em>模組</em>是一組 PHP、JavaScript 和/或 CSS 檔，其延伸網站特性及新增功能。核心軟體下載時已分送一組<em>核心模組</em>。其他<em>提供的模組</em>可以從 <a href=\"https://www.drupal.org/project/project_module\">drupal.org 上的「下載 &amp; 延伸」頁面</a>個別下載。"

msgid "What is an Experimental module?"
msgstr "何謂試驗性模組？"

msgid "An <em>Experimental</em> module is a module that is still in development and is not yet stable. Using Experimental modules on production sites is not recommended."
msgstr "<em>試驗性</em>模組是目前仍在開發中且尚未穩定的模組。不建議在正式作業網站上使用試驗性模組。"

msgid "What are installing and uninstalling?"
msgstr "何謂安裝及解除安裝？"

msgid "Installing a core or downloaded contributed module means turning it on, so that you can use its features and functionality. Uninstalling means turning it off and removing all of its configuration. A module cannot be uninstalled if another installed module depends on it, or if you have created content on your site using the module -- you would need to delete the content and uninstall dependent modules first."
msgstr "安裝核心或已下載的所提供模組表示開啟該模組，讓您可以使用其特性和功能。解除安裝表示將其關閉並移除其所有配置。如果某個模組有另一個已安裝的模組相依，或者您已使用該模組在網站上建立內容，則無法將該模組解除安裝 -- 您需要先刪除內容，並將相依模組解除安裝。"

msgid "Extending overview"
msgstr "延伸概觀"

msgid "See the related topics listed below for help performing tasks related to extending the functionality of your site."
msgstr "請參閱下列相關主題，以協助執行與延伸網站功能相關的作業。"

msgid "<a href=\"https://www.drupal.org/docs/user_guide/en/understanding-modules.html\">Concept: Modules topic in the User Guide</a>"
msgstr "<a href=\"https://www.drupal.org/docs/user_guide/en/understanding-modules.html\">使用手冊中的「概念：模組」主題</a>"

msgid "<a href=\"https://www.drupal.org/docs/user_guide/en/extend-chapter.html\">Extending and customizing your site chapter in the User Guide</a>"
msgstr "<a href=\"https://www.drupal.org/docs/user_guide/en/extend-chapter.html\">使用手冊中的「延伸及自訂網站」章節</a>"

msgid "Maintaining and troubleshooting your site"
msgstr "維護及疑難排解網站"

msgid "Maintaining and troubleshooting overview"
msgstr "維護及疑難排解概觀"

msgid "Here are some tasks and hints related to maintaining your site, and troubleshooting problems that may come up on your site. See the related topics below for more information."
msgstr "以下的一些作業和提示是關於維護您的網站，以及對於您的網站上可能出現的問題進行疑難排解。如需相關資訊，請參閱下面的相關主題。"

msgid "When performing maintenance, such as installing, uninstalling, or upgrading a module, put your site in maintenance mode."
msgstr "執行維護時，例如安裝、解除安裝或升級模組，請將網站置於維護模式。"

msgid "Configure your site so that cron runs periodically."
msgstr "配置您的網站，以便定期執行 cron。"

msgid "If your site is not behaving as expected, clear the cache before trying to diagnose the problem."
msgstr "如果您的網站行為未如預期，請清除快取之後，再嘗試診斷該問題。"

msgid "There are several site reports that can help you diagnose problems with your site. There are also two core modules that can be used for error logging: Database Logging and Syslog."
msgstr "有幾個網站報告可以協助您診斷網站的問題。還有兩個可用來進行錯誤記載的核心模組：資料庫記載及 Syslog。"

msgid "<a href=\"https://www.drupal.org/docs/user_guide/en/prevent-chapter.html\">Preventing and Fixing Problems chapter in the User Guide</a>"
msgstr "<a href=\"https://www.drupal.org/docs/user_guide/en/prevent-chapter.html\">「使用者手冊」中的「防止及修正問題」章節</a>"

msgid "<a href=\"https://www.drupal.org/docs/user_guide/en/security-chapter.html\">Security and Maintenance chapter in the User Guide</a>"
msgstr "<a href=\"https://www.drupal.org/docs/user_guide/en/security-chapter.html\">「使用者手冊」中的「安全及維護」章節</a>"

msgid "Managing media"
msgstr "管理媒體"

msgid "What are media items?"
msgstr "何謂媒體項目？"

msgid "Core media items include audio, images, documents, and videos. You can add other media types, such as social media posts, through the use of contributed modules. Media items may be files located in your site's file system, or remote items referenced by a URL. Media items are content entities, and they are divided into media types (which are entity sub-types); media types can have fields. See @content_structure_topic for more information on content entities and fields."
msgstr "核心媒體項目包括音訊、影像、文件及視訊。 您可以透過使用提供的模組來新增其他媒體類型，如社交媒體貼文。 媒體項目可以是位於網站檔案系統中的檔案，或 URL 所參照的遠端項目。 媒體項目是內容實體，它們會分為媒體類型（即實體子類型）；媒體類型可以具有欄位。 如需內容實體和欄位的相關資訊，請參閱 @content_structure_topic。"

msgid "What is the media library?"
msgstr "何謂媒體庫？"

msgid "The media library is a visual user interface for managing and reusing media items. Add media items to content using Media reference fields and the Media library field widget."
msgstr "媒體庫是用來管理及重複使用媒體項目的視覺化使用者介面。使用媒體參照欄位及媒體庫欄位小組件將媒體項目新增至內容。"

msgid "What is an image style?"
msgstr "何謂影像樣式？"

msgid "An image style is a set of processing steps, known as <em>effects</em>, that can be applied to images. Examples of effects include scaling and cropping images to different sizes. Responsive image styles can associate image styles with your theme's size breakpoints. This allows serving images sized for the browser width."
msgstr "影像樣式是可以套用至影像的一組處理步驟（稱為<em>效果</em>）。效果範例包括將影像調整及裁剪成不同的大小。回應式影像樣式可以將影像樣式與佈景主題的大小岔斷點相關聯。這將容許提供針對瀏覽器寬度調整大小的影像。"

msgid "Overview of managing media"
msgstr "管理媒體的概觀"

msgid "The following modules provide media-related functionality:"
msgstr "下列模組提供媒體相關功能："

msgid "Media items and media types are managed by the core Media module."
msgstr "媒體項目及媒體類型是由核心「媒體」模組管理。"

msgid "The core Media module provides a Media reference field to add media to content entities. The core File and Image modules also provide reference fields. It is recommended to use the Media reference field because it is more versatile."
msgstr "核心「媒體」模組提供媒體參照欄位，以將媒體新增至內容實體。核心「檔案」及「影像」模組也提供參照欄位。建議使用媒體參照欄位，因為它更通用。"

msgid "The core Media Library module provides the media library and the Media library field widget. With this module installed, the Media library field widget becomes the default widget for editing Media reference fields."
msgstr "核心「媒體庫」模組提供媒體庫及媒體庫欄位小組件。安裝此模組之後，媒體庫欄位小組件會變成編輯媒體參照欄位的預設小組件。"

msgid "The core Image module provides a user interface for defining image styles. The core Responsive Image module provides responsive image styles. Using the core Breakpoint module, and a breakpoint-enabled theme, these responsive styles can serve images sized for the browser."
msgstr "核心「影像」模組提供用來定義影像樣式的使用者介面。核心「回應式影像」模組提供回應式影像樣式。透過使用核心「岔斷點」模組及啟用岔斷點的佈景主題，這些回應式樣式即可提供針對瀏覽器調整大小的影像。"

msgid "<a href=\"https://www.drupal.org/docs/8/core/modules/media\">Media module</a>"
msgstr "<a href=\"https://www.drupal.org/docs/8/core/modules/media\">媒體模組</a>"

msgid "Managing menus"
msgstr "管理選單"

msgid "What is a menu?"
msgstr "何謂功能表？"

msgid "A menu is a collection of <em>menu links</em> used to navigate a web site. Menus and menu links can be provided by modules or site administrators."
msgstr "功能表是用來導覽網站的<em>功能表鏈結</em>之集合。功能表及功能表鏈結可由模組或網站管理者提供。"

msgid "Managing menus overview"
msgstr "管理功能表概觀"

msgid "The core Menu UI module provides a user interface for managing menus, including creating new menus, reordering menu links, and disabling links provided by modules. It also provides the ability for links to content items to be added to menus while editing, if configured on the content type. The core Custom Menu Links module provides the ability to add custom links to menus. Each menu can be displayed by placing a block in a theme region; some themes also can display a menu outside of the block system. See the related topics listed below for specific tasks."
msgstr "核心「功能表 UI」模組提供使用者介面來管理功能表，其中包括建立新的功能表、重新排序功能表鏈結，以及停用模組提供的鏈結。如果已在內容類型中進行配置，它亦可讓您在編輯時將內容項目的鏈結新增至功能表。核心「自訂功能表鏈結」模組可讓您將自訂鏈結新增至功能表。每個功能表皆可透過在佈景主題區域中放置一個區塊來顯示；部分佈景主題亦可在區塊系統外部顯示功能表。如需瞭解特定作業，請參閱下列相關主題。"

msgid "Additional Resources"
msgstr "其他資源"

msgid "<a href=\"https://www.drupal.org/docs/user_guide/en/menu-concept.html\">User guide page Concept: Menu</a>"
msgstr "<a href=\"https://www.drupal.org/docs/user_guide/en/menu-concept.html\">使用者手冊的概念：功能表頁面</a>"

msgid "Optimizing site performance"
msgstr "將網站效能最佳化"

msgid "What is site performance?"
msgstr "何謂網站效能？"

msgid "Site performance, in this context, refers to speed factors such as the page load time and the response time after a user action on a page."
msgstr "在此環境定義中，網站效能指的是速度係數，例如頁面載入時間和頁面上發生使用者動作之後的回應時間。"

msgid "What is caching?"
msgstr "何謂快取？"

msgid "Caching is saving already-rendered HTML output and other calculated data for later use the first time it is needed. This saves time, because the next time the same data is needed it can be quickly retrieved instead of recalculated. Automatic caching systems also include mechanisms to delete cached calculations or mark them as no longer valid when the underlying data changes. To facilitate that, cached data has a <em>lifetime</em>, which is the maximum time before the data will be deleted from the cache (forcing recalculation)."
msgstr "快取儲存已呈現的 HTML 輸出及其他計算的資料，以供稍後第一次需要時使用。這會節省時間，因為下次需要相同資料時，就可以快速擷取，而不用重新計算。自動快取系統還包括在基礎資料變更時刪除已快取計算或將其標示為不再有效的機制。為了協助達成，快取的資料具有<em>生命期限</em>，這是從快取中刪除資料之前的時間上限（強制執行重新計算）。"

msgid "What is file aggregation?"
msgstr "何謂檔案聚集？"

msgid "Aggregation is when CSS and JavaScript files are merged together and compressed into a format that is much smaller than the original. This allows for faster transmission and faster rendering on the other end."
msgstr "當 CSS 和 JavaScript 檔合併在一起並壓縮成比原始格式小很多的格式時，這就是聚集。這樣可以在另一端進行更快的傳輸及更快的呈現。"

msgid "What can I do to improve my site's performance?"
msgstr "我可以做些什麼來改善我網站的效能？"

msgid "The following Drupal core modules and mechanisms can improve your site's performance:"
msgstr "下列 Drupal 核心模組和機制可以改善您網站的效能："

msgid "Internal Page Cache module"
msgstr "內部頁面快取模組"

msgid "Caches pages requested by users who are not logged in (anonymous users). Do not use if your site needs to send different output to different anonymous users."
msgstr "快取未登入的使用者（匿名使用者）所要求的頁面。如果您的網站需要將不同的輸出傳送給不同的匿名使用者，請不要使用。"

msgid "Internal Dynamic Page Cache module"
msgstr "內部動態頁面快取模組"

msgid "Caches data for both authenticated and anonymous users, with non-cacheable data in the page converted to placeholders and calculated when the page is requested."
msgstr "快取已鑑別使用者和匿名使用者的資料，頁面中的非快取資料會轉換為位置保留元，並在要求頁面時計算。"

msgid "Big Pipe module"
msgstr "Big Pipe 模組"

msgid "Changes the way pages are sent to users, so that cacheable parts are sent out first with placeholders, and the uncacheable or personalized parts of the page are streamed afterwards. This allows the browser to render the bulk of the page quickly and fill in the details later."
msgstr "變更頁面傳送給使用者的方式，讓可快取的部分先與位置保留元一起送出，之後再以串流方式處理頁面的未快取部分或個人化部分。這可讓瀏覽器快速呈現頁面主體，並在稍後填寫詳細資料。"

msgid "Performance page settings"
msgstr "效能頁面設定"

msgid "In the <em>Manage</em> administrative menu, if you navigate to <em>Configuration</em> &gt; <em>Development</em> &gt; <em>Performance</em>, you will find a setting for the maximum cache lifetime, as well as the ability to turn on CSS and JavaScript file aggregation."
msgstr "在<em>管理</em>管理功能表中，如果您導覽至<em>配置</em> &gt; <em>開發</em> &gt; <em>效能</em>，您將會找到快取生命期限上限的設定，以及開啟 CSS 和 JavaScript 檔案聚集的能力。"

msgid "Online documentation for the Internal Page Cache module"
msgstr "內部頁面快取模組的線上文件"

msgid "Online documentation for the Internal Dynamic Page Cache module"
msgstr "內部動態頁面快取模組的線上文件"

msgid "Online documentation for the BigPipe module"
msgstr "BigPipe 模組的線上文件"

msgid "Making your site secure"
msgstr "維護網站安全"

msgid "What are security updates?"
msgstr "何謂安全更新項目？"

msgid "Any software occasionally has bugs, and sometimes these bugs have security implications. When security bugs are fixed in the core software, modules, or themes that your site uses, they are released in a <em>security update</em>. You will need to apply security updates in order to keep your site secure."
msgstr "任何軟體偶爾都會有錯誤，有時這些錯誤有安全疑慮。當安全錯誤在核心軟體、模組或網站所使用的佈景主題中修正之後，它們會在<em>安全更新項目</em>中釋放。您需要套用安全更新項目，才能確保網站安全。"

msgid "What are security advisories?"
msgstr "何謂安全公告？"

msgid "A security advisory is a public announcement about a reported security problem in the core software. Contributed projects with a shield icon and \"Stable releases for this project are covered by the security advisory policy\" on their project page are also covered by Drupal's security advisory policy. Security advisories are managed by the <a href=\"https://www.drupal.org/drupal-security-team\">Drupal Security Team</a>."
msgstr "安全諮詢是關於核心軟體中所報告的安全問題的公開公告。 在其專案頁面上，具有防護圖示及「安全諮詢原則涵蓋此專案的穩定版本」的所提供專案也涵蓋在 Drupal 的安全諮詢原則中。 安全諮詢由 <a href=\"https://www.drupal.org/drupal-security-team\">Drupal 安全團隊</a>管理。"

msgid "Security tasks"
msgstr "安全作業"

msgid "Keeping track of updates, updating the core software, and updating contributed modules and/or themes are all part of keeping your site secure. See the related topics listed below for specific tasks."
msgstr "追蹤更新項目、更新核心軟體，以及更新提供的模組和/或佈景主題都是維護網站安全的一環。請參閱下列關於特定作業的相關主題。"

msgid "<a href=\"https://www.drupal.org/drupal-security-team/security-advisory-process-and-permissions-policy\">Security advisory process and permissions policy</a>"
msgstr "<a href=\"https://www.drupal.org/drupal-security-team/security-advisory-process-and-permissions-policy\">安全諮詢處理程序及許可權原則</a>"

msgid "Using in-line (quick) settings editing"
msgstr "使用行內（快速）設定編輯"

msgid "Edit settings in place."
msgstr "就地編輯設定。"

msgid "What is quick editing?"
msgstr "何謂快速編輯？"

msgid "The core Settings Tray module provides the ability to quickly edit settings inline. It requires the core Contextual Links module in order to expose the links that let you edit in place."
msgstr "核心「設定匣」模組可讓您快速行內編輯設定。 它需要核心「環境定義鏈結」模組，才能公開可讓您就地編輯的鏈結。"

msgid "Who can edit settings in place?"
msgstr "誰可以就地編輯設定？"

msgid "In order to follow these steps to edit settings in place, the core Settings Tray module must be installed. Also, either the core Toolbar module or a contributed replacement must be installed. You will need to have <em>Use contextual links</em> permission, as well as permission to edit the particular content or settings."
msgstr "若要遵循這些步驟來就地編輯設定，必須安裝核心「設定匣」模組。 另外，也必須安裝「工具列」核心模組或提供的取代項目。 您將需要擁有<em>使用環境定義鏈結</em>權限，以及編輯特定內容或設定的權限。"

msgid "Find and visit a page on your site that has the settings that you would like to edit."
msgstr "尋找並造訪您網站上具有您要編輯之設定的頁面。"

msgid "Click the contextual links <em>Edit</em> button on the toolbar (in most themes, it looks like a pencil). Contextual <em>Edit</em> links with the same icon will appear all over your page."
msgstr "按一下工具列上的環境定義鏈結<em>編輯</em>按鈕（在大部分的佈景主題中，它看起來像鉛筆）。 具有相同圖示的環境定義<em>編輯</em>鏈結將顯示在您的頁面上。"

msgid "Find the contextual link for the part of the page you want to edit. For example, if you want to edit the settings for a block, the link should be in the top-right corner of the block, or top-left for right-to-left languages."
msgstr "尋找您要編輯之頁面部分的環境定義鏈結。 例如，如果您要編輯區塊的設定，則鏈結應該位在區塊的右上角，若是由右至左語言則位在左上角。"

msgid "Click the link to open the contextual links menu, and click <em>Quick edit</em>. An editing form for the settings should appear on the page."
msgstr "按一下鏈結以開啟環境定義鏈結功能表，然後按一下<em>快速編輯</em>。 頁面上應該會出現設定的編輯表單。"

msgid "Make your edits and submit the form."
msgstr "進行編輯並提交表單。"

msgid "Tracking the content of your website"
msgstr "追蹤網站內容"

msgid "Tracking overview"
msgstr "追蹤概觀"

msgid "The core History module tracks how recently users have viewed content items, and provides a Views field and filter that can be used to show users content that they haven't yet seen."
msgstr "核心「歷程」模組會追蹤使用者最近檢視內容項目的方式，並提供視圖欄位及過濾器，用來向使用者顯示他們尚未看到的內容。"

msgid "If you have one or more tracking modules installed on your site, see the related topics listed below for specific tasks."
msgstr "如果已在網站上安裝一個以上的追蹤模組，請參閱下列相關主題以瞭解特定作業。"

msgid "Working with languages and translations"
msgstr "使用語言和翻譯"

msgid "What text can be translated in your site?"
msgstr "在您的網站中可以翻譯哪些文字？"

msgid "There are three types of text that can be translated:"
msgstr "有三種類型的文字可以翻譯："

msgid "Content (blocks, content items, etc.) can be written in English or another language, and can be translated into additional languages. See @content_structure_topic to learn more about content."
msgstr "內容（區塊、內容項目等）可使用英文或另一種語言撰寫，並可以翻譯成其他語言。 請參閱 @content_structure_topic 以進一步瞭解內容。"

msgid "Many configuration items also include text that can be translated. Default configuration provided by your site's software is provided in English; you can also download community-provided translations. See @config_overview_topic to learn more about configuration."
msgstr "許多配置項目也包括可翻譯的文字。 您網站軟體所提供的預設配置是以英文提供；您也可以下載社群提供的翻譯。 請參閱 @config_overview_topic  以進一步瞭解配置。"

msgid "User interface text that is provided by the core software, your install profile, themes, and modules is provided in English, but can be translated into other languages. You can also download translations that community-members have provided."
msgstr "由核心軟體所提供的使用者介面文字、您的安裝設定檔、佈景主題及模組是以英文提供，但可以翻譯成其他語言。 您也可以下載社群成員提供的翻譯。"

msgid "Working with languages overview"
msgstr "使用語言概觀"

msgid "The core Language module lets you add new languages to your site, provides the <em>Language switcher</em> block, and provides the ability to configure block visibility by language; the block and block visibility settings are only available if you have multiple languages configured. The core Content Translation, Configuration Translation, and Interface Translation modules let you translate content, configuration, and the built-in user interface, respectively. The core Update Manager module manages automatic downloads of community-provided translations of default configuration and user-interface text. See the related topics listed below for specific tasks."
msgstr "「語言」核心模組可讓您將語言新增至網站、提供<em>語言切換器</em>區塊，以及提供依語言配置區塊可見性的功能；只有在您已配置多種語言時，才能使用區塊和區塊可見性設定。 「內容翻譯」、「配置翻譯」及「介面翻譯」核心模組，可讓您分別翻譯內容、配置及內建的使用者介面。 「更新管理程式」核心模組則管理社群所提供之預設配置和使用者介面文字翻譯的自動下載。 如需瞭解特定作業，請參閱下列相關主題。"

msgid "Accessibility of the administrative interface"
msgstr "管理介面的協助工具"

msgid "Overview of accessibility"
msgstr "協助工具概觀"

msgid "The core administrative interface has built-in compliance with many accessibility standards so that most pages are accessible to most users in their default state. However, certain pages become more accessible to some users through the use of a non-default or improved interface. These interfaces include:"
msgstr "核心管理介面的內建項目符合許多協助工具標準，因此大部分使用者都可以在預設狀態中存取大部分頁面。 不過，透過使用非預設或改良的介面，可讓一些使用者更容易存取某些頁面。 這些介面包括："

msgid "Disabling drag-and-drop functionality"
msgstr "停用拖放功能"

msgid "The default drag-and-drop user interface for ordering tables in the administrative interface presents a challenge for some users, including keyboard-only users and users of screen readers and other assistive technology. The drag-and-drop interface can be disabled in a table by clicking a link labeled <em>Show row weights</em> above the table. The replacement interface allows users to order the table by choosing numerical weights (with increasing numbers) instead of dragging table rows."
msgstr "在管理介面中排序表格的預設拖放使用者介面會對某些使用者而言是一種挑戰，包括僅使用鍵盤的使用者和螢幕閱讀器及其他輔助技術的使用者。您可以在表格中按一下表格上方標示為<em>顯示列加權</em>的鏈結，來停用拖放介面。此取代介面可讓使用者選擇數值加權（增加數字），而不必拖曳表格列來排序表格。"

msgid "Enabling inline form errors"
msgstr "啟用行內表單錯誤"

msgid "Errors that occur when you submit a form, such as not filling in a required field, are sometimes difficult for users to understand and locate. In order to make these errors easier to find, the best practice is to put a summary of the errors at the top of the form page. To make them easier to understand, the best practice is to display error messages with the form fields they are related to. Both of these practices are implemented by the core Inline Form Errors module."
msgstr "使用者有時很難瞭解及尋找當您提交表單時所發生的錯誤，例如未填寫必要欄位。 為了更容易找到這些錯誤，最佳作法是將錯誤的摘要放在表單頁面的頂端。 為了使這些錯誤更容易令人瞭解，最佳作法是使用與其相關的表單欄位來顯示錯誤訊息。 這兩種作法都是由「行內表單錯誤」核心模組來實作。"

msgid "Using the administrative interface"
msgstr "使用管理介面"

msgid "What administrative interface components are available?"
msgstr "有哪些管理介面元件可用？"

msgid "The following administrative interface components are provided by Drupal core and its modules (some contributed modules offer additional functionality):"
msgstr "Drupal 核心及其模組提供下列管理介面元件（部分提供的模組提供其他功能）："

msgid "Accessibility features, to enable all users to perform administrative tasks. See @accessibility_topic for more information."
msgstr "協助工具特性，讓所有使用者都能夠執行管理作業。 如需相關資訊，請參閱 @accessibility_topic。"

msgid "A menu system, which you can navigate to find pages for administrative tasks. The core Toolbar module displays this menu on the top or left side of the page (right side in right-to-left languages). There are also contributed module replacements for the core Toolbar module, with additional features, such as the <a href=\"https://www.drupal.org/project/admin_toolbar\">Admin Toolbar module</a>."
msgstr "功能表系統，您可以導覽來尋找管理作業的頁面。核心「工具列」模組會將此功能表顯示在頁面頂端或左側（如果是由右至左的語言，則在右側）。核心「工具列」模組也有提供的模組取代項目，且具有其他特性，例如<a href=\"https://www.drupal.org/project/admin_toolbar\">管理工具列模組</a>。"

msgid "The core Shortcuts module enhances the toolbar with a configurable list of links to commonly-used tasks."
msgstr "核心「快速鍵」模組透過可配置的鏈結清單來鏈結到常用作業，以加強此工具列。"

msgid "If you install the core Contextual Links module, non-administrative pages will contain links leading to related administrative tasks."
msgstr "如果您安裝了核心「環境定義鏈結」模組，則非管理頁面將包含引起相關管理作業的鏈結。"

msgid "In-place or <em>quick</em> editing. In-place editing of configuration is provided by the core Settings Tray module. See @settings_tray_topic for more information."
msgstr "就地或<em>快速</em>編輯。 配置的就地編輯由核心「設定匣」模組提供。 如需相關資訊，請參閱 @settings_tray_topic。"

msgid "The core Help module displays help topics, and provides a Help block that can be placed on administrative pages to provide an overview of their functionality."
msgstr "核心「說明」模組會顯示說明主題，並提供一個可放置在管理頁面上的「說明」區塊，以提供其功能的概觀。"

msgid "The core Tour module allows modules to provide interactive tours of administrative pages for more detailed help."
msgstr "核心「導覽」模組可讓模組提供管理頁面的互動式導覽，以取得更詳細的說明。"

msgid "What are the sections of the administrative menu?"
msgstr "管理功能表的區段是什麼？"

msgid "The administrative menu, which you can navigate by visiting <em>@admin_link</em> on your site or by using an administrative toolbar, has the following sections (some may not be available, depending on which modules are currently installed on your site, and your permissions):"
msgstr "您可以在網站上造訪 <em>@admin_link</em> 或使用管理工具列來導覽的管理功能表具有下列區段（部分可能無法使用，視您網站上目前安裝的模組以及您的權限而定）："

msgid "<strong>Content:</strong> Find, manage, and create new pages; manage comments and files."
msgstr "<strong>內容：</strong>尋找、管理及建立新頁面；管理評論和檔案。"

msgid "<strong>Structure:</strong> Place and edit blocks, set up content types and fields, configure menus, administer taxonomy, and configure some contributed modules."
msgstr "<strong>結構：</strong>放置及編輯區塊、設定內容類型和欄位、配置功能表、管理分類架構，以及配置某些提供的模組。"

msgid "<strong>Appearance:</strong> Switch between themes, install themes, and update existing themes."
msgstr "<strong>外觀：</strong>切換佈景主題、安裝佈景主題，以及更新現有的佈景主題。"

msgid "<strong>Extend:</strong> Update, install, and uninstall modules."
msgstr "<strong>延伸：</strong>更新、安裝及解除安裝模組。"

msgid "<strong>Configuration:</strong> Configure the settings for various site functionality, including some contributed modules."
msgstr "<strong>配置：</strong>配置各種網站功能的設定，包括某些提供的模組。"

msgid "<strong>People:</strong> Manage user accounts and permissions."
msgstr "<strong>人員：</strong>管理使用者帳戶和權限。"

msgid "<strong>Reports:</strong> Display information about site security, necessary updates, and site activity."
msgstr "<strong>報告：</strong>顯示網站安全、必要更新及網站活動的相關資訊。"

msgid "<strong>Help:</strong> Get help on using the administrative interface."
msgstr "<strong>說明：</strong>取得關於使用管理介面的說明。"

msgid "Administrative interface overview"
msgstr "管理介面概觀"

msgid "Install the core modules mentioned above to use the corresponding aspect of the administrative interface. See the related topics listed below for more details on some aspects of the administrative interface."
msgstr "安裝上述核心模組，以使用管理介面的對應層面。 如需管理介面部分層面的詳細資料，請參閱下面列出的相關主題。"

msgid "Enabling web services"
msgstr "啟用 Web 服務"

msgid "What is a web service?"
msgstr "何謂 Web 服務？"

msgid "A web service allows your site to provide its content and data to other web sites and applications. Typically, the data is transported via <a href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Hypertext_Transfer_Protocol\">HTTP</a> in a serialized machine-readable format."
msgstr "Web 服務可讓網站將其內容及資料提供給其他網站及應用程式。一般而言，資料會透過 <a href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Hypertext_Transfer_Protocol\">HTTP</a> 以序列化機器可讀格式傳輸。"

msgid "What is serialization?"
msgstr "何謂序列化？"

msgid "Serialization is the process of converting complex data structures into text strings, so that they can be exchanged and stored. The reverse process is called <em>deserialization</em>. JSON and XML are the two most-commonly-used data serialization formats for web services."
msgstr "序列化是將複式資料結構轉換成字串以便能夠交換及儲存它們的程序。反向程序稱為<em>解除序列化</em>。JSON 及 XML 是 Web 服務最常用的兩種資料序列化格式。"

msgid "What is HTTP Basic authentication?"
msgstr "何謂 HTTP 基本鑑別？"

msgid "<a href=\"http://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Basic_access_authentication\">HTTP Basic authentication</a> is a method for authenticating requests by sending a user name and password along with the request."
msgstr "<a href=\"http://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Basic_access_authentication\">HTTP 基本鑑別</a>是透過隨要求一起傳送使用者名稱及密碼來鑑別要求的一種方法。"

msgid "What modules provide web services?"
msgstr "哪些模組提供 Web 服務？"

msgid "The following Drupal core modules provide web services:"
msgstr "下列 Drupal 核心模組提供 Web 服務："

msgid "JSON:API module"
msgstr "JSON:API 模組"

msgid "Exposes <em>entities</em> to other applications using a fully compliant implementation of the <a href=\"https://jsonapi.org\">JSON:API Specification</a>. See @content_structure_topic for more information on content entities and fields."
msgstr "使用完全相容的 <a href=\"https://jsonapi.org\">JSON:API 規格</a>實作，將<em>實體</em>公開到其他應用程式。 如需內容實體和欄位的相關資訊，請參閱 @content_structure_topic。"

msgid "RESTful Web Services module"
msgstr "RESTful Web 服務模組"

msgid "Exposes entities and other resources to other applications using a <a href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Representational_state_transfer\">REST</a> implementation. Data is exchanged using a serialization format such as JSON, and transferred using an authentication method such as HTTP Basic Authentication."
msgstr "使用 <a href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Representational_state_transfer\">REST</a> 實作將實體及其他資源公開給其他應用程式。 使用序列化格式（例如 JSON）交換資料，並使用鑑別方法（例如 HTTP 基本鑑別）傳送資料。"

msgid "Serialization module"
msgstr "序列化模組"

msgid "Provides a framework for adding specific serialization formats for other modules to use."
msgstr "提供架構來新增特定序列化格式以供其他模組使用。"

msgid "HTTP Basic Authentication module"
msgstr "HTTP 基本鑑別模組"

msgid "Provides a way for web services to be authenticated using HTTP Basic authentication against Drupal user accounts."
msgstr "提供針對 Drupal 使用者帳戶，使用 HTTP 基本鑑別來鑑別 Web 服務的方法。"

msgid "There are also contributed modules that provide web services."
msgstr "還有一些提供的模組會提供 Web 服務。"

msgid "Online documentation for the RESTful Web Services module"
msgstr "RESTful Web 服務模組的線上文件"

msgid "Online documentation for the JSON:API module"
msgstr "JSON:API 模組的線上文件"

msgid "Comparison of the RESTFul Web Services and JSON:API modules"
msgstr "「RESTFul Web 服務」模組和 JSON:API 模組的比較"

msgid "Connecting text editors to text formats"
msgstr "將文字編輯器連接至文字格式"

msgid "Configure a text format so that when a user is editing text and selects this text format, a text editor installed on your site is shown. Configure the text editor, such as choosing which buttons and functions are available. See @filter_overview_topic for more about text formats."
msgstr "配置文字格式以便在使用者編輯文字並選取此文字格式時，即會顯示網站上安裝的文字編輯器。 配置文字編輯器，如選擇可以使用的按鈕及功能。 如需文字格式的相關資訊，請參閱 @filter_overview_topic。"

msgid "What is a text editor?"
msgstr "何謂文字編輯器？"

msgid "A text editor is software (typically, a JavaScript library) that provides buttons and other command mechanisms to make editing HTML text easier. Some editors are called <em>visual</em> or <em>WYSIWYG (What You See Is What You Get)</em> editors; these editors hide the details of HTML from the user, and instead show formatted output on the screen. The core Text Editor module provides a framework for deploying text editors on your site. The core CKEditor 5 module provides CKEditor 5, which is a widely-used JavaScript text editor that creates clean and valid HTML; the module also enforces the HTML tag restrictions in the associated text format. Various contributed modules provide other editors; to install a new editor, besides installing the module, you may need to download the editor library from a third-party site."
msgstr "文字編輯器是軟體（通常為 JavaScript 程式庫），可提供按鈕及其他指令機制，讓編輯 HTML 文字變得更容易。 部分編輯器稱為<em>視覺化</em>或 <em>WYSIWYG（所見即所得）</em>編輯器；這些編輯器會向使用者隱藏 HTML 的詳細資料，而在畫面上顯示已格式化的輸出。 核心「文字編輯器」模組提供用於在網站上部署文字編輯器的架構。 核心 CKEditor 5 模組提供 CKEditor 5，它是廣泛使用的 JavaScript 文字編輯器，可建立全新且有效的 HTML；該模組也會以相關聯的文字格式施行 HTML 標籤限制。 各種提供的模組會提供其他編輯器；若要安裝新的編輯器，除了安裝模組以外，可能還需要從協力廠商網站下載編輯器程式庫。"

msgid "In the <em>Manage</em> administrative menu, navigate to <em>Configuration</em> &gt; <em>Content Authoring</em> &gt; <em>@overview_link</em>. The <em>Text editor</em> column in the table shows the text editor that is currently connected to each text format, if any."
msgstr "在<em>管理</em>管理功能表中，導覽至<em>配置</em> &gt; <em>內容編寫</em> &gt; <em>@overview_link</em>。 表格中的<em>文字編輯器</em>直欄會顯示目前連接至每種文字格式的文字編輯器（如果有的話）。"

msgid "Follow the steps on @filter_overview_topic to add a new text format or configure an existing text format; when you reach the step about text editors, return to this topic."
msgstr "遵循 @filter_overview_topic 上的步驟來新增文字格式，或配置現有的文字格式；當您到達文字編輯器的相關步驟時，請回到這個主題。"

msgid "Select <em>CKEditor 5</em> as the <em>Text editor</em>, or another text editor that you have installed. The rest of these steps assume you selected <em>CKEditor 5</em>."
msgstr "選取 <em>CKEditor 5</em> 作為<em>文字編輯器</em>，或選取您已安裝的另一個文字編輯器。 其餘步驟假設您已選取 <em>CKEditor 5</em>。"

msgid "Under <em>Toolbar configuration</em>, drag buttons between <em>Available buttons</em> and <em>Active toolbar</em>; only buttons in <em>Active toolbar</em> will be shown to the user. Focusing or hovering over a button will display a tooltip explaining what the button does."
msgstr "在<em>工具列配置</em>下方，在<em>可用按鈕</em>與<em>作用中工具列</em>之間拖曳按鈕；只有<em>作用中工具列</em>中的按鈕才會顯示給使用者。 聚焦或將游標移至按鈕上方會顯示工具提示，說明按鈕的用途。"

msgid "Drag buttons within <em>Active toolbar</em> to the desired order, and group buttons by dragging them between group identifiers; drag <em>a new group identifier</em> to the toolbar to add additional groups."
msgstr "將<em>作用中工具列</em>內的按鈕拖曳至所需順序，並在群組 ID 之間拖曳按鈕，以將按鈕分組；將<em>新群組 ID</em> 拖曳至工具列，以新增其他群組。"

msgid "If you add buttons that require configuration, the <em>CKEditor 5 plugin settings</em> section will be visible, and provide their respective configuration forms."
msgstr "如果您新增需要配置的按鈕，則會顯示 <em>CKEditor 5 外掛程式設定</em>區段，並提供其各自的配置表單。"

msgid "Return to @filter_overview_topic to complete the text format configuration, and be sure to save the text format."
msgstr "回到 @filter_overview_topic 以完成文字格式配置，並且務必要儲存文字格式。"

msgid "Adding a field to an entity sub-type"
msgstr "新增欄位至實體子類型"

msgid "Content types"
msgstr "內容類型"

msgid "Add a field to an entity sub-type; see @content_structure_topic for an overview of entity types and sub-types, as well as an overview of field types."
msgstr "將欄位新增至實體子類型；如需實體類型和子類型的概觀，以及欄位類型的概觀，請參閱 @content_structure_topic。"

msgid "Navigate to the page for managing the entity sub-type you want to add the field to. For example, to add a field to a content type, in the <em>Manage</em> administrative menu, navigate to <em>Structure</em> &gt; <em>@content_types_link</em>."
msgstr "導覽至頁面以管理您要將欄位新增至其中的實體子類型。 例如，若要將欄位新增至內容類型，請在<em>管理</em>管理功能表中導覽至<em>結構</em> &gt; <em>@content_types_link</em>。"

msgid "Find the particular sub-type that you want to add the field to, and click <em>Manage fields</em>."
msgstr "尋找您要將欄位新增至的特定子類型，然後按一下<em>管理欄位</em>。"

msgid "Click <em>Add field</em>."
msgstr "按一下<em>新增欄位</em>。"

msgid "In <em>Add a new field</em>, select the type of field you want to add; see @content_structure_topic for an overview of field types."
msgstr "在<em>新增欄位</em>中，選取您要新增的欄位類型；如需欄位類型的概觀，請參閱 @content_structure_topic。"

msgid "The <em>Label</em> field should now be visible; enter a label for the field, which is used as the field label for both content editing and content display."
msgstr "<em>標籤</em>欄位現在應該會顯示出來；請輸入欄位的標籤，其將作為內容編輯和內容顯示的欄位標籤。"

msgid "Click <em>Save and continue</em>."
msgstr "按一下<em>儲存並繼續</em>。"

msgid "On the next screen, enter a value for <em>Allowed number of values</em>. You can limit the field to one value per entity item, a set number of values, or set it to have unlimited values. Click <em>Save field settings</em>."
msgstr "在下一個畫面上，請輸入<em>容許的值數</em>的值。您可以將欄位限制為每個實體項目一個值、一組值，或將其設為具有無限制的值。按一下<em>儲存欄位設定</em>。"

msgid "On the next screen, optionally edit the settings for the field, which vary depending on what field type you are creating. For all fields, you can edit the <em>Label</em>, <em>Help text</em> (text to be displayed below the field on the content editing page), and <em>Required field</em> (to make it so a value must be entered in order to save the content when editing). You can also configure a default value for the field."
msgstr "在下一個畫面上，選擇性地編輯欄位的設定，這會根據您要建立的欄位類型而有所不同。對於所有欄位，您可以編輯<em>標籤</em>、<em>說明文字</em>（要顯示在內容編輯頁面上該欄位下方的文字）及<em>必要欄位</em>（必須在其中輸入值，這樣編輯時才能儲存內容）。您也可以配置欄位的預設值。"

msgid "Click <em>Save settings</em>. You should be returned to the <em>Manage fields</em> page, with your new field in the list."
msgstr "按一下<em>儲存設定</em>。您應該回到<em>管理欄位</em>頁面，而且清單中會有您的新欄位。"

msgid "Configuring field display for an entity sub-type"
msgstr "配置實體子類型的欄位顯示"

msgid "Configure the <em>formatters</em> used to display the fields of an entity sub-type, their order in the display, and the formatter settings. See @content_structure_topic for background information."
msgstr "配置用來顯示實體子類型欄位的<em>格式製作程式</em>、其在顯示畫面中的順序，以及格式製作程式設定。 如需背景資訊，請參閱 @content_structure_topic。"

msgid "Navigate to the page for managing the entity type you want to add the field to. For example, to add a field to a content type, in the <em>Manage</em> administrative menu, navigate to <em>Structure</em> &gt; <em>@content_types_link</em>."
msgstr "導覽至頁面，以管理您要將欄位新增至其中的實體類型。 例如，若要將欄位新增至內容類型，請在<em>管理</em>管理功能表中導覽至<em>結構</em> &gt; <em>@content_types_link</em>。"

msgid "Find the particular sub-type that you want to configure the display of, and click <em>Manage display</em> in the <em>Operations</em> list."
msgstr "尋找您要配置顯示方式的特定子類型，然後按一下<em>作業</em>清單中的<em>管理顯示</em>。"

msgid "Use the drag arrows to order the fields in your preferred order."
msgstr "使用拖曳箭頭，依您偏好的順序來排序欄位。"

msgid "Drag any fields that you do not wish to see in the display to the <em>Disabled</em> section."
msgstr "將您不希望在顯示畫面中看到的任何欄位拖曳至<em>已停用</em>區段。"

msgid "In the <em>Label</em> column, select the position for each field label in the display, or <em>- Hidden -</em> to hide a label. You can also choose <em>- Visually Hidden-</em> if you want the label's text to appear in the HTML page, so that screen readers and search engines can read it, but it will not be visible."
msgstr "在<em>標籤</em>直欄中，選取顯示畫面中每一個欄位標籤的位置，或 <em>- 隱藏 -</em> 以隱藏標籤。如果您想要標籤的文字出現在 HTML 頁面中，您也可以選擇 <em>- 視覺化隱藏-</em>，使螢幕閱讀器和搜尋引擎可以讀取它，但它不會顯示出來。"

msgid "In the <em>Format</em> column, select the formatter for displaying each field."
msgstr "在<em>格式</em>直欄中，選取要顯示每一個欄位的格式製作程式。"

msgid "After selecting the desired formatters, click the settings gear in each row to change the settings for the formatter."
msgstr "選取想要的格式製作程式之後，請按一下每一列中的設定齒輪，以變更格式製作程式的設定。"

msgid "When you are done making changes, click <em>Save</em>."
msgstr "完成變更時，請按一下<em>儲存</em>。"

msgid "Test the display for your entity sub-type by viewing an entity. If needed, return to these steps to further refine the display."
msgstr "透過檢視實體來測試實體子類型的顯示。必要的話，請回到這些步驟，以進一步精簡顯示畫面。"

msgid "Configuring the edit form for an entity sub-type"
msgstr "配置實體子類型的編輯表單"

msgid "Configure the <em>widgets</em> used to edit the fields of an entity sub-type, their order on the form, and the widget settings. See @content_structure_topic for background information."
msgstr "配置用來編輯實體子類型欄位的<em>小組件</em>、其在表單上的順序，以及小組件設定。 如需背景資訊，請參閱 @content_structure_topic。"

msgid "Find the particular sub-type that you want to configure the editing form for, and click <em>Manage form display</em> in the <em>Operations</em> list."
msgstr "尋找您要配置編輯表單的特定子類型，然後按一下<em>作業</em>清單中的<em>管理表單顯示</em>。"

msgid "Drag any fields that you do not wish to see on the editing form to the <em>Disabled</em> section."
msgstr "將任何您不希望在編輯表單上看到的欄位拖曳至<em>已停用</em>區段。"

msgid "In the <em>Widget</em> column, select the widget for editing each field."
msgstr "在<em>小組件</em>直欄中，選取要編輯每一個欄位的小組件。"

msgid "After selecting the desired widgets, click the settings gear in each row to change the settings for the widget."
msgstr "選取想要的小組件之後，請按一下每一列中的設定齒輪，以變更小組件的設定。"

msgid "Test the editing form for your entity sub-type by editing or creating an entity. If needed, return to these steps to further refine the form."
msgstr "透過編輯或建立實體來測試實體子類型的編輯表單。必要的話，請回到這些步驟，以進一步精簡表單。"

msgid "Adding a reference field to an entity sub-type"
msgstr "新增參照欄位至實體子類型"

msgid "Add an entity reference field to an entity sub-type; see @content_structure_topic for more information on entities and reference fields."
msgstr "將實體參照欄位新增至實體子類型；如需實體和參照欄位的相關資訊，請參閱 @content_structure_topic。"

msgid "In <em>Add a new field</em>, select the type of reference field you want to add. The <em>Reference</em> section of the select list shows the most common types of reference field; choose <em>Other...</em> if the entity type you want to reference is not listed."
msgstr "在<em>新增欄位</em>中，選取您要新增的參照欄位類型。此選取清單的<em>參照</em>區段會顯示最常見的參照欄位類型；如果未列出您要參照的實體類型，請選擇<em>其他...</em>。"

msgid "On the next screen, verify that the type of entity you want to reference is shown in <em>Type of item to reference</em>, or select it if not. Enter a value for <em>Allowed number of values</em>. You can limit the field to one value per entity item, a set number of values, or set it to have unlimited values. Click <em>Save field settings</em>."
msgstr "在下一個畫面上，驗證您要參照的實體類型有顯示在<em>要參照的項目類型</em>中，如果沒有，請選取該類型。請輸入<em>容許的值數</em>的值。您可以將欄位限制為每個實體項目一個值、一組值，或將其設為具有無限制的值。按一下<em>儲存欄位設定</em>。"

msgid "On the next screen, optionally edit the settings for <em>Label</em>, <em>Help text</em> (text to be displayed below the field on the content editing page), and <em>Required field</em> (to make it so a value must be entered in order to save the content when editing)."
msgstr "在下一個畫面上，選擇性地編輯<em>標籤</em>、<em>說明文字</em>（要顯示在內容編輯頁面上該欄位下方的文字）及<em>必要欄位</em>（必須在其中輸入值，這樣編輯時才能儲存內容）的設定。"

msgid "In the <em>Reference type</em> section, you will usually want to limit the entity sub-types that can be referenced; for example, if you are creating a <em>Content</em> reference, you can check one or two <em>Content type</em> choices. The choices will be easier for content editors to scan if you also choose a sort value (normally the entity title or label field)."
msgstr "在<em>參照類型</em>區段中，您通常會想要限制可參照的實體子類型；例如，如果您要建立<em>內容</em>參照，您可以勾選一個或兩個<em>內容類型</em>選擇。如果您同時選擇排序值（一般是實體標題或標籤欄位），則內容編輯器會更容易掃描這些選擇。"

msgid "Managing text filters and text formats"
msgstr "管理文字過濾器及文字格式"

msgid "Configure text formats on the site."
msgstr "配置網站上的文字格式。"

msgid "What are text filters and text formats?"
msgstr "何謂文字過濾器及文字格式？"

msgid "A text filter is a processing step that can be applied to text, either to transform it in some way (such as converting URLs in the text into HTML links), or to defend against potentially-dangerous input from site users. A text format is an ordered sequence of text filters. Text filters are provided by modules; text formats are managed by the core Filter module."
msgstr "文字過濾器是一種處理步驟，可套用至文字以按某種方式轉換文字（如將文字中的 URL 轉換為 HTML 鏈結），或防禦網站使用者潛在危險的輸入。文字格式是文字過濾器的排序序列。文字過濾器是由模組提供；文字格式是由核心「過濾器」模組管理。"

msgid "Text fields that have \"formatted\" in the field type name, such as <em>Text (formatted)</em>, use text formats. Users choose the text format when editing the field text; when the field text is shown on the site, it is processed by the chosen text format. Administrators can configure text formats and assign permissions for who can use each format. If the core Text Editor module is enabled, administrators can also associate visual editors with text formats."
msgstr "欄位類型名稱中具有「格式化」的文字欄位（如<em>文字（格式化）</em>）會使用文字格式。使用者在編輯欄位文字時可選擇文字格式；當欄位文字顯示在網站上時，即會使用所選文字格式來處理。管理者可以配置文字格式，並為可以使用每種格式的人員指派許可權。如果已啟用核心「文字編輯器」模組，則管理者也可以將視覺化編輯器與文字格式相關聯。"

msgid "What text filters are available?"
msgstr "可用的文字過濾器有哪些？"

msgid "Some of the more commonly used text filters are:"
msgstr "部分比較常用的文字過濾器如下："

msgid "Limits which HTML tags can be used; useful both for site security and enforcing site design."
msgstr "限制可以使用的 HTML 標籤；對網站安全及強制執行網站設計都很有用。"

msgid "Convert line breaks into HTML"
msgstr "將換行轉換成 HTML"

msgid "Line breaks in HTML source are displayed as horizontal spaces. This filter converts line breaks into HTML paragraph and line break tags."
msgstr "HTML 來源中的換行會顯示為水平間距。此過濾器會將換行轉換成 HTML 段落及換行標籤。"

msgid "Takes plain URLs in text and turns them into HTML links."
msgstr "擷取文字中的一般 URL，並將其轉換成 HTML 鏈結。"

msgid "For text formats that allow HTML image tags, restricts images to URLs within this site."
msgstr "對於容許 HTML 影像標籤的文字格式，將影像限制為此網站內的 URL。"

msgid "In the <em>Manage</em> administrative menu, navigate to <em>Configuration</em> &gt; <em>Content Authoring</em> &gt; <em>@overview_link</em>. If you do not have the core Text Editor module installed, the menu link and page title will instead be <em>Text formats</em>."
msgstr "在<em>管理</em>管理功能表中，導覽至<em>配置</em> &gt; <em>內容編寫</em> &gt; <em>@overview_link</em>。 如果您未安裝核心「文字編輯器」模組，則功能表鏈結及頁面標題會改為<em>文字格式</em>。"

msgid "Click <em>Configure</em> to configure an existing text format, or <em>+ Add text format</em> to create a new text format."
msgstr "按一下<em>配置</em>以配置現有文字格式，或按一下 <em>+ 新增文字格式</em>以建立新的文字格式。"

msgid "Enter the desired <em>Name</em> for the text format."
msgstr "輸入所需的文字格式<em>名稱</em>。"

msgid "Check the <em>Roles</em> that can use this text format. Some HTML tags allow users to embed malicious links or scripts in text. To ensure security, anonymous and untrusted users should only have access to text formats that restrict them to either plain text or a safe set of HTML tags. <strong>Improper text format configuration is a security risk.</strong>"
msgstr "勾選可以使用此文字格式的<em>角色</em>。部分 HTML 標籤容許使用者在文字中內嵌惡意鏈結或 Script。為了確保安全，匿名及未授信使用者能存取的文字格式，應僅限使用純文字或一組安全 HTML 標籤。<strong>不適當的文字格式配置會帶來安全風險。</strong>"

msgid "If the core Text Editor module is installed, see the related topic to connect a text editor to this text format."
msgstr "如果已安裝核心「文字編輯器」模組，請參閱相關主題以將文字編輯器連接至此文字格式。"

msgid "Under <em>Enabled filters</em>, check the text filters that you want to use."
msgstr "在<em>已啟用的過濾器</em>下方，勾選您要使用的文字過濾器。"

msgid "Under <em>Filter processing order</em>, drag the filters to the correct order. Choose the order carefully; for example, if you have a filter that results in a particular HTML tag being added to the text, that should run after a filter that restricts HTML tags, to avoid deleting the new tags the first filter added."
msgstr "在<em>過濾器處理順序</em>下方，將過濾器拖曳至正確的順序。請仔細選擇順序；例如，如果您有一個過濾器會導致將特定 HTML 標籤新增至文字，則該過濾器應該在限制 HTML 標籤的過濾器之後執行，以免刪除第一個過濾器新增的標籤。"

msgid "Under <em>Filter settings</em>, verify and adjust the settings for each active filter that has configuration options."
msgstr "在<em>過濾器設定</em>下方，驗證並調整具有配置選項的每個作用中過濾器的設定。"

msgid "Click <em>Save configuration</em>, which will return you to the <em>Text formats and editors</em> page."
msgstr "按一下<em>儲存配置</em>，這會讓您回到<em>文字格式及編輯器</em>頁面。"

msgid "Repeat these steps if you have additional text formats to configure."
msgstr "如果您有其他要配置的文字格式，請重複這些步驟。"

msgid "Extend"
msgstr "擴展"

msgid "Extend"
msgstr "擴展"

msgid "Extend"
msgstr "擴展"

msgid "Extend"
msgstr "擴展"

msgid "Set up your site so that users can search for help."
msgstr "設定您的網站，讓使用者可以搜尋說明。"

msgid "In the <em>Manage</em> administrative menu, navigate to <em>@extend_link</em>. Verify that the Search, Help, Help Topics, and Block modules are installed (or install them if they are not already installed)."
msgstr "在<em>管理</em>管理功能表中，導覽至 <em>@extend_link</em>。 驗證是否已安裝「搜尋」、「說明」、「說明主題」及「區塊」模組（如果尚未安裝就安裝它們）。"

msgid "In the <em>Manage</em> administrative menu, navigate to <em>Configuration</em> &gt; <em>Search and metadata</em> &gt; <em>Search pages</em>."
msgstr "在<em>管理</em>管理功能表中，導覽至<em>配置</em> &gt; <em>搜尋 meta 資料</em> &gt; <em>搜尋頁面</em>。"

msgid "Verify that a Help search page is listed in the <em>Search pages</em> section. If not, add a new page of type <em>Help</em>."
msgstr "驗證「說明搜尋」頁面列在<em>搜尋頁面</em>區段中。如果沒有，請新增<em>說明</em>類型的新頁面。"

msgid "Check the indexing status of the Help search page. If it is not fully indexed, see @cron_topic about how to run Cron until indexing is complete."
msgstr "請檢查「說明」搜尋頁面的檢索狀態。 如果未完整檢索，請參閱 @cron_topic 瞭解如何執行 cron 直到檢索完成。"

msgid "In the future, you can click <em>Rebuild search index</em> on this page, or @cache_topic, in order to force help topic text to be reindexed for searching. This should be done whenever a module, theme, language, or string translation is updated."
msgstr "在未來，您可以在此頁面或 @cache_topic 上按一下<em>重建搜尋索引</em>，以強制重新檢索說明主題文字來進行搜尋。 每當更新模組、佈景主題、語言或字串翻譯時，就應該這麼做。"

msgid "In the <em>Manage</em> administrative menu, navigate to <em>Structure</em> &gt; <em>Block layout</em>."
msgstr "在<em>管理</em>管理功能表中，導覽至<em>結構</em> &gt; <em>區塊佈置</em>。"

msgid "Click the link for your administrative theme (such as the core Claro theme), near the top of the page, and verify that there is already a search block for help located in the Help region. If not, follow the steps in the related topic to place the <em>Search form</em> block in the Help region. When configuring the block, choose <em>Help</em> as the search page, and in the <em>Pages</em> tab under <em>Visibility</em>, enter <em>/admin/help</em> to make the search form only visible on the main <em>Help</em> page."
msgstr "按一下頁面頂端附近的管理佈景主題鏈結（例如核心 Claro 佈景主題），並驗證「說明」區域中已有說明的搜尋區塊。 如果沒有，請遵循相關主題中的步驟，將<em>搜尋表單</em>區塊放置在「說明」區域中。 配置區塊時，請選擇<em>說明</em>作為搜尋頁面，並在<em>可見性</em>下的<em>頁面</em>標籤中，輸入 <em>/admin/help</em>，讓搜尋表單只出現在主要<em>說明</em>頁面上。"

msgid "In the <em>Manage</em> administrative menu, navigate to <em>@help_link</em>. Verify that the search block is visible, and try a search."
msgstr "在<em>管理</em>管理功能表中，導覽至 <em>@help_link</em>。 請驗證搜尋區塊是否可見，並嘗試搜尋。"

msgid "Tracking which content a user has visited"
msgstr "追蹤使用者已造訪的內容"

msgid "What content visits are tracked?"
msgstr "追蹤哪些內容造訪？"

msgid "The core History module tracks when each logged-in user has most recently visited each content item page on the site. This allows content to be marked as <em>new</em> or <em>updated</em> for each user, meaning that it was newly created or has been updated since the last time they visited its page. These records are kept for one month, meaning that content older than one month is never marked as new or updated."
msgstr "核心「歷程」模組會追蹤每個登入的使用者最近造訪網站上每個內容項目頁面的時間。這容許針對每個使用者將內容標示為<em>新</em>或<em>已更新</em>，表示它是自使用者前次造訪其頁面以來新建立或已更新的內容。這些記錄會保留一個月，表示旱於一個月的內容永不標示為新或已更新。"

msgid "What options are available for using this tracking information?"
msgstr "使用此追蹤資訊時有哪些可用的選項？"

msgid "You can display the new/updated status of content by creating or editing a view. There is a <em>Has new content</em> field for <em>Content</em> views, which displays the new/updated marker. There is also a <em>Has new content</em> filter, which limits the view to new and updated content."
msgstr "您可以透過建立或編輯視圖來顯示內容的新/已更新狀態。<em>內容</em>視圖中有<em>具有新內容</em>欄位，可顯示新/已更新標記。此外，還有一個<em>具有新內容</em>過濾器，它會將視圖限制為全新及已更新內容。"

msgid "Adding an image style"
msgstr "新增影像樣式"

msgid "Image styles"
msgstr "圖片樣式"

msgid "Add a new image style, which can be used to process and display images. See @media_topic for an overview of image styles."
msgstr "新增可用來處理及顯示影像的影像樣式。 如需影像樣式的概觀，請參閱 @media_topic。"

msgid "In the <em>Manage</em> administrative menu, navigate to <em>Configuration</em> &gt; <em>Media</em> &gt; @styles_link."
msgstr "在<em>管理</em>管理功能表中，導覽至<em>配置</em> &gt; <em>媒體</em> &gt; @styles_link。"

msgid "Click <em>Add image style</em>."
msgstr "按一下<em>新增影像樣式</em>。"

msgid "Enter a descriptive <em>Image style name</em>, and click <em>Create new style</em>."
msgstr "輸入敘述性<em>影像樣式名稱</em>，然後按一下<em>建立新樣式</em>。"

msgid "Under <em>Effect</em>, choose an effect to apply and click <em>Add</em>."
msgstr "在<em>效果</em>下方，選擇要套用的效果，然後按一下<em>新增</em>。"

msgid "Configure the effect on the next page. Most effects require some additional configuration after they are added.  For example, for the <em>Crop</em> effect, enter the <em>Width</em> and <em>Height</em> to crop the image to, and choose the <em>Anchor</em> point. Click <em>Add effect</em>."
msgstr "在下一頁上配置效果。大部分效果在新增之後需要進行一些其他配置。例如，對於<em>裁剪</em>效果，請輸入要將影像裁剪至的<em>寬度</em>及<em>高度</em>，然後選擇<em>錨點</em>。按一下<em>新增效果</em>。"

msgid "Repeat the previous two steps until all of the effects have been added."
msgstr "重複前兩個步驟，直到已新增所有效果為止。"

msgid "Drag to change the order of the effects. Then click <em>Save</em> to save the new order."
msgstr "拖曳以變更效果的順序。然後按一下<em>儲存</em>以儲存新順序。"

msgid "The image style can now be used to format a field containing an image in your layouts or traditional field displays. It can also be used as part of a responsive image style. See related topics below for more information."
msgstr "現在，您可以使用影像樣式，在佈置或傳統欄位顯示畫面中格式化包含影像的欄位。它亦可用作回應式影像樣式的一部分。如需相關資訊，請參閱下面的相關主題。"

msgid "Adding a language"
msgstr "新增語言"

msgid "Add a language to your site."
msgstr "將語言新增至網站。"

msgid "In the <em>Manage</em> administrative menu, navigate to <em>Configuration</em> &gt; <em>Region and language</em> &gt; @languages_link."
msgstr "在「<em>管理</em>」管理功能表中，導覽至<em>配置</em> &gt; <em>地區和語言</em> &gt; @languages_link。"

msgid "Click <em>Add language</em>."
msgstr "按一下<em>新增語言</em>。"

msgid "If your language is in the <em>Language name</em> list, select it and click <em>Add language</em>."
msgstr "如果您的語言是在<em>語言名稱</em>清單中，請選取該語言，然後按一下<em>新增語言</em>。"

msgid "If your language is not in the list, select <em>Custom language...</em> and enter the <em>Language code</em>, <em>Language name</em>, and <em>Direction</em> for the language. Click <em>Add custom language</em>."
msgstr "如果您的語言不在清單中，請選取<em>自訂語言...</em>，並輸入該語言的<em>語言碼</em>、<em>語言名稱</em>及<em>方向</em>。 按一下<em>新增自訂語言</em>。"

msgid "Wait for the translation system to be updated. Also, if you have the core Update Manager module installed and translations are available for your language, wait for translations to be downloaded. You should be returned to the <em>Languages</em> page when this completes."
msgstr "等待翻譯系統更新。 另外，如果您已安裝「更新管理程式」核心模組，且您的語言有翻譯可用，請等待下載翻譯。 當此作業完成時，您應該回到<em>語言</em>頁面"

msgid "Configuring language detection and selection"
msgstr "配置語言偵測和選擇"

msgid "Detection and selection"
msgstr "偵測及選擇"

msgid "Configure the methods used to decide which language will be used to display text on your site."
msgstr "配置一些方法，用來決定哪些語言將用來在網站上顯示文字。"

msgid "What is a language detection method?"
msgstr "何謂語言偵測方法？"

msgid "A language detection method is a way for your site to decide what language should be used to display text. This decision is made by evaluating a series of detection methods for languages; the first detection method that gets a result will determine which language is used. If you have more than one language on your site, you can configure the detection methods that are used and the order they are evaluated, for both user interface text and content text. Configuration text always uses the interface text method, and most sites use the same detection methods for all types of text."
msgstr "語言偵測方法是您網站決定應使用何種語言來顯示文字的一種方式。此一決定是透過評估一系列語言偵測方法做出的；第一個取得結果的偵測方法將決定使用哪種語言。 如果您的網站上有多種語言，您可以配置所使用的偵測方法，以及對使用者介面文字和內容文字進行評估的順序。 配置文字一律使用介面文字方法，大部分網站會對所有類型的文字使用相同的偵測方法。"

msgid "What language detection methods are available?"
msgstr "有哪些語言偵測方法可用？"

msgid "The available detection methods depend on what modules you have installed. Some of the most commonly-used language detection methods are:"
msgstr "可用的偵測方法視您安裝的模組而定。 一些最常用的語言偵測方法如下："

msgid "Use the language from the URL, which can either be in a path prefix like <em>example.com/fr/page_path</em> for French (fr) language, or in a domain like <em>fr.example.com/page_path</em>."
msgstr "使用 URL 中的語言，該語言可能出現在 <em>example.com/fr/page_path</em> 之類的路徑字首中（表示法文 (fr) 語言），也可能出現在 <em>fr.example.com/page_path</em> 之類的網域中。"

msgid "For logged in users, use the language they have set in their profiles."
msgstr "若為已登入的使用者，請使用他們在設定檔中設定的語言。"

msgid "Browser"
msgstr "瀏覽器"

msgid "Use the language preferences from the user's browser."
msgstr "使用使用者瀏覽器中的語言喜好設定。"

msgid "Selected language"
msgstr "已選語言"

msgid "Use the language most recently selected from a <em>Language switcher</em> block."
msgstr "使用最近從<em>語言切換器</em>區塊選取的語言。"

msgid "Use the language from a session parameter or a request parameter; for example, adding <em>?language=fr</em> to the end of the URL."
msgstr "使用階段作業參數或要求參數中的語言；例如，將 <em>?language=fr</em> 新增至 URL 的結尾。"

msgid "In the <em>Manage</em> administrative menu, navigate to <em>Configuration</em> &gt; <em>Region and language</em> &gt; <em>Languages</em> &gt; @detection_link."
msgstr "在「<em>管理</em>」管理功能表中，導覽至<em>配置</em> &gt; <em>區域和語言</em> &gt; <em>語言</em> > @detection_link。"

msgid "Check the boxes to enable the desired language detection methods, and uncheck boxes for the methods you do not want to use."
msgstr "勾選方框以啟用所需的語言偵測方法，並針對您不想使用的方法取消勾選其方框。"

msgid "Drag the methods to change their order, if desired."
msgstr "拖曳方法以變更其順序（如果需要的話）。"

msgid "Click <em>Save settings</em>."
msgstr "按一下<em>儲存設定</em>。"

msgid "Click <em>Configure</em> on each enabled detection method and verify that its configuration is correct (or update the configuration if not)."
msgstr "在每一個已啟用的偵測方法上按一下<em>配置</em>，並驗證其配置正確無誤（如果不正確，則更新配置）。"

msgid "Changing the layout for an entity"
msgstr "變更實體的佈置"

msgid "Configure an entity sub-type to have its fields displayed using a layout (see @content_structure_topic for more on entities and fields)."
msgstr "配置實體子類型，以使用佈置來顯示其欄位（如需實體和欄位的相關資訊，請參閱 @content_structure_topic）。"

msgid "What are the parts of a layout?"
msgstr "何謂佈置的組件？"

msgid "A layout consists of one or more <em>sections</em>. Each section can have from one to four <em>columns</em>. You can place blocks, including special blocks for the fields on the entity sub-type, in each column of each section (see @block_overview_topic for more on blocks)."
msgstr "佈置由一個以上的<em>區段</em>組成。每一個區段都可以有一到四個<em>直欄</em>。 您可以在每一個區段的每一個直欄中，放置區塊，包括實體子類型上欄位的特殊區塊（如需區塊的相關資訊，請參閱 @block_overview_topic）。"

msgid "Navigate to the page for managing the entity type you want to add the field to. For example, to add a field to a content type, in the <em>Manage</em> administrative menu, navigate to <em>Structure</em> &gt; @content_types_link."
msgstr "導覽至頁面，以管理您要將欄位新增至其中的實體類型。 例如，若要將欄位新增至內容類型，請在<em>管理</em>管理功能表中導覽至<em>結構</em> &gt; @content_types_link。"

msgid "Find the particular sub-type that you want to create a layout for, and click <em>Manage display</em> in the <em>Operations</em> list."
msgstr "尋找您要為其建立佈置的特定子類型，然後按一下<em>作業</em>清單中的<em>管理顯示</em>。"

msgid "Under <em>Layout options</em>, check <em>Use Layout Builder</em>. You can also check the box below to allow each entity item to have its layout individually customized (if it is left unchecked, the site will use the same layout for all items of this entity sub-type)."
msgstr "在<em>佈置選項</em>下，勾選<em>使用佈置建置器</em>。您也可以勾選下面的方框，以容許每一個實體項目的佈置可以個別自訂（如果保持不勾選，則網站將對此實體子類型的所有項目使用相同佈置）。"

msgid "Click <em>Save</em>. You will be returned to the <em>Manage display</em> page, but you will no longer see the table of fields of the classic display manager."
msgstr "按一下<em>儲存</em>。您將會回到<em>管理顯示</em>頁面，但不會再看到標準顯示管理程式的欄位表格。"

msgid "Click <em>Manage layout</em> to enter layout management view. A default layout will be set up for you, with a single one-column section containing the fields on your entity sub-type."
msgstr "按一下<em>管理佈置</em>以進入佈置管理視圖。會為您設定一個預設佈置，其單一直欄區段包含實體子類型的欄位。"

msgid "To remove the default section and start from an empty layout, find and click the <em>Remove</em> button for the default section, which looks like an X. Confirm by clicking <em>Remove</em> in the pop-up dialog."
msgstr "若要移除預設區段並從空的佈置開始，請尋找預設區段並按一下<em>移除</em>按鈕，它看起來像 X。請在蹦現對話框中按一下<em>移除</em>加以確認。"

msgid "Add new sections, each with one to four columns, to your layout. For instance, you might want a one-column section at the top, a two-column section in the middle, and then a one-column section at the bottom. To add a section, click <em>Add section</em> and click the desired number of columns. For multi-column sections, set the column width percentages and click <em>Add section</em> in the pop-up dialog."
msgstr "將新的區段新增至佈置中，每一個區段有一至四個直欄。例如，您可能想要頂端有一直欄區段、中間有兩直欄區段，底端有一直欄區段。若要新增區段，請按一下<em>新增區段</em>，然後按一下所要的欄數。如果是多直欄區段，請設定欄寬百分比，並按一下蹦現對話框中的<em>新增區段</em>。"

msgid "In each section, click <em>Add block</em> to add a block. You will see a list of the blocks available on your site, plus a section called <em>Content fields</em> with a block for each field on your content item. Each block can be configured, if desired, with a <em>Title</em>, and for content field blocks, you can also configure the field formatter. Continue to add blocks to your sections until all the desired blocks and fields are displayed."
msgstr "在每一個區段中，按一下<em>新增區塊</em>以新增區塊。您將會看到網站上有可用的區塊清單，還有一個稱為<em>內容欄位</em>的區段，其中包含內容項目上每一個欄位的區塊。您可以使用<em>標題</em>來配置每一個區塊，對於內容欄位區塊，您還可以配置欄位格式製作程式。繼續將區塊新增至區段，直到顯示所有想要的區塊和欄位為止。"

msgid "Verify your layout. You can check <em>Show content preview</em> to show a preview of what your layout will look like, or uncheck it to see the names of the fields and blocks in each section."
msgstr "驗證您的佈置。您可以勾選<em>顯示內容預覽</em>，以顯示您的佈置樣貌的預覽，或取消勾選它，來查看每一個區段中的欄位名稱和區塊名稱。"

msgid "If needed, reorder the blocks by dragging them to new locations. If you hover over a block, a contextual menu will appear that will let you change the configuration of the block, remove the block, or <em>Move</em> blocks within the section using a more compact interface."
msgstr "必要的話，請將區塊拖曳至新的位置，以重新排序區塊。如果您移至區塊上，會出現環境定義功能表，它可讓您使用更精簡的介面來變更區塊的配置、移除區塊，或<em>移動</em>區段內的區塊。"

msgid "When you are satisfied with your layout, click <em>Save layout</em>."
msgstr "當您滿意您的佈置時，請按一下<em>儲存佈置</em>。"

msgid "Creating layout defaults"
msgstr "建立佈置預設值"

msgid "Building Layouts Using the Layout Builder UI"
msgstr "使用佈置建置器使用者介面來建置佈置"

msgid "Importing a translation file"
msgstr "匯入翻譯檔"

msgid "Import a file (.po extension) containing translations for user interface text."
msgstr "匯入包含使用者介面文字翻譯的檔案（.po 副檔名）。"

msgid "In the <em>Manage</em> administrative menu, navigate to <em>Configuration</em> &gt; <em>Region and language</em> &gt; <em>User interface translation</em> &gt; @import_link."
msgstr "在「<em>管理</em>」管理功能表中，導覽至 <em>配置</em> &gt; <em>區域和語言</em> &gt; <em>使用者介面翻譯</em> &gt; @import_link。"

msgid "Browse to find the <em>Translation file</em> you want to import. Select the language and check the desired import options."
msgstr "瀏覽以尋找您要匯入的<em>翻譯檔</em>。 選取語言，並檢查所需的匯入選項。"

msgid "Click <em>Import</em> and wait for your file to be imported."
msgstr "按一下<em>匯入</em>，然後等待匯入您的檔案。"

msgid "Translating user interface text"
msgstr "翻譯使用者介面文字"

msgid "User interface translation"
msgstr "使用者介面翻譯"

msgid "Translate user interface text strings from English into a non-English language that is configured on your site."
msgstr "將使用者介面字串從英文翻譯成網站上配置的非英文語言。"

msgid "In the <em>Manage</em> administrative menu, navigate to <em>Configuration</em> &gt; <em>Region and language</em> &gt; @translate_link."
msgstr "在「<em>管理</em>」管理功能表中，導覽至<em>配置</em> &gt; <em>地區和語言</em> &gt; @translate_link。"

msgid "Using the filters, search for a string or set of strings that you want to translate; make sure to select the correct <em>Translation language</em> if you have more than one non-English language on your site."
msgstr "使用過濾器，搜尋您要翻譯的字串或一組字串；如果您的網站上有多個非英文語言，請務必選取正確的<em>翻譯語言</em>。"

msgid "Enter new translations and click <em>Save translations</em>."
msgstr "輸入新的翻譯，然後按一下<em>儲存翻譯</em>。"

msgid "Repeat these steps until all of the desired user interface text is translated for all languages on your site."
msgstr "重複這些步驟，直到所有所需的使用者介面文字都已翻譯成您網站上的所有語言為止。"

msgid "Checking interface translation status"
msgstr "檢查介面翻譯狀態"

msgid "Available translation updates"
msgstr "有翻譯更新可用"

msgid "Check the current status of interface translations, and see if there are any updates available."
msgstr "檢查介面翻譯的現行狀態，並查看是否有任何可用的更新。"

msgid "In the <em>Manage</em> administrative menu, navigate to <em>Configuration</em> &gt; <em>Region and language</em> &gt; @language_link."
msgstr "在「<em>管理</em>」管理功能表中，導覽至<em>配置</em> &gt; <em>地區和語言</em> &gt; @language_link。"

msgid "Look at the <em>Interface translation</em> column in the language table, to find the percentage of user interface text that has been translated for each language."
msgstr "查看語言表格中的<em>介面翻譯</em>直欄，以尋找已翻譯成每種語言的使用者介面文字百分比。"

msgid "In the <em>Manage</em> administrative menu, navigate to <em>Reports</em> &gt; <em>@translation_updates_link</em>. This report is only available if the core Update Status module is installed."
msgstr "在<em>管理</em>管理功能表中，導覽至<em>報告</em> &gt; <em>@translation_updates_link</em>。 只有在已安裝「更新狀態」核心模組時，才能使用此報告。"

msgid "Optionally, click <em>Check manually</em> to update the report."
msgstr "選擇性地按一下<em>手動檢查</em>以更新報告。"

msgid "View the report to find out if any languages have translation updates that you can download."
msgstr "檢視報告，以瞭解是否有任何語言具有您可以下載的翻譯更新。"

msgid "Adding a new media type"
msgstr "新增媒體類型"

msgid "Media types"
msgstr "媒體類型"

msgid "Add a new media type that can be referenced in Media reference fields; media types are a content entity type. See @media_topic for an overview of media items and media types, and @content_structure_topic for more information on content entities and fields."
msgstr "新增可在媒體參照欄位中參照的新媒體類型；媒體類型是內容實體類型。 如需媒體項目和媒體類型的概觀，請參閱 @media_topic；如需內容實體和欄位的相關資訊，請參閱 @content_structure_topic。"

msgid "In the <em>Manage</em> administrative menu, navigate to <em>Structure</em> &gt; @media_link."
msgstr "在<em>管理</em>管理功能表中，導覽至<em>結構</em> &gt; @media_link。"

msgid "If there is not already a media type for the type of media you want to use on your site, click <em>Add media type</em>."
msgstr "如果網站上還沒有您想要使用媒體類型的對應媒體類型，請按一下<em>新增媒體類型</em>。"

msgid "Enter a <em>Name</em> and <em>Description</em> for your media type, and select the <em>Media source</em>."
msgstr "輸入媒體類型的<em>名稱</em>及<em>說明</em>，然後選取<em>媒體來源</em>。"

msgid "For most media sources, there is additional information that will need to be stored with your media item, in a field on your media type. Under <em>Media source configuration</em>, select an existing field to re-use to store this information, or select <em> - Create -</em> to create a new field."
msgstr "對於大部分媒體來源，還有其他資訊需要與媒體項目一起儲存在媒體類型的欄位中。在<em>媒體來源配置</em>下方，選取要重複使用的現有欄位來儲存此資訊，或選取 <em>- 建立 -</em> 以建立新欄位。"

msgid "Note the types of metadata in the <em>Field mapping</em> section that can be mapped to fields on your media type."
msgstr "記下<em>欄位對映</em>區段中可以對映至媒體類型欄位的 meta 資料類型。"

msgid "Optionally, add additional fields for the metadata noted above or for other information that you want to store to your media type by clicking on <em>Manage fields</em> (see related topic below)."
msgstr "選擇性地透過按一下<em>管理欄位</em>來新增其他欄位，以用於上面所記錄的 meta 資料或您要儲存至媒體類型的其他資訊（請參閱下面的相關主題）。"

msgid "If you have added metadata fields, click <em>Edit</em>. Under <em>Field mapping</em>, select the fields you added for each piece of metadata information."
msgstr "如果您已新增 meta 資料欄位，請按一下<em>編輯</em>。在<em>欄位對映</em>下方，選取您為每段 meta 資料資訊新增的欄位。"

msgid "You can now use this media type by adding a Media reference field to any content entity sub-type. See related topic below."
msgstr "現在，將媒體參照欄位新增至任何內容實體子類型，即可使用此媒體類型。請參閱下面的相關主題。"

msgid "Configure menu settings for a content type"
msgstr "配置內容類型的功能表設定"

msgid "For an existing content type, configure the available menus that will be shown as options on content editing screens; links to content items of this type can be added to these menus during editing."
msgstr "對於現有內容類型，配置將在內容編輯畫面上顯示為選項的可用功能表；在編輯期間，可將此類型內容項目的鏈結新增至這些功能表。"

msgid "In the <em>Manage</em> administrative menu, navigate to <em>Structure</em> &gt; @content_types_link."
msgstr "在<em>管理</em>管理功能表中，導覽至<em>結構</em> &gt; @content_types_link。"

msgid "Locate the content type you want to configure, and click <em>Edit</em> in the <em>Operations</em> list."
msgstr "尋找您要配置的內容類型，然後在<em>作業</em>清單中按一下<em>編輯</em>。"

msgid "Under <em>Menu settings</em>, check the menus that you want to be available when editing a content item of this type."
msgstr "在<em>功能表設定</em>下方，勾選您希望在編輯此類型內容項目時可用的功能表。"

msgid "Optionally, select the <em>Default parent item</em>, to put links to content items under a default location in the menu structure."
msgstr "選擇性地選取<em>預設母項項目</em>，以將內容項目的鏈結放置在功能表結構中的預設位置下方。"

msgid "Click <em>Save content type</em>."
msgstr "按一下<em>儲存內容類型</em>。"

msgid "Adding a link to a menu"
msgstr "將鏈結新增至功能表"

msgid "Add a link to a menu. Note that you can also add a link to a menu from the content edit page if menu settings have been configured for the content type."
msgstr "將鏈結新增至功能表。請注意，如果已針對內容類型配置功能表設定，您亦可從內容編輯頁面將鏈結新增至功能表。"

msgid "In the <em>Manage</em> administration menu, navigate to <em>Structure</em> &gt; @structure_menu_link."
msgstr "在<em>管理</em>管理功能表中，導覽至<em>結構</em> &gt; @structure_menu_link。"

msgid "Locate the desired menu and click <em>Add link</em> in the <em>Operations</em> list."
msgstr "尋找所需的功能表，然後在<em>作業</em>清單中按一下<em>新增鏈結</em>。"

msgid "Enter the <em>Menu link title</em> to be displayed."
msgstr "輸入要顯示的<em>功能表鏈結標題</em>。"

msgid "Enter the <em>Link</em>, one of the following:"
msgstr "輸入<em>鏈結</em>（下列其中一項）："

msgid "An internal path, such as <em>/node/add</em>"
msgstr "內部路徑，如 <em>/node/add</em>"

msgid "A full external URL"
msgstr "完整外部 URL"

msgid "Start typing the title of a content item and select it when the full title comes up"
msgstr "開始鍵入內容項目的標題，並在完整標題出現時選取它"

msgid "<em>&lt;nolink&gt;</em> to display the <em>Menu link title</em> as plain text without a link"
msgstr "<em>&lt;nolink&gt;</em>，將<em>功能表鏈結標題</em>顯示為沒有鏈結的純文字"

msgid "<em>&lt;front&gt;</em> to link to the front page of your site"
msgstr "<em>&lt;front&gt;</em>，鏈結至網站首頁"

msgid "Make sure that <em>Enabled</em> is checked; if not, the menu link will not be displayed."
msgstr "確定已勾選<em>已啟用</em>，否則將不會顯示功能表鏈結。"

msgid "Optionally, enter a <em>Description</em>, which will be displayed when a user hovers over the link."
msgstr "選擇性地輸入在使用者將游標移至鏈結上方時將會顯示的<em>說明</em>。"

msgid "Optionally, check <em>Show as expanded</em> to automatically show the children of this link (if any) when this link is shown."
msgstr "選擇性地勾選<em>顯示為已展開</em>，以在顯示此鏈結時自動顯示此鏈結的子項（如果有的話）。"

msgid "Optionally, select the <em>Parent link</em>, if this menu link should be a child of another menu link."
msgstr "選擇性地選取<em>母項鏈結</em>（如果此功能表鏈結應該是另一個功能表鏈結的子項）。"

msgid "Click <em>Save</em>. You will be returned to the <em>Add link</em> page to add another link."
msgstr "按一下<em>儲存</em>。您將回到<em>新增鏈結</em>頁面，以新增另一個鏈結。"

msgid "Locate the menu you just added a link to and click <em>Edit</em> in the <em>Operations</em> list."
msgstr "尋找您剛向其新增鏈結的功能表，然後在<em>作業</em>清單中按一下<em>編輯</em>。"

msgid "Verify that the order of links is correct. If it is not, drag menu links until the order is correct, and click <em>Save</em>."
msgstr "驗證鏈結順序是否正確。如果不正確，請拖曳功能表鏈結，直到順序正確為止，然後按一下<em>儲存</em>。"

msgid "Creating a menu"
msgstr "建立功能表"

msgid "Create a new menu."
msgstr "建立新的功能表。"

msgid "In the <em>Manage</em> administration menu, navigate <em>Structure</em> &gt; @structure_menu_link."
msgstr "在<em>管理</em>管理功能表中，導覽至<em>結構</em> &gt; @structure_menu_link。"

msgid "Click <em>Add menu</em>."
msgstr "按一下<em>新增功能表</em>。"

msgid "Enter the title for the menu, which is used as the default block title if the menu is displayed as a block. If desired, also edit the machine name of the menu, which is by default derived from the title."
msgstr "輸入功能表的標題，該標題在功能表顯示為區塊時會用作預設區塊標題。如有需要，另請編輯依預設會從該標題衍生的功能表機器名稱。"

msgid "Enter an administrative summary, which is displayed on the <em>Menus</em> page."
msgstr "輸入將在<em>功能表</em>頁面上顯示的管理摘要。"

msgid "If your site has more than one language, choose the language for the menu."
msgstr "如果您的網站有多種語言，請選擇功能表的語言。"

msgid "Click <em>Save</em>. You will be on the menu editing page, ready to add links to the menu if the core Custom Menu Links module is installed; see related topics for further tasks."
msgstr "按一下<em>儲存</em>。您將位於功能表編輯頁面上，如果已安裝核心「自訂功能表鏈結」模組，則可準備將鏈結新增至功能表；如需執行進一步的作業，請參閱相關主題。"

msgid "Reordering and disabling menu links"
msgstr "重新排序及停用功能表鏈結"

msgid "Disable menu links or change the order and hierarchy of menu links."
msgstr "停用功能表鏈結，或變更功能表鏈結的順序及階層。"

msgid "Click <em>Edit menu</em> for the menu that you want to edit."
msgstr "針對您要編輯的功能表，按一下<em>編輯功能表</em>。"

msgid "Drag menu links into a new order, or check/uncheck <em>Enabled</em> to enable or disable menu links."
msgstr "將功能表鏈結拖曳至新順序，或勾選/取消勾選<em>已啟用</em>來啟用或停用功能表鏈結。"

msgid "Click <em>Save</em> to save your changes."
msgstr "按一下<em>儲存</em>以儲存變更。"

msgid "Migrating, updating, and upgrading"
msgstr "移轉、更新及升級"

msgid "What are updating, upgrading, and migrating?"
msgstr "何謂更新、升級及移轉？"

msgid "<em>Updating</em> is the process of changing from one minor version of the software to a newer version, such as from version 8.3.4 to 8.3.5, or 8.3.5 to 8.4.0. Starting with version 8.x, you can also update to major versions 9, 10, and beyond if your add-on modules, themes, and install profiles are compatible. <em>Upgrading</em> is the process of changing from an older major version of the software to a newer version, such as from version 7 to 8. <em>Migrating</em> is the process of importing data into a site."
msgstr "<em>更新</em>是從軟體的某個次要版本變更為較新版本的程序，例如，從 8.3.4 版至 8.3.5 版或從 8.3.5 版至 8.4.0 版。從 8.x 版開始，如果附加程式模組、佈景主題及安裝設定檔相容，您亦可更新至主要版本 9、10 及更高版本。<em>升級</em>是從軟體的較舊主要版本變更為較新版本的程序，例如，從第 7 版至第 8 版。<em>移轉</em>是將資料匯入網站的程序。"

msgid "To upgrade a site from Drupal 6 or 7 to Drupal 8 or later, keeping the content and configuration the same, you will install the new version of the software and add-on modules and themes in a new site, and then migrate the content and other data from your old site into the new site."
msgstr "若要將網站從 Drupal 6 或 7 升級至 Drupal 8 或更新版本，並使內容及配置保持相同，您會在新網站中安裝軟體的新版本以及附加程式模組和佈景主題，然後將內容及其他資料從舊網站移轉至新網站。"

msgid "Overview of Migrating"
msgstr "移轉概觀"

msgid "You can use the <em>Migration</em> group of modules to perform the migration step of upgrading from Drupal 6 or 7 to Drupal 8 or later, as well as other migrations. These modules also provide APIs that can be used by programmers to write custom software for migrations. Here are the functions of the core migration modules:"
msgstr "您可以使用模組的<em>移轉</em>群組來執行從 Drupal 6 或 7 升級至 Drupal 8 或更新版本的移轉步驟，以及其他移轉作業。 這些模組還提供 API，可供程式設計師用來撰寫用於移轉的自訂軟體。 以下是核心移轉模組的功能："

msgid "Migrate"
msgstr "遷移"

msgid "Provides the underlying API for migrating data."
msgstr "提供用於移轉資料的基礎 API。"

msgid "Migrate Drupal"
msgstr "遷移 Drupal"

msgid "Provides data migration from older versions of the Drupal software into a new site."
msgstr "提供從 Drupal 軟體的較舊版本至新網站的資料移轉。"

msgid "Migrate Drupal UI"
msgstr "移轉 Drupal 使用者介面"

msgid "Provides a user interface for performing data migration from older versions of the Drupal software into a new site."
msgstr "提供使用者介面以用於執行從 Drupal 軟體的較舊版本至新網站的資料移轉。"

msgid "If the source of the data you want to migrate is a different content management system, or if the data source is a Drupal site that was built using contributed modules that the core migration modules do not support, then you will also need one or more contributed or custom modules in order to migrate your data."
msgstr "如果您要移轉的資料來源是不同的內容管理系統，或該資料來源是使用核心移轉模組不支援的已提供模組所建置的 Drupal 網站，則您還將需要一個以上的已提供或自訂模組才能移轉資料。"

msgid "<a href=\"https://www.drupal.org/docs/upgrading-drupal\">Upgrading Drupal</a>"
msgstr "<a href=\"https://www.drupal.org/docs/upgrading-drupal\">升級 Drupal</a>"

msgid "Migrating data for an upgrade using the user interface"
msgstr "利用使用者介面移轉資料以進行升級"

msgid "Upgrade"
msgstr "升級"

msgid "Migrate data into a new, empty site, as part of an upgrade from an older version of Drupal. See @migrate_overview_topic for an overview of migrating and upgrading."
msgstr "作為從 Drupal 的較舊版本進行升級的一部分，將資料移轉至新的空網站。 如需移轉及升級的概觀，請參閱 @migrate_overview_topic。"

msgid "In the <em>Manage</em> administrative menu, navigate to <em>Configuration</em> &gt; <em>Development</em> &gt; <em>@migrate_drupal_upgrade_link</em>."
msgstr "在<em>管理</em>管理功能表中，導覽至<em>配置</em> &gt; <em>開發</em> &gt; <em>@migrate_drupal_upgrade_link</em>。"

msgid "Read the introduction and follow the <em>Preparation steps</em> on the page. Then click <em>Continue</em>."
msgstr "閱讀簡介並遵循頁面上的<em>準備步驟</em>。然後按一下<em>繼續</em>。"

msgid "Select the Drupal version of the source site. Also enter the database credentials and public and private files directories (private file directory is not available when migrating from Drupal 6). Click <em>Review upgrade</em>."
msgstr "選取來源網站的 Drupal 版本。另請輸入資料庫認證及公用和專用檔案目錄（從 Drupal 6 移轉時無法使用專用檔案目錄）。按一下<em>檢閱升級</em>。"

msgid "If the next page you see contains a message about conflicting content, that means that the site where you are running the upgrade is not empty. If you continue, you will lose the data in the site. If that is acceptable, click the button to continue; if not, start these steps over in a new, clean Drupal site."
msgstr "如果您看到的下一頁包含有關衝突內容的訊息，則表示執行升級的網站不是空的。如果您繼續，則會遺失網站中的資料。如果可以接受，請按一下按鈕以繼續；否則，請在全新的乾淨 Drupal 網站中重新開始執行這些步驟。"

msgid "On the <em>What will be upgraded?</em> page, review the list of modules whose data will not be upgraded. If that list is not empty and you want to migrate the data from those modules, you will need to download contributed modules and/or install core or contributed modules, and start these steps over."
msgstr "在<em>將要升級什麼？</em>頁面上，檢閱不會升級其資料的模組清單。如果該清單不是空的，且您要從這些模組移轉資料，則需要下載提供的模組及/或安裝核心或提供的模組，並重新開始執行這些步驟。"

msgid "When the list of modules that will and will not be upgraded meets your expectations, click <em>Perform upgrade</em> and wait for the upgrade to complete. You will see a message about the number of upgrade tasks that were successful or failed, and you can review the upgrade message log by clicking the link on the results page."
msgstr "在將要升級以及不會升級的模組清單符合您的預期時，按一下<em>執行升級</em>，然後等待升級完成。您會看到成功或失敗的升級作業數目相關訊息，並可透過按一下結果頁面上的鏈結來檢閱升級訊息日誌。"

msgid "<a href=\"https://www.drupal.org/docs/upgrading-drupal/upgrading-from-drupal-6-or-7-to-drupal-8-and-newer\">Upgrading from Drupal 6 or 7 to Drupal 8 (and newer)</a>"
msgstr "<a href=\"https://www.drupal.org/docs/upgrading-drupal/upgrading-from-drupal-6-or-7-to-drupal-8-and-newer\">從 Drupal 6 或 7 升級至 Drupal 8（以及更新版本）</a>"

msgid "Creating a content item"
msgstr "建立內容項目"

msgid "Access the Content overview page"
msgstr "存取內容概觀頁面"

msgid "Create and publish a content item. See @content_overview_topic for more about content types and content items."
msgstr "建立及發佈內容項目。 如需內容類型和內容項目的相關資訊，請參閱 @content_overview_topic。"

msgid "Who can create content?"
msgstr "誰可以建立內容？"

msgid "Users with the <em>@content_permissions_link</em> permission can visit the <em>Content</em> page as described in this topic. Each content type has its own create permissions. For example, to create content of type Article, a user would need the Article: Create new content permission. In addition, users with the <em>Bypass content access control</em> or <em>Administer content</em> permission can create content items of all types. Some contributed modules change the permission structure for creating content."
msgstr "擁有 <em>@content_permissions_link</em> 權限的使用者可以造訪<em>內容</em>頁面，如本主題所述。 每一種內容類型都有自己的建立權限。 例如，若要建立「文章」類型的內容，使用者就需要「文章：建立新內容」權限。 此外，擁有<em>略過內容存取控制</em>或<em>管理內容</em>權限的使用者可以建立所有類型的內容項目。 部分提供的模組會變更建立內容的權限結構。"

msgid "In the <em>Manage</em> administrative menu, navigate to <em>@content_link</em>."
msgstr "在<em>管理</em>管理功能表中，導覽至 <em>@content_link</em>。"

msgid "Click <em>Add content</em>."
msgstr "按一下<em>新增內容</em>。"

msgid "If there is more than one content type defined on your site that you have permission to create, click the name of the type of content you want to create."
msgstr "如果您的網站上定義了多個您有權建立的內容類型，請按一下您要建立的內容類型名稱。"

msgid "On the content edit form, enter the <em>Title</em> of your content, which will show as the page title when the content item is displayed on a page, and also as the label for the content item in administration screens."
msgstr "在內容編輯表單上，輸入內容的<em>標題</em>，當內容項目顯示在頁面上時，該標題將顯示為頁面標題，同時在管理畫面中會顯示為內容項目的標籤。"

msgid "Fill in the other fields shown on the edit form for this specific content type."
msgstr "填寫此特定內容類型顯示在編輯表單上的其他欄位。"

msgid "Leave the <em>Published</em> field checked to publish the content immediately, or uncheck it to make it unpublished. Unpublished content is generally not shown to non-administrative site users."
msgstr "保持勾選<em>已發佈</em>欄位以立即發佈內容，或取消勾選以使其取消發佈。 未發佈的內容通常不會向非管理網站使用者顯示。"

msgid "Optionally, click <em>Preview</em> to preview the content."
msgstr "選擇性地按一下<em>預覽</em>以預覽內容。"

msgid "Click <em>Save</em>. You will see the content displayed on a page."
msgstr "按一下<em>儲存</em>。 您將會看到頁面上顯示的內容。"

msgid "User Guide: Basic page management"
msgstr "使用手冊：基本頁面管理"

msgid "User Guide: Creating a content item"
msgstr "使用手冊：建立內容項目"

msgid "Creating a content type"
msgstr "建立內容類型"

msgid "Administer content types"
msgstr "管理內容類型"

msgid "Create a new content type. See @content_overview_topic for more about content types."
msgstr "建立新的內容類型。 如需內容類型的相關資訊，請參閱 @content_overview_topic。"

msgid "Who can create a content type?"
msgstr "誰可以建立內容類型？"

msgid "Users with the <em>@content_permissions_link</em> permission (typically administrators) can create new content types."
msgstr "擁有 <em>@content_permissions_link</em> 權限的使用者（通常是管理者）可以建立新的內容類型。"

msgid "In the <em>Manage</em> administrative menu, navigate to <em>Structure</em> &gt; <em>@content_types_link</em>."
msgstr "在<em>管理</em>管理功能表中，導覽至<em>結構</em> > <em>@content_types_link</em>。"

msgid "Click <em>Add content type.</em>"
msgstr "按一下<em>新增內容類型</em>。"

msgid "In the <em>Name</em> field, enter a name for the content type, which is how it will be listed in the administrative interface."
msgstr "在<em>名稱</em>欄位中，輸入內容類型的名稱，這就是其在管理介面中列出的樣子。"

msgid "Optionally, enter a <em>Description</em> for the content type. You may also want to adjust some of the settings in the vertical tabs section of the edit page."
msgstr "選擇性地輸入內容類型的<em>說明</em>。 您也可以在編輯頁面的垂直標籤區段中，調整部分設定。"

msgid "Click <em>Save and manage fields</em>. Your content type will be created, and assuming you have the core Field UI module installed, you will be taken to the <em>Manage fields</em> page for the content type. (If you do not have the core Field UI module installed, the button will say <em>Save</em> instead.)"
msgstr "按一下<em>儲存及管理欄位</em>。 系統將會建立內容類型，假設您已安裝「欄位使用者介面」核心模組，就會將您帶領到該內容類型的<em>管理欄位</em>頁面。 （如果您未安裝「欄位使用者介面」核心模組，則按鈕會改為顯示<em>儲存</em>。）"

msgid "If you have the core Field UI module installed, follow the steps in the related topics to add fields to the new content type, set up the editing form, and configure the display."
msgstr "如果您已安裝「欄位使用者介面」核心模組，請遵循相關主題中的步驟，將欄位新增至新內容類型、設定編輯表單，以及配置顯示畫面。"

msgid "User Guide: Adding a content type"
msgstr "使用手冊：新增內容類型"

msgid "User Guide: Setting up content structure"
msgstr "使用手冊：設定內容結構"

msgid "Editing a content item"
msgstr "編輯內容項目"

msgid "Find a content item and edit it, or update a group of content items in bulk. See @node_overview_topic for more about content types and content items."
msgstr "尋找內容項目並編輯該項目，或大量更新一組內容項目。 如需內容類型和內容項目的相關資訊，請參閱 @node_overview_topic。"

msgid "Who can find and edit content?"
msgstr "誰可以尋找並編輯內容？"

msgid "Users with the <em>@content_permissions_link</em> permission can use the <em>Content</em> page to find content. Each content type has its own edit permissions. For example, to edit content of type Article, a user would need the <em>Article: Edit own content</em> permission to edit an article they created, or the <em>Article: Edit any content</em> permission to edit an article someone else created. In addition, users with the <em>Bypass content access control</em> or <em>Administer content</em> permission can edit content items of all types. Some contributed modules change the permission structure for editing content."
msgstr "擁有 <em>@content_permissions_link</em> 權限的使用者可以使用<em>內容</em>頁面來尋找內容。 每一種內容類型都有自己的編緝權限。 例如，若要編輯「文章」類型的內容，使用者需要<em>文章：編輯自己的內容</em>權限來編輯他們所建立的文章，或者需要<em>文章：編輯任何內容</em>權限來編輯其他人所建立的文章。 此外，擁有<em>略過內容存取控制</em>或<em>管理內容</em>權限的使用者可以編輯所有類型的內容項目。 部分提供的模組會變更編輯內容的權限結構。"

msgid "Optionally, use filters to reduce the list of content items shown:"
msgstr "選擇性地使用過濾器來減少顯示的內容項目清單："

msgid "<em>Title</em>: key word(s) from the title"
msgstr "<em>標題</em>：標題中的關鍵字"

msgid "<em>Content type</em>"
msgstr "<em>內容類型</em>"

msgid "<em>Published status</em>"
msgstr "<em>已發佈狀態</em>"

msgid "<em>Language</em>"
msgstr "<em>語言</em>"

msgid "If you enter or select filter values, click <em>Filter</em> to apply the filters."
msgstr "如果您輸入或選取過濾器值，請按一下<em>過濾</em>以套用過濾器。"

msgid "Optionally, sort the list by clicking a column header. Click again to reverse the order."
msgstr "選擇性地排序清單，方法是按一下直欄標頭。 再按一下以反轉順序。"

msgid "To edit the title or other field values for one content item, click <em>Edit</em> in the row of the content item. Update the values and click <em>Save</em>."
msgstr "若要編輯一個內容項目的標題或其他欄位值，請在內容項目的列中按一下<em>編輯</em>。 更新值，然後按一下<em>儲存</em>。"

msgid "A few types of edits can be done in bulk to multiple content items. For example, to publish several unpublished content items, check the boxes in the left column (right column in right-to-left languages) to select the desired content items. For <em>Action</em>, select the <em>Publish content</em> action. Click <em>Apply to selected items</em> to make the change. The other actions under <em>Action</em> work in a similar manner."
msgstr "幾種類型的編輯可以大量執行到多個內容項目中。 例如，若要發佈數個未發佈的內容項目，請勾選左欄（由右至左語言的右欄）中的方框，以選取所需的內容項目。 針對<em>動作</em>，請選取<em>發佈內容</em>動作。 按一下<em>套用至選定項目</em>以進行變更。 <em>動作</em>下的其他動作以類似的方式運作。"

msgid "User Guide: Editing a content item"
msgstr "使用手冊：編輯內容項目"

msgid "Managing content"
msgstr "管理內容"

msgid "What is a content item?"
msgstr "何謂內容項目？"

msgid "A <em>content item</em> is a type of content entity for page-level content, which can have fields that store text, HTML markup, images, attached files, and other data. See @content_structure_topic for more about content entities and fields."
msgstr "<em>內容項目</em>是頁面層次內容的內容實體類型，其中可包含儲存文字、HTML 標記、影像、附加檔案及其他資料的欄位。 如需內容實體和欄位的相關資訊，請參閱 @content_structure_topic。"

msgid "What is a content type?"
msgstr "何謂內容類型？"

msgid "Content items are divided into <em>content types</em>, which are the entity sub-types for the content item entity type; each content type has its own fields and display settings. For example, you might set up content types for pages, articles, recipes, events, and blog entries on your web site."
msgstr "內容項目分成<em>數個內容類型</em>，這些內容類型是內容項目實體類型的實體子類型；每一個內容類型都有自己的欄位和顯示設定。 例如，您可以在網站上設定頁面、文章、秘訣、事件及部落格文章的內容類型。"

msgid "Overview of managing content"
msgstr "管理內容的概觀"

msgid "The core Node module allows you to define content types, and add and edit content items. The core Field UI module allows you to attach fields to each content type and manage the edit form and display for each content type. See the related topics listed below for specific tasks. Many other core and contributed modules and installation profiles provide pre-defined content types, modify the permission structure for content items, and provide other functionality."
msgstr "「節點」核心模組可讓您定義內容類型，以及新增和編輯內容項目。 「欄位使用者介面」核心模組可讓您將欄位附加至每一個內容類型，並管理每一個內容類型的編輯表單及顯示畫面。 如需瞭解特定作業，請參閱下列相關主題。 許多其他核心和提供的模組與安裝設定檔可提供預先定義的內容類型、修改內容項目的權限結構，並提供其他功能。"

msgid "Creating a URL alias for a content item"
msgstr "建立內容項目的 URL 別名"

msgid "Create and edit URL aliases"
msgstr "建立及編輯 URL 別名"

msgid "Give a content item page a human- or SEO-friendly URL alias; you can follow similar steps to create an alias for a taxonomy term page. See @overview_topic for more about aliases."
msgstr "為內容項目頁面提供將對人或 SEO 友善的 URL 別名；您可以遵循類似步驟來建立分類架構術語頁面的別名。 如需別名的相關資訊，請參閱 @overview_topic。"

msgid "Who can create URL aliases?"
msgstr "誰可以建立 URL 別名？"

msgid "Users with the <em>@path_permissions_link</em> permission can create aliases. To follow the steps in this topic, you will also need permission to edit the content item."
msgstr "擁有 <em>@path_permissions_link</em> 權限的使用者可以建立別名。 若要遵循本主題中的步驟，您還需要編輯內容項目的權限。"

msgid "Locate and open the content edit form for the content item, or create a new content item (see related topics on creating and editing content)."
msgstr "尋找並開啟內容項目的內容編輯表單，或建立新的內容項目（請參閱建立及編輯內容的相關主題）。"

msgid "Under <em>URL alias</em> on the edit form, enter the desired alias (for example, \"/about-us\"). Make sure the alias starts with a \"/\" character."
msgstr "在 <em>URL 別名</em>下的編輯表單上，輸入所需的別名（例如， \"/about-us\"）。 請確定別名的開頭是 \"/\" 字元。"

msgid "Verify that the page can be visited with the new alias, for example <em>https://example.com/about-us</em>."
msgstr "驗證是否可以使用新別名來造訪頁面，例如 <em>https://example.com/about-us</em>。"

msgid "User guide: Creating a Content Item"
msgstr "使用手冊：建立內容項目"

msgid "Editing a URL alias"
msgstr "編輯 URL 別名"

msgid "Administer URL aliases"
msgstr "管理路徑別名 (URL alias)"

msgid "URL aliases"
msgstr "URL 別名"

msgid "Change an existing URL alias, to correct the path or the alias value. See @path_overview_topic for more about aliases."
msgstr "變更現有的 URL 別名，以更正路徑或別名值。 如需別名的相關資訊，請參閱 @path_overview_topic。"

msgid "Who can manage URL aliases?"
msgstr "誰可以管理 URL 別名？"

msgid "Users with the <em>@path_permissions_link</em> permission can edit aliases."
msgstr "擁有 <em>@path_permissions_link</em> 權限的使用者可以編輯別名。"

msgid "In the <em>Manage</em> administration menu, navigate to <em>Configuration</em> &gt; <em>Search and metadata</em> &gt; <em>@path_aliases_link</em>. A list of all the site's aliases will appear."
msgstr "在<em>管理</em>管理功能表中，導覽至<em>配置</em> > <em>搜尋與 meta 資料</em> > <em>@path_aliases_link</em>。 即會顯示所有網站別名的清單。"

msgid "Click <em>Edit</em> in the dropdown button for the alias that you would like to change."
msgstr "在所要變更別名的下拉按鈕中按一下<em>編輯</em>。"

msgid "Make the required changes and click <em>Save</em>. You will be returned to the URL alias list page."
msgstr "進行必要的變更，然後按一下<em>儲存</em>。 您將會回到 URL 別名清單頁面。"

msgid "Note that you can also add new aliases from this page, for any path on your site."
msgstr "請注意，您也可以針對網站上的任何路徑，從這個頁面新增別名。"

msgid "Configuring aliases for URLs"
msgstr "配置 URL 的別名"

msgid "What is a URL?"
msgstr "何謂 URL？"

msgid "URL is the abbreviation for \"Uniform Resource Locator\", which is the page's address on the web. It is the \"name\" by which a browser identifies a page to display. In the example \"Visit us at <em>example.com</em>.\", <em>https://example.com</em> would be the URL for the home page of your website. Users use URLs to locate content on the web."
msgstr "URL 是 \"Uniform Resource Locator\" 的縮寫，它是 Web 上的頁面位址。 它是瀏覽器用來識別所要顯示頁面的「名稱」。 在「造訪我們的 <em>example.com</em>」範例中，<em>https://example.com</em> 會是網站首頁的 URL。 使用者可使用 URL 來尋找 Web 上的內容。"

msgid "What is a path?"
msgstr "何謂路徑？"

msgid "A path is the unique, last part of the URL for a specific function or piece of content. For example, for a page whose full URL is <em>https://example.com/node/7</em>, the path is <em>node/7</em>. Here are some examples of paths you might find in your site:"
msgstr "路徑是特定函數或內容片段的唯一、最後一部分 URL。 例如，若是其完整 URL 為  <em>https://example.com/node/7</em> 的頁面，則路徑為  <em>node/7</em>。 以下是您可能在網站中找到的一些路徑範例："

msgid "node/7: Path to a particular content item."
msgstr "node/7：特定內容項目的路徑。"

msgid "taxonomy/term/6: Path to a taxonomy term page."
msgstr "taxonomy/term/6：分類架構術語頁面的路徑。"

msgid "user/3: Path to a user profile page."
msgstr "user/3：使用者設定檔頁面的路徑。"

msgid "What is an alias?"
msgstr "何謂別名？"

msgid "The core software allows you to provide more understandable URLs for pages on your site, which are called <em>aliases</em>. For example, if you have an \"About Us\" page with the path <em>node/7</em>, you can set up an alias of <em>about</em> so that your visitors will see it as <em>https://www.example.com/about</em>."
msgstr "核心軟體可讓您為網站上的頁面提供更容易瞭解的 URL，這些 URL 稱為<em>別名</em>。 例如，如果您有路徑為 <em>node/7</em> 的「關於我們」頁面，則可以設定 <em>about</em> 的別名，讓您的訪客看到其為 <em>https://www.example.com/about</em>。"

msgid "Overview of configuring paths, aliases, and URLs"
msgstr "配置路徑、別名及 URL 的概觀"

msgid "The core Path module provides the URL aliasing functionality. The contributed <a href=\"https://www.drupal.org/project/pathauto\">Pathauto</a> module allows you to configure automatically-generated URL aliases for content items and other pages. See the related topics listed below for specific tasks."
msgstr "「路徑」核心模組提供 URL 別名化功能。 提供的 <a href=\"https://www.drupal.org/project/pathauto\">Pathauto</a> 模組可讓您為內容項目和其他頁面配置自動產生的 URL 別名。 如需瞭解特定作業，請參閱下列相關主題。"

msgid "User Guide topic on Paths"
msgstr "路徑的使用手冊主題"

msgid "Configuring a responsive image style"
msgstr "配置回應式影像樣式"

msgid "Responsive image styles"
msgstr "回應式影像樣式"

msgid "Configure a responsive image style, which can be used to display images at different sizes on different devices. See @media_topic for an overview of responsive image styles, and @breakpoint_overview_topic for an overview of breakpoints."
msgstr "配置可用來在不同裝置上顯示不同大小影像的回應式影像樣式。 如需回應式影像樣式的概觀，請參閱 @media_topic ；如需岔斷點的概觀，請參閱 @breakpoint_overview_topic。"

msgid "In the <em>Manage</em> administrative menu, navigate to <em>Configuration</em> &gt; <em>Media</em> &gt; <em>@styles_link</em>."
msgstr "在<em>管理</em>管理功能表中，導覽至<em>配置</em> &gt; <em>媒體</em> &gt; <em>@styles_link</em>。"

msgid "Click <em>Add responsive image style</em>."
msgstr "按一下<em>新增回應式影像樣式</em>。"

msgid "Enter a descriptive <em>Label</em> for your style."
msgstr "為您的樣式輸入敘述性<em>標籤</em>。"

msgid "Select a <em>Breakpoint group</em> from the groups defined by your installed themes and modules."
msgstr "從已安裝的佈景主題和模組定義的群組中選取<em>岔斷點群組</em>。"

msgid "Select a <em>Fallback image style</em> to use when none of the other styles apply. See @image_style_topic if you need to add a new style."
msgstr "選取未套用任何其他樣式時要使用的<em>備用影像樣式</em>。 如果您需要新增樣式，請參閱 @image_style_topic。"

msgid "On the next page, locate the fieldsets for the breakpoints provided by the selected <em>Breakpoint group</em>."
msgstr "在下一頁上，針對選取的<em>岔斷點群組</em>提供的岔斷點尋找欄位集。"

msgid "For each breakpoint that you want to use, expand the corresponding fieldset. Select the <em>Select a single image style.</em> radio button under <em>Type</em> for the breakpoint, and select the <em>Image style</em> to use for images when that breakpoint is in effect. Repeat this step for the rest of the breakpoints you want to use."
msgstr "針對您要使用的每一個岔斷點，展開對應的欄位集。選取岔斷點的<em>類型</em>下的<em>選取單一影像樣式。</em>圓鈕，然後選取<em>影像樣式</em>以在該岔斷點生效時用於影像。對您要使用的其餘岔斷點重複此步驟。"

msgid "Click <em>Save</em>"
msgstr "按一下<em>儲存</em>"

msgid "You can now use this responsive image style to format a field containing an image, in your layouts or traditional field displays. See related topics below for more information."
msgstr "現在，您可以使用此回應式影像樣式，在佈置或傳統欄位顯示畫面中格式化包含影像的欄位。如需相關資訊，請參閱下面的相關主題。"

msgid "Configuring search pages"
msgstr "配置搜尋頁面"

msgid "Search pages"
msgstr "搜尋頁面"

msgid "Configure one or more search pages."
msgstr "配置一個以上的搜尋頁面。"

msgid "In the <em>Manage</em> administrative menu, navigate to <em>Configuration</em> &gt; <em>Search and Metadata</em> &gt; <em>@search_settings_link</em>."
msgstr "在<em>管理</em>管理功能表中，導覽至<em>配置</em> &gt; <em>搜尋與 meta 資料</em> &gt; <em>@search_settings_link</em>。"

msgid "Scroll down to the <em>Search pages</em> section. You will see a list of the already-configured search pages on your site."
msgstr "向下捲動至<em>搜尋頁面</em>區段。您將在網站上看到已配置的搜尋頁面清單。"

msgid "To configure an existing search page, click <em>Edit</em>. Or, to add a new search page, select the <em>Search page type</em> and click <em>Add search page</em>."
msgstr "若要配置現有的搜尋頁面，請按一下<em>編輯</em>。或者，若要新增搜尋頁面，請選取<em>搜尋頁面類型</em>，然後按一下<em>新增搜尋頁面</em>。"

msgid "Enter the desired <em>Label</em> name and URL <em>Path</em> for the search page."
msgstr "針對搜尋頁面輸入所需的<em>標籤</em>名稱及 URL <em>路徑</em>。"

msgid "For <em>Content</em> search pages, select the desired level of influence in ranking search results of the available <em>Content ranking</em> factors."
msgstr "對於<em>內容</em>搜尋頁面，請在可用<em>內容分級</em>係數的分級搜尋結果中，選取想要的影響力。"

msgid "Click <em>Save</em>. You will be returned to the <em>Search pages</em> page."
msgstr "按一下<em>儲存</em>。您將回到<em>搜尋頁面</em>頁面。"

msgid "Verify that the correct search page is listed as <em>Default</em> in the <em>Status</em> column. If not, click <em>Set as default</em> in the <em>Operations</em> list for the correct search page."
msgstr "驗證是否在<em>狀態</em>直欄中將正確的搜尋頁面列為<em>預設值</em>。如果沒有，請按一下<em>作業</em>清單中的<em>設為預設值</em>，以取得正確的搜尋頁面。"

msgid "Optionally, disable or delete any search pages that you do not want to have available on the site (disabling is temporary, while deleting is permanent)."
msgstr "選擇性地停用或刪除您不想在網站上使用的任何搜尋頁面（停用是暫時的，而刪除是永久的）。"

msgid "Follow the steps in @search_index_topic to make sure that the search index is updated."
msgstr "請遵循 @search_index_topic  中的步驟，以確定已更新搜尋索引。"

msgid "Managing the search index"
msgstr "管理搜尋索引"

msgid "Manage the search index, and make sure that the site is fully indexed for searching."
msgstr "管理搜尋索引，並確保網站已完整編製索引以進行搜尋。"

msgid "What is the search index?"
msgstr "何謂搜尋索引？"

msgid "The <em>Content</em> and <em>Help</em> search types provided by the core software pre-index their content and store the results in several database tables that are collectively called the <em>search index</em>. The process of indexing renders the content and breaks it up into words, which can then be matched more efficiently with keyword queries when users perform searches. Search indexing happens during cron runs; see @cron_topic for more information about cron."
msgstr "核心軟體所提供的<em>內容</em>及<em>說明</em>搜尋類型會預先檢索其內容，並將結果儲存在數個資料庫表格中，這些資料庫表格統稱為<em>搜尋索引</em>。 編製索引的程序會呈現內容並將其分解成單字，然後在使用者執行搜尋時，可以更有效率地與關鍵字查詢搭配使用。 在 cron 執行期間會進行搜尋檢索；如需 cron 的相關資訊，請參閱 @cron_topic。"

msgid "Under <em>Indexing throttle</em>, select the <em>Number of items to index per cron run</em>. A smaller number will make cron faster and reduce the possibility of timeout; a larger number will make sure more of your site is indexed in fewer cron runs."
msgstr "在<em>檢索節流控制</em>下，選取<em>每個 cron 執行要編製索引的項目數</em>。較小的數字會加快cron 速度並減少逾時的可能性；較大的數字會確保在較少 cron 執行中編製更多網站的索引。"

msgid "Under <em>Default indexing settings</em>, enter the desired <em>Minimum word length to index</em>. Words smaller than this length will be dropped from both keywords when searching and content when indexing."
msgstr "在<em>預設編製索引設定</em> 下，輸入想要的<em>要編製索引的最小單字長度</em>。小於此長度的單字將會同時從關鍵字（在搜尋時）和內容（在編製索引時）中捨棄。"

msgid "If your site uses Chinese, Japanese, or Korean languages, optionally check <em>Simple CJK handling</em> under <em>Default indexing settings</em> to provide some support for these languages."
msgstr "如果您的網站使用中文、日文或韓文語言，請選擇性地勾選<em>預設編製索引設定</em>下的<em>簡式 CJK 處理</em>，以為這些語言提供部分支援。"

msgid "Click <em>Save configuration</em>, and you should be returned to the <em>Search pages</em> page."
msgstr "按一下<em>儲存配置</em>，您應會回到<em>搜尋頁面</em>頁面。"

msgid "Click <em>Re-index site</em> if you have changed the indexing configuration, or later on, if you believe that the search index has been corrupted."
msgstr "如果您已變更檢索配置，或者稍後如果您認為搜尋索引已毀損，請按一下<em>重新編製網站索引</em>。"

msgid "Follow the steps in @cron_topic to make sure a cron task has been configured."
msgstr "請遵循 @cron_topic 中的步驟，以確定已配置 cron 作業。"

msgid "After waiting for cron to run several times, verify that the content has been fully indexed for searching. The overall status is listed under <em>Indexing progress</em>, and the status for each search page is shown in the <em>Indexing progress</em> column of the <em>Search pages</em> section."
msgstr "等待 cron 執行數次之後，驗證已完全編製內容索引以進行搜尋。整體狀態會列在<em>編製索引進度</em>下，每一個搜尋頁面的狀態會顯示在<em>搜尋頁面</em>區段的<em>編製索引進度</em>直欄中。"

msgid "Configuring site search"
msgstr "配置網站搜尋"

msgid "What are search pages?"
msgstr "何謂搜尋頁面？"

msgid "The core Search module organizes site search into <em>pages</em>. Each page allows users to search a particular type of content with a particular configuration. The configuration includes specifying a URL that starts with <em>search</em>, a name for the page, and additional options for some search page types."
msgstr "核心「搜尋」模組會將網站搜尋組織到<em>頁面</em>中。每一個頁面都可讓使用者使用特定配置搜尋特定類型的內容。配置包括指定以 <em>search</em> 開頭的 URL、頁面的名稱及部分搜尋頁面類型的其他選項。"

msgid "When users visit the main search page (see @search_link), they will see the configured search pages that they have access to. Each search page has a search form on it, and the page will display search results after the user enters keywords into the form and clicks the search button."
msgstr "當使用者造訪主要搜尋頁面（請參閱 @search_link）時，他們將會看到他們有權存取的已配置搜尋頁面。 每一個搜尋頁面上都有一個搜尋表單，在使用者於表單中輸入關鍵字並按一下搜尋按鈕後，頁面會顯示搜尋結果。"

msgid "What modules provide site search?"
msgstr "哪些模組提供網站搜尋？"

msgid "The core Search module provides the ability to configure search pages; search page types are provided by both core and contributed modules. The core modules that provide search page types are:"
msgstr "核心「搜尋」模組可讓您配置搜尋頁面；核心模組及提供的模組都會提供搜尋頁面類型。提供搜尋頁面類型的核心模組如下："

msgid "The Node module, for searching content pages"
msgstr "「節點」模組，用於搜尋內容頁面"

msgid "The User module, for searching user profiles"
msgstr "「使用者」模組，用於搜尋使用者設定檔"

msgid "The Help module, for searching help topics"
msgstr "「說明」模組，用於搜尋說明主題"

msgid "As an alternative to the core Search module's system of search pages, you can use contributed modules to provide site search. For example, the <a href=\"https://www.drupal.org/project/apachesolr\">Apache Solr</a> and <a href=\"https://www.drupal.org/project/sphinx\">Sphinx</a> contributed modules use third-party technology to provide site search."
msgstr "作為搜尋頁面的核心「搜尋」模組系統的替代方案，您可以使用提供的模組來提供網站搜尋。例如，<a href=\"https://www.drupal.org/project/apachesolr\">Apache Solr</a> 及 <a href=\"https://www.drupal.org/project/sphinx\">Sphinx</a> 提供的模組使用協力廠商技術來提供網站搜尋。"

msgid "What are the limitations of the core Search module?"
msgstr "何謂核心「搜尋」模組的限制？"

msgid "There are two main limitations of the core Search module. First, it is not appropriate for very large sites -- if you have a large site, look into other search technologies like Apache Solr. Second, the Node search page type only supports exact keyword matching, which is not the behavior that most users will expect. You can improve this by installing a language-specific stemming module for your language (such as <a href=\"https://www.drupal.org/project/porterstemmer\">Porter Stemmer</a> for American English), which makes it so that, for example, a search for the word walk would match pages containing the words walk, walking, and walked."
msgstr "核心「搜尋」模組有兩個主要限制。首先，它不適用於非常大的網站 - 如果您具有大型網站，請查看其他搜尋技術（例如 Apache Solr）。其次，「節點」搜尋頁面類型僅支援關鍵字完全相符，這不是大多數使用者預期的行為。您可以安裝您所用語言的語言專用詞幹分析模組（例如，美式英文的 <a href=\"https://www.drupal.org/project/porterstemmer\">Porter Stemmer</a>），來改善此情況，例如，搜尋單字 walk 會將包含單字 walk、walking 及 walked 的頁面視為相符。"

msgid "What are the search permissions?"
msgstr "何謂搜尋許可權？"

msgid "Users with <em>Use search</em> permission can use the <em>Search form</em> block and <em>Search</em> page; this permission is required for any search configured in the core Search module."
msgstr "具有<em>使用搜尋</em>許可權的使用者可以使用<em>搜尋表單</em>區塊及<em>搜尋</em>頁面；在核心「搜尋」模組中配置的任何搜尋都需要此許可權。"

msgid "In addition to <em>Use search</em>, <em>View user information</em> permission is needed for searching users."
msgstr "除了<em>使用搜尋</em>之外，搜尋使用者還需要<em>檢視使用者資訊</em>許可權。"

msgid "In addition to <em>Use search</em>, <em>View published content</em> permission is needed for searching content."
msgstr "除了<em>使用搜尋</em>之外，搜尋內容還需要<em>檢視已發佈的內容</em>許可權。"

msgid "Users with <em>Use advanced search</em> permission can use more complex search filtering when performing content searches."
msgstr "具有<em>使用進階搜尋</em>許可權的使用者在執行內容搜尋時可以使用更複雜的搜尋過濾。"

msgid "Configuring site search overview"
msgstr "配置網站搜尋概觀"

msgid "In order to configure site search using the core Search module, you will need to configure one or more search pages. You will also need to verify or alter permissions so that the desired user roles can search the site. (See @user_overview_topic for more information about roles and permissions.) For content search, you will also need to make sure that the search index is configured and that the site is fully indexed. Finally, you may wish to place the <em>Search form</em> block on pages of your site, or add the search page to a navigation menu, to give users easy access to search. See the related topics listed below for specific tasks."
msgstr "若要使用核心「搜尋」模組配置網站搜尋，您需要配置一個以上搜尋頁面。 您也需要驗證或變更權限，讓所需的使用者角色可以搜尋網站。 （如需角色和權限的相關資訊，請參閱 @user_overview_topic。） 對於內容搜尋，您還需要確保已配置搜尋索引，且已完全編製網站索引。最後，您可能想要將<em>搜尋表單</em>區塊放置在網站的頁面上，或將搜尋頁面新增至導覽功能表，讓使用者可以輕鬆地存取搜尋。 如需瞭解特定作業，請參閱下列相關主題。"

msgid "<a href=\"https://www.drupal.org/documentation/modules/search\">Online documentation for the Search module</a>"
msgstr "<a href=\"https://www.drupal.org/documentation/modules/search\">「搜尋」模組的線上文件</a"

msgid "Creating and using shortcut administrative links"
msgstr "建立及使用捷徑管理鏈結"

msgid "Create, view, and use a set of shortcuts to access administrative pages."
msgstr "建立、檢視及使用一組捷徑來存取管理頁面。"

msgid "What are shortcuts?"
msgstr "何謂捷徑？"

msgid "<em>Shortcuts</em> are quick links to administrative pages; they are managed by the core Shortcut module. A site can have one or more <em>shortcut sets</em>, which can be shared by one or more users (by default, there is only one set shared by all users); each set contains a limited number of shortcuts. Users need <em>Use shortcuts</em> permission to view shortcuts; <em>Edit current shortcut set</em> permission to add, delete, or edit the shortcuts in the set assigned to them; and <em>Select any shortcut set</em> permission to select a different shortcut set when editing their user profile. There is also an <em>Administer shortcuts</em> permission, which allows an administrator to do any of these actions, as well as select shortcut sets for other users."
msgstr "<em>捷徑</em>是管理頁面的快速鏈結；它們由核心「捷徑」模組管理。一個網站可以有一個以上的<em>捷徑集</em>，可以由一或多個使用者共用（依預設，所有使用者只有一個共用的捷徑集）；每一個捷徑集包含數量有限的捷徑。使用者需要<em>使用捷徑</em>許可權來檢視捷徑；需要<em>編輯現行捷徑集</em>許可權來新增、刪除或編輯指派給他們的捷徑集內的捷徑；需要<em>選取任何捷徑集</em>許可權，在編輯其使用者設定檔時選取不同的捷徑集。也有<em>管理捷徑</em>許可權，容許管理者執行其中任何動作，以及為其他使用者選取捷徑集。"

msgid "Make sure that the core Shortcut module is enabled, and that you have a role with <em>Edit current shortcut set</em> or <em>Administer shortcuts</em> permission. Also, make sure that a toolbar module is installed (either the core Toolbar module or a contributed module replacement)."
msgstr "請確定已啟用核心「捷徑」模組，且您具有<em>編輯現行捷徑集</em>或<em>管理捷徑</em>許可權的角色。此外，請確定已安裝工具列模組（核心「工具列」模組或提供的模組取代項目）。"

msgid "Navigate to an administrative page that you want in your shortcut list."
msgstr "導覽至您希望它出現在捷徑清單中的管理頁面。"

msgid "Click the shortcut link to add the page to your shortcut list -- in the core Claro administrative theme, the link looks like a star, and is displayed next to the page title. However, if the page is already in your shortcut set, clicking the shortcut link will remove it from your shortcut set."
msgstr "按一下捷徑鏈結以將頁面新增至捷徑清單 -- 在核心 Claro 管理佈景主題中，該鏈結看起來像是星號，並顯示在頁面標題旁邊。 不過，如果該頁面已在捷徑集內，則按一下捷徑鏈結的話，會從捷徑集移除它。"

msgid "Repeat until all the desired links have been added to your shortcut set."
msgstr "請重複執行，直到所有想要的鏈結已新增至捷徑集為止。"

msgid "Click <em>Shortcuts</em> in the toolbar to display your shortcuts, and verify that the list is complete."
msgstr "按一下工具列中的<em>捷徑</em>以顯示您的捷徑，並驗證清單是否完整。"

msgid "Optionally, click <em>Edit shortcuts</em> at the right end of the shortcut list (left end in right-to-left languages), to remove links or change their order."
msgstr "選擇性地按一下捷徑清單右端的<em>編輯捷徑</em>（如果是由右至左語言，則在左端），以移除鏈結或變更其順序。"

msgid "Click any link in the shortcut bar to go directly to the administrative page."
msgstr "按一下捷徑列中的任何鏈結，以直接移至管理頁面。"

msgid "Clearing the site cache"
msgstr "清除網站快取"

msgid "Performance"
msgstr "效能"

msgid "Clear the data in the site cache."
msgstr "清除網站快取中的資料。"

msgid "What is the cache?"
msgstr "何謂快取？"

msgid "Some of the calculations that are done when your site loads a page take a long time to run. To save time when these calculations would need to be done again, their results can be <em>cached</em> in your site's database. There are internal mechanisms to <em>clear</em> cached data when the conditions or assumptions that went into the calculation have changed, but you can also clear cached data manually. When your site is misbehaving, a good first step is to clear the cache and see if the problem goes away."
msgstr "網站載入頁面時所完成的一些計算花費很長時間執行。當這些計算需要再次執行時，若要節省時間，可以將其結果<em>快取</em>在您網站的資料庫中。當進入計算的條件或假設已變更時，會有內部機制來<em>清除</em>快取的資料，但您也可以手動清除快取的資料。當您的網站表現不好時，理想的首要步驟是清除快取，然後看看問題是否消失。"

msgid "In the <em>Manage</em> administrative menu, navigate to <em>Configuration</em> &gt; <em>Development</em> &gt; <em>@performance_link</em>."
msgstr "在「<em>管理</em>」管理功能表中，導覽至<em>配置</em> &gt; <em>開發</em> &gt; <em>@performance_link</em>。"

msgid "Click <em>Clear all caches</em>. Your site's cached data will be cleared."
msgstr "按一下<em>清除所有快取</em>。將清除您網站的快取資料。"

msgid "<a href=\"https://www.drupal.org/docs/user_guide/en/prevent-cache.html\">Concept: Cache in the User Guide</a>"
msgstr "<a href=\"https://www.drupal.org/docs/user_guide/en/prevent-cache.html\">使用手冊中的「概念：快取」</a>"

msgid "Changing basic site settings"
msgstr "變更基本網站設定"

msgid "Basic site settings"
msgstr "基本網站設定"

msgid "Date and time formats"
msgstr "日期與時間格式"

msgid "Configure the basic settings of your site, including the site name, slogan, main email address, default time zone, default country, and the date formats to use."
msgstr "配置網站的基本設定，包括網站名稱、標語、主要電子郵件位址、預設時區、預設國家/地區，以及要使用的日期格式。"

msgid "In the <em>Manage</em> administrative menu, navigate to <em>Configuration</em> &gt; <em>System</em> &gt; <em>@information_link</em>."
msgstr "在「<em>管理</em>」管理功能表中，導覽至<em>配置</em> &gt; <em>系統</em> &gt; <em>@information_link</em>。"

msgid "Enter the site name, slogan, and main email address for your site."
msgstr "輸入您網站的網站名稱、標語及主要電子郵件位址。"

msgid "Click <em>Save configuration</em>. You should see a message indicating that the settings were saved."
msgstr "按一下<em>儲存配置</em>。您應該會看到訊息，指出已儲存這些設定。"

msgid "In the <em>Manage</em> administrative menu, navigate to <em>Configuration</em> &gt; <em>Region and language</em> &gt; <em>@regional_link</em>."
msgstr "在「<em>管理</em>」管理功能表中，導覽至<em>配置</em> &gt; <em>地區和語言</em> &gt; <em>@regional_link</em>。"

msgid "Select the default country and default time zone for your site."
msgstr "選取您網站的預設國家/地區和預設時區。"

msgid "In the <em>Manage</em> administrative menu, navigate to <em>Configuration</em> &gt; <em>Region and language</em> &gt; <em>@datetime_link</em>."
msgstr "在「<em>管理</em>」管理功能表中，導覽至<em>配置</em> &gt; <em>地區和語言</em> &gt; <em>@datetime_link</em>。"

msgid "Look at the <em>Patterns</em> for the Default long, medium, and short date formats. If any of them does not match the date format you want to use on your site, click <em>Edit</em> in that row to edit the format."
msgstr "查看<em>型樣</em>中的預設長、中、短日期格式。如果其中有任何一個不符合您要在網站上使用的日期格式，請按一下該列中的<em>編輯</em>，以編輯格式。"

msgid "Adjust the <em>Format string</em> until the <em>Displayed</em> format matches what you want. (Date format strings are composed of PHP date format codes.)"
msgstr "調整<em>格式字串</em>，直到<em>顯示的</em>格式符合您想要的格式為止。（日期格式字串由 PHP 日期格式代碼組成。）"

msgid "Click <em>Save format</em>. You should see a message indicating that the format was saved."
msgstr "按一下<em>儲存格式</em>。您應該會看到訊息，指出已儲存格式。"

msgid "Repeat the previous three steps for any other date formats that need to be changed."
msgstr "對任何需要變更的其他日期格式重複前三個步驟。"

msgid "<a href=\"https://www.php.net/manual/datetime.format.php#refsect1-datetime.format-parameters\">PHP date format codes reference</a>"
msgstr "<a href=\"https://www.php.net/manual/datetime.format.php#refsect1-datetime.format-parameters\">PHP 日期格式代碼參照</a>"

msgid "Configuring error responses, including 403/404 pages"
msgstr "配置錯誤回應，包括 403/404 頁面"

msgid "Logging and errors"
msgstr "日誌與錯誤"

msgid "Set up your site to respond appropriately to site errors, including 403 and 404 page responses."
msgstr "設定您的網站，以適當回應網站錯誤，包括 403 和 404 頁面回應。"

msgid "What are 403 and 404 responses?"
msgstr "何謂 403 和 404 回應？"

msgid "When a user visits a web page, the web server sends a response code in addition to the page content. A normal, non-error response has code 200. If the page does not exist on the site, the response code is 404. If the page exists, but the user is not authorized to visit the page, the response code is 403. The core software provides default responses for both 403 and 404 codes, but if you prefer, you can create your own pages for each."
msgstr "當使用者造訪網頁時，除了頁面內容之外，Web 伺服器還會傳送回應碼。正常、非錯誤回應的代碼為 200。如果該頁面不在網站上，則回應碼為 404。如果頁面存在，但使用者未獲授權造訪該頁面，則回應碼為 403。核心軟體會提供 403 和 404 代碼的預設回應，但您也可以為每一個代碼建立您自己的頁面。"

msgid "What other errors can occur?"
msgstr "還會發生什麼其他錯誤？"

msgid "Under some situations, your site can generate error messages. These can be due to user errors (such as entering invalid values in a form, or incorrect configuration), PHP runtime errors, or software bugs. Some errors may result in a <em>white screen of death</em> (a totally blank web page response); less drastic errors will generate error messages. You can configure what happens when an error message is generated."
msgstr "在某些狀況下，您的網站可能會產生錯誤訊息。這些有可能是因為使用者錯誤（例如在表單中輸入無效的值或配置不正確）、PHP 執行時期錯誤或軟體錯誤。某些錯誤可能會導致<em>白色當機畫面</em>（完全空白的網頁回應）；較不嚴重的錯誤會產生錯誤訊息。您可以配置在產生錯誤訊息時所發生的狀況。"

msgid "If desired, create pages to use for 403 and 404 responses. Note the URLs for these pages."
msgstr "您可以建立用於 403 及 404 回應的頁面。請記下這些頁面的 URL。"

msgid "In the <em>Error pages</em> section, enter the URL for your 403/404 pages, starting after the site home page URL. For example, if your site URL is <em>https://example.com</em> and your 404 page is <em>https://example.com/not-found</em>, you would enter <em>/not-found</em>."
msgstr "在<em>錯誤頁面</em>區段中，輸入 403/404 頁面的 URL，從網站首頁 URL 之後開始。 例如，如果您的網站 URL 是 <em>https://example.com</em>，您的 404 頁面是 <em>https://example.com/not-found</em>，則您應該輸入 <em>/not-found</em>。"

msgid "In the <em>Manage</em> administrative menu, navigate to <em>Configuration</em> &gt; <em>Development</em> &gt; <em>@log_settings_link</em>."
msgstr "在「<em>管理</em>」管理功能表中，導覽至<em>配置</em> &gt; <em>開發</em> &gt; <em>@log_settings_link</em>。"

msgid "For a production site, select <em>None</em> under <em>Error messages to display</em>. For a site that is in development, select one of the other options, so that you are more aware of the errors the site is generating."
msgstr "若為正式作業網站，請在<em>顯示的錯誤訊息</em>下選取<em>無</em>。對於開發中的網站，請選取其中一個其他選項，讓您更清楚網站產生的錯誤。"

msgid "Enabling and disabling maintenance mode"
msgstr "啟用及停用維護模式"

msgid "Maintenance mode"
msgstr "維護模式"

msgid "Put your site in maintenance mode to perform maintenance operations, and then return to normal mode when finished."
msgstr "將網站置於維護模式以執行維護作業，然後在完成時回到標準模式。"

msgid "What is maintenance mode?"
msgstr "何謂維護模式？"

msgid "When your site is in maintenance mode, most site visitors will see a simple maintenance mode message page, rather than being able to use the full functionality of the site. Users with <em>Use the site in maintenance mode</em> permission who are already logged in will be able to use the full site, and the log in page at <em>/user</em> will also be accessible to anyone."
msgstr "當您的網站處於維護模式時，大部分網站造訪者都會看到簡式維護模式訊息頁面，而不能使用網站的完整功能。具有<em>在維護模式下使用網站</em>許可權的已登入使用者將能夠使用完整網站，且任何人也都可以存取 <em>/user</em> 的登入頁面。"

msgid "In the <em>Manage</em> administrative menu, navigate to <em>Configuration</em> &gt; <em>Development</em> &gt; <em>@maintenance_link</em>."
msgstr "在「<em>管理</em>」管理功能表中，導覽至<em>配置</em> &gt; <em>開發</em> &gt; <em>@maintenance_link</em>。"

msgid "Check <em>Put site into maintenance mode</em>, optionally change the <em>Message to display when in maintenance mode</em>, and click <em>Save configuration</em>. Your site will be in maintenance mode."
msgstr "勾選<em>將網站置於維護模式</em>，選擇性地變更<em>在維護模式時要顯示的訊息</em>，然後按一下<em>儲存配置</em>。您的網站將處於維護模式。"

msgid "Perform your maintenance operations."
msgstr "執行維護作業。"

msgid "Uncheck <em>Put site into maintenance mode</em> and click <em>Save configuration</em>. Your site will be back in normal operation mode."
msgstr "取消勾選<em>將網站置於維護模式</em>，然後按一下<em>儲存配置</em>。您的網站將回到標準作業模式。"

msgid "Clear the site cache. See @cache_topic for instructions."
msgstr "清除網站快取。 如需指示，請參閱 @cache_topic。"

msgid "Installing a module"
msgstr "安裝模組"

msgid "Install a core module, or a contributed module that has already been downloaded."
msgstr "安裝核心模組，或已下載的已提供模組。"

msgid "In the <em>Manage</em> administrative menu, navigate to <em>@extend_link</em>."
msgstr "在<em>管理</em>管理功能表中，導覽至 <em>@extend_link</em>。"

msgid "Enter a word from the module name or description into the filter box, to make the list of modules smaller. Locate the module you want to install."
msgstr "將模組名稱或說明中的單字輸入到過濾器方框中，使模組清單縮小。尋找您要安裝的模組。"

msgid "Check the box next to the name of the module you want to install; you can also check more than one box to install multiple modules at the same time. If the checkbox is disabled for the module you are trying to install, expand the information to see why -- you may need to download an additional module that your module requires."
msgstr "勾選您要安裝的模組名稱旁邊的方框；您也可以勾選多個方框，同時安裝多個模組。如果您嘗試安裝的模組已停用勾選框，請展開資訊，以瞭解原因何在 -- 您可能需要下載您模組需要的其他模組。"

msgid "Click <em>Install</em> at the bottom of the page. If you chose to install a module with dependencies that were not already installed, or if you chose an Experimental module, confirm your choice on the next page."
msgstr "按一下頁面底端的<em>安裝</em>。如果您選擇安裝的模組還有尚未安裝的相依項，或者您選擇了試驗性模組，請在下一頁確認您的選擇。"

msgid "Wait for the module (or modules) to be installed. You should be returned to the <em>Extend</em> page with a message saying the module or modules were installed."
msgstr "等待安裝模組。您應該會回到<em>延伸</em>頁面，並有訊息指出已安裝模組。"

msgid "Uninstalling a module"
msgstr "解除安裝模組"

msgid "Uninstall"
msgstr "解除安裝"

msgid "Uninstall a module. Your site should be in <em>maintenance mode</em> when you uninstall modules. See @maintenance_topic for details."
msgstr "將模組解除安裝。 當您解除安裝模組時，您的網站應該處於<em>維護模式</em>。 如需詳細資料，請參閱 @maintenance_topic。"

msgid "In the <em>Manage</em> administrative menu, navigate to <em>Extend</em> &gt; <em>@uninstall_link</em>."
msgstr "在「<em>管理</em>」管理功能表中，導覽至<em>延伸</em> &gt; <em>@uninstall_link</em>。"

msgid "Enter a word from the module name or description into the filter box, to make the list of modules smaller. Locate the module you want to uninstall."
msgstr "將模組名稱或說明中的單字輸入到過濾器方框中，使模組清單縮小。尋找您要解除安裝的模組。"

msgid "In the <em>Description</em> column, see if there are reasons that this module cannot be uninstalled. For example, you may have created content using this module (which you would need to delete first), or there may be another module installed that requires this module to be installed (you would need to uninstall the other module first)."
msgstr "在<em>說明</em>直欄中，查看是否有無法解除安裝此模組的原因。例如，您可能已使用此模組建立內容（您需要先刪除該內容），或可能已安裝另一個模組，而它需要安裝此模組（您必須先解除安裝另一個模組）。"

msgid "If there are no reasons listed, the module can be uninstalled. Check the box in the <em>Uninstall</em> column, next to the module's name."
msgstr "如果沒有列出任何原因，就可以解除安裝模組。勾選模組名稱旁邊的<em>解除安裝</em>直欄中的方框。"

msgid "Click <em>Uninstall</em> at the bottom of the page. Verify the list of modules to be uninstalled and configuration to be deleted on the confirmation page, and click <em>Uninstall</em>."
msgstr "按一下頁面底端的<em>解除安裝</em>。驗證要解除安裝的模組清單及要在確認頁面上刪除的配置，然後按一下<em>解除安裝</em>。"

msgid "Wait for the module to be uninstalled. You should be returned to the <em>Uninstall</em> page with a message saying the module was uninstalled."
msgstr "等待解除安裝模組。您應該會回到<em>解除安裝</em>頁面，並有訊息指出已解除安裝模組。"

msgid "Running reports on your site"
msgstr "對您的網站執行報告"

msgid "Status report"
msgstr "狀態報告"

msgid "Run reports to learn about the status and health of your site."
msgstr "執行報告以瞭解網站的狀態和性能。"

msgid "In the <em>Manage</em> administrative menu, navigate to <em>Reports</em> &gt; <em>@status_link</em> to see a report that summarizes the health and status of your site. If there are any warnings or errors, you will need to fix them. Take note of any upcoming highly critical security releases that may impact your site."
msgstr "在「<em>管理</em>」管理功能表中，導覽至<em>報告</em> &gt; <em>@status_link</em>，以查看摘要網站性能及狀態的報告。 如果有任何警告或錯誤，您需要修正它們。 請注意可能影響您網站的任何即將發生的高度重要安全版本。"

msgid "If you have the core Database Logging module installed, in the <em>Manage</em> administrative menu, navigate to <em>Reports</em> &gt; <em>Recent log messages</em> to see a report of the error and informational messages your site has generated. You can filter the report by <em>Severity</em> to see only the most critical messages, if desired."
msgstr "如果您已安裝核心「資料庫記載」模組，請在<em>管理</em>管理功能表中，導覽至<em>報告</em> &gt; <a href=\"@status_url\"><em>最近的日誌訊息</em></a>，以查看您網站已產生的錯誤和參考訊息的報告。需要時，您可以依<em>嚴重性</em>過濾報告，這樣您只會看到最重要的訊息。"

msgid "If you have the core Update Manager module installed, in the <em>Manage</em> administrative menu, navigate to <em>Reports</em> &gt; <em>Available updates</em> to see a report of the updates that are available for your site software. If <em>Last checked</em> is far in the past, click <em>Check manually</em> to update the report. Scan the report; if Drupal core or any modules or themes have security updates available, you should update them as soon as possible."
msgstr "如果您已安裝核心「更新管理程式」模組，請在<em>管理</em>管理功能表中，導覽至<em>報告</em> &gt; <em>可用的更新</em>，以查看您網站軟體可用的更新項目報告。如果<em>前次檢查</em>時間過很久了，請按一下<em>手動檢查</em>以更新報告。掃描報告；如果 Drupal 核心或任何模組或佈景主題有可用的安全更新項目，您應該儘快更新。"

msgid "<a href=\"https://www.drupal.org/docs/user_guide/en/security-chapter.html\">Security and Maintenance chapter in the User Guide</a>, which includes information on how to update your site's core software, modules, and themes"
msgstr "<a href=\"https://www.drupal.org/docs/user_guide/en/security-chapter.html\">使用手冊中的「安全及維護」章節</a>，其中包括如何更新網站核心軟體、模組和佈景主題的相關資訊"

msgid "Installing a theme and setting default themes"
msgstr "安裝佈景主題並設定預設佈景主題"

msgid "Appearance"
msgstr "外觀"

msgid "Install a core theme, or a contributed theme that has already been downloaded. Choose the default themes to use for the site and for administrative pages."
msgstr "安裝核心佈景主題，或已下載的已提供佈景主題。選擇要用於網站及管理頁面的預設佈景主題。"

msgid "In the <em>Manage</em> administrative menu, navigate to <em>@themes_link</em>."
msgstr "在「<em>管理</em>」管理功能表中，導覽至 <em>@themes_link</em>。"

msgid "Locate the themes that you want to use as the site default theme and for administrative pages."
msgstr "尋找您要用作網站預設佈景主題及用於管理頁面的佈景主題。"

msgid "For each of these themes, if the theme is in the <em>Uninstalled themes</em> section, click the <em>Install</em> link to install the theme. Wait for the theme to be installed (translations might be downloaded). You should be returned to the <em>Appearance</em> page."
msgstr "對於每一個佈景主題，如果佈景主題位於<em>未安裝的佈景主題</em>區段中，請按一下<em>安裝</em>鏈結以安裝佈景主題。等待安裝佈景主題（可能下載翻譯）。您應該回到<em>外觀</em>頁面。"

msgid "Locate the theme that you want to be your default theme, which should now be in the <em>Installed themes</em> section. If it is not already labeled as the <em>default theme</em>, click the <em>Set as default</em> link."
msgstr "尋找您要成為預設佈景主題的佈景主題，現在它應該位於<em>已安裝的佈景主題</em>區段中。如果尚未標示為<em>預設佈景主題</em>，請按一下<em>設為預設值</em>鏈結。"

msgid "At the bottom of the page, select the <em>Administration theme</em> that you want to use on administrative pages. Click <em>Save configuration</em> if you selected a new theme."
msgstr "在頁面底端，選取您要在管理頁面上使用的<em>管理佈景主題</em>。如果您選取了新的佈景主題，請按一下<em>儲存配置</em>。"

msgid "If you changed the default theme for your site, visit the site home page or another page on the non-administration part of your site and verify that the site is using the new theme. If you changed the administration theme, verify that the new theme is used on administrative pages."
msgstr "如果您變更了網站的預設佈景主題，請造訪網站首頁或網站的非管理部分的另一頁面，並驗證該網站是否使用新的佈景主題。如果您已變更管理佈景主題，請驗證在管理頁面上使用了新的佈景主題。"

msgid "Uninstalling an unused theme"
msgstr "解除安裝未用的佈景主題"

msgid "Uninstall a theme that was previously installed, but is no longer being used on the site."
msgstr "將先前已安裝但已不再使用於網站上的佈景主題解除安裝。"

msgid "Locate the theme that you want to uninstall, in the <em>Installed themes</em> section."
msgstr "在<em>已安裝的佈景主題</em>區段中尋找您要解除安裝的佈景主題。"

msgid "Click the <em>Uninstall</em> link to uninstall the theme. If there is not an <em>Uninstall</em> link, the theme cannot be uninstalled because it is either being used as the site default theme, being used as the <em>Administration theme</em>, or is the base theme for another installed theme."
msgstr "按一下<em>解除安裝</em>鏈結，以解除安裝佈景主題。 如果沒有<em>解除安裝</em>鏈結，則無法將佈景主題解除安裝，因為它可能用作網站預設佈景主題、用作<em>管理佈景主題</em>，或是另一個已安裝的佈景主題的基本佈景主題。"

msgid "Configuring taxonomy"
msgstr "配置分類架構"

msgid "Administer vocabularies and terms"
msgstr "管理詞彙表及術語"

msgid "Taxonomy"
msgstr "分類"

msgid "Create a taxonomy vocabulary and add a reference field for that vocabulary to a content entity. See @taxonomy_overview_topic for information about taxonomy and @content_structure_topic for more on content entities."
msgstr "建立分類架構詞彙，並將該詞彙的參照欄位新增至內容實體。 如需分類架構的相關資訊，請參閱 @taxonomy_overview_topic；如需內容實體的相關資訊，請參閱 @content_structure_topic。"

msgid "Who can configure a taxonomy vocabulary?"
msgstr "誰可以配置分類架構詞彙？"

msgid "Users with the <em>@taxonomy_permissions_link</em> permission can configure a vocabulary. To add a field in the administrative interface, the core Field UI module must be installed, and you will also need the <em>Administer fields</em> permission for the entity you are adding the field to."
msgstr "擁有 <em>@taxonomy_permissions_link</em> 權限的使用者可以配置詞彙。 若要在管理介面中新增欄位，必須要安裝「欄位使用者介面」核心模組，而且對於要將欄位新增至其中的實體，您也需要有<em>管理欄位</em>權限。"

msgid "In the <em>Manage</em> administrative menu, navigate to <em>Structure</em> &gt; <em>@taxonomy_admin_link</em>."
msgstr "在<em>管理</em>管理功能表中，導覽至<em>結構</em> > <em>@taxonomy_admin_link</em>。"

msgid "Click <em>Add vocabulary</em>."
msgstr "按一下<em>新增詞彙</em>。"

msgid "In the <em>Name</em> field, enter a name for the vocabulary (for example \"Ingredients\"), which is how it will be shown in the administrative interface. Optionally, add a description."
msgstr "在<em>名稱</em>欄位中，輸入詞彙的名稱（例如「材料」），這就是其在管理介面中顯示的樣子。 選擇性地新增說明。"

msgid "Click <em>Save</em>. Your vocabulary will be created and you will see the page that lists all the terms in this vocabulary."
msgstr "按一下<em>儲存</em>。 即會建立詞彙，您將會看到列出此詞彙中所有術語的頁面。"

msgid "Optionally, click <em>Add term</em> to add a term to the new vocabulary. In the <em>Name</em> field, enter the term name (for example \"Butter\"). Click <em>Save</em>. You will receive a confirmation about the term you created. You may optionally continue to add more terms."
msgstr "選擇性地按一下<em>新增術語</em>，將術語新增至詞彙中。 在<em>名稱</em>欄位中，輸入術語名稱（例如「奶油」）。按一下<em>儲存</em>。 您將收到關於所建立術語的確認訊息。 您可以選擇性地繼續新增更多術語。"

msgid "If you have the Field UI module installed, follow the instructions on the related <em>Adding a reference field to an entity sub-type</em> topic to add a taxonomy reference field to the entity type of your choice. The settings page will allow you to choose the <em>Vocabulary</em> that you created as the vocabulary to reference."
msgstr "如果您已安裝「欄位使用者介面」模組，請遵循<em>將參照欄位新增至實體子類型</em>相關主題上的指示，將分類架構參照欄位新增至您選擇的實體類型。 設定頁面可讓您選擇所建立的<em>詞彙</em>作為要參照的詞彙。"

msgid "You may also want to configure the display and form display of the new field (see related topics)."
msgstr "您也可能想要配置新欄位的顯示畫面及表單顯示畫面（請參閱相關主題）。"

msgid "User Guide: Setting up a taxonomy"
msgstr "使用手冊：設定分類架構"

msgid "Managing taxonomy"
msgstr "管理分類架構"

msgid "What is taxonomy?"
msgstr "何謂分類架構？"

msgid "<em>Taxonomy</em> is used to classify website content. One common example of taxonomy is the tags used to classify or categorize posts in a blog website; a cooking website could use an ingredients taxonomy to classify recipes. Individual taxonomy items are known as <em>terms</em> (the blog tags or recipe ingredients in these examples); and a set of terms is known as a <em>vocabulary</em> (the set of all blog post tags, or the set of all recipe ingredients in these examples). Technically, taxonomy terms are an entity type and the entity subtypes are the vocabularies; see @content_structure_topic for more on content entities. Like other entities, taxonomy terms can have fields attached; for instance, you could set up an image field to contain an icon for each term."
msgstr "<em>分類架構</em>用來分類網站內容。 分類架構的一個常見範例是用來在部落格網站中對文章進行分類的標籤；烹飪網站可以使用材料分類架構來分類食譜。 個別分類架構項目稱為<em>術語</em>（這些範例中的部落格標籤或食譜材料）；一組術語稱為<em>詞彙</em>（這些範例中所有部落格文章標籤的集合，或所有食譜材料的集合）。 在技術上，分類架構術語是實體類型，實體子類型是詞彙；如需內容實體的相關資訊，請參閱 @content_structure_topic。 與其他實體一樣，分類架構術語可以附加欄位；例如，您可以設定影像欄位，以包含每個術語的圖示。"

msgid "An individual vocabulary can organize its terms in a hierarchy, or it could be flat. For example, blog tags normally have a flat structure, while a recipe ingredients vocabulary could be hierarchical (for example, tomatoes could be a sub-term of vegetables, and under tomatoes, you could have green and red tomatoes)."
msgstr "個別詞彙可以使用階層組織其術語，也可以是平面結構。 例如，部落格標籤通常具有平面結構，而食譜材料詞彙可能是階層式結構（例如，番茄可以是蔬菜的子術語，而在番茄下，您可能有綠色和紅色的番茄）。"

msgid "Taxonomy terms are normally attached as reference fields to other content entities, which is how you can use them to classify content. When you set up a taxonomy reference field, you can let users enter terms in two ways:"
msgstr "分類架構術語通常會附加為其他內容實體的參照欄位，這就是您使用它們來分類內容的方法。 當您設定分類架構參照欄位時，可以讓使用者透過兩種方式輸入術語："

msgid "Free tagging"
msgstr "自由分類（tag）"

msgid "New terms can be created right on the content editing form."
msgstr "您可以直接在內容編輯表單上建立新術語。"

msgid "Fixed list of terms"
msgstr "固定術語清單"

msgid "The list of terms is curated and managed outside the content editing form, and users can only select from the existing list when editing content."
msgstr "術語清單是在內容編輯表單之外進行整理及管理，而使用者在編輯內容時，只能從現有的清單中加以選取。"

msgid "Taxonomy reference fields can be added to any entity, such as user accounts, content blocks, or regular content items. If you use them to classify regular content items, your site will automatically be set up with taxonomy listing pages for each term; each of these pages lists all of the content items that are classified with that term."
msgstr "可以將分類架構參照欄位新增至任何實體，例如使用者帳戶、內容區塊或一般內容項目。 如果您使用它們來分類一般內容項目，您的網站會自動設定每個術語的分類架構清單頁面；這些頁面的每一頁都會列出以該術語分類的所有內容項目。"

msgid "Overview of managing taxonomy"
msgstr "管理分類架構的概觀"

msgid "The core Taxonomy module allows you to create and edit taxonomy vocabularies and taxonomy terms. The core Field UI module provides a user interface for adding fields to entities, including the taxonomy reference field, and configuring field editing and display. See the related topics listed below for specific tasks."
msgstr "「分類架構」核心模組可讓您建立及編輯分類架構詞彙與分類架構術語。 「欄位使用者介面」核心模組提供使用者介面，用來將欄位新增至實體（包括分類架構參照欄位），以及配置欄位的編輯和顯示。 如需瞭解特定作業，請參閱下列相關主題。"

msgid "User guide on Taxonomy"
msgstr "分類架構的使用手冊"

msgid "Taking tours of administrative pages"
msgstr "導覽管理頁面"

msgid "Take a tour of an administrative page."
msgstr "導覽管理頁面。"

msgid "What are tours?"
msgstr "何謂導覽？"

msgid "The core Tour module provides users with <em>tours</em>, which are guided tours of the administrative interface. Each tour starts on a particular administrative page, and consists of one or more <em>tips</em> that highlight elements of the page, guide you through a workflow, or explain key concepts. Users need <em>Access tour</em> permission to view tours, and JavaScript must be enabled in their browsers."
msgstr "核心「導覽」模組為使用者提供的<em>導覽</em>是管理介面的引導式導覽。每一個導覽會從特定管理頁面開始，並包含一或多個<em>提示</em>，其強調顯示頁面的元素、引導您完成工作流程或說明主要概念。使用者需要<em>存取導覽</em>許可權才能檢視導覽，且必須在其瀏覽器中啟用 JavaScript。"

msgid "Make sure that the core Tour module is installed, and that you have a role with the <em>Access tour</em> permission. Also, make sure that a toolbar module is installed (either the core Toolbar module or a contributed module replacement)."
msgstr "請確定已安裝核心「導覽」模組，且您具有<em>存取導覽</em>許可權的角色。此外，請確定已安裝工具列模組（核心「工具列」模組或提供的模組取代項目）。"

msgid "Visit an administrative page that has a tour, such as the edit view page provided by the core Views UI module."
msgstr "造訪具有導覽的管理頁面，例如由核心「視圖使用者介面」模組提供的編輯視圖頁面。"

msgid "Click the <em>Tour</em> button at the right end of the toolbar (left end for right-to-left languages). The first tip of the tour should appear."
msgstr "按一下工具列右端的<em>導覽</em>按鈕（如果是由右至左語言，則位於左端）。應該會出現導覽的第一個提示。"

msgid "Click the <em>Next</em> button to advance to the next tip, and <em>End tour</em> at the end to close the tour."
msgstr "按<em>下一步</em>按鈕以前進至下一個提示，結束時按一下<em>結束導覽</em>以結束導覽。"

msgid "Creating a user account"
msgstr "建立使用者帳戶"

msgid "People"
msgstr "使用者"

msgid "Create a new user account."
msgstr "建立一個新的使用者帳號。"

msgid "In the <em>Manage</em> administrative menu, navigate to <em>@people_link</em>."
msgstr "在「<em>管理</em>」管理功能表中，導覽至 <em>@people_link</em>。"

msgid "Click <em>Add user</em>."
msgstr "按一下<em>新增使用者</em>。"

msgid "Enter the <em>Email address</em>, <em>Username</em>, and <em>Password</em> (twice) for the new user."
msgstr "輸入新使用者的<em>電子郵件位址</em>、<em>使用者名稱</em>和<em>密碼</em>（兩次）。"

msgid "Verify that the <em>Roles</em> checked for the new user are correct."
msgstr "驗證為新使用者勾選的<em>角色</em>正確無誤。"

msgid "If you want the new user to receive an email message notifying them of the new account, check <em>Notify user of new account</em>."
msgstr "如果您要新使用者收到通知他們有新帳戶的電子郵件訊息，請勾選<em>通知使用者有新帳戶</em>。"

msgid "Optionally, change other settings on the form."
msgstr "選擇性地變更表單上的其他設定。"

msgid "Click <em>Create new account</em>."
msgstr "按一下<em>建立新的帳戶</em>。"

msgid "You will be left on the <em>Add user</em> page; repeat these steps if you have more user accounts to create."
msgstr "您將留在<em>新增使用者</em>頁面上；如果您有更多使用者帳戶要建立，請重複這些步驟。"

msgid "Adding a new role"
msgstr "新增角色"

msgid "Create a new role."
msgstr "建立新的角色。"

msgid "In the <em>Manage</em> administrative menu, navigate to <em>People</em> &gt; <em>@roles_link</em>."
msgstr "在「<em>管理</em>」管理功能表中，導覽至<em>人員</em> &gt; <em>@roles_link</em>。"

msgid "Click <em>Add role</em>."
msgstr "按一下<em>新增角色</em>。"

msgid "Enter the desired <em>Role name</em>. If desired, click <em>Edit</em> to change the <em>Machine name</em> for the role."
msgstr "輸入所要的<em>角色名稱</em>。也可以按一下<em>編輯</em>來變更角色的<em>機器名稱</em>。"

msgid "Click <em>Save</em>. You should be returned to the <em>Roles</em> page and your new role should be in the role list."
msgstr "按一下<em>儲存</em>。您應該會回到<em>角色</em>頁面，您的新角色應該在角色清單中。"

msgid "Managing user accounts and site visitors"
msgstr "管理使用者帳戶和網站訪客"

msgid "What is a user?"
msgstr "何謂使用者？"

msgid "A user is anyone accessing or viewing your site. <em>Anonymous</em> users are users who are not logged in, and <em>Authenticated</em> users are users who are logged in."
msgstr "使用者是任何存取或檢視您網站的人。<em>匿名</em>使用者是未登入的使用者，<em>已鑑別</em>使用者是已登入的使用者。"

msgid "What is a role?"
msgstr "何謂角色？"

msgid "<em>Roles</em> are used to group and classify users; each user can be assigned one or more roles. There are also special roles for all anonymous and all authenticated users."
msgstr "<em>角色</em>可用來將使用者分組及分類；每一個使用者都可以獲指派一個以上角色。所有匿名使用者及所有已鑑別的使用者也都具有特殊角色。"

msgid "What is a permission?"
msgstr "何謂許可權？"

msgid "Granting a <em>permission</em> to a role allows users who have been assigned that role to perform an action on the site, such as viewing content, editing or creating  a particular type of content, administering settings for a particular module, or using a particular function of the site (such as search)."
msgstr "授與<em>許可權</em>給角色可讓已獲指派該角色的使用者能夠在網站上執行動作，例如檢視內容、編輯或建立特定類型的內容、管理特定模組的設定，或使用網站的特定功能（例如搜尋）。"

msgid "Overview of managing user accounts and visitors"
msgstr "管理使用者帳戶和訪客的概觀"

msgid "The core User module allows users to register, log in, and log out, and administrators to manage user roles and permissions. The core Ban module allows administrators to ban certain IP addresses from accessing the site. Depending on which modules you have installed on your site, the related topics below will help you with tasks related to managing user accounts and visitors."
msgstr "核心「使用者」模組讓使用者進行登錄、登入及登出，以及讓管理者管理使用者角色和許可權。核心「禁用」模組讓管理者可以禁止某些 IP 位址存取該網站。根據您在網站上已安裝的模組而定，下面的相關主題將協助您處理管理使用者帳戶和訪客的相關作業。"

msgid "Modifying the permissions for a role"
msgstr "修改角色的許可權"

msgid "Modify the permissions for an existing role."
msgstr "修改現有角色的許可權。"

msgid "In the <em>Manage</em> administrative menu, navigate to <em>People</em> &gt; <em>@permissions_link</em>."
msgstr "在「<em>管理</em>」管理功能表中，導覽至 <em>人員</em> &gt; <em>@permissions_link</em>。"

msgid "Review the permissions for the role, paying particular attention to the permissions marked with <em>Warning: Give to trusted roles only; this permission has security implications.</em> Uncheck permissions that this role should not have, in the row of the permission and the column of the role; check permissions that this role should have."
msgstr "檢閱角色的許可權，特別留意標示為<em>警告：僅提供給信任的角色；此許可權有安全疑慮</em>的許可權。在許可權列及角色直欄中取消勾選此角色不應該具有的許可權；勾選此角色應該具有的許可權。"

msgid "Configuring how user accounts are created and deleted"
msgstr "配置如何建立及刪除使用者帳戶"

msgid "Configure settings related to how user accounts are created and deleted."
msgstr "配置與如何建立及刪除使用者帳戶相關的設定。"

msgid "What are the settings related to user account creation and deletion?"
msgstr "與使用者帳戶之建立及刪除相關的設定為何？"

msgid "You can make it possible for new users to register themselves for accounts, with or without email verification or administrative approval. Or, you can make it so only administrators with <em>Administer users</em> permission can register new users."
msgstr "您可以讓新使用者能夠註冊自己的帳戶，可選擇有或沒有電子郵件驗證或管理單位核准。或者，您可以讓只具有<em>管理使用者</em>許可權的管理者才能登錄新使用者。"

msgid "You can configure what happens to content that a user created, if their account is <em>canceled</em> (deleted)."
msgstr "對於萬一使用者的帳戶<em>被取消</em>（被刪除）時使用者建立的內容會發生什麼情況，您可加以配置。"

msgid "You can edit the email messages that are sent to users when their accounts are pending, approved, created, blocked, or canceled, or when they request a password reset."
msgstr "對於在擱置、核准、建立、封鎖或取消使用者帳戶時，或在使用者要求密碼重設時所傳送給使用者的電子郵件訊息，您可加以編輯。"

msgid "What are variables in email message text?"
msgstr "電子郵件訊息文字中的變數是什麼？"

msgid "<em>Variables</em> are short text strings, enclosed in square brackets [], that you can insert into configured email message text. When an individual message is generated, data from your site is substituted for the variables. Some commonly-used variables are:"
msgstr "<em>變數</em>是以方括弧 [] 括住的簡短字串，您可以將其插入已配置的電子郵件訊息文字中。產生個別訊息時，您網站中的資料會替換變數。一些常用的變數如下："

msgid "[site:name]: The name of your website."
msgstr "[site:name]：網站的名稱。"

msgid "[site:url]: The URL of your website."
msgstr "[site:url]：網站的 URL。"

msgid "[site:login-url]: The URL where users can log in to your site."
msgstr "[site:login-url]：使用者可以在其中登入您網站的 URL。"

msgid "[user:display-name]: The user's displayed name."
msgstr "[user:display-name]：使用者的顯示名稱。"

msgid "[user:account-name]: The user's account name."
msgstr "[user:account-name]：使用者的帳戶名稱。"

msgid "[user:mail]: The user's email alias."
msgstr "[user:mail]：使用者的電子郵件別名。"

msgid "[user:one-time-login-url]: An expiring URL that a user can use to log in once, if they need to reset their password."
msgstr "[user:one-time-login-url]：如果使用者需要重設其密碼，則為使用者可用來登入一次且即將到期的 URL。"

msgid "In the <em>Manage</em> administrative menu, navigate to <em>Configuration</em> &gt; <em>People</em> &gt; <em>@account_settings_link</em>."
msgstr "在「<em>管理</em>」管理功能表中，導覽至<em>配置</em> &gt; <em>人員</em> &gt; <em>@account_settings_link</em>。"

msgid "Select the method you want to use for creating user accounts, and check or uncheck the box that requires email verification, to match the settings you want for your site."
msgstr "選取您要用於建立使用者帳戶的方法，並勾選或取消勾選需要電子郵件驗證的方框，以符合您想要用於網站的設定。"

msgid "Select the desired option for what happens to content that a user created if their account is canceled."
msgstr "對於萬一使用者的帳戶被取消時使用者建立的內容會發生什麼情況，請選取想要的選項。"

msgid "Optionally, edit the text of email messages related to user accounts."
msgstr "選擇性地編輯與使用者帳戶相關的電子郵件訊息文字。"

msgid "Verify that the other settings are correct."
msgstr "驗證其他設定是否正確。"

msgid "Modifying or deleting a user account"
msgstr "修改或刪除使用者帳戶"

msgid "Update or delete an existing user account."
msgstr "更新或刪除現有的使用者帳戶。"

msgid "Enter all or part of the user name or email address of the user account you want to update or delete, and click <em>Filter</em>. A short list of user accounts, including the account of interest, should be shown in the table; if not, modify the filter text until you can find the account of interest."
msgstr "輸入您要更新或刪除之使用者帳戶的全部或部分使用者名稱或電子郵件位址，然後按一下<em>過濾器</em>。簡短的使用者帳戶清單（包括感興趣的帳戶）應該會顯示在表格中；如果沒有，請修改過濾器文字，直到您找到感興趣的帳戶為止。"

msgid "Click <em>Edit</em> in the <em>Operations</em> area of the account of interest."
msgstr "在感興趣帳戶的<em>作業</em>區域中按一下<em>編輯</em>。"

msgid "To delete the user account, scroll to the bottom and click <em>Cancel account</em>. Select what you want to happen to the user's content on the next screen, and click <em>Cancel account</em>."
msgstr "若要刪除使用者帳戶，請捲動至底端，然後按一下<em>取消帳戶</em>。選取您希望下一個畫面上使用者內容會發生什麼情況，然後按一下<em>取消帳戶</em>。"

msgid "To update the user account, enter new values in the form and click <em>Save</em>."
msgstr "若要更新使用者帳戶，請在表單中輸入新值，然後按一下<em>儲存</em>。"

msgid "Managing content listings (views)"
msgstr "管理內容清單（視圖）"

msgid "What is a view?"
msgstr "何謂視圖？"

msgid "A <em>view</em> is a listing of items on your site; for example, a block showing the most recent comments, a page listing news items, or a list of registered users. The listings can be formatted in a table, grid, list, calendar, RSS feed, and other formats (some output formats may require you to install additional contributed modules)."
msgstr "<em>視圖</em>是網站上的項目清單；例如，顯示最近評論的區塊、列出新聞項目的頁面或已登錄使用者清單。您可以用表格、網格、清單、行事曆、RSS 資訊來源及其他格式（部分輸出格式可能要求您安裝其他提供的模組）來格式化清單。"

msgid "What are the components of a view?"
msgstr "視圖有哪些元件？"

msgid "When you first create a view, you will specify what type of <em>base data</em> is being displayed in the view, which cannot be changed. After choosing a base data type, you can edit the following components, which allow you to specify which data to output, in what order, and in what format:"
msgstr "第一次建立視圖時，您會指定要在視圖中顯示的<em>基本資料</em>，這無法變更。選擇基本資料類型之後，您可以編輯下列元件，以讓您指定要輸出的資料、順序及格式："

msgid "<em>Displays</em>: whether the output goes to a page, block, feed, etc.; a single view can have multiple displays, each with different settings."
msgstr "<em>顯示畫面</em>：輸出是否要進入頁面、區塊、資訊來源等；單一視圖可以具有多個顯示畫面，每個顯示畫面各有不同的設定。"

msgid "<em>Format</em>: the output style for each display, such as content item, grid, table, or HTML list."
msgstr "<em>格式</em>：每一個顯示畫面的輸出樣式，例如內容項目、網格、表格或 HTML 清單。"

msgid "<em>Fields</em>: if the Format allows, the particular fields to display."
msgstr "<em>欄位</em>：在格式容許時顯示的特定欄位。"

msgid "<em>Filter criteria</em>: criteria to limit the data to output, such as whether the content is published, the type of content, etc. Filters can be <em>exposed</em> to let users choose how to filter the data."
msgstr "<em>過濾準則</em>：用於限制要輸出的資料的準則，例如是否已發佈內容、內容類型等。您可以<em>公開</em>過濾器，以讓使用者選擇過濾資料的方式。"

msgid "<em>Sort criteria</em>: how to order the data. Sorting can also be exposed to users."
msgstr "<em>排序準則</em>：排序資料的方式。排序也可以公開給使用者。"

msgid "<em>Page settings</em>, <em>Block settings</em>, etc.: settings specific to the display type, such as the URL for a page display. Most display types support an <em>Access</em> setting, where you can choose a Permission or Role that a user must have in order to see the view."
msgstr "<em>頁面設定</em>、<em>區塊設定</em>等等：顯示類型專用的設定，例如用於頁面顯示的 URL。 大部分的顯示類型都支援<em>存取權</em>設定，您可以在其中選擇使用者必須擁有才能查看視圖的權限或角色。"

msgid "<em>Header</em> and <em>Footer</em>: content to display at the top or bottom of the view display."
msgstr "<em>標頭</em>及<em>標底</em>：要顯示在視圖顯示畫面頂端或底端的內容。"

msgid "<em>No results behavior</em>: what to do if the filter criteria result in having no data to display."
msgstr "<em>無結果行為</em>：在過濾準則導致沒有資料顯示時執行的操作"

msgid "<em>Pager</em>: how many items to display, and how to paginate if there are additional items to display."
msgstr "<em>分頁器</em>：要顯示的項目數，以及在有其他項目要顯示時的分頁方式。"

msgid "<em>Advanced</em> &gt; <em>Contextual filters</em>: like regular filters, except the criteria come from the <em>context</em>, such as the current date, page the view is displayed on, etc."
msgstr "<em>進階</em> &gt; <em>環境定義過濾器</em>：如一般過濾器一樣，除準則來自<em>環境定義</em>以外，例如現行日期、顯示視圖的頁面等。"

msgid "<em>Advanced</em> &gt; <em>Relationships</em>: additional data to pull in and display, related in some way to the base data of the view (such as data about the user who created the content item)."
msgstr "<em>進階</em> &gt; <em>關係</em>：要取回及顯示的其他資料，部分方式與視圖的基本資料相關（例如建立內容項目的使用者的相關資料）。"

msgid "<em>Advanced</em> &gt; <em>Exposed form</em>: if you have exposed filters or sorts, how to display the form to the user."
msgstr "<em>進階</em> &gt; <em>公開表單</em>：在您已公開過濾器或排序時將表單顯示給使用者的方式。"

msgid "What are bulk operations?"
msgstr "何謂大量作業？"

msgid "Views using a table display format can include a bulk operations form, which allows users with sufficient permission to select one or more items from the view and apply an administrative action to them. The bulk actions available are specific to the base data type of the view; for example, a view of content items could support bulk publishing and unpublishing actions. If you have the core Actions UI module installed, see the related topic \"Configuring actions\" for more about actions."
msgstr "使用表格顯示格式的視圖可以包含大量作業表單，這可讓擁有足夠權限的使用者從視圖中選取一個以上的項目，並將管理動作套用到這些項目。 可用的大量動作專用於視圖的基本資料類型；例如，內容項目的視圖可支援大量發佈和取消發佈動作。 如果您已安裝核心「動作使用者介面」模組，請參閱相關主題「配置動作」，以取得動作的相關資訊。"

msgid "Managing views overview"
msgstr "管理視圖概觀"

msgid "The core Views module handles the display of views, and the core Views UI module allows you to create, edit, and delete views in the administrative interface. See the related topics listed below for specific tasks (if the Views UI module is installed)."
msgstr "核心「視圖」模組會處理視圖的顯示，核心「視圖 UI」模組可讓您在管理介面中建立、編輯及刪除視圖。如需瞭解特定作業，請參閱下列相關主題（如果已安裝「視圖 UI」模組）。"

msgid "<a href=\"https://www.drupal.org/docs/user_guide/en/views-chapter.html\">Views chapter in the User Guide</a>"
msgstr "<a href=\"https://www.drupal.org/docs/user_guide/en/views-chapter.html\">使用手冊中的視圖章節</a>"

msgid "Adding a new display to an existing view"
msgstr "將新的顯示畫面新增至現有視圖"

msgid "Views"
msgstr "Views"

msgid "Views"
msgstr "Views"

msgid "Views"
msgstr "Views"

msgid "Views"
msgstr "Views"

msgid "Add a new display to an existing view. This will allow you to display similar data to an existing view, using similar settings, in a new block, page, feed, etc."
msgstr "將新的顯示畫面新增至現有視圖。這可讓您在新的區塊、頁面、資訊來源等中使用類似設定將類似資料顯示在現有視圖中。"

msgid "If you are not already editing your view, in the <em>Manage</em> administrative menu, navigate to <em>Structure</em> &gt; <em>@views_link</em>. Find the view you want to edit, and click its <em>Edit</em> link."
msgstr "如果您尚未編輯視圖，請在「<em>管理</em>」管理功能表中導覽至<em>結構</em> &gt; <em>@views_link</em>。 尋找您要編輯的視圖，然後按一下其<em>編輯</em>鏈結。"

msgid "Under <em>Displays</em>, click <em>Add</em>."
msgstr "在<em>顯示</em>下，按一下<em>新增</em>。"

msgid "In the pop-up list, click the link for the type of display you want to add; the most common types are <em>Page</em> and <em>Block</em>. The new display will be added to your view, and you will be editing that display."
msgstr "在蹦現清單中，按一下您要新增的顯示類型的鏈結；最常見的類型是<em>頁面</em>及<em>區塊</em>。新的顯示畫面將新增至您的視圖，且您將編輯該顯示畫面。"

msgid "Optionally, click the link next to <em>Display name</em> and enter a new name to be shown for this display in the administrative interface."
msgstr "選擇性地按一下<em>顯示名稱</em>旁邊的鏈結，然後輸入要在管理介面中為此顯示畫面顯示的新名稱。"

msgid "Follow the steps in @view_edit_topic to edit the other settings for the display."
msgstr "請遵循 @view_edit_topic 中的步驟，以編輯顯示的其他設定。"

msgid "Adding a bulk operations form to a view"
msgstr "將大量作業表單新增至視圖"

msgid "Administer views"
msgstr "管理 views"

msgid "Add one or more existing actions as bulk operations to an existing table-style view. If you have the core Actions UI module installed, see the related topic \"Configuring actions\" for more information about actions."
msgstr "將一個以上的現有動作新增為現有表格樣式視圖的大量作業。 如果您已安裝核心「動作使用者介面」模組，請參閱相關主題「配置動作」，以取得動作的相關資訊。"

msgid "Who can edit views?"
msgstr "誰可以編輯視圖？"

msgid "The core Views UI module will need to be installed and you will need <em>@views_permissions</em> permission in order to edit a view."
msgstr "需要安裝「視圖使用者介面」核心模組，而且您需要有 <em>@views_permissions</em> 權限才能編輯視圖。"

msgid "In the <em>Manage</em> administrative menu, navigate to <em>Structure</em> &gt; <em>@views</em>. A list of all views is shown."
msgstr "在<em>管理</em>管理功能表中，導覽至<em>結構</em> > <em>@views</em>。 即會顯示所有視圖的清單。"

msgid "Find the view that you would like to edit, and click <em>Edit</em> from the dropdown button. Note that bulk operations work best in a view with a Page display, and a Table format."
msgstr "尋找您要編輯的視圖，然後從下拉按鈕中按一下<em>編輯</em>。 請注意，大量作業最適用於具有「頁面」顯示畫面及「表格」格式的視圖。"

msgid "If there is not already an <em>Operations bulk form</em> in the <em>Fields</em> list for the view, click <em>Add</em> in the <em>Fields</em> section to add it. (The exact name of the bulk form field will vary, and may contain keywords like \"bulk update\", \"form element\" or \"operations\" -- not to be confused with <em>operations links</em>, which are applied to each item in a row.) If the bulk operations field already exists, click the field name to edit its settings."
msgstr "如果視圖的<em>欄位</em>清單中尚未有<em>作業大量表單</em>，請按一下 <em>欄位</em>區段中的 <em>新增</em>來加以新增。 （大量表單欄位的確切名稱會有所不同，而且可能包含「大量更新」、「表單元素」或「作業」等關鍵字 -- 請勿與<em>作業鏈結</em>混淆，這些作業鏈結會套用至列中的每一個項目。） 如果大量作業欄位已存在，請按一下欄位名稱來編輯其設定。"

msgid "Check the action(s) you want to make available in the <em>Selected actions</em> list and click <em>Apply (all displays)</em>."
msgstr "檢查您要在<em>選定動作</em>清單中提供的動作，然後按一下<em>套用（全部顯示）</em>。"

msgid "Verify that the <em>Access</em> settings for the view are at least as restrictive as the permissions necessary to perform the bulk operations. People with permission to see the view, but who don't have permission to do the bulk operations, will experience problems."
msgstr "驗證視圖的<em>存取權</em>設定至少與執行大量作業所需權限一樣嚴格。 有權查看視圖，但無權執行大量作業的人會遇到問題。"

msgid "Click <em>Save</em>. The action(s) will be available as bulk operations in the view."
msgstr "按一下<em>儲存</em>。 動作在視圖中可作為大量作業使用。"

msgid "Creating a new view"
msgstr "建立新的視圖"

msgid "Create a new view to list content or other items on your site."
msgstr "建立新的視圖，以列出網站上的內容或其他項目。"

msgid "In the <em>Manage</em> administrative menu, navigate to <em>Structure</em> &gt; <em>@views_link</em>."
msgstr "在「<em>管理</em>」管理功能表中，導覽至<em>結構</em> &gt; <em>@views_link</em>。"

msgid "Click <em>Add view</em>."
msgstr "按一下<em>新增視圖</em>。"

msgid "In the <em>View name</em> field, enter a name for the view, which is how it will be listed in the administrative interface."
msgstr "在<em>視圖名稱</em>欄位中，輸入視圖的名稱，這將是它在管理介面中列出的方式。"

msgid "In <em>View settings</em> &gt; <em>Show</em>, select the base data type to display in your view. This cannot be changed later."
msgstr "在<em>視圖設定</em> &gt; <em>顯示</em>中，選取要顯示在視圖中的基本資料類型。此語言稍後無法變更。"

msgid "Optionally, select or enter filtering, sorting, and page/block display settings; these can be added or changed later."
msgstr "選擇性地選取或輸入過濾、排序及頁面/區塊顯示設定；這些設定稍後可以新增或變更。"

msgid "Click <em>Save and edit</em>. Your view will be created; edit it following the steps in the related topics below."
msgstr "按一下<em>儲存並編輯</em>。系統將建立您的視圖；請遵循下面的相關主題中的步驟進行編輯。"

msgid "Editing an existing view display"
msgstr "編輯現有的視圖顯示畫面"

msgid "Edit an existing view display, to modify what data is displayed or how it is displayed."
msgstr "編輯現有的視圖顯示畫面，以修改顯示的資料或顯示方式。"

msgid "Under <em>Displays</em>, click the display you want to edit."
msgstr "在<em>顯示</em>下，按一下您要編輯的顯示畫面。"

msgid "Find the section whose settings you want to change, such as <em>Format</em> or <em>Filter criteria</em>. (See @views_overview_topic for more information.)"
msgstr "尋找您要變更其設定的區段，例如<em>格式</em>或<em>過濾準則</em>。 （如需相關資訊，請參閱 @views_overview_topic。）"

msgid "For sections containing lists (such as <em>Fields</em> and <em>Filter criteria</em>), to modify or delete an existing item, click the name of the item. To add a new item, click <em>Add</em> in the drop-down list. To change the order of items, click <em>Rearrange</em> in the drop-down list."
msgstr "對於包含清單（例如<em>欄位</em>及<em>過濾準則</em>）的區段，若要修改或刪除現有項目，請按一下項目的名稱。若要新增項目，請在下拉清單中按一下<em>新增</em>。若要變更項目的順序，請按一下下拉清單中的<em>重新排列</em>。"

msgid "For sections containing individual settings (such as <em>Title</em> and <em>Format</em>), there are often two links for each setting. The first link shows the current value; click that link to change the value. If there is a second link called <em>Settings</em>, click that link to change the settings details. For example, if your <em>Format</em> is currently shown as <em>Unformatted list</em>, click <em>Unformatted list</em> to switch to using a <em>Grid</em> or <em>Table</em> format. Click <em>Settings</em> next to your format type to change the settings for your chosen format."
msgstr "對於包含個別設定的區段（例如<em>標題</em>及<em>格式</em>），每一個設定通常有兩個鏈結。第一個鏈結顯示現行值；按一下該鏈結以變更此值。如果有第二個鏈結（稱為<em>設定</em>），請按一下該鏈結可變更設定詳細資料。例如，如果<em>格式</em>目前顯示為<em>未格式化清單</em>，請按一下<em>未格式化清單</em>以切換為使用<em>網格</em>或<em>表格</em>格式。按一下您的格式類型旁邊的<em>設定</em>，以變更所選格式的設定。"

msgid "When you have finished changing all the settings, verify that the display is correct by clicking <em>Update preview</em>. Return to editing settings if necessary."
msgstr "完成變更所有設定後，按一下<em>更新預覽</em>來驗證顯示畫面是否正確。必要的話，請回到編輯設定。"

msgid "When you have verified the display, click <em>Save</em>. Alternatively, if you have made mistakes and want to discard your changes, click <em>Cancel</em>."
msgstr "驗證顯示畫面後，按一下<em>儲存</em>。或者，如果您發生錯誤且想要捨棄變更，請按一下<em>取消</em>。"

msgid "Managing content moderation workflows"
msgstr "管理內容控管工作流程"

msgid "What is a content moderation workflow?"
msgstr "何謂內容控管工作流程？"

msgid "On some sites, new content and content revisions need to be <em>moderated</em>. That is, they need to pass through several <em>states</em> before becoming visible to site visitors. The collection of states and the definition of the transitions between states is known as a <em>workflow</em>. For example, new content might start out in a <em>Draft</em> state, and then might need to pass through several <em>Review</em> states before it becomes <em>Published</em> on the live site."
msgstr "在部分網站上，新的內容及內容修訂需要<em>受控管</em>。也就是說，它們需要經過幾種<em>狀態</em>，然後才能顯示給網站造訪者。狀態的集合及狀態之間轉移的定義稱為<em>工作流程</em>。例如，新的內容可能會在<em>草稿</em>狀態下開始，接著可能需要經過數種<em>檢閱</em>狀態，然後才能在即時網站上變成<em>已發佈</em>。"

msgid "The core software allows you to configure workflows in which each transition has an associated permission that can be granted to a particular role. See @configuring_workflows_topic for more information."
msgstr "核心軟體可讓您配置工作流程，在其中每一個轉移都有可授與特定角色的相關聯權限。 如需相關資訊，請參閱 @configuring_workflows_topic"

msgid "Users with sufficient permissions can change the workflow state of a particular entity. See @changing_states_topic for more information."
msgstr "擁有足夠權限的使用者可以變更特定實體的工作流程狀態。 如需相關資訊，請參閱 @changing_states_topic。"

msgid "Overview of content moderation workflows"
msgstr "內容控管工作流程概觀"

msgid "The core Content Moderation module allows you to expand on core software's \"unpublished\" and \"published\" states for content. It allows you to have a published version that is live, but have a separate working copy that is undergoing review before it is published. This is achieved by using workflows to apply different states and transitions to entities as needed."
msgstr "核心「內容控管」模組可讓您擴充核心軟體內容的「未發佈」及「已發佈」狀態。它可讓您擁有已發佈的即時版本，但同時又擁有在發佈之前正在檢閱的個別工作副本。這是透過下列方式達成的：根據需要使用工作流程將不同狀態及轉移套用至實體。"

msgid "The core Workflows module allows you to manage workflows with states and transitions."
msgstr "核心「工作流程」模組可讓您使用狀態及轉移來管理工作流程。"

msgid "See the related topics listed below for specific tasks and background information."
msgstr "如需瞭解特定作業及背景資訊，請參閱下列相關主題。"

msgid "On-line documentation about Content Moderation"
msgstr "內容控管的相關線上文件"

msgid "Missing help topic %topic"
msgstr "遺漏說明主題 %topic"

msgid "Related topics"
msgstr "相關主題"

msgid "Topics can be provided by modules or themes. Top-level help topics on your site:"
msgstr "主題可由模組或佈景主題提供。您網站上的最上層說明主題："

msgid "Your search used too many AND/OR expressions. Only the first @count terms were included in this search."
msgstr "您的搜尋使用太多 AND/OR 表示式。此搜尋只併入了前 @count 個詞彙。"

msgid "Search for either of the two terms with uppercase <strong>OR</strong>. For example, <strong>cats OR dogs</strong>."
msgstr "搜尋時,在兩個關鍵字之間插入大寫的 <strong>OR</strong> ,例如, <strong>貓 OR 狗</strong>。"

msgid "Help search is not fully indexed. Some results may be missing or incorrect."
msgstr "說明搜尋未完整檢索。 部分結果可能會遺漏或不正確。"

msgid "You must include at least one keyword to match in the content, and punctuation is ignored."
msgid_plural "You must include at least one keyword to match in the content. Keywords must be at least @count characters, and punctuation is ignored."
msgstr[0] "至少必須包含一個要在內容中比對的關鍵字。關鍵字必須至少有 @count 個字元，標點符號會被忽略。"

msgid "Has new content"
msgstr "有新內容"

msgid "Show a marker if the content is new or updated."
msgstr "如果內容是新的或已更新，則顯示標記。"

msgid "Show only content that is new or updated."
msgstr "僅顯示新的或更新過的內容。"

msgid "The History module keeps track of which content a user has read. It marks content as <em>new</em> or <em>updated</em> depending on the last time the user viewed it. History records that are older than one month are removed during cron, which means that content older than one month is always considered <em>read</em>. The History module does not have a user interface but it provides a filter to <a href=\":views-help\">Views</a> to show new or updated content. For more information, see the <a href=\":url\">online documentation for the History module</a>."
msgstr "「歷程」模組可追蹤使用者已閱讀的內容。根據使用者前次檢視內容的時間而定，此模組會將內容標示為<em>新的</em>或<em>已更新</em>。cron 期間會移除一個月以前的歷程記錄，這表示一個月以前的內容一律視為<em>已閱讀</em>。「歷程」模組沒有使用者介面，但提供過濾器讓<a href=\":views-help\">視圖</a>顯示新的或已更新的內容。如需相關資訊，請參閱<a href=\":url\">「歷程」模組的線上文件</a>。"

msgid "History"
msgstr "記錄"

msgid "Records which content users have viewed and marks it as new or updated."
msgstr "記錄使用者已檢視的內容，並將其標示為新的或已更新。"

msgid "History user"
msgstr "歷程使用者"

msgid "Check for new comments as well"
msgstr "同時檢查是否有新回應"

msgid "exposed"
msgstr "已公開"

msgid "Sample original image"
msgstr "原始圖像示範"

msgid "Sample modified image"
msgstr "已修改圖像示範"

msgid "image from @field_name"
msgstr "來自 @field_name 的影像"

msgid "Relate each @entity with a @field set to the image."
msgstr "建立每一個 @entity 與設為影像的 @field 的關聯。"

msgid "The Image module allows you to create fields that contain image files and to configure <a href=\":image_styles\">Image styles</a> that can be used to manipulate the display of images. See the <a href=\":field\">Field module help</a> and the <a href=\":field_ui\">Field UI help</a> pages for terminology and general information on entities, fields, and how to create and manage fields. For more information, see the <a href=\":image_documentation\">online documentation for the Image module</a>."
msgstr "「影像」模組讓您可以建立包含影像檔案的欄位，以及配置可用來處理影像顯示的<a href=\":image_styles\">影像樣式</a>。如需實體、欄位的術語和一般資訊，以及如何建立及管理欄位的相關資訊，請參閱<a href=\":field\">「欄位」模組說明</a>和<a href=\":field_ui\">「欄位使用者介面」說明</a>頁面。如需相關資訊，請參閱<a href=\":image_documentation\">「影像」模組的線上文件</a>。"

msgid "Defining image styles"
msgstr "定義影像樣式"

msgid "The concept of image styles is that you can upload a single image but display it in several ways; each display variation, or <em>image style</em>, is the result of applying one or more <em>effects</em> to the original image. As an example, you might upload a high-resolution image with a 4:3 aspect ratio, and display it scaled down, square cropped, or black-and-white (or any combination of these effects). The Image module provides a way to do this efficiently: you configure an image style with the desired effects on the <a href=\":image\">Image styles page</a>, and the first time a particular image is requested in that style, the effects are applied. The resulting image is saved, and the next time that same style is requested, the saved image is retrieved without the need to recalculate the effects. Drupal core provides several effects that you can use to define styles; others may be provided by contributed modules."
msgstr "影像樣式的概念，是您可以上傳單一影像，但以數種方式顯示；每一種顯示變化（或稱為<em>影像樣式</em>）都是將一個以上<em>效果</em>套用至原始影像所產生的結果。舉例來說，您可以上傳長寬比 4:3 的高解析度影像，並以縮小比例、方形裁剪或黑白（或這些效果的任意組合）格式予以顯示。「影像」模組讓您可以有效率地執行上述作業：您在<a href=\":image\">影像樣式頁面</a>上使用所需的效果配置影像樣式後，在第一次要求該樣式的特定影像時，即會套用效果。產生的影像會儲存起來，等到下次要求同樣樣式時，就會直接擷取儲存的影像，而無須重新計算效果。Drupal 核心提供數種可讓您用來定義樣式的效果；提供的模組也會提供其他效果。"

msgid "Naming image styles"
msgstr "為影像樣式命名"

msgid "When you define an image style, you will need to choose a displayed name and a machine name. The displayed name is shown in administrative pages, and the machine name is used to generate the URL for accessing an image processed in that style. There are two common approaches to naming image styles: either based on the effects being applied (for example, <em>Square 85x85</em>), or based on where you plan to use it (for example, <em>Profile picture</em>)."
msgstr "在定義影像樣式時，您必須選擇顯示名稱和機器名稱。顯示名稱會顯示在管理頁面中，而機器名稱則用來產生 URL，用以存取以該樣式處理的影像。影像樣式有兩種常見的命名方法：根據套用的效果（例如，<em>85x85 見方</em>），或根據其預定用途（例如，<em>人員資訊照片</em>）。"

msgid "Configuring image fields"
msgstr "配置影像欄位"

msgid "A few of the settings for image fields are defined once when you create the field and cannot be changed later; these include the choice of public or private file storage and the number of images that can be stored in the field. The rest of the settings can be edited later; these settings include the field label, help text, allowed file extensions, image resolution restrictions, and the subdirectory in the public or private file storage where the images will be stored. The editable settings can also have different values for different entity sub-types; for instance, if your image field is used on both Page and Article content types, you can store the files in a different subdirectory for the two content types."
msgstr "有幾項影像欄位設定是在您建立欄位時即定義的，而且後續無法變更；其中包括公用或專用檔案儲存體的選擇，以及可儲存在欄位中的影像數目。其餘設定則可於後續再行編輯；這些設定包括欄位標籤、說明文字、容許的副檔名、影像解析度限制，以及將用來儲存影像的公用或專用檔案儲存體中的子目錄。可編輯設定在用於不同的實體子類型時有可能有不同的值；例如，如果您的影像欄位同時用於「頁面」和「文章」內容類型上，您可以將這兩種內容類型的檔案儲存在不同的子目錄中。"

msgid "For accessibility and search engine optimization, all images that convey meaning on websites should have alternate text. Drupal also allows entry of title text for images, but it can lead to confusion for screen reader users and its use is not recommended. Image fields can be configured so that alternate and title text fields are enabled or disabled; if enabled, the fields can be set to be required. The recommended setting is to enable and require alternate text and disable title text."
msgstr "為了將協助工具及搜尋引擎最佳化，所有在網站上傳達意義的影像都應有替代文字。Drupal 也容許輸入影像的標題文字，但這可能會讓螢幕閱讀器使用者感到混淆，因此不建議使用。您可以配置影像欄位，以啟用或停用替代和標題文字欄位；如果已啟用，則可將這些欄位設為必要欄位。建議設定是啟用替代文字並將其設為必要，但停用標題文字。"

msgid "When you create an image field, you will need to choose whether the uploaded images will be stored in the public or private file directory defined in your settings.php file and shown on the <a href=\":file-system\">File system page</a>. This choice cannot be changed later. You can also configure your field to store files in a subdirectory of the public or private directory; this setting can be changed later and can be different for each entity sub-type using the field. For more information on file storage, see the <a href=\":system-help\">System module help page</a>."
msgstr "在建立影像欄位時，您必須選擇上傳的影像將儲存在公用還是專用檔案目錄中；此目錄定義於您的 settings.php 檔案中，並顯示在<a href=\":file-system\">檔案系統頁面</a>上。這項選擇無法於後續變更。您也可以配置欄位，以將檔案儲存在公用或專用目錄的子目錄中；此設定可於後續變更，並且可能隨著使用欄位的各種實體子類型而不同。如需檔案儲存的相關資訊，請參閱<a href=\":system-help\">「系統」模組說明頁面</a>。"

msgid "The maximum file size that can be uploaded is limited by PHP settings of the server, but you can restrict it further by configuring a <em>Maximum upload size</em> in the field settings (this setting can be changed later). The maximum file size, either from PHP server settings or field configuration, is automatically displayed to users in the help text of the image field."
msgstr "可上傳的檔案大小上限由伺服器的 PHP 設定限制，但您也可以透過在欄位設定中配置<em>上傳大小上限</em>（此設定可於後續變更），進一步予以限制。檔案大小上限（來自於 PHP 伺服器設定或欄位配置）會在影像欄位的說明文字中自動向使用者顯示。"

msgid "You can also configure a minimum and/or maximum resolution for uploaded images. Images that are too small will be rejected. Images that are to large will be resized. During the resizing the <a href=\"http://wikipedia.org/wiki/Exchangeable_image_file_format\">EXIF data</a> in the image will be lost."
msgstr "您也可以為上傳的影像配置解析度下限和（或）上限。太小的影像會被拒絕。太大的影像則會進行大小調整。在調整大小期間，影像中的 <a href=\"http://wikipedia.org/wiki/Exchangeable_image_file_format\">EXIF 資料</a>將會遺失。"

msgid "You can also configure a default image that will be used if no image is uploaded in an image field. This default can be defined for all instances of the field in the field storage settings when you create a field, and the setting can be overridden for each entity sub-type that uses the field."
msgstr "您也可以配置一個預設影像，在影像欄位中未上傳任何影像時，將使用該預設影像。您可以在建立欄位時，為欄位儲存體設定中的所有欄位實例定義此預設值，並且可以為使用該欄位的每一個實體子類型置換這項設定。"

msgid "Configuring displays and form displays"
msgstr "配置顯示及表單顯示"

msgid "On the <em>Manage display</em> page, you can choose the image formatter, which determines the image style used to display the image in each display mode and whether or not to display the image as a link. On the <em>Manage form display</em> page, you can configure the image upload widget, including setting the preview image style shown on the entity edit form."
msgstr "在<em>管理顯示</em>頁面上，您可以選擇影像格式製作程式，以決定在各種顯示模式下顯示影像時所使用的影像樣式，以及是否要將影像顯示為鏈結。在<em>管理表單顯示</em>頁面上，您可以配置影像上傳小組件，包括設定在實體編輯表單上顯示的預覽影像樣式。"

msgid "Image styles commonly provide thumbnail sizes by scaling and cropping images, but can also add various effects before an image is displayed. When an image is displayed with a style, a new file is created and the original image is left unchanged."
msgstr "圖像樣式一般使用比例縮放和裁切圖片提供縮略圖尺寸，但也可以在圖片被顯示前增加各種效果。當使用一個樣式的圖片被顯示時，將會建立一個新的檔案同時原始圖片不會更改。"

