msgid "The domain names to use for these languages. <strong>Modifying this value may break existing URLs. Use with caution in a production environment.</strong> Example: Specifying \"de.example.com\" as language domain for German will result in a URL like \"http://de.example.com/contact\"."
msgstr "要用於這些語言的網域名稱。<strong>修改此值可能會岔斷現有 URL。在正式作業環境中，請謹慎使用。</strong> 範例：指定 \"de.example.com\" 作為德文的語言網域，將會產生如下的 URL：\"http://de.example.com/contact\"。"

