msgid "Updating translations"
msgstr "更新翻譯"

msgid "Check manually"
msgstr "手動檢查"

msgid "The Interface Translation module allows you to translate interface text (<em>strings</em>) into different languages, and to switch between them for the display of interface text. It uses the functionality provided by the <a href=\":language\">Language module</a>. For more information, see the <a href=\":doc-url\">online documentation for the Interface Translation module</a>."
msgstr "「介面翻譯」模組介面讓您可以將介面文字（<em>字串</em>）翻譯為其他語言，以及對顯示的介面文字切換使用這些語言。它會使用<a href=\":language\">語言模組</a>所提供的功能。如需相關資訊，請參閱<a href=\":doc-url\">「介面翻譯」模組的線上文件</a>。"

msgid "Importing translation files"
msgstr "匯入翻譯檔案"

msgid "Translation files with translated interface text are imported automatically when languages are added on the <a href=\":languages\">Languages</a> page, or when modules or themes are enabled. On the <a href=\":locale-settings\">Interface translation settings</a> page, the <em>Translation source</em> can be restricted to local files only, or to include the <a href=\":server\">Drupal translation server</a>. Although modules and themes may not be fully translated in all languages, new translations become available frequently. You can specify whether and how often to check for translation file updates and whether to overwrite existing translations on the <a href=\":locale-settings\">Interface translation settings</a> page. You can also manually import a translation file on the <a href=\":import\">Interface translation import</a> page."
msgstr "含有翻譯介面文字的翻譯檔，會在語言新增至<a href=\":languages\">語言</a>頁面或是在模組或佈景主題啟用時自動匯入。在<a href=\":locale-settings\">介面翻譯設定</a>頁面上，<em>翻譯來源</em>可以僅限定為本端檔案，或是包括 <a href=\":server\">Drupal 翻譯伺服器</a>。雖然模組和佈景主題不一定能完整翻譯為所有語言，但會經常提供新的翻譯。您可以指定是否要檢查可用的翻譯檔更新及其頻率，以及是否要改寫<a href=\":locale-settings\">介面翻譯設定</a>頁面上的現有翻譯。您也可以在<a href=\":import\">介面翻譯匯入</a>頁面上手動匯入翻譯檔。"

msgid "Checking the translation status"
msgstr "檢查翻譯狀態"

msgid "You can check how much of the interface on your site is translated into which language on the <a href=\":languages\">Languages</a> page. On the <a href=\":translation-updates\">Available translation updates</a> page, you can check whether interface translation updates are available on the <a href=\":server\">Drupal translation server</a>."
msgstr "您可以在<a href=\":languages\">語言</a>頁面上查看您網站上的介面有多少部分已翻譯為哪一種語言。在<a href=\":translation-updates\">可用的翻譯更新</a>頁面上，您可以查看 <a href=\":server\">Drupal 翻譯伺服器</a>上是否有可用的介面翻譯更新。"

msgid "Translating individual strings"
msgstr "翻譯個別字串"

msgid "You can translate individual strings directly on the <a href=\":translate\">User interface translation</a> page, or download the currently-used translation file for a specific language on the <a href=\":export\">Interface translation export</a> page. Once you have edited the translation file, you can then import it again on the <a href=\":import\">Interface translation import</a> page."
msgstr "您可以直接在<a href=\":translate\">使用者介面翻譯</a>頁面上翻譯個別字串，或是在<a href=\":export\">介面翻譯匯出</a>頁面下載特定語言目前使用的翻譯檔。在編輯翻譯檔之後，您可以接著在<a href=\":import\">介面翻譯匯入</a>頁面上重新予以匯入。"

msgid "Overriding default English strings"
msgstr "置換預設英文字串"

msgid "If translation is enabled for English, you can <em>override</em> the default English interface text strings in your site with other English text strings on the <a href=\":translate\">User interface translation</a> page. Translation is off by default for English, but you can turn it on by visiting the <em>Edit language</em> page for <em>English</em> from the <a href=\":languages\">Languages</a> page."
msgstr "如果已啟用英文翻譯，您可以在<a href=\":translate\">使用者介面翻譯</a>頁面上，將您網站中的預設英文介面字串<em>置換</em>為其他英文字串。依預設會關閉英文翻譯，但您可以將其開啟，只要從<a href=\":languages\">語言</a>頁面進入<em>英文</em>的<em>編輯語言</em>頁面即可。"

msgid "Interface translations are automatically imported when a language is added, or when new modules or themes are enabled. The report <a href=\":update\">Available translation updates</a> shows the status. Interface text can be customized in the <a href=\":translate\">user interface translation</a> page."
msgstr "介面翻譯會在新增語言或是啟用新模組或佈景主題時自動匯入。<a href=\":update\">可用的翻譯更新</a>報告會顯示其狀態。介面文字可在<a href=\":translate\">使用者介面翻譯</a>頁面中自訂。"

msgid "This page allows a translator to search for specific translated and untranslated strings, and is used when creating or editing translations. (Note: Because translation tasks involve many strings, it may be more convenient to <a title=\"User interface translation export\" href=\":export\">export</a> strings for offline editing in a desktop Gettext translation editor.) Searches may be limited to strings in a specific language."
msgstr "此頁面可讓翻譯者搜尋已翻譯和未翻譯的特定字串，並且可用來建立或編輯翻譯。（附註：因為翻譯作業涉及大量字串，所以，將字串<a title=\"User interface translation export\" href=\":export\">匯出</a>到桌面的 Gettext 翻譯編輯器中進行離線編輯，可能較為方便。）搜尋可限定對特定語言的字串執行。"

msgid "Translation files are automatically downloaded and imported when <a title=\"Languages\" href=\":language\">languages</a> are added, or when modules or themes are enabled."
msgstr "在新增<a title=\"Languages\" href=\":language\">語言</a>或啟用模組或佈景主題時，系統會自動下載並匯入翻譯檔。"

msgid "This page allows translators to manually import translated strings contained in a Gettext Portable Object (.po) file. Manual import may be used for customized translations or for the translation of custom modules and themes. To customize translations you can download a translation file from the <a href=\":url\">Drupal translation server</a> or <a title=\"User interface translation export\" href=\":export\">export</a> translations from the site, customize the translations using a Gettext translation editor, and import the result using this page."
msgstr "此頁面讓翻譯者可以手動匯入 Gettext Portable Object (.po) 檔案中包含的翻譯字串。手動匯入可用於自訂翻譯，或是自訂模組和佈景主題的翻譯。若要自訂翻譯，您可以從 <a href=\":url\">Drupal 翻譯伺服器</a>下載翻譯檔，或是從網站<a title=\"User interface translation export\" href=\":export\">匯出</a>翻譯，然後使用 Gettext 翻譯編輯器自訂翻譯，再使用此頁面匯入結果。"

msgid "Note that importing large .po files may take several minutes."
msgstr "請注意匯入大的 .po 檔案會花費數分鐘."

msgid "This page exports the translated strings used by your site. An export file may be in Gettext Portable Object (<em>.po</em>) form, which includes both the original string and the translation (used to share translations with others), or in Gettext Portable Object Template (<em>.pot</em>) form, which includes the original strings only (used to create new translations with a Gettext translation editor)."
msgstr "您可以在此匯出您的網站裡的翻譯字串。匯出的檔案可以是 Gettext Portable Object (<em>.po</em>) 格式，包括原本的字串和翻譯字串 (可以與其他們分享使用)，也可以是 Gettext Portable Object Template (<em>.pot</em>) 格式，只包括原始字串，可以用來建立新的翻譯。"

