msgid "The Custom Menu Links module allows users to create menu links. These links can be translated if multiple languages are used for the site."
msgstr "「自訂功能表鏈結」模組讓使用者可以建立功能表鏈結。如果網站使用多種語言，則可以翻譯這些鏈結。"

msgid "It is required by the Menu UI module, which provides an interface for managing menus and menu links. For more information, see the <a href=\":menu-help\">Menu UI module help page</a> and the <a href=\":drupal-org-help\">online documentation for the Custom Menu Links module</a>."
msgstr "「功能表使用者介面」模組需要此項目，它提供一個介面可用來管理功能表和功能表鏈結。如需相關資訊，請參閱<a href=\":menu-help\">「功能表使用者介面」模組說明頁面</a>和<a href=\":drupal-org-help\">「自訂功能表鏈結」模組的線上文件</a>。"

msgid "For more information, see the <a href=\":drupal-org-help\">online documentation for the Custom Menu Links module</a>. If you enable the Menu UI module, it provides an interface for managing menus and menu links."
msgstr "如需相關資訊，請參閱<a href=\":drupal-org-help\">「自訂功能表鏈結」模組的線上文件</a>。如果您啟用「功能表使用者介面」模組，它提供一個介面可用來管理功能表和功能表鏈結。"

msgid "Custom Menu Links"
msgstr "自訂選單連結"

msgid "Allows users to create menu links."
msgstr "容許使用者建立功能表鏈結。"

msgid "Add menu link"
msgstr "新增選單連結"

msgid "Edit menu link"
msgstr "設定選單連結"

msgid "Delete menu link"
msgstr "刪除選單連結"

msgid "The entity ID for this menu link content entity."
msgstr "此功能表鏈結內容實體的實體 ID。"

msgid "The content menu link UUID."
msgstr "內容功能表鏈結 UUID。"

msgid "The menu link language code."
msgstr "功能表鏈結語言碼。"

msgid "The content menu link bundle."
msgstr "內容功能表鏈結組合。"

msgid "Menu link title"
msgstr "選單連結標題"

msgid "The text to be used for this link in the menu."
msgstr "選單連結的文字"

msgid "Shown when hovering over the menu link."
msgstr "當駐停在選單連結時被顯示。"

msgid "The menu name. All links with the same menu name (such as \"tools\") are part of the same menu."
msgstr "功能表名稱。具有相同功能表名稱（例如 \"tools\"）的所有鏈結都屬於相同的功能表。"

msgid "The location this menu link points to."
msgstr "此功能表鏈結指向的位置。"

msgid "External"
msgstr "外部"

msgid "A flag to indicate if the link points to a full URL starting with a protocol, like http:// (1 = external, 0 = internal)."
msgstr "此標示指出鏈結是否指向開頭為通訊協定的完整 URL（例如 http://）（1 = 外部，0 = 內部）。"

msgid "Indicates whether the menu link should be rediscovered"
msgstr "指出是否應該重新探索功能表鏈結"

msgid "A flag for whether the link should be enabled in menus or hidden."
msgstr "此標示指出應該在功能表中啟用還是隱藏鏈結。"

msgid "Parent plugin ID"
msgstr "母項外掛程式 ID"

msgid "The ID of the parent menu link plugin, or empty string when at the top level of the hierarchy."
msgstr "母項功能表鏈結外掛程式的 ID，在階層的最上層時為空字串。"

msgid "The time that the menu link was last edited."
msgstr "功能表鏈結的前次編輯時間。"

msgid "Custom menu link"
msgstr "自訂選單連結"

msgid "Custom menu links"
msgstr "自訂功能表鏈結"

msgid "custom menu link"
msgstr "自訂功能表鏈結"

msgid "custom menu links"
msgstr "自訂功能表鏈結"

msgid "The menu link %title has been deleted."
msgstr "已刪除自訂選單 %title。"

msgid "The menu link has been saved."
msgstr "選單連結儲存完畢"

msgctxt "Validation"
msgid "Menu tree hierarchy."
msgstr "功能表樹狀結構階層。"

msgid "You can only change the hierarchy for the <em>published</em> version of this menu link."
msgstr "您只能變更此功能表鏈結之<em>已發佈</em>版本的階層。"

msgid "The menu name. All links with the same menu name (such as 'navigation') are part of the same menu."
msgstr "功能表名稱。具有相同功能表名稱（例如 'navigation'）的所有鏈結都屬於相同的功能表。"

msgid "The menu link ID (mlid) is the integer primary key."
msgstr "功能表鏈結 ID (mlid) 是整數主要索引鍵。"

msgid "The parent link ID (plid) is the mlid of the link above in the hierarchy, or zero if the link is at the top level in its menu."
msgstr "母項鏈結 ID (plid) 是階層中上方鏈結的 mlid，如果鏈結在其功能表中位於最上層，則為零。"

msgid "The Drupal path or external path this link points to."
msgstr "此鏈結指向的 Drupal 路徑或外部路徑。"

msgid "For links corresponding to a Drupal path (external = 0), this connects the link to a {menu_router}.path for joins."
msgstr "若鏈結對應至 Drupal 路徑（外部 = 0），這會將鏈結連接至結合的 {menu_router}.path。"

msgid "The text displayed for the link, which may be modified by a title callback stored in {menu_router}."
msgstr "鏈結顯示的文字，可利用 {menu_router} 中儲存的標題回呼來修改。"

msgid "A serialized array of options to set on the URL, such as a query string or HTML attributes."
msgstr "要在 URL 上設定的選項序列化陣列，例如查詢字串或 HTML 屬性。"

msgid "The name of the module that generated this link."
msgstr "產生此鏈結的模組名稱。"

msgid "A flag for whether the link should be rendered in menus. (1 = a disabled menu link that may be shown on admin screens, -1 = a menu callback, 0 = a normal, visible link)"
msgstr "此旗標指出是否應該在功能表中呈現鏈結。（1 = 管理畫面上可顯示的已停用功能表鏈結，-1 =功能表回呼，0 = 正常、可見的鏈結）"

msgid "Flag indicating whether any links have this link as a parent (1 = children exist, 0 = no children)."
msgstr "此標示指出是否有任何鏈結以此鏈結為母項（1 = 子項存在，0 = 沒有子項）。"

msgid "Flag for whether this link should be rendered as expanded in menus - expanded links always have their child links displayed, instead of only when the link is in the active trail (1 = expanded, 0 = not expanded)"
msgstr "此標示指出是否應該在功能表中展開呈現此鏈結 - 展開的鏈結一律會顯示其子項鏈結，而不是只有在鏈結位於作用中軌跡時才顯示（1 = 展開，0 = 未展開）"

msgid "Link weight among links in the same menu at the same depth."
msgstr "在相同功能表中位於相同深度的鏈結之間的鏈結加權。"

msgid "The depth relative to the top level. A link with plid == 0 will have depth == 1."
msgstr "相對於最上層的深度。plid == 0 的鏈結 depth == 1。"

msgid "A flag to indicate that the user has manually created or edited the link (1 = customized, 0 = not customized)."
msgstr "此標示指出使用者已手動建立或編輯鏈結（1 = 自訂，0 = 未自訂）。"

msgid "The first mlid in the materialized path. If N = depth, then pN must equal the mlid. If depth > 1 then p(N-1) must equal the plid. All pX where X > depth must equal zero. The columns p1 .. p9 are also called the parents."
msgstr "具體化路徑中的第一個 mlid。如果 N = depth，則 pN 必須等於 mlid。如果 depth > 1，則 p(N-1) 必須等於 plid。X > depth 的所有 pX 必須等於零。直欄 p1 .. p9 也稱為母項。"

msgid "Flag that indicates that this link was generated during the update from Drupal 5."
msgstr "此標示指出此鏈結是在從 Drupal 5 更新期間產生的。"

msgid "Menu link language code."
msgstr "功能表鏈結語言碼。"

msgid "Translation set id."
msgstr "轉換集 ID。"

msgid "Language for this menu."
msgstr "此功能表的語言。"

msgid "Menu link title translation."
msgstr "功能表鏈結標題翻譯。"

msgid "Menu link description translation."
msgstr "功能表鏈結說明翻譯。"

msgid "Menu link ID of the source language menu link."
msgstr "來源語言功能表鏈結的功能表鏈結 ID。"

msgid "The Menu UI module provides an interface for managing menus. A menu is a hierarchical collection of links, which can be within or external to the site, generally used for navigation. For more information, see the <a href=\":menu\">online documentation for the Menu UI module</a>."
msgstr "「功能表使用者介面」模組提供一個介面可用來管理功能表。功能表是階層式的鏈結集合，可能在網站內部或外部，通常用於導覽。如需相關資訊，請參閱<a href=\":menu\">「功能表使用者介面」模組的線上文件</a>。"

msgid "Users with the <em>Administer menus and menu links</em> permission can add, edit, and delete custom menus on the <a href=\":menu\">Menus page</a>. Custom menus can be special site menus, menus of external links, or any combination of internal and external links. You may create an unlimited number of additional menus, each of which will automatically have an associated block (if you have the <a href=\":block_help\">Block module</a> installed). By selecting <em>Edit menu</em>, you can add, edit, or delete links for a given menu. The links listing page provides a drag-and-drop interface for controlling the order of links, and creating a hierarchy within the menu."
msgstr "具有<em>管理功能表及功能表鏈結</em>許可權的使用者可以在<a href=\":menu\">功能表頁面</a>上新增、編輯及刪除自訂功能表。自訂功能表可以是特殊的網站功能表、外部鏈結的功能表，或內部和外部鏈結的任何組合。您可以建立的額外功能表數目沒有限制，而每一個自動會有相關聯的區塊（如果您已安裝<a href=\":block_help\">「區塊」模組</a>）。您可以選取<em>編輯功能表</em>，以新增、編輯或刪除給定功能表的鏈結。鏈結清單頁面提供一個拖放介面，用於控制鏈結順序以及在功能表內建立階層。"

msgid "Displaying menus"
msgstr "顯示選單"

msgid "If you have the Block module enabled, then each menu that you create is rendered in a block that you enable and position on the <a href=\":blocks\">Block layout page</a>. In some <a href=\":themes\">themes</a>, the main menu and possibly the secondary menu will be output automatically; you may be able to disable this behavior on the <a href=\":themes\">theme's settings page</a>."
msgstr "如果您已啟用「區塊」模組，則您建立的每一個功能表，將會呈現在您於<a href=\":blocks\">「區塊佈置」頁面</a>上啟用及放置的區塊中。在某些<a href=\":themes\">佈景主題</a>中，將會自動輸出主功能表，甚至是次要功能表；您也可以在<a href=\":themes\">佈景主題的設定頁面</a>上停用此行為。"

msgid "You can enable the newly-created block for this menu on the <a href=\":blocks\">Block layout page</a>."
msgstr "您可以在<a href=\":blocks\">「區塊佈置」頁面</a>上為此功能表啟用新建立的區塊。"

msgid "Each menu has a corresponding block that is managed on the <a href=\":blocks\">Block layout page</a>."
msgstr "每一個功能表各有一個在<a href=\":blocks\">「區塊佈置」頁面</a>上管理的相對應區塊。"

msgid "Menu settings"
msgstr "選單設定"

msgid "Provide a menu link"
msgstr "設定選單連結"

msgid "Menu links with lower weights are displayed before links with higher weights."
msgstr "加權較低的功能表鏈結會比加權較高的鏈結更早顯示。"

msgid "Available menus"
msgstr "可用選單"

msgid "Content of this type can be placed in the selected menus."
msgstr "此類型的內容可以放置在選取的功能表中。"

msgid "Default parent link"
msgstr "預設母項鏈結"

msgid "Choose the menu link to be the default parent for a new link in the content authoring form."
msgstr "選擇功能表鏈結作為內容編寫表單中新鏈結的預設母項。"

msgid "The selected menu link is not under one of the selected menus."
msgstr "選取的功能表鏈結不在已選取的其中一個功能表之下。"

msgid "Not in menu"
msgstr "不存在選單中"

msgid "Menu UI"
msgstr "選單使用者介面"

msgid "Provides a user interface for managing menus."
msgstr "提供用於管理功能表的使用者介面。"

msgid "Add menu"
msgstr "新增選單"

msgid "Edit menu"
msgstr "編輯選單"

msgid "Manage menus and menu links."
msgstr "管理選單及選單連結"

msgid "Reset menu link"
msgstr "重設選單連結"

msgid "Delete menu"
msgstr "刪除選單"

msgid "Override parent selector"
msgstr "置換母項選取器"

msgid "Per-content type menu settings"
msgstr "個別內容類型功能表設定"

msgid "Menu machine name"
msgstr "選單可機讀名稱"

msgid "Edit menu %label"
msgstr "編輯功能表 %label"

msgid "A unique name to construct the URL for the menu. It must only contain lowercase letters, numbers and hyphens."
msgstr "用於建構功能表 URL 的唯一名稱。它只能包含小寫字母、數字和連字號。"

msgid "Administrative summary"
msgstr "管理摘要"

msgid "Menu language"
msgstr "選單語言"

msgid "Menu %label has been updated."
msgstr "功能表 %label 已更新。"

msgid "Menu %label has been added."
msgstr "功能表 %label 已新增。"

msgid "Menu link"
msgstr "選單連結"

msgid "There are no menu links yet. <a href=\":url\">Add link</a>."
msgstr "尚無功能表鏈結。<a href=\":url\">新增鏈結</a>。"

msgid "<q>Log in</q> for anonymous users"
msgstr "匿名使用者的「登入」"

msgid "logged in users only"
msgstr "只限已登入的使用者"

msgid "Enable @title menu link"
msgstr "啟用 @title 選單連結"

msgid "%capital_name contains 1 menu link with pending revisions. Manipulation of a menu tree having links with pending revisions is not supported, but you can re-enable manipulation by getting each menu link to a published state."
msgid_plural "%capital_name contains @count menu links with pending revisions. Manipulation of a menu tree having links with pending revisions is not supported, but you can re-enable manipulation by getting each menu link to a published state."
msgstr[0] "%capital_name 包含 @count 個具有擱置修訂的功能表鏈結。不支援操作其鏈結具有擱置修訂的功能表樹狀結構，但您可以透過讓每一個功能表鏈結進入已發佈狀態，來重新啟用操作。"

msgid "Deleted custom menu %title and all its menu links."
msgstr "刪除掉自訂的選單 %title 以及其所有的選單項目。"

msgid "<strong>Warning:</strong> There is currently 1 menu link in %title. It will be deleted (system-defined links will be reset)."
msgid_plural "<strong>Warning:</strong> There are currently @count menu links in %title. They will be deleted (system-defined links will be reset)."
msgstr[0] ""
msgstr[1] ""

msgid "Are you sure you want to reset the link %item to its default values?"
msgstr "您確定要重設連結 %item 為預設值？"

msgid "Any customizations will be lost. This action cannot be undone."
msgstr "任何自訂的改變將會消失。此動作無法復原!"

msgid "The menu link was reset to its default settings."
msgstr "對選單項目的設定已重設為預設值。"

msgctxt "Validation"
msgid "Menu settings."
msgstr "功能表設定。"

msgid "You can only change the menu settings for the <em>published</em> version of this content."
msgstr "您只能變更此內容<em>已發佈</em>版本的功能表設定。"

msgid "The Migrate module provides a framework for migrating data, usually from an external source into your site. It does not provide a user interface. For more information, see the <a href=\":migrate\">online documentation for the Migrate module</a>."
msgstr "「移轉」模組提供一種移轉資料的架構；通常是從外部來源移轉至您的網站中。此模組並未提供使用者介面。如需相關資訊，請參閱<a href=\":migrate\">「移轉」模組的線上文件</a>。"

msgid "Provides a framework for migrating data to Drupal."
msgstr "提供將資料移轉至 Drupal 的架構。"

msgid "Migration"
msgstr "遷移"

msgid "Migration @id is busy with another operation: @status"
msgstr "移轉 @id 正在處理另一項作業：@status"

msgid "Migration @id did not meet the requirements. @message"
msgstr "移轉 @id 不符合需求。@message"

msgid "Migration failed with source plugin exception: @e in @file line @line"
msgstr "移轉失敗，發生來源外掛程式異常狀況：@e，位於 @file 第 @line 行"

msgid "New object was not saved, no error provided"
msgstr "未儲存新物件，未提供任何錯誤"

msgid "Memory usage is @usage (@pct% of limit @limit), reclaiming memory."
msgstr "記憶體用量為 @usage（限制 @limit 的 @pct%），將收回記憶體。"

msgid "Memory usage is now @usage (@pct% of limit @limit), not enough reclaimed, starting new batch"
msgstr "目前的記憶體用量為 @usage（限制 @limit 的 @pct%），收回量不足，將啟動新批次"

msgid "Memory usage is now @usage (@pct% of limit @limit), reclaimed enough, continuing"
msgstr "目前的記憶體用量為 @usage（限制 @limit 的 @pct%），收回量已足夠，將繼續作業"

msgid "The destination system contains data which was not created by a migration."
msgstr "目的地系統包含不是由移轉建立的資料。"

msgid "@entity_type revisions"
msgstr "@entity_type 修訂版本"

msgid "Did not save to map table due to NULL value for key field @field"
msgstr "由於索引鍵欄位 @field 為空值，而未儲存至對映表"

msgid "Could not save to map table due to missing destination id values"
msgstr "由於遺漏目的地 ID 值，而無法儲存至對映表"

msgid "The Migrate Drupal module provides a framework based on the <a href=\":migrate\">Migrate module</a> to facilitate migration from a Drupal (6, 7, or 8) site to your website. It does not provide a user interface. For more information, see the <a href=\":migrate_drupal\">online documentation for the Migrate Drupal module</a>."
msgstr "「移轉 Drupal」模組根據<a href=\":migrate\">移轉模組</a>提供了一個架構，可協助您從 Drupal（6、7 或 8）網站移轉至您的網站。此模組並未提供使用者介面。如需相關資訊，請參閱<a href=\":migrate_drupal\">「移轉 Drupal」模組的線上文件</a>。"

msgid "Failed to connect to your database server. The server reports the following message: %error.<ul><li>Is the database server running?</li><li>Does the database exist, and have you entered the correct database name?</li><li>Have you entered the correct username and password?</li><li>Have you entered the correct database hostname?</li></ul>"
msgstr "連接資料庫伺服器失敗。伺服器報告下面的訊息： %error。<ul><li>資料庫伺服器正常運行？</li><li>資料庫是否存在，您輸入了正確的資料庫名？</li><li>您輸入了正確的使用者名和密碼？</li><li>您輸入了正確的資料庫主機名？</li></ul>"

msgid "Provides a framework to migrate data from previous versions of Drupal into the site."
msgstr "提供將資料從舊版 Drupal 移轉至網站的架構。"

msgid "Migrate Drupal settings"
msgstr "移轉 Drupal 設定"

msgid "source_module enforcement tags"
msgstr "source_module 強制執行標籤"

msgid "Tag"
msgstr "標籤"

msgid "Follow-up migration tags"
msgstr "追蹤移轉標籤"

msgid "Field discovery failed for Drupal core version @core. Did this site have the Field module installed? Error: @message"
msgstr "針對 Drupal 核心版本 @core 的欄位探索失敗。此網站是否已安裝「欄位」模組？錯誤：@message"

msgid "Source module not found for @migration_id."
msgstr "找不到 @migration_id 的來源模組。"

msgid "Destination module not found for @migration_id."
msgstr "找不到 @migration_id 的目的地模組。"

msgid "@label (@derivative)"
msgstr "@label (@derivative)"

msgid "The config object collection."
msgstr "配置物件集合。"

msgid "The config object name."
msgstr "配置物件名稱。"

msgid "Serialized configuration object data."
msgstr "序列化配置物件資料。"

msgid "The Migrate Drupal UI module provides a simple user interface to perform an upgrade from an earlier version of Drupal. For more information, see the <a href=\":migrate\">online documentation for the Migrate Drupal UI module</a>."
msgstr "「移轉 Drupal 使用者介面」模組提供一個簡易的使用者介面，用來執行舊版 Drupal 的升級。如需相關資訊，請參閱<a href=\":migrate\">「移轉 Drupal 使用者介面」模組的線上文件</a>。"

msgid "Preparing the site"
msgstr "準備網站"

msgid "You need to enable all modules on this site that are enabled on the previous site. For example, if you have used the Book module on the previous site then you must enable the Book module on this site for that data to be available on this site."
msgstr "您必須在此網站上啟用先前網站所啟用的所有模組。例如，如果您在先前網站上使用了「書籍」模組，則必須在此網站上啟用「書籍」模組，才能在此網站上使用該項資料。"

msgid "Performing the upgrade"
msgstr "執行升級"

msgid "On the <a href=\":upgrade\">Upgrade</a> page, you are guided through performing the upgrade in several steps."
msgstr "在<a href=\":upgrade\">升級</a>頁面上，系統會引導您以數個步驟執行升級。"

msgid "If an upgrade has been performed on this site, you will be informed."
msgstr "如果已在此網站上執行升級，您將會收到通知。"

msgid "You need to enter the database credentials of the Drupal site that you want to upgrade. You can also include its files directory in the upgrade. For example local files, /var/www/docroot, or remote files http://www.example.com."
msgstr "您必須輸入要升級之 Drupal 網站的資料庫認證。 您也可以將其檔案目錄一併升級。 例如，本端檔案 /var/www/docroot 或遠端檔案 http://www.example.com。"

msgid "If there is existing content on the site that may be overwritten by this upgrade, you will be informed."
msgstr "如果網站上有此升級可能會改寫的現有內容，您將會收到通知。"

msgid "The next page provides an overview of the modules that will be upgraded and those that will not be upgraded, before you proceed to perform the upgrade."
msgstr "在您繼續執行升級之前，下一頁會提供將會升級以及不會升級的模組概觀。"

msgid "Finally, a message is displayed about the number of upgrade tasks that were successful or failed."
msgstr "最後，會顯示一則訊息，說明成功或失敗的升級作業數。"

msgid "Reviewing the upgrade log"
msgstr "檢閱升級日誌"

msgid "You can review a <a href=\":log\">log of upgrade messages</a> by clicking the link in the message provided after the upgrade or by filtering the messages for the type <em>migrate_drupal_ui</em> on the <a href=\":messages\">Recent log messages</a> page."
msgstr "您可以在升級後提供的訊息中按一下鏈結，或是在<a href=\":messages\">最近日誌訊息</a>頁面上過濾出 <em>migrate_drupal_ui</em> 類型的訊息，以檢閱<a href=\":log\">升級訊息日誌</a>。"

msgid "Rolling back an upgrade"
msgstr "回復升級"

msgid "Rolling back an upgrade is not yet supported through the user interface."
msgstr "目前尚不支援透過使用者介面回復升級。"

msgid "The Migrate Drupal UI module has been enabled. Proceed to the <a href=\":url\">upgrade form</a>."
msgstr "「移轉 Drupal 使用者介面」模組已啟用。請繼續進行<a href=\":url\">升級表單</a>。"

msgid "Provides a user interface for migrating from older Drupal versions."
msgstr "提供從舊版 Drupal 進行移轉的使用者介面。"

msgid "Upgrade log"
msgstr "升級日誌"

msgid "Upgrade content and configuration from either a Drupal 6 or a Drupal 7 site."
msgstr "從 Drupal 6 或 Drupal 7 網站升級內容和配置。"

msgid "View the upgrade log."
msgstr "檢視升級日誌。"

msgid "Upgrade process not completed"
msgstr "升級程序未完成"

msgid "Congratulations, you upgraded Drupal!"
msgstr "恭喜，您已升級 Drupal！"

msgid "Source ID @source_id: @message"
msgstr "來源 ID @source_id：@message"

msgid "Operation stopped by request"
msgstr "作業應要求而停止"

msgid "Operation on @migration failed"
msgstr "@migration 的作業失敗"

msgid "Operation on @migration skipped due to unfulfilled dependencies"
msgstr "由於相依關係不符，而略過 @migration 的作業"

msgid "Currently upgrading @migration (@current of @max total tasks)"
msgstr "目前正在移轉 @migration（@current 個，總計 @max 個作業）"

msgid "Review the detailed upgrade log"
msgstr "檢閱詳細升級日誌"

msgid "Completed 1 upgrade task successfully"
msgid_plural "Completed @count upgrade tasks successfully"
msgstr[0] "已順利完成 @count 個升級作業"

msgid "1 upgrade failed"
msgid_plural "@count upgrades failed"
msgstr[0] "@count 個升級失敗"

msgid "Upgraded @migration (processed 1 item total)"
msgid_plural "Upgraded @migration (processed @count items total)"
msgstr[0] "已升級 @migration（總計已處理 @count 個項目）"

msgid "Continuing with @migration (processed 1 item)"
msgid_plural "Continuing with @migration (processed @count items)"
msgstr[0] "繼續進行 @migration（已處理 @count 個項目）"

msgid "Review upgrade"
msgstr "檢閱升級"

msgid "Drupal Upgrade"
msgstr "Drupal 升級"

msgid "Provide the information to access the Drupal site you want to upgrade. Files can be imported into the upgraded site as well.  See the <a href=\":url\">Upgrade documentation for more detailed instructions</a>."
msgstr "請提供用於存取您要升級的 Drupal 網站之資訊。您也可以將檔案匯入已升級的網站。如需詳細指示，請參閱<a href=\":url\">升級文件</a>。"

msgid "Drupal version of the source site"
msgstr "來源網站的 Drupal 版本"

msgid "Drupal 6"
msgstr "Drupal 6"

msgid "Drupal 7"
msgstr "Drupal 7"

msgid "Source connection"
msgstr "來源連線"

msgid "- User defined -"
msgstr "- 使用者定義 -"

msgid "Choose one of the keys from the $databases array or else select \"User defined\" and enter database credentials."
msgstr "從 $databases 陣列中選擇其中一個金鑰，或選取「使用者定義」並輸入資料庫認證。"

msgid "Source database"
msgstr "來源資料庫"

msgid "Provide credentials for the database of the Drupal site you want to upgrade."
msgstr "提供要升級之 Drupal 網站的資料庫認證。"

msgid "Source files"
msgstr "來源檔案"

msgid "Document root for files"
msgstr "檔案的文件根目錄"

msgid "To import files from your current Drupal site, enter a local file directory containing your site (e.g. /var/www/docroot), or your site address (for example http://example.com)."
msgstr "若要從您的現行 Drupal 網站匯入檔案，請輸入包含該網站的本端檔案目錄（例如：/var/www/docroot），或是您的網站位址（例如，http://example.com）。"

msgid "Document root for public files"
msgstr "公用檔案的文件根目錄"

msgid "To import public files from your current Drupal site, enter a local file directory containing your site (e.g. /var/www/docroot), or your site address (for example http://example.com)."
msgstr "若要從您的現行 Drupal 網站匯入公用檔案，請輸入包含該網站的本端檔案目錄（例如：/var/www/docroot），或是您的網站位址（例如，http://example.com）。"

msgid "Document root for private files"
msgstr "專用檔案的文件根目錄"

msgid "To import private files from your current Drupal site, enter a local file directory containing your site (e.g. /var/www/docroot). Leave blank to use the same value as Public files directory."
msgstr "若要從您的現行 Drupal 網站匯入專用檔案，請輸入包含該網站的本端檔案目錄（例如：/var/www/docroot）。 保留空白，以使用與 Public 檔案目錄相同的值。"

msgid "Source database does not contain a recognizable Drupal version."
msgstr "來源資料庫未包含可辨識的 Drupal 版本。"

msgid "Source database is Drupal version @version but version @selected was selected."
msgstr "來源資料庫是 Drupal 版本 @version，但選取的是版本 @selected。"

msgid "<h3>Resolve all issues below to continue the upgrade.</h3>"
msgstr "<h3>請解決下面的所有問題以繼續升級。</h3>"

msgid "Failed to read from @title."
msgstr "無法從 @title 讀取。"

msgid "The server reports the following message: %error."
msgstr "伺服器報告了下列訊息：%error。"

msgid "WARNING: Content may be overwritten on your new site."
msgstr "警告：可能會改寫新網站上的內容。"

msgid "Upgrade analysis report"
msgstr "升級分析報告"

msgid "There is conflicting content of these types:"
msgstr "存在下列類型的衝突內容："

msgid "It looks like you have content on your new site which <strong>may be overwritten</strong> if you continue to run this upgrade. The upgrade should be performed on a clean Drupal @version installation. For more information see the <a target=\"_blank\" href=\":id-conflicts-handbook\">upgrade handbook</a>."
msgstr "如果繼續執行此升級，則<strong>可能會改寫</strong>您在新網站上擁有的內容。應該在全新的 Drupal @version 安裝上執行升級。如需相關資訊，請參閱<a target=\"_blank\" href=\":id-conflicts-handbook\">升級手冊</a>。"

msgid "There is translated content of these types:"
msgstr "存在下列類型的已翻譯內容："

msgid "It looks like you are migrating translated content from your old site. Possible ID conflicts for translations are not automatically detected in the current version of Drupal. Refer to the <a target=\"_blank\" href=\":id-conflicts-handbook\">upgrade handbook</a> for instructions on how to avoid ID conflicts with translated content."
msgstr "您好像正在從舊網站移轉已翻譯的內容。在 Drupal 的現行版本中，不會自動偵測翻譯是否有可能的 ID 衝突。如需如何避免與已翻譯內容產生 ID 衝突的相關指示，請參閱<a target=\"_blank\" href=\":id-conflicts-handbook\">升級手冊</a>。"

msgid "I acknowledge I may lose data. Continue anyway."
msgstr "我確認我可能會遺失資料。仍然繼續。"

msgid "An upgrade has already been performed on this site. To perform a new migration, create a clean and empty new install of Drupal @version. Rollbacks are not yet supported through the user interface. For more information, see the <a href=\":url\">upgrading handbook</a>."
msgstr "在此網站已執行過升級。若要執行新移轉，請建立 Drupal @version 的全新安裝，並將其清空。目前尚無法透過使用者介面來支援回復。如需相關資訊，請參閱<a href=\":url\">升級手冊</a>。"

msgid "Last upgrade: @date"
msgstr "前次升級：@date"

msgid "Import new configuration and content from old site"
msgstr "從舊網站匯入新的配置及內容"

msgid "Upgrade a site by importing its files and the data from its database into a clean and empty new install of Drupal @version. See the <a href=\":url\">Drupal site upgrades handbook</a> for more information."
msgstr "將網站的檔案和資料從其資料庫匯入至 Drupal @version 的全新安裝，來升級網站。如需相關資訊，請參閱 <a href=\":url\">Drupal 網站升級手冊</a>。"

msgid "Old site"
msgstr "舊網站"

msgid "The site you want to upgrade."
msgstr "您要升級的網站。"

msgid "New site"
msgstr "新網站"

msgid "This empty Drupal @version installation you will import the old site to."
msgstr "這個空白的 Drupal @version 安裝是您要匯入舊網站之處。"

msgid "Make sure that <strong>access to the database</strong> for the old site is available from this new site."
msgstr "請確定可從此新網站取得舊網站的<strong>資料庫存取權</strong>。"

msgid "<strong>If the old site has private files</strong>, a copy of its files directory must also be accessible on the host of this new site."
msgstr "<strong>如果舊網站具有專用檔案</strong>，則還必須可在此新網站的主機上存取其檔案目錄的副本。"

msgid "<strong>Enable all modules on this new site</strong> that are enabled on the old site. For example, if the old site uses the Book module, then enable the Book module on this new site so that the existing data can be imported to it."
msgstr "<strong>在此新網站上啟用</strong>已在舊網站上啟用的所有模組。例如，如果舊網站使用「書籍」模組，則在此新網站上啟用「書籍」模組，以便能夠將現有資料匯入其中。"

msgid "<strong>Do not add any content to the new site</strong> before upgrading. Any existing content is likely to be overwritten by the upgrade process. See <a href=\":url\">the upgrade preparation guide</a>."
msgstr "在升級之前，<strong>請勿將任何內容新增至新網站</strong>。升級程序可能會改寫任何現有內容。請參閱<a href=\":url\">升級準備手冊</a>。"

msgid "Put this site into <a href=\":url\">maintenance mode</a>."
msgstr "讓此網站進入<a href=\":url\">維護模式</a>。"

msgid "Preparation steps"
msgstr "準備步驟"

msgid "The upgrade can take a long time. It is better to upgrade from a local copy of your site instead of directly from your live site."
msgstr "此升級可能需要很長時間。最好從網站的本端副本進行升級，而不要直接從線上網站進行升級。"

msgid "What will be upgraded?"
msgstr "將要升級什麼？"

msgid "Modules that will not be upgraded"
msgstr "不會升級的模組"

msgid "The new site is missing modules corresponding to the old site's modules. Unless they are installed prior to the upgrade, configuration and/or content needed by them will not be available on your new site. <a href=':review'>Read the checklist</a> to help decide what to do."
msgstr "新網站遺漏與舊網站模組相對應的模組。除非它們是在升級之前安裝，否則，您的新網站上將不會提供它們所需的配置及/或內容。<a href=':review'>閱讀核對清單</a>以協助決定要執行的作業。"

msgid "Drupal @version module name"
msgstr "Drupal @version 模組名稱"

msgid "Drupal @version machine name"
msgstr "Drupal @version 機器名稱"

msgid "Drupal @version"
msgstr "Drupal @version"

msgid "Modules that will be upgraded"
msgstr "將會升級的模組"

msgid "Running upgrade"
msgstr "執行升級"

msgid "Perform upgrade"
msgstr "執行升級"

msgid "Module will not be upgraded"
msgid_plural "Modules will not be upgraded"
msgstr[0] "不會升級這些模組"

msgid "Module will be upgraded"
msgid_plural "Modules will be upgraded"
msgstr[0] "將會升級這些模組"

msgid "The MySQL module provides the connection between Drupal and a MySQL, MariaDB or equivalent database. For more information, see the <a href=\":mysql\">online documentation for the MySQL module</a>."
msgstr "MySQL 模組提供 Drupal 與 MySQL、 MariaDB 或同等資料庫之間的連線。 如需相關資訊，請參閱 <a href=\":mysql\">MySQL 模組的線上文件</a>。"

msgid "This is not supported by Drupal."
msgstr "Drupal 不支援此動作。"

msgid "The recommended level for Drupal is \"READ COMMITTED\"."
msgstr "建議的 Drupal 層次是「已確定的讀取」。"

msgid "For this to work correctly, all tables must have a primary key. The following table(s) do not have a primary key: @tables."
msgstr "若要正確運作，所有表格都必須具有主要索引鍵。 下列表格沒有主要索引鍵：@tables。"

msgid "See the <a href=\":performance_doc\">setting MySQL transaction isolation level</a> page for more information."
msgstr "如需相關資訊，請參閱<a href=\":performance_doc\">設定 MySQL 交易隔離層次</a>頁面。"

msgid "Transaction isolation level"
msgstr "交易隔離層次"

msgid "MySQL"
msgstr "MySQL"

msgid "Provides the MySQL database driver."
msgstr "提供 MySQL 資料庫驅動程式。"

msgid "MariaDB"
msgstr "MariaDB"

msgid "MySQL, Percona Server, or equivalent"
msgstr "MySQL, Percona 伺服器, 或其他類似的"

msgid "MySQL, MariaDB, Percona Server, or equivalent"
msgstr "MySQL、MariaDB、Percona Server 或相等的。"

msgid "Your MySQL server and PHP MySQL driver must support utf8mb4 character encoding. Make sure to use a database system that supports this (such as MySQL/MariaDB/Percona 5.5.3 and up), and that the utf8mb4 character set is compiled in. See the <a href=\":documentation\" target=\"_blank\">MySQL documentation</a> for more information."
msgstr "MySQL 伺服器與 PHP MySQL 驅動程式必須支援 utf8mb4 字元編碼。確保使用的資料庫系統能夠支援 且將 utf8mb4 字元集編譯好 (像是 MySQL / MariaDB / Percona 5.5.3+)。更多細節請參考 <a href=\":documentation\" target=\"_blank\">MySQL 文件</a>。"

msgid "Database %database not found. The server reports the following message when attempting to create the database: %error."
msgstr "找不到%database資料庫。建立該資料庫時伺服器發出以下訊息： %error"

msgid "Failed to connect to your database server. The server reports the following message: %error.<ul><li>Is the database server running?</li><li>Does the database exist or does the database user have sufficient privileges to create the database?</li><li>Have you entered the correct database name?</li><li>Have you entered the correct username and password?</li><li>Have you entered the correct database hostname and port number?</li></ul>"
msgstr "無法連接至資料庫伺服器。伺服器報告了下列訊息：%error。<ul><li>資料庫伺服器是否在執行中？</li><li>資料庫是否存在，或資料庫使用者是否具有足夠的專用權來建立資料庫？</li><li>您是否已輸入正確的資料庫名稱？</li><li>您是否已輸入正確的使用者名稱和密碼？</li><li>您是否已輸入正確的資料庫主機名稱及埠號？</li></ul>"

msgid "READ COMMITTED"
msgstr "已確定的讀取"

msgid "REPEATABLE READ"
msgstr "可重複讀取"

msgid "Use database default"
msgstr "使用資料庫預設值"

msgid "The recommended database transaction level for Drupal is \"READ COMMITTED\". For more information, see the <a href=\":performance_doc\">setting MySQL transaction isolation level</a> page."
msgstr "Drupal 建議的資料庫交易層次是「已確定的讀取」。 如需相關資訊，請參閱<a href=\":performance_doc\">設定 MySQL 交易隔離層次</a>頁面。"

msgid "The MyISAM storage engine is not supported."
msgstr "不支援 MyISAM 儲存引擎。"

msgid "The MySQLnd driver version %version is less than the minimum required version. Upgrade to MySQLnd version %mysqlnd_minimum_version or up, or alternatively switch mysql drivers to libmysqlclient version %libmysqlclient_minimum_version or up."
msgstr "MySQLnd 版本 %version 小於最低需求。升級 MySQLnd 版本至 %mysqlnd_minimum_version 以上，或是改用 mysql 函式庫 libmysqlclient %libmysqlclient_minimum_version 以上版本。"

msgid "The libmysqlclient driver version %version is less than the minimum required version. Upgrade to libmysqlclient version %libmysqlclient_minimum_version or up, or alternatively switch mysql drivers to MySQLnd version %mysqlnd_minimum_version or up."
msgstr "libmysqlclient 函式庫版本 %version 小於最低需求。升級 libmysqlclient 版本至 %libmysqlclient_minimum_version 以上，或是改用 MySQLnd %mysqlnd_minimum_version 以上版本。"

msgid "The update has encountered an error."
msgstr "更新時發生錯誤。"

msgid "An error occurred and processing did not complete."
msgstr "發生一個錯誤而無法完成工作"

msgid "1 item successfully processed:"
msgid_plural "@count items successfully processed:"
msgstr[0] "成功執行了 1 個項目："
msgstr[1] "成功執行了 @count 個項目："

msgid "Nodes"
msgstr "節點"

msgid "Tokens related to individual content items, or \"nodes\"."
msgstr "有關單獨的內容項目或 \"節點\" 的標識符。"

msgid "Content ID"
msgstr "內容 ID"

msgid "The unique ID of the content item, or \"node\"."
msgstr "內容項目或 \"節點\" 的唯一ID。"

msgid "The unique ID of the node's latest revision."
msgstr "節點最新修訂版本唯一 ID。"

msgid "Content type name"
msgstr "內容類型名稱"

msgid "The human-readable name of the node type."
msgstr "人類可讀的節點類型名稱。"

msgid "The main body text of the node."
msgstr "節點正文內容。"

msgid "The summary of the node's main body text."
msgstr "節點正文摘要。"

msgid "The language code of the language the node is written in."
msgstr "撰寫節點時所用語言的語言碼。"

msgid "The URL of the node."
msgstr "節點的URL。"

msgid "The URL of the node's edit page."
msgstr "節點編輯頁面的 URL"

msgid "The date the node was most recently updated."
msgstr "節點的最近更新日期。"

msgid "Some roles lack permission to access content, but display %display has no access control."
msgstr "部分角色缺少存取內容的權限，但顯示 %display 沒有存取控制。"

msgid "Display %display has no access control but does not contain a filter for published nodes."
msgstr "顯示 %display 沒有存取控制，但不包含過濾器用來過濾已發佈的節點。"

msgid "Display %display has set node/% as path. This will not produce what you want. If you want to have multiple versions of the node view, use Layout Builder."
msgstr "顯示 %display 已將 node/% 設為路徑。這不會產生您要的結果。如果您要有多個節點視圖版本，請使用「佈置建置器」。"

msgid "The content access permissions need to be rebuilt."
msgstr "需要重建內容的存取權限。"

msgid "The content access permissions need to be rebuilt. <a href=\":node_access_rebuild\">Rebuild permissions</a>."
msgstr "需要重建內容存取權。<a href=\":node_access_rebuild\">重建權限</a>。"

msgid "The Node module manages the creation, editing, deletion, settings, and display of the main site content. Content items managed by the Node module are typically displayed as pages on your site, and include a title, some meta-data (author, creation time, content type, etc.), and optional fields containing text or other data (fields are managed by the <a href=\":field\">Field module</a>). For more information, see the <a href=\":node\">online documentation for the Node module</a>."
msgstr "「節點」模組可管理主要網站內容的建立、編輯、刪除、設定及顯示。「節點」模組所管理的內容項目通常會顯示為網站上的頁面，包括標題、一些 meta 資料（作者、建立時間、內容類型等），以及包含文字或其他資料的選用欄位（欄位由<a href=\":field\">「欄位」模組</a>管理）。如需相關資訊，請參閱<a href=\":node\">「節點」模組的線上文件</a>。"

msgid "Creating content"
msgstr "建立內容"

msgid "When new content is created, the Node module records basic information about the content, including the author, date of creation, and the <a href=\":content-type\">Content type</a>. It also manages the <em>publishing options</em>, which define whether or not the content is published, promoted to the front page of the site, and/or sticky at the top of content lists. Default settings can be configured for each <a href=\":content-type\">type of content</a> on your site."
msgstr "建立新的內容時，「節點」模組會記錄內容的基本資訊，包括作者、建立日期和<a href=\":content-type\">內容類型</a>。同時會管理<em>發佈選項</em>，以定義內容是否已發佈、提升至網站的首頁，及/或固定在內容清單的頂端。網站上每一種<a href=\":content-type\">內容類型</a>的預設值都可以配置。"

msgid "Creating custom content types"
msgstr "建立自定內容類型"

msgid "The Node module gives users with the <em>Administer content types</em> permission the ability to <a href=\":content-new\">create new content types</a> in addition to the default ones already configured. Creating custom content types gives you the flexibility to add <a href=\":field\">fields</a> and configure default settings that suit the differing needs of various site content."
msgstr "除了已配置的預設內容類型之外，「節點」模組還讓具有<em>管理內容類型</em>權限的使用者可以<a href=\":content-new\">建立新的內容類型</a>。建立自訂內容類型讓您可以靈活地新增<a href=\":field\">欄位</a>並配置預設值，以滿足各種網站內容的不同需求。"

