msgstr "未選取任何內容。"

msgid "Display the content with standard node view."
msgstr "以標準節點視圖來顯示內容。"

msgid "teasers"
msgstr "摘要"

msgid "full posts"
msgstr "內容全文"

msgid "titles"
msgstr "標題"

msgid "titles (linked)"
msgstr "標題 (連結)"

msgid "tagged with"
msgstr "標記為"

msgid "Content revisions"
msgstr "內容修訂"

msgid "You have not created any content types yet. Go to the <a href=\"@create_content\">content type creation page</a> to add a new content type."
msgstr "您尚未建立任何內容類型。請移至<a href=\"@create_content\">建立內容類型頁面</a>來新增內容類型。"

msgid "Submitted by @author_name on @date"
msgstr "由 @author_name 在 @date 提交"

msgid "The Options module allows you to create fields where data values are selected from a fixed list of options. Usually these items are entered through a select list, checkboxes, or radio buttons. See the <a href=\":field\">Field module help</a> and the <a href=\":field_ui\">Field UI help</a> pages for general information on fields and how to create and manage them. For more information, see the <a href=\":options_do\">online documentation for the Options module</a>."
msgstr "「選項」模組讓您可以建立從固定選項清單中選取資料值的欄位。這些項目通常是透過選取清單、勾選框或圓鈕輸入的。如需欄位的一般資訊和如何建立及管理欄位的相關資訊，請參閱<a href=\":field\">「欄位」模組說明</a>和<a href=\":field_ui\">「欄位使用者介面」說明</a>頁面。如需相關資訊，請參閱<a href=\":options_do\">「選項」模組的線上文件</a>。"

msgid "Managing and displaying list fields"
msgstr "管理及顯示清單欄位"

msgid "The <em>settings</em> and the <em>display</em> of the list fields can be configured separately. See the <a href=\":field_ui\">Field UI help</a> for more information on how to manage fields and their display."
msgstr "清單欄位的<em>設定</em>和<em>顯示</em>可以個別配置。如需如何管理欄位及其顯示畫面的相關資訊，請參閱<a href=\":field_ui\">「欄位使用者介面」說明</a>。"

msgid "Defining option keys and labels"
msgstr "定義選項索引鍵和標籤"

msgid "When you define the list options you can define a key and a label for each option in the list. The label will be shown to the users while the key gets stored in the database."
msgstr "在定義清單選項時，您可以為清單中的每一個選項定義一個索引鍵和標籤。使用者會在索引鍵儲存於資料庫時看見此標籤。"

msgid "Choosing list field type"
msgstr "選擇清單欄位類型"

msgid "There are three types of list fields, which store different types of data: <em>float</em>, <em>integer</em> or, <em>text</em>. The <em>float</em> type allows storing approximate decimal values. The <em>integer</em> type allows storing whole numbers, such as years (for example, 2012) or values (for example, 1, 2, 5, 305). The <em>text</em> list field type allows storing text values. No matter which type of list field you choose, you can define whatever labels you wish for data entry."
msgstr "清單欄位分成三種類型，分別儲存不同類型的資料：<em>浮點</em>、<em>整數</em>或<em>文字</em>。<em>浮點</em>類型容許儲存近似十進位值。<em>整數</em>類型容許儲存整數，像是年份（例如，2012）或值（例如，1、2、5、305）。<em>文字</em>清單欄位類型容許儲存文字值。無論您選擇哪一種清單欄位類型，都可以定義任何要用於資料項目的標籤。"

msgid "Defines field types with select lists, checkboxes, and radio buttons to select values from fixed lists of options."
msgstr "使用選取清單、勾選框及圓鈕來定義欄位類型，以從固定選項清單中選取值。"

msgid "List (integer) settings"
msgstr "清單（整數）設定"

msgid "Allowed values list"
msgstr "許可值列表"

msgid "Allowed value with label"
msgstr "具有標籤的容許值"

msgid "Allowed values function"
msgstr "容許值函數"

msgid "List (float) settings"
msgstr "清單（浮點）設定"

msgid "List (text) settings"
msgstr "清單（文字）設定"

msgid "Options list default display settings"
msgstr "選項清單預設顯示設定"

msgid "Key format settings"
msgstr "索引鍵格式設定"

msgid "Check boxes/radio buttons format settings"
msgstr "勾選框/圓鈕格式設定"

msgid "Select list format settings"
msgstr "選取清單格式設定"

msgid "Display a summary"
msgstr "顯示摘要"

msgid "Sort order"
msgstr "排序次序"

msgid "Key"
msgstr "Key"

msgid "The possible values this field can contain. Enter one value per line, in the format key|label."
msgstr "此欄位可包含的可能值。每行輸入一個值，採用索引鍵|標籤格式。"

msgid "The key is the stored value, and must be numeric. The label will be used in displayed values and edit forms."
msgstr "索引鍵是已儲存的值，且必須是數值。標籤將用於顯示的值和編輯表單中。"

msgid "The label is optional: if a line contains a single number, it will be used as key and label."
msgstr "標籤是選用項目：如果行中包含單一數字，則會將其用作索引鍵和標籤。"

msgid "Lists of labels are also accepted (one label per line), only if the field does not hold any values yet. Numeric keys will be automatically generated from the positions in the list."
msgstr "也接受標籤清單（每行一個標籤），但前提是欄位中尚未包含任何值。數值索引鍵將會自動從清單中的位置產生。"

msgid "Allowed HTML tags in labels: @tags"
msgstr "標籤中允許使用的 HTML 標記：@tags"

msgid "Float value"
msgstr "浮點值"

msgid "Allowed values list: each key must be a valid integer or decimal."
msgstr "允許的值列表：每個鍵都須為合法的整型值或十進制值。"

msgid "List (float)"
msgstr "列表 (浮點數)"

msgid "This field stores float values from a list of allowed 'value => label' pairs, i.e. 'Fraction': 0 => 0, .25 => 1/4, .75 => 3/4, 1 => 1."
msgstr "此欄位會儲存容許的「值 => 標籤」配對清單中的浮點值，亦即「分數」：0 => 0，.25 => 1/4，.75 => 3/4，1 => 1。"

msgid "Allowed values list: keys must be integers."
msgstr "允許使用數值列表：鍵必須為整數。"

msgid "List (integer)"
msgstr "列表 (整數)"

msgid "This field stores integer values from a list of allowed 'value => label' pairs, i.e. 'Lifetime in days': 1 => 1 day, 7 => 1 week, 31 => 1 month."
msgstr "此欄位會儲存容許的「值 => 標籤」配對清單中的整數值，亦即「生命期限」：1 => 1 天、7 => 1 週、31 => 1 個月。"

msgid "The value of this field is being determined by the %function function and may not be changed."
msgstr "此欄位中的值由 %function 函數決定並可能不會更改。"

msgid "Allowed values list: invalid input."
msgstr "允許數值清單：無效的輸入。"

msgid "Allowed values list: some values are being removed while currently in use."
msgstr "容許值清單：部分要移除的值目前正在使用中。"

msgid "The key is the stored value. The label will be used in displayed values and edit forms."
msgstr "索引鍵是已儲存的值。標籤將用於顯示的值和編輯表單中。"

msgid "The label is optional: if a line contains a single string, it will be used as key and label."
msgstr "此標籤為可選項: 如果每行包含一個單獨的字元串，它將被當作關鍵字和標籤使用。"

msgid "Allowed values list: each key must be a string at most 255 characters long."
msgstr "允許的值列表：每個鍵都須為字元串並少於 255 個字元。"

msgid "List (text)"
msgstr "文字清單"

msgid "This field stores text values from a list of allowed 'value => label' pairs, i.e. 'US States': IL => Illinois, IA => Iowa, IN => Indiana."
msgstr "此欄位會儲存容許的「值 => 標籤」配對清單中的文字值，亦即「美國州名」：IL => 伊利諾州、IA => 愛荷華州、IN => 印第安那州。"

msgid "Display list value as human readable"
msgstr "將清單值顯示為人類可讀的值"

msgid "The Internal Page Cache module caches pages for anonymous users in the database. For more information, see the <a href=\":pagecache-documentation\">online documentation for the Internal Page Cache module</a>."
msgstr "「內部頁面快取」模組可在資料庫中快取匿名使用者的頁面。如需相關資訊，請參閱<a href=\":pagecache-documentation\">「內部頁面快取」模組的線上文件</a>。"

msgid "Pages requested by anonymous users are stored the first time they are requested and then are reused. Depending on your site configuration and the amount of your web traffic tied to anonymous visitors, the caching system may significantly increase the speed of your site."
msgstr "匿名使用者所要求的頁面會在第一次要求時儲存，然後重複使用。視您的網站配置和匿名訪客的關聯 Web 資料流量而定，快取系統可以大幅增加網站的速度。"

msgid "Pages are usually identical for all anonymous users, while they can be personalized for each authenticated user. This is why entire pages can be cached for anonymous users, whereas they will have to be rebuilt for every authenticated user."
msgstr "雖然頁面可針對每一個已鑑別使用者而個人化，但對於所有匿名使用者而言，通常完全相同。因此可以為匿名使用者快取整個頁面，而對於每一個已鑑別使用者而言，就必須重建。"

msgid "To speed up your site for authenticated users, see the <a href=\":dynamic_page_cache-help\">Dynamic Page Cache module</a>."
msgstr "若要針對已鑑別使用者來加快您的網站，請參閱<a href=\":dynamic_page_cache-help\">「動態頁面快取」模組</a>。"

msgid "Configuring the internal page cache"
msgstr "配置內部頁面快取"

msgid "On the <a href=\":cache-settings\">Performance page</a>, you can configure how long browsers and proxies may cache pages based on the Cache-Control header; this setting is ignored by the Internal Page Cache module, which caches pages permanently until invalidation, unless they carry an Expires header. There is no other configuration."
msgstr "在<a href=\":cache-settings\">效能頁面</a>上，您可以根據 Cache-Control 標頭來配置瀏覽器及 Proxy 可快取頁面的時間；除非它們執行 Expires 標頭，否則「內部頁面快取」模組會忽略此設定，並永久地快取頁面，直到失效為止。沒有任何其他配置。"

msgid "Internal Page Cache"
msgstr "內部頁面快取"

msgid "Caches pages for anonymous users and can be used when external page cache is not available."
msgstr "會快取匿名使用者的頁面，當外部頁面快取無法使用時，可以使用這些頁面。"

msgid "The Path module allows you to specify an alias, or custom URL, for any existing internal system path. Aliases should not be confused with URL redirects, which allow you to forward a changed or inactive URL to a new URL. In addition to making URLs more readable, aliases also help search engines index content more effectively. Multiple aliases may be used for a single internal system path. To automate the aliasing of paths, you can install the contributed module <a href=\":pathauto\">Pathauto</a>. For more information, see the <a href=\":path\">online documentation for the Path module</a>."
msgstr "「路徑」模組讓您可以指定任何現有內部系統路徑的別名或自訂 URL。請勿將別名與 URL 重新導向混淆，後者讓您可以將已變更或非作用中的 URL 轉遞至新的 URL。別名除了讓 URL 的可讀性更，還有助於搜尋引擎更有效地編製內容索引。單一內部系統路徑可以使用多個別名。若要自動進行路徑別名化，您可以安裝提供的模組 <a href=\":pathauto\">Pathauto</a>。如需相關資訊，請參閱<a href=\":path\">「路徑」模組的線上文件</a>。"

msgid "Creating aliases"
msgstr "建立路徑別名"

msgid "If you create or edit a taxonomy term you can add an alias (for example <em>music/jazz</em>) in the field \"URL alias\". When creating or editing content you can add an alias (for example <em>about-us/team</em>) under the section \"URL path settings\" in the field \"URL alias\". Aliases for any other path can be added through the page <a href=\":aliases\">URL aliases</a>. To add aliases a user needs the permission <a href=\":permissions\">Create and edit URL aliases</a>."
msgstr "如果您建立或編輯分類架構術語，則可以在「URL 別名」欄位中新增別名（例如 <em>music/jazz</em>）。建立或編輯內容時，您可以在「URL 路徑設定」區段下的「URL 別名」欄位中新增別名（例如 <em>about-us/team</em>）。您可以透過 <a href=\":aliases\">URL 別名</a>頁面來新增其他任何路徑的別名。若要新增別名，使用者需要有<a href=\":permissions\">建立及編輯 URL 別名</a>權限。"

msgid "Managing aliases"
msgstr "管理路徑別名"

msgid "The Path module provides a way to search and view a <a href=\":aliases\">list of all aliases</a> that are in use on your website. Aliases can be added, edited and deleted through this list."
msgstr "「路徑」模組提供一種方式來搜尋及檢視網站上使用的<a href=\":aliases\">所有別名的清單</a>。您可以透過此清單來新增、編輯及刪除別名。"

msgid "An alias defines a different name for an existing URL path - for example, the alias 'about' for the URL path 'node/1'. A URL path can have multiple aliases."
msgstr "通過使用別名為已有的連結地址指定不同的名稱 - 比如，別名 'about' 對應於連結地址 'node/1'。一個連結地址可以有多個別名。"

msgid "Enter the path you wish to create the alias for, followed by the name of the new alias."
msgstr "輸入您要建立別名的路徑，以及新的別名路徑。"

msgid "URL alias"
msgstr "路徑別名 (URL alias)"

msgid "A path alias set for a specific language will always be used when displaying this page in that language, and takes precedence over path aliases set as <em>- Not specified -</em>."
msgstr "以特定語言顯示此頁面時，一律會使用該語言已設定的路徑別名，其優先順序高於設為 <em>- 未指定 -</em> 的路徑別名。"

msgid "- Not specified -"
msgstr "- 未指定 -"

msgid "Specify the existing path you wish to alias. For example: /node/28, /forum/1, /taxonomy/term/1."
msgstr "指定您想要建立別名的現有路徑。例如：/node/28、/forum/1、/taxonomy/term/1。"

msgid "Specify an alternative path by which this data can be accessed. For example, type \"/about\" when writing an about page."
msgstr "指定存取此資料時可用的替代路徑。例如，撰寫「關於」頁面時的 \"/about\"。"

msgid "Alias: @alias"
msgstr "別名：@alias"

msgid "No alias"
msgstr "沒有路徑別名"

msgid "Allows users to create custom URLs for existing paths on the site."
msgstr "容許使用者為網站上的現有路徑建立自訂 URL。"

msgid "Add alias"
msgstr "新增網址別名"

msgid "Add custom URLs to existing paths."
msgstr "將自訂 URL 新增至現有路徑。"

msgid "The alias has been saved."
msgstr "別名已儲存。"

msgid "No path aliases available. <a href=\":link\">Add URL alias</a>."
msgstr "沒有可用的路徑別名。<a href=\":link\">新增 URL 別名</a>。"

msgid "Alias"
msgstr "別名"

msgid "System path"
msgstr "系統路徑"

msgid "Filter aliases"
msgstr "過濾器別名"

msgid "Path alias"
msgstr "路徑別名"

msgid "Path id"
msgstr "路徑 ID"

msgid "Language Code"
msgstr "語言碼"

msgid "An entity field containing a path alias and related data."
msgstr "包含路徑別名及相關資料的實體欄位。"

msgid "URL path settings"
msgstr "網址路徑設定"

msgctxt "Validation"
msgid "Path alias."
msgstr "路徑別名。"

msgid "You can only change the URL alias for the <em>published</em> version of this content."
msgstr "您只能變更此內容<em>已發佈</em>版本的 URL 別名。"

msgid "The numeric identifier of the path alias."
msgstr "路徑別名的數值 ID。"

msgid "The language code of the URL alias."
msgstr "URL 別名的語言碼。"

msgid "The internal system path."
msgstr "內部系統路徑。"

msgid "The path alias."
msgstr "路徑別名。"

msgid "Provides the API allowing to rename URLs."
msgstr "會提供容許重新命名 URL 的 API。"

msgid "The path that this alias belongs to."
msgstr "此別名所屬的路徑。"

msgid "The source path has to start with a slash."
msgstr "來源路徑必須以斜線開頭。"

msgid "An alias used with this path."
msgstr "與此路徑搭配使用的別名。"

