msgid "Single Directory Components is a module that aims to simplify the front-end development workflow, and improve maintainability of core and contrib themes. For more information, see the <a href=\":docs\">online documentation for the Single Directory Components module</a>."
msgstr "「單一目錄元件」是一個模組，旨在簡化前端開發工作流程，並改善核心及 contrib 佈景主題的可維護性。 如需相關資訊，請參閱<a href=\":docs\">「單一目錄元件」模組的線上文件</a>。"

msgid "Single Directory Components introduces the concept of UI components to Drupal core. A component is a combination of a Twig template, stylesheets, scripts, assets, and metadata, that live in the same directory. Components represent an encapsulated and re-usable UI element."
msgstr "「單一目錄元件」將使用者介面元件的概念引進 Drupal 核心。 元件是存在於相同目錄中的 Twig 範本、樣式表、Script、資產及 meta 資料的組合。 元件代表封裝且可重複使用的使用者介面元素。"

msgid "<a href=\":sdc-docs\">Single Directory Components</a> reduce the number of framework implementation details required to put templated HTML, CSS, and JS in a Drupal page. They also define explicit component APIs, and provide a methodology to replace a component provided upstream (in a parent theme or module)."
msgstr "<a href=\":sdc-docs\">單一目錄元件</a>可減少在 Drupal 頁面中放置範本化 HTML、CSS 及 JS 所需的架構實作詳細資料數目。 它們還定義了明確元件 API，並提供方法來取代上游（在母項佈景主題或模組中）所提供的元件。"

msgid "Single Directory Components"
msgstr "單一目錄元件"

msgid "Allows discovery and rendering of self-contained UI components."
msgstr "容許探索及呈現自行包含的使用者介面元件。"

msgid "- Description not available -"
msgstr "- 無法使用說明 -"

msgid "All Components"
msgstr "所有元件"

msgid "The Search module provides the ability to set up search pages based on plugins provided by other modules. In Drupal core, there are two page-type plugins: the Content page type provides keyword searching for content managed by the Node module, and the Users page type provides keyword searching for registered users. Contributed modules may provide other page-type plugins. For more information, see the <a href=\":search-module\">online documentation for the Search module</a>."
msgstr "「搜尋」模組讓您可以根據其他模組所提供的外掛程式來設定搜尋頁面。在 Drupal 核心中，有兩個頁面類型外掛程式：「內容」頁面類型支援以關鍵字搜尋「節點」模組所管理的內容，「使用者」頁面類型支援以關鍵字搜尋已登錄的使用者。提供的模組可能會提供其他頁面類型外掛程式。如需相關資訊，請參閱<a href=\":search-module\">「搜尋」模組的線上文件</a>。"

msgid "To configure search pages, visit the <a href=\":search-settings\">Search pages page</a>. In the Search pages section, you can add a new search page, edit the configuration of existing search pages, enable and disable search pages, and choose the default search page. Each enabled search page has a URL path starting with <em>search</em>, and each will appear as a tab or local task link on the <a href=\":search-url\">search page</a>; you can configure the text that is shown in the tab. In addition, some search page plugins have additional settings that you can configure for each search page."
msgstr "若要配置搜尋頁面，請造訪<a href=\":search-settings\">「搜尋頁面」頁面</a>。在「搜尋頁面」區段中，您可以新增搜尋頁面、編輯現有搜尋頁面的配置、啟用與停用搜尋頁面，以及選擇預設搜尋頁面。每一個已啟用的搜尋頁面都有以 <em>search</em> 開頭的 URL 路徑，而且在<a href=\":search-url\">搜尋頁面</a>上都會顯示為欄標或本端作業鏈結；您可以配置欄標中顯示的文字。此外，部分搜尋頁面外掛程式還會有額外的設定，讓您針對每一個搜尋頁面進行配置。"

msgid "Some search page plugins, such as the core Content search page, index searchable text using the Drupal core search index, and will not work unless content is indexed. Indexing is done during <em>cron</em> runs, so it requires a <a href=\":cron\">cron maintenance task</a> to be set up. There are also several settings affecting indexing that can be configured on the <a href=\":search-settings\">Search pages page</a>: the number of items to index per cron run, the minimum word length to index, and how to handle Chinese, Japanese, and Korean characters."
msgstr "部分搜尋頁面外掛程式（例如核心「內容」搜尋頁面）會使用 Drupal 核心搜尋索引，將可搜尋的文字編製索引，而且除非內容已編製索引，否則無法運作。索引是在 <em>cron</em> 執行期間編製，所以需要設定 <a href=\":cron\">cron 維護作業</a>。在<a href=\":search-settings\">「搜尋頁面」頁面</a>上，還有數個會影響索引編製的設定可配置：每次執行 cron 時要編製索引的項目數、可編製索引的最小字組長度，以及如何處理中文、日文及韓文字元。"

msgid "Modules providing search page plugins generally ensure that content-related actions on your site (creating, editing, or deleting content and comments) automatically cause affected content items to be marked for indexing or reindexing at the next cron run. When content is marked for reindexing, the previous content remains in the index until cron runs, at which time it is replaced by the new content. However, there are some actions related to the structure of your site that do not cause affected content to be marked for reindexing. Examples of structure-related actions that affect content include deleting or editing taxonomy terms, enabling or disabling modules that add text to content (such as Taxonomy, Comment, and field-providing modules), and modifying the fields or display parameters of your content types. If you take one of these actions and you want to ensure that the search index is updated to reflect your changed site structure, you can mark all content for reindexing by clicking the \"Re-index site\" button on the <a href=\":search-settings\">Search pages page</a>. If you have a lot of content on your site, it may take several cron runs for the content to be reindexed."
msgstr "提供搜尋頁面外掛程式的模組通常可確保網站上的內容相關動作（建立、編輯或刪除內容和評論），一定會自動造成受影響的內容項目，被標示為在下一次執行 cron 時編製索引或重新編製索引。當內容已標示為要重新編製索引時，先前的內容會保留在索引中，直到 cron 執行為止，到時就會取代為新的內容。不過，有一些與網站結構相關的動作，並不會造成受影響的內容被標示為要重新編製索引。影響內容的結構相關動作包括以下範例：刪除或編輯分類架構術語、啟用或停用將文字新增至內容的模組（例如「分類架構」、「評論」及欄位提供模組），以及修改內容類型的欄位或顯示參數。如果您採取其中一個動作，而且想要確保搜尋索引會更新以反映已變更的網站結構，您可以按一下<a href=\":search-settings\">「搜尋頁面」頁面</a>上的「將網站重新編製索引」按鈕，即可將所有內容標示為要重新編製索引。如果網站上有大量內容，則可能需要執行許多次 cron，才能將內容重新編製索引。"

msgid "Displaying the Search block"
msgstr "顯示搜尋區塊"

msgid "The Search module includes a block, which can be enabled and configured on the <a href=\":blocks\">Block layout page</a>, if you have the Block module enabled; the default block title is Search, and it is the Search form block in the Forms category, if you wish to add another instance. The block is available to users with the <a href=\":search_permission\">Use search</a> permission, and it performs a search using the configured default search page."
msgstr "如果您已啟用「區塊」模組，則「搜尋」模組會包括一個可在<a href=\":blocks\">「區塊佈置」頁面</a>上啟用及配置的區塊；預設區塊標題是「搜尋」，在「表單」種類中是「搜尋表單」區塊（如果您想要新增另一個實例）。具有<a href=\":search_permission\">使用搜尋</a>權限的使用者可使用此區塊，以使用已配置的預設搜尋頁面來執行搜尋。"

msgid "Searching your site"
msgstr "搜尋您的網站"

msgid "Users with <a href=\":search_permission\">Use search</a> permission can use the Search block and <a href=\":search\">Search page</a>. Users with the <a href=\":node_permission\">View published content</a> permission can use configured search pages of type <em>Content</em> to search for content containing exact keywords; in addition, users with <a href=\":search_permission\">Use advanced search</a> permission can use more complex search filtering. Users with the <a href=\":user_permission\">View user information</a> permission can use configured search pages of type <em>Users</em> to search for active users containing the keyword anywhere in the username, and users with the <a href=\":user_permission\">Administer users</a> permission can search for active and blocked users, by email address or username keyword."
msgstr "具有<a href=\":search_permission\">使用搜尋</a>權限的使用者可以使用「搜尋」區塊及<a href=\":search\">搜尋頁面</a>。具有<a href=\":node_permission\">檢視已發佈的內容</a>權限的使用者，可以使用已配置的<em>內容</em>類型搜尋頁面，來搜尋包含確切關鍵字的內容；此外，具有<a href=\":search_permission\">使用進階搜尋</a>權限的使用者，可以使用更複雜的搜尋過濾。具有<a href=\":user_permission\">檢視使用者資訊</a>權限的使用者，可以使用已配置的<em>使用者</em>類型搜尋頁面，來搜尋使用者名稱中任何地方包含關鍵字的作用中使用者，而具有<a href=\":user_permission\">管理使用者</a>權限的使用者，可以依電子郵件位址或使用者名稱關鍵字，來搜尋作用中和已封鎖的使用者。"

msgid "Extending the Search module"
msgstr "延伸搜尋模組"

msgid "By default, the Search module only supports exact keyword matching in content searches. You can modify this behavior by installing a language-specific stemming module for your language (such as <a href=\":porterstemmer_url\">Porter Stemmer</a> for American English), which allows words such as walk, walking, and walked to be matched in the Search module. Another approach is to use a third-party search technology with stemming or partial word matching features built in, such as <a href=\":solr_url\">Apache Solr</a> or <a href=\":sphinx_url\">Sphinx</a>. There are also contributed modules that provide additional search pages. These and other <a href=\":contrib-search\">search-related contributed modules</a> can be downloaded by visiting Drupal.org."
msgstr "依預設，「搜尋」模組在內容搜尋中僅支援確切的關鍵字對比。您可以修改此行為，請安裝您所用語言的語言專用詞幹分析模組（例如，美式英文的 <a href=\":porterstemmer_url\">Porter Stemmer</a>），它可以在「搜尋」模組中比對 walk、walking 和 walked 這類字組。另一種方法是使用內建詞幹分析或局部字組比對特性的協力廠商搜尋技術，例如 <a href=\":solr_url\">Apache Solr</a> 或 <a href=\":sphinx_url\">Sphinx</a>。還有一些提供的模組也會提供其他搜尋頁面。您可以造訪 Drupal.org 來下載這些<a href=\":contrib-search\">搜尋相關的提供模組</a>。"

