msgid "The maximum number of items indexed in each run of the <a href=\":cron\">cron maintenance task</a>. If necessary, reduce the number of items to prevent timeouts and memory errors while indexing. Some search page types may have their own setting for this."
msgstr "每一次執行 <a href=\":cron\">cron 維護作業</a>時編製索引的項目數上限。必要的話，請減少項目數，以防止編製索引時發生逾時及記憶體錯誤。在這方面，部分搜尋頁面類型可能會有自己的設定。"

msgid "Default indexing settings"
msgstr "預設索引設定"

msgid "<p>Search pages that use an index may use the default index provided by the Search module, or they may use a different indexing mechanism. These settings are for the default index. <em>Changing these settings will cause the default search index to be rebuilt to reflect the new settings. Searching will continue to work, based on the existing index, but new content won't be indexed until all existing content has been re-indexed.</em></p><p><em>The default settings should be appropriate for the majority of sites.</em></p>"
msgstr "<p>使用索引的搜尋頁面可能使用「搜尋」模組所提供的預設索引，也可能使用不同的索引機制。這些設定適用於預設索引。<em>變更這些設定會導致重建預設搜尋索引，以反映新的設定。搜尋會根據現有索引繼續運作，但必須等到現有內容全部都重新編製索引之後，才會將新的內容編製索引。</em></p><p><em>預設值應該適用於大多數網站。</em></p>"

msgid "The minimum character length for a word to be added to the index. Searches must include a keyword of at least this length."
msgstr "新增至索引的字組必須符合的字元長度下限。搜尋包括的關鍵字必須至少是此長度。"

msgid "Whether to apply a simple Chinese/Japanese/Korean tokenizer based on overlapping sequences. Turn this off if you want to use an external preprocessor for this instead. Does not affect other languages."
