msgstr "此搜尋頁面的標籤。"

msgid "The search page path must be unique."
msgstr "搜尋頁面路徑必須是唯一的。"

msgid "Search for @keywords"
msgstr "搜尋 @keywords"

msgid "Search looks for exact, case-insensitive keywords; keywords shorter than a minimum length are ignored."
msgstr "搜尋會尋找完全相符、不區分大小寫的關鍵字；比最小長度更短的關鍵字會被忽略。"

msgid "Use upper-case OR to get more results. Example: cat OR dog (content contains either \"cat\" or \"dog\")."
msgstr "請使用大寫 OR 來取得更多結果。範例：cat OR dog（內容包含 \"cat\" 或 \"dog\"）。"

msgid "You can use upper-case AND to require all words, but this is the same as the default behavior. Example: cat AND dog (same as cat dog, content must contain both \"cat\" and \"dog\")."
msgstr "您可以使用大寫 AND 表示需要所有字組，但這與預設行為相同。範例：cat AND dog（同於 cat dog，內容必須同時包含 \"cat\" 和 \"dog\"）。"

msgid "Use quotes to search for a phrase. Example: \"the cat eats mice\"."
msgstr "請使用引號來搜尋詞組。範例：\"the cat eats mice\"。"

msgid "You can precede keywords by - to exclude them; you must still have at least one \"positive\" keyword. Example: cat -dog (content must contain cat and cannot contain dog)."
msgstr "您可以在關鍵字之前加上 - 以排除關鍵字；您仍必須至少有一個「確定的」關鍵字。範例：cat -dog（內容必須包含 cat，但不得包含 dog）。"

msgid "The search page that the form submits to, or Default for the default search page."
msgstr "表單提交至的搜尋頁面，或預設搜尋頁面的預設值。"

msgid "Search form"
msgstr "搜尋表單"

msgid "Forms"
msgstr "表單"

msgid "The module providing a search page."
msgstr "提供搜尋頁面的模組。"

msgid "Whether or not this module is enabled for search."
msgstr "是否啟用此模組進行搜尋。"

msgid "Show All"
msgstr "全部顯示"

msgid "Show None"
msgstr "不顯示"

msgid "Provides a row plugin to display search results."
msgstr "提供一列外掛來顯示搜尋結果."

msgid "The Serialization module provides a service for serializing and deserializing data to and from formats such as JSON and XML."
msgstr "「序列化」模組提供的服務可在不同格式（例如 JSON 和 XML）來回將資料序列化及解除序列化。"

msgid "Serialization is the process of converting data structures like arrays and objects into a string. This allows the data to be represented in a way that is easy to exchange and store (for example, for transmission over the Internet or for storage in a local file system). These representations can then be deserialized to get back to the original data structures."
msgstr "序列化是將陣列和物件之類的資料結構轉換為字串的程序。這可讓資料以易於交換及儲存（例如，透過網際網路傳輸或儲存在本端檔案系統中）的方式呈現。然後，這些呈現的資料可以解除序列化，而回復為原始資料結構。"

msgid "The serializer splits this process into two parts. Normalization converts an object to a normalized array structure. Encoding takes that array and converts it to a string."
msgstr "序列化程式將此程序分成兩部分。正規化會將物件轉換為正規化陣列結構。編碼會接著將該陣列轉換為字串。"

msgid "This module does not have a user interface. It is used by other modules which need to serialize data, such as <a href=\":rest\">REST</a>."
msgstr "此模組沒有使用者介面。其他需要將資料序列化的模組也會使用此模組，例如 <a href=\":rest\">REST</a>。"

msgid "For more information, see the <a href=\":doc_url\">online documentation for the Serialization module</a>."
msgstr "如需相關資訊，請參閱<a href=\":doc_url\">「序列化」模組的線上文件</a>。"

msgid "Serialization"
msgstr "序列化"

msgid "Provides a service for converting data to and from formats such as JSON and XML."
msgstr "提供一項可將資料轉換成 JSON 和 XML 之類的格式，以及從這些格式轉換成資料的服務。"

msgid "The Settings Tray module allows users with the <a href=\":administer_block_permission\">Administer blocks</a> and <a href=\":contextual_permission\">Use contextual links</a> permissions to edit blocks without visiting a separate page. For more information, see the <a href=\":handbook_url\">online documentation for the Settings Tray module</a>."
msgstr "「設定匣」模組可讓具有<a href=\":administer_block_permission\">管理區塊</a>及<a href=\":contextual_permission\">使用環境定義鏈結</a>權限的使用者，編輯區塊而不必造訪個別頁面。如需相關資訊，請參閱<a href=\":handbook_url\">設定匣模組的線上文件</a>。"

msgid "Editing blocks in place"
msgstr "就地編輯區塊"

msgid "To edit blocks in place, either click the <strong>Edit</strong> button in the toolbar and then click on the block, or choose \"Quick edit\" from the block's contextual link. (See the <a href=\":contextual\">Contextual Links module help</a> for more information about how to use contextual links.)"
msgstr "若要就地編輯區塊，請按一下工具列中的<strong>編輯</strong>按鈕，然後按一下區塊，或從區塊的環境定義鏈結中選擇「快速編輯」。（如需如何使用環境定義鏈結的相關資訊，請參閱<a href=\":contextual\">環境定義鏈結模組說明</a>。）"

msgid "The Settings Tray for the block will open in a sidebar, with a compact form for configuring what the block shows."
msgstr "區塊的「設定匣」會在資訊看板中開啟，其中包含用於配置區塊顯示內容的簡潔表單。"

msgid "Save the form and the changes will be immediately visible on the page."
msgstr "儲存表單便可在頁面上立即看到變更。"

msgid "Quick edit settings"
msgstr "快速編輯設定"

msgid "Settings Tray"
msgstr "設定匣"

msgid "Allows users to directly edit the configuration of blocks on the current page."
msgstr "容許使用者直接編輯現行頁面上的區塊配置。"

msgid "Quick edit"
msgstr "快速編輯"

msgid "Editing"
msgstr "編輯"

msgid "Exited edit mode."
msgstr "已結束編輯模式。"

msgid "Configure @block"
msgstr "配置 @block"

msgid "Advanced block options"
msgstr "進階區塊選項"

msgid "Block title"
msgstr "區塊標題"

msgid "Display block title"
msgstr "顯示區塊標題"

msgid "Save @block"
msgstr "儲存 @block"

msgid "The Shortcut module allows users to create sets of <em>shortcut</em> links to commonly-visited pages of the site. Shortcuts are contained within <em>sets</em>. Each user with <em>Select any shortcut set</em> permission can select a shortcut set created by anyone at the site. For more information, see the <a href=\":shortcut\">online documentation for the Shortcut module</a>."
msgstr "「捷徑」模組讓使用者可以建立幾組<em>捷徑</em>鏈結，以指向經常造訪的網站頁面。捷徑位於<em>集</em>之內。每一個具有<em>選取任何捷徑集</em>權限的使用者，都可以選取任何人在網站上所建立的捷徑集。如需相關資訊，請參閱<a href=\":shortcut\">「捷徑」模組的線上文件</a>。"

msgid "Administering shortcuts"
msgstr "管理捷徑"

msgid "Users with the <em>Administer shortcuts</em> permission can manage shortcut sets and edit the shortcuts within sets from the <a href=\":shortcuts\">Shortcuts administration page</a>."
msgstr "具有<em>管理捷徑</em>權限的使用者，可以從<a href=\":shortcuts\">「捷徑」管理頁面</a>來管理捷徑集並編輯捷徑集之內的捷徑。"

msgid "Choosing shortcut sets"
msgstr "選擇捷徑組"

msgid "Users with permission to switch shortcut sets can choose a shortcut set to use from the Shortcuts tab of their user account page."
msgstr "具有權限的使用者可以從使用者帳號頁面中的捷徑標籤選定一個捷徑套組來切換捷徑套組。"

msgid "Adding and removing shortcuts"
msgstr "新增及刪除捷徑"

msgid "The Shortcut module creates an add/remove link for each page on your site; the link lets you add or remove the current page from the currently-enabled set of shortcuts (if your theme displays it and you have permission to edit your shortcut set). The core Claro administration theme displays this link next to the page title, as a gray or yellow star. If you click on the gray star, you will add that page to your preferred set of shortcuts. If the page is already part of your shortcut set, the link will be a yellow star, and will allow you to remove the current page from your shortcut set."
msgstr "「捷徑」模組會為網站上的每一個頁面建立「新增/移除」鏈結；此鏈結讓您可以在目前啟用的捷徑集中新增或移除現行頁面（如果佈景主題顯示此頁面，而且您有權編輯捷徑集）。 核心 Claro 管理佈景主題會在頁面標題旁邊以灰色或黃色星號顯示此鏈結。 如果按一下灰色星號，則會將該頁面新增至您偏好的捷徑集。 如果此頁面已是捷徑集的一部分，則鏈結為黃色星號，讓您可以從捷徑集中移除現行頁面。"

msgid "Displaying shortcuts"
msgstr "顯示捷徑"

msgid "You can display your shortcuts by enabling the <em>Shortcuts</em> block on the <a href=\":blocks\">Blocks administration page</a>. Certain administrative modules also display your shortcuts; for example, the core <a href=\":toolbar-help\">Toolbar module</a> provides a corresponding menu link."
msgstr "您可以在<a href=\":blocks\">「區塊」管理頁面</a>上啟用<em>捷徑</em>區塊來顯示您的捷徑。某些管理模組也會顯示您的捷徑；例如，核心<a href=\":toolbar-help\">工具列模組</a>會提供對應的功能表鏈結。"

msgid "Define which shortcut set you are using on the <a href=\":shortcut-link\">Shortcuts tab</a> of your account page."
msgstr "定義你要在使用者頁面裡的<a href=\":shortcut-link\">捷徑標籤</a> 組合。"

