msgid "The SQLite module provides the connection between Drupal and a SQLite database. For more information, see the <a href=\":sqlite\">online documentation for the SQLite module</a>."
msgstr "SQLite 模組提供 Drupal 與 SQLite 資料庫之間的連線。 如需相關資訊，請參閱<a href=\":sqlite\"> SQLite 模組的線上文件</a>。"

msgid "SQLite"
msgstr "SQLite"

msgid "Provides the SQLite database driver."
msgstr "提供 SQLite 資料庫驅動程式。"

msgid "Database file"
msgstr "資料庫檔案"

msgid "The absolute path to the file where @drupal data will be stored. This must be writable by the web server and should exist outside of the web root."
msgstr "檔案絕對路徑的 @drupal 數據將被儲存。但前提是其對於網路伺服器和可能存在的外部網站根目錄，必須是可寫入的狀態。"

msgid "Failed to open or create database file %database. The database engine reports the following message when attempting to create the database: %error."
msgstr "無法開啟或建立資料庫檔案 %database。嘗試建立資料庫時，資料庫引擎報告下列訊息：%error。"

msgid "Failed to connect to database. The database engine reports the following message: %error.<ul><li>Does the database file exist?</li><li>Does web server have permission to write to the database file?</li>Does the web server have permission to write to the directory the database file should be created in?</li></ul>"
msgstr "無法連接至資料庫。資料庫引擎報告下列訊息：%error。<ul><li>資料庫檔案是否存在？</li><li>Web 伺服器是否具有寫入資料庫檔案的權限？</li>Web 伺服器是否有權寫入應在其中建立資料庫檔案的目錄？</li></ul>"

msgid "Number of views"
msgstr "瀏覽次數"

msgid "The number of visitors who have read the node."
msgstr "讀過該節點的遊客人數。"

