msgid "Relate nodes to taxonomy terms, specifying which vocabulary or vocabularies to use. This relationship will cause duplicated records if there are multiple terms."
msgstr "將節點與分類架構術語相關聯，並指定一或數個要使用的詞彙。如果有多個術語，此關係會造成重複的記錄。"

