msgid "Translation of either the name or the description."
msgstr "名稱或說明的翻譯。"

msgid "Language code from locales_target table"
msgstr "來自 locales_target 表格的語言碼"

msgid "The depth will match nodes tagged with terms in the hierarchy. For example, if you have the term \"fruit\" and a child term \"apple\", with a depth of 1 (or higher) then filtering for the term \"fruit\" will get nodes that are tagged with \"apple\" as well as \"fruit\". If negative, the reverse is true; searching for \"apple\" will also pick up nodes tagged with \"fruit\" if depth is -1 (or lower)."
msgstr "深度會在階層中比對以術語標記的節點。例如，如果您有術語 \"fruit\" 和子項術語 \"apple\"，且深度為 1（或更高），則過濾術語 \"fruit\" 可取得以 \"apple\" 及 \"fruit\" 標記的節點。如果是負數，則剛好相反；如果深度為 -1（或更低），則搜尋 \"apple\" 也會挑選以 \"fruit\" 標記的節點。"

msgid "If selected, users can enter multiple values in the form of 1+2+3. Due to the number of JOINs it would require, AND will be treated as OR with this filter."
msgstr "如果已選取，則使用者可以輸入多個值，格式為 1+2+3。由於所需的 JOIN 次數，此過濾器會將 AND 視為 OR。"

msgid "No name"
msgstr "無名稱"

msgid "No vocabulary"
msgstr "沒有詞彙"

msgid "Filter to items that share all terms"
msgstr "過濾出共用所有術語的項目"

msgid "Filter to items that share any term"
msgstr "過濾出共用任何術語的項目"

msgid "Taxonomy term name"
msgstr "分類架構術語名稱"

msgid "The taxonomy term ID for the term."
msgstr "術語的分類架構術語 ID。"

msgid "The taxonomy term name for the term."
msgstr "術語的分類架構術語名稱。"

msgid "The machine name for the vocabulary the term belongs to."
msgstr "術語所屬詞彙的機器名稱。"

msgid "The name for the vocabulary the term belongs to."
msgstr "術語所屬詞彙的名稱。"

msgid "Select which vocabulary to show terms for in the regular options."
msgstr "選取在一般選項中用於顯示術語的詞彙。"

msgid "Dropdown"
msgstr "下拉選單"

msgid "An invalid vocabulary is selected. Please change it in the options."
msgstr "選取的詞彙無效。請在選項中變更此詞彙。"

msgid "Select terms from vocabulary @voc"
msgstr "從詞彙 @voc 中選取術語"

msgid "Select terms"
msgstr "選擇項目"

msgid "Leave blank for all. Otherwise, the first selected term will be the default instead of \"Any\"."
msgstr "保留空白，表示全部。否則，第一個選取的術語會被當作預設值，而不是「任何」。"

msgid "Is one of"
msgstr "屬於其中之一"

msgid "Choose which vocabularies you wish to relate. Remember that every term found will create a new record, so this relationship is best used on just one vocabulary that has only one term per node."
msgstr "選擇想要關聯的詞彙。請記住，找到的每個術語都會建立一筆新記錄，所以此關係最好只用於一個詞彙，且其中每個節點只有一個術語。"

msgid "The Telephone module allows you to create fields that contain telephone numbers. See the <a href=\":field\">Field module help</a> and the <a href=\":field_ui\">Field UI help</a> pages for general information on fields and how to create and manage them. For more information, see the <a href=\":telephone_documentation\">online documentation for the Telephone module</a>."
msgstr "「電話」模組讓您可以建立包含電話號碼的欄位。如需欄位的一般資訊和如何建立及管理欄位的相關資訊，請參閱<a href=\":field\">「欄位」模組說明</a>和<a href=\":field_ui\">「欄位使用者介面」說明</a>頁面。如需相關資訊，請參閱<a href=\":telephone_documentation\">「電話」模組的線上文件</a>。"

msgid "Managing and displaying telephone fields"
msgstr "管理及顯示電話欄位"

msgid "The <em>settings</em> and the <em>display</em> of the telephone field can be configured separately. See the <a href=\":field_ui\">Field UI help</a> for more information on how to manage fields and their display."
msgstr "電話欄位的<em>設定</em>和<em>顯示</em>可以個別配置。如需如何管理欄位及其顯示畫面的相關資訊，請參閱<a href=\":field_ui\">「欄位使用者介面」說明</a>。"

msgid "Displaying telephone numbers as links"
msgstr "將電話號碼顯示為鏈結"

msgid "Telephone numbers can be displayed as links with the scheme name <em>tel:</em> by choosing the <em>Telephone</em> display format on the <em>Manage display</em> page. Any spaces will be stripped out of the link text. This semantic markup improves the user experience on mobile and assistive technology devices."
msgstr "您可以在<em>管理顯示</em>頁面上選擇<em>電話</em>顯示格式，將電話號碼顯示為具有架構名稱 <em>tel:</em> 的鏈結。任何空格都會從鏈結文字中刪除。此語意標記可改善行動式裝置和輔助技術裝置的使用體驗。"

msgid "Telephone"
msgstr "電話"

msgid "Defines a field type for telephone numbers."
msgstr "定義電話號碼的欄位類型。"

msgid "Telephone link format settings"
msgstr "電話鏈結格式設定"

msgid "Title to replace basic numeric telephone number display"
msgstr "用來取代基本數值電話號碼顯示的標題"

msgid "Telephone default format settings"
msgstr "電話預設格式設定"

msgid "Link using text: @title"
msgstr "使用文字的鏈結：@title"

msgid "Link using provided telephone number."
msgstr "使用所提供電話號碼的鏈結。"

msgid "Telephone link"
msgstr "電話連結"

msgid "%name: the telephone number may not be longer than @max characters."
msgstr "%name：電話號碼的長度不得超過 @max 個字元。"

msgid "Telephone number"
msgstr "電話號碼"

msgid "This field stores a telephone number in the database."
msgstr "此欄位會將電話號碼儲存在資料庫中。"

msgid "The Text module allows you to create short and long text fields with optional summaries. See the <a href=\":field\">Field module help</a> and the <a href=\":field_ui\">Field UI help</a> pages for general information on fields and how to create and manage them. For more information, see the <a href=\":text_documentation\">online documentation for the Text module</a>."
msgstr "「文字」模組讓您可以建立附有選用摘要的短文字和長文字欄位。如需欄位的一般資訊和如何建立及管理欄位的相關資訊，請參閱<a href=\":field\">「欄位」模組說明</a>和<a href=\":field_ui\">「欄位使用者介面」說明</a>頁面。如需相關資訊，請參閱<a href=\":text_documentation\">「文字」模組的線上文件</a>。"

msgid "Managing and displaying text fields"
msgstr "管理及顯示文字欄位"

msgid "The <em>settings</em> and <em>display</em> of the text field can be configured separately. See the <a href=\":field_ui\">Field UI help</a> for more information on how to manage fields and their display."
msgstr "文字欄位的<em>設定</em>和<em>顯示</em>可以個別配置。如需如何管理欄位及其顯示畫面的相關資訊，請參閱<a href=\":field_ui\">「欄位使用者介面」說明</a>。"

msgid "Creating short text fields"
msgstr "建立短文字欄位"

msgid "If you choose <em>Text (plain)</em> or <em>Text (formatted)</em> as the field type on the <em>Manage fields</em> page, then a field with a single row is displayed. You can change the maximum text length in the <em>Field settings</em> when you set up the field."
msgstr "如果您在<em>管理欄位</em>頁面上選擇<em>文字（一般）</em>或<em>文字（格式化）</em>作為欄位類型，則會顯示具有單一列的欄位。您可以在設定欄位時，在<em>欄位設定</em>中變更文字長度上限。"

msgid "Creating long text fields"
msgstr "建立長文字欄位"

msgid "If you choose <em>Text (plain, long)</em>, <em>Text (formatted, long)</em>, or <em>Text (formatted, long, with summary)</em> on the <em>Manage fields</em> page, then users can insert text of unlimited length. On the <em>Manage form display</em> page, you can set the number of rows that are displayed to users."
msgstr "如果您在<em>管理欄位</em>頁面上選擇<em>文字（一般、長）</em>、<em>文字（格式化、長）</em>或<em>文字（格式化、長、附有摘要）</em>，則使用者可插入不限長度的文字。在<em>管理表單顯示</em>頁面上，您可以設定要對使用者顯示的列數。"

msgid "Trimming the text length"
msgstr "修整文字長度"

msgid "On the <em>Manage display</em> page you can choose to display a trimmed version of the text, and if so, where to cut off the text."
msgstr "在<em>管理顯示</em>頁面上，您可以選擇顯示經過修整的文字，並選擇要從何處截斷文字。"

msgid "Displaying summaries instead of trimmed text"
msgstr "顯示摘要而非修整的文字"

msgid "As an alternative to using a trimmed version of the text, you can enter a separate summary by choosing the <em>Text (formatted, long, with summary)</em> field type on the <em>Manage fields</em> page. Even when <em>Summary input</em> is enabled, and summaries are provided, you can display <em>trimmed</em> text nonetheless by choosing the appropriate format on the <em>Manage display</em> page."
msgstr "除了使用經過修整的文字以外，您也可以在<em>管理欄位</em>頁面上選擇<em>文字（格式化、長、附有摘要）</em>欄位類型，以輸入個別的摘要。即使已啟用<em>摘要輸入</em>，並且提供了摘要，您仍可在<em>管理顯示</em>頁面上選擇適當的格式，以顯示<em>修整的</em>文字。"

msgid "Using text formats and editors"
msgstr "使用文字格式和編輯器"

msgid "If you choose <em>Text (plain)</em> or <em>Text (plain, long)</em> you restrict the input to <em>Plain text</em> only. If you choose <em>Text (formatted)</em>, <em>Text (formatted, long)</em>, or <em>Text (formatted, long with summary)</em> you allow users to write formatted text. Which options are available to individual users depends on the settings on the <a href=\":formats\">Text formats and editors page</a>."
msgstr "如果您選擇<em>文字（一般）</em>或<em>文字（一般、長）</em>，則會將輸入限定為<em>純文字</em>。如果您選擇<em>文字（格式化）</em>、<em>文字（格式化、長）</em>或<em>文字（格式化、長、附有摘要）</em>，您將容許使用者寫入格式化文字。個別使用者有哪些可用選項，取決於<a href=\":formats\">文字格式和編輯器頁面</a>上的設定。"

msgid "Edit summary"
msgstr "編輯摘要"

msgid "Hide summary"
msgstr "隱藏摘要"

msgid "Defines field types for short and long text with optional summaries."
msgstr "定義具有選用摘要的短文字和長文字的欄位類型。"

