msgid "If the summary is not set, the trimmed %label field will end at the last full sentence before this character limit."
msgstr "如果未設定摘要，則修整 %label 欄位將結束在此字元限制之前的最後一個完整句子上。"

msgid "Trimmed limit: @trim_length characters"
