msgid "Tours guide you through workflows or explain concepts on various user interface pages. The tours with links in this list are on user interface landing pages; the tours without links will show on individual pages (such as when editing a View using the Views UI module). Available tours:"
msgstr "「導覽」會在各種使用者介面頁面上引導您逐步執行工作流程或說明概念。下列清單中附有鏈結的導覽位於使用者介面登入頁面；無鏈結的導覽則會顯示在個別頁面（例如，使用「視圖使用者介面」模組來編輯「視圖」時）。可用的導覽："

msgid "Tracker"
msgstr "過往文章"

msgid "The node ID of the node."
msgstr "節點 ID。"

msgid "Whether or not the node is published."
msgstr "節點是否已發佈。"

msgid "The date the node was last updated."
msgstr "節點的最近更新日期。"

msgid "Tracker - User"
msgstr "追蹤器 - 使用者"

msgid "The node ID of the node a user created or commented on. You must use an argument or filter on UID or you will get misleading results using this field."
msgstr "使用者建立或評論之節點的節點 ID。您必須在 UID 上使用引數或過濾器，否則使用此欄位時會得到誤導的結果。"

msgid "Uid"
msgstr "Uid"

msgid "The user ID of a user who touched the node (either created or commented on it)."
msgstr "接觸節點之使用者的使用者 ID（建立或評論）。"

msgid "Whether or not the node is published. You must use an argument or filter on UID or you will get misleading results using this field."
msgstr "節點是否已發佈。您必須在 UID 上使用引數或過濾器，否則使用此欄位時會得到誤導的結果。"

msgid "The date the node was last updated or commented on. You must use an argument or filter on UID or you will get misleading results using this field."
msgstr "節點前次更新或評論的日期。您必須在 UID 上使用引數或過濾器，否則使用此欄位時會得到誤導的結果。"

msgid "Display nodes only if a user posted the node or commented on the node."
msgstr "只有在使用者已張貼節點或節點上的回應時才顯示節點。"

msgid "The Activity Tracker module displays the most recently added and updated content on your site, and allows you to follow new content created by each user. This module has no configuration options. For more information, see the <a href=\":tracker\">online documentation for the Activity Tracker module</a>."
msgstr "「活動追蹤器」模組可顯示網站上最近新增及更新的內容，還讓您可以追蹤每一個使用者所建立的新內容。此模組不具有配置選項。如需相關資訊，請參閱<a href=\":tracker\">「活動追蹤器」模組的線上文件</a>。"

msgid "Tracking new and updated site content"
msgstr "追蹤新增及已更新的網站內容"

msgid "The <a href=\":recent\">Recent content</a> page shows new and updated content in reverse chronological order, listing the content type, title, author's name, number of comments, and time of last update. Content is considered updated when changes occur in the text, or when new comments are added. The <em>My recent content</em> tab limits the list to the currently logged-in user."
msgstr "<a href=\":recent\">最新內容</a>頁面會依反向時間順序顯示新增及更新的內容，列出內容類型、標題、作者名稱、評論次數及前次更新時間。文字變更或加入新評論時，即視為內容更新。<em>我的最新內容</em>欄標會限制只有目前登入的使用者才能看到清單。"

msgid "Tracking user-specific content"
msgstr "追蹤特定使用者內容"

msgid "To follow a specific user's new and updated content, select the <em>Activity</em> tab from the user's profile page."
msgstr "若要追蹤特定使用者新增及更新的內容，請從使用者的設定檔頁面中選取<em>活動</em>欄標。"

msgid "Indexed %count content items for tracking."
msgstr "索引的%count內容項可供跟蹤。"

msgid "Activity Tracker"
msgstr "活動追蹤器"

msgid "Displays recently added and updated content."
msgstr "顯示最近新增及更新的內容。"

