msgid "What displays of recently-updated content are available?"
msgstr "可用的最近更新內容的顯示畫面有哪些？"

msgid "Assuming that you have the core Activity Tracker module installed, these pages that show recently-updated content are available:"
msgstr "假設您已安裝核心「活動追蹤器」模組，則顯示最近更新內容的下列頁面將可用："

msgid "@recent_link: Shows the content that has been most recently added, updated, or commented on."
msgstr "@recent_link：顯示最近新增、更新或評論的內容。"

msgid "The <em>My recent content</em> tab on the <em>Recent content</em> page (for logged-in users) limits the list to content created or commented on by the user viewing the page."
msgstr "<em>最近內容</em>頁面上的<em>我的最近內容</em>標籤（用於登入使用者）將清單限制為檢視頁面的使用者建立或評論的內容。"

msgid "The <em>Activity</em> tab on a user profile shows the same list for the user whose profile is being viewed."
msgstr "使用者設定檔上的<em>活動</em>標籤顯示正在檢視其設定檔之使用者的相同清單。"

