msgid "The User module allows users to register, log in, and log out. It also allows users with proper permissions to manage user roles and permissions. For more information, see the <a href=\":user_docs\">online documentation for the User module</a>."
msgstr "「使用者」模組可讓使用者登錄、登入及登出。它也可讓具有適當權限的使用者管理使用者角色和權限。如需相關資訊，請參閱<a href=\":user_docs\">「使用者」模組的線上文件</a>。"

msgid "Creating and managing users"
msgstr "建立並管理使用者"

msgid "Through the <a href=\":people\">People administration page</a> you can add and cancel user accounts and assign users to roles. By editing one particular user you can change their username, email address, password, and information in other fields."
msgstr "您可以藉由<a href=\":people\">使用者管理頁面</a>新增、撤銷使用者帳號以及指定使用者角色。在單一使用者編輯頁中，您也可以改變使用者登入名稱、Email 位址、密碼以及其他使用者資訊欄位。"

msgid "Configuring user roles"
msgstr "配置使用者角色"

msgid "<em>Roles</em> are used to group and classify users; each user can be assigned one or more roles. Typically there are two pre-defined roles: <em>Anonymous user</em> (users that are not logged in), and <em>Authenticated user</em> (users that are registered and logged in). Depending on how your site was set up, an <em>Administrator</em> role may also be available: users with this role will automatically be assigned any new permissions whenever a module is enabled. You can create additional roles on the <a href=\":roles\">Roles administration page</a>."
msgstr "<em>角色</em>可用來將使用者分組及分類；每一個使用者都可以獲指派一個以上角色。通常會有兩個預先定義的角色：<em>匿名使用者</em>（未登入的使用者）和<em>已鑑別使用者</em>（已登錄並登入的使用者）。取決於您網站的設定方式，<em>管理者</em>角色可能也可供使用：每當模組啟用時，就會自動將任何新權限指派給具有此角色的使用者。您可以在<a href=\":roles\">「角色」管理頁面</a>中建立其他角色。"

msgid "Setting permissions"
msgstr "設定權限"

msgid "After creating roles, you can set permissions for each role on the <a href=\":permissions_user\">Permissions page</a>. Granting a permission allows users who have been assigned a particular role to perform an action on the site, such as viewing content, editing or creating  a particular type of content, administering settings for a particular module, or using a particular function of the site (such as search)."
msgstr "建立角色之後，您可以在<a href=\":permissions_user\">「權限」頁面</a>設定每一個角色的權限。授與權限可讓已獲指派特定角色的使用者能夠在網站上執行某個動作，例如檢視內容、編輯或建立特定類型的內容、管理特定模組的設定，或使用網站的特定功能（例如搜尋）。"

msgid "Other permissions pages"
msgstr "其他許可權頁面"

msgid "The main Permissions page can be overwhelming, so each module that defines permissions has its own page for setting them. There are links to these pages on the <a href=\":modules\">Extend page</a>. When editing a content type, vocabulary, etc., there is also a Manage permissions tab for permissions related to that configuration."
msgstr "主要「許可權」頁面可能過於龐大，因此每一個定義許可權的模組都有自己的頁面來設定許可權。 <a href=\":modules\">延伸頁面</a>上有指向這些頁面的鏈結。 在編輯內容類型、詞彙等時， 還有一個「管理許可權」標籤，含有與該配置相關的許可權。"

msgid "Managing account settings"
msgstr "管理使用者設定"

msgid "The <a href=\":accounts\">Account settings page</a> allows you to manage settings for the displayed name of the Anonymous user role, personal contact forms, user registration settings, and account cancellation settings. On this page you can also manage settings for account personalization, and adapt the text for the email messages that users receive when they register or request a password recovery. You may also set which role is automatically assigned new permissions whenever a module is enabled (the Administrator role)."
msgstr "<a href=\":accounts\">「帳戶設定」頁面</a>可讓您管理「匿名」使用者角色的顯示名稱設定、個人聯絡表單、使用者登錄設定以及帳戶取消設定。在此頁面中，您也可以管理帳戶個人化的設定，以及調整使用者在登錄或要求密碼回復時所接收到的電子郵件訊息文字。您也可以設定哪個角色在模組啟用時即會自動獲指派新權限（「管理者」角色）。"

msgid "Managing user account fields"
msgstr "管理使用者帳號欄位"

msgid "Because User accounts are an entity type, you can extend them by adding fields through the Manage fields tab on the <a href=\":accounts\">Account settings page</a>. By adding fields for e.g., a picture, a biography, or address, you can a create a custom profile for the users of the website. For background information on entities and fields, see the <a href=\":field_help\">Field module help page</a>."
msgstr "使用者帳號屬於一種實體類型，因此您可以在<a href=\":accounts\">使用者設定頁面</a>的欄位管理頁籤中新增欄位，例如照片、個人簡介或是地址，藉此建立自訂的網站使用者頁面。想了解關於實體與欄位的背景資訊，請參考<a href=\":field_help\">Field module help page</a>。"

msgid "This web page allows administrators to register new users. Users' email addresses and usernames must be unique."
msgstr "此網頁可讓管理者登錄新的使用者。使用者的電子郵件位址和使用者名稱必須是唯一的。"

msgid "Permissions let you control what users can do and see on your site. You can define a specific set of permissions for each role. (See the <a href=\":role\">Roles</a> page to create a role.) Any permissions granted to the Authenticated user role will be given to any user who is logged in to your site. On the <a href=\":settings\">Role settings</a> page, you can make any role into an Administrator role for the site, meaning that role will be granted all permissions. You should be careful to ensure that only trusted users are given this access and level of control of your site."
msgstr "權限可讓您控制使用者在您的網站上可執行的動作和查看的項目。 您可以為每一個角色定義一組特定的權限。 （若要建立角色，請參閱<a href=\":role\">角色</a>頁面。） 任何授與「已鑑別」使用者角色的權限，都將指定給任何已登入您網站的使用者。 在<a href=\":settings\">角色設定</a>頁面上，您可以將任何角色設為網站的「管理者」角色，這表示該角色將獲授與所有許可權。 您應謹慎操作，以確保只有受信任的使用者會獲得對您網站的這種存取權和控制層次。"

msgid "A role defines a group of users that have certain privileges. These privileges are defined on the <a href=\":permissions\">Permissions page</a>. Here, you can define the names and the display sort order of the roles on your site. It is recommended to order roles from least permissive (for example, Anonymous user) to most permissive (for example, Administrator user). Users who are not logged in have the Anonymous user role. Users who are logged in have the Authenticated user role, plus any other roles granted to their user account."
msgstr "角色會定義具有特定專用權的使用者群組。這些專用權定義於<a href=\":permissions\">「權限」頁面</a>上。在此處，您可以定義網站上各角色的名稱和顯示排序。建議您將角色從權限最低的（例如，「匿名」使用者）排序到權限最高的（例如，「管理者」使用者）。未登入的使用者會具有「匿名」使用者角色。已登入的使用者會具有「已鑑別」使用者角色，以及任何授與其使用者帳戶的其他角色。"

msgid "This form lets administrators add and edit fields for storing user data."
