msgstr "資料金鑰的名稱。"

msgid "Is the logged in user"
msgstr "已登入使用者"

msgid "Usernames"
msgstr "使用者名稱"

msgid "Enter a comma separated list of user names."
msgstr "輸入以逗號分隔的使用者名稱列表。"

msgid "Only has the 'authenticated user' role"
msgstr "僅具有「已鑑別使用者」角色"

msgid "Has roles in addition to 'authenticated user'"
msgstr "具有「已鑑別使用者」以外的角色"

msgid "Tokens related to views."
msgstr "與視圖相關的記號。"

msgid "The label of the view."
msgstr "視圖的標籤。"

msgid "The description of the view."
msgstr "視圖的說明。"

msgid "The machine-readable ID of the view."
msgstr "視圖的機器可讀 ID。"

msgid "The title of current display of the view."
msgstr "視圖現行顯示畫面的標題。"

msgid "The URL of the view."
msgstr "View 的 URL。"

msgid "Base table"
msgstr "基資料表"

msgid "The base table used for this view."
msgstr "用於此視圖的基本表格。"

msgid "Base field"
msgstr "基本欄位"

msgid "The base field used for this view."
msgstr "用於此視圖的基本欄位。"

msgid "Total rows"
msgstr "總計列"

msgid "The total amount of results returned from the view. The current display will be used."
msgstr "從視圖傳回的結果總數。將使用現行顯示畫面。"

msgid "Items per page"
msgstr "每頁的項目數"

msgid "The number of items per page."
msgstr "每頁的項目數。"

msgid "The current page of results the view is on."
msgstr "視圖目前所在的結果頁面。"

msgid "Page count"
msgstr "頁數"

msgid "The total page count."
msgstr "頁面總計數。"

msgid "Global"
msgstr "全域"

msgid "Random"
msgstr "隨機的"

msgid "Randomize the display order."
msgstr "隨機化顯示順序。"

msgid "Allow a contextual filter value to be ignored. The query will not be altered by this contextual filter value. Can be used when contextual filter values come from the URL, and a part of the URL needs to be ignored."
msgstr "容許忽略環境定義過濾器值。此環境定義過濾器值不會變更查詢。可在環境定義過濾器值來自 URL，且需要忽略 URL 的某部分時使用。"

msgid "Custom text"
msgstr "自定文字"

msgid "Provide custom text or link."
msgstr "提供自訂文字或鏈結。"

msgid "View result counter"
msgstr "檢視結果計數器"

msgid "Displays the actual position of the view result"
msgstr "顯示檢視結果的實際位置"

msgid "Text area"
msgstr "多行文字欄位"

msgid "Provide markup for the area using any available text format."
msgstr "使用任何可用的文字格式來提供區域的標記。"

msgid "Unfiltered text"
msgstr "未過濾的內文"

msgid "Provide markup for the area with minimal filtering."
msgstr "以最少的過濾為區域提供標記。"

msgid "Title override"
msgstr "覆蓋標題"

msgid "Override the default view title for this view. This is useful to display an alternative title when a view is empty."
msgstr "置換此視圖的預設視圖標題。這有助於在空的視圖中顯示替代標題。"

msgid "View area"
msgstr "View 區域"

msgid "Insert a view inside an area."
msgstr "在區域內插入視圖。"

msgid "Result summary"
msgstr "結果摘要"

msgid "Shows result summary, for example the items per page."
msgstr "顯示結果摘要，例如每頁項目數。"

msgid "Displays messages in an area."
msgstr "顯示區域中的訊息。"

msgid "Response status code"
msgstr "回應狀態碼"

msgid "Alter the HTTP response status code used by this view, mostly helpful for empty results."
msgstr "變更此視圖所使用的 HTTP 回應狀態碼，在空的結果中最有效用。"

msgid "Combine fields filter"
msgstr "結合欄位過濾器"

msgid "Combine multiple fields together and search by them."
msgstr "將多個欄位結合在一起，並進行搜尋。"

msgid "Dropbutton"
msgstr "下拉按鈕"

msgid "Display fields in a dropbutton."
msgstr "顯示 Dropbutton 中的欄位。"

msgid "Link to display"
msgstr "要顯示的鏈結"

msgid "Displays a link to a path-based display of this view while keeping the filter criteria, sort criteria, pager settings and contextual filters."
msgstr "顯示指向此視圖之路徑型顯示的鏈結，同時保留過濾準則、排序準則、分頁器設定及環境定義過濾器。"

msgid "Rendered entity - @label"
msgstr "呈現實體 - @label"

msgid "Displays a rendered @label entity in an area."
msgstr "顯示區域中已呈現的 @label 實體。"

msgid "Allows users to apply an action to one or more items."
msgstr "讓使用者可以將一個動作 (action) 套用到一或多個項目上。"

msgid "@group (historical data)"
msgstr "@group（歷程資料）"

msgid "Appears in: @bundles."
msgstr "顯示於：@bundles"

msgid "This is an alias of @group: @field."
msgstr "這是 @group: @field 的別名"

msgid "@group: @field"
msgstr "@group：@field"

msgid "@group (historical data): @field"
msgstr "@group (historical data)：@field"

msgid "Also known as:"
msgstr "也被稱為："

msgid "@label (@name)"
msgstr "@label (@name)"

msgid "@label (@name:@column)"
msgstr "@label (@name：@column)"

msgid "@label:@column"
msgstr "@label：@column"

msgid "- No value -"
msgstr "- 無數值 -"

msgid "@label (@name:delta)"
msgstr "@label (@name:delta)"

msgid "@label:delta"
msgstr "@label:delta"

msgid "Delta - Appears in: @bundles."
msgstr "差異 - 出現在：@bundles。"

msgid "@label referenced from @field_name"
msgstr "從 @field_name 參照的 @label"

msgid "@field_name: @label"
msgstr "@field_name：@label"

msgid "@entity using @field_name"
msgstr "使用 @field_name 的 @entity"

msgid "Relate each @entity with a @field_name set to the @label."
msgstr "建立每一個 @entity 與設為 @label 的 @field_name 的關聯。"

msgid "A non-existent config entity name returned by FieldStorageConfigInterface::getBundles(): entity type: %entity_type, bundle: %bundle, field name: %field"
msgstr "FieldStorageConfigInterface::getBundles() 傳回了不存在的配置實體名稱：實體類型：%entity_type，組合：%bundle，欄位名稱：%field"

msgid "The Views module provides a back end to fetch information from content, user accounts, taxonomy terms, and other entities from the database and present it to the user as a grid, HTML list, table, unformatted list, etc. The resulting displays are known generally as <em>views</em>."
msgstr "「視圖」模組提供了一個後端，可從內容、使用者帳戶、分類架構詞彙和資料庫中的其他實體提取資訊，並以網格、HTML 清單、表格、未格式化清單等形式顯示給使用者。產生的顯示畫面通稱為<em>視圖</em>。"

msgid "For more information, see the <a href=\":views\">online documentation for the Views module</a>."
msgstr "如需相關資訊，請參閱<a href=\":views\">「視圖」模組的線上文件</a>。"

msgid "In order to create and modify your own views using the administration and configuration user interface, you will need to enable either the Views UI module in core or a contributed module that provides a user interface for Views. See the <a href=\":views-ui\">Views UI module help page</a> for more information."
msgstr "若要使用管理和配置使用者介面建立及修改您自己的視圖，您必須啟用核心中的「視圖使用者介面」模組，或是提供「視圖」使用者介面的隨附模組。如需相關資訊，請參閱<a href=\":views-ui\">「視圖使用者介面」模組說明頁面</a>。"

msgid "Adding functionality to administrative pages"
msgstr "將功能新增至管理頁面"

msgid "The Views module adds functionality to some core administration pages. For example, <em>admin/content</em> uses Views to filter and sort content. With Views uninstalled, <em>admin/content</em> is more limited."
msgstr "「視圖」模組可將功能新增至某些核心管理頁面。例如，<em>管理/內容</em>會使用「視圖」來過濾及排序內容。如果將「視圖」解除安裝，<em>管理/內容</em>將更為受限。"

msgid "Expanding Views functionality"
msgstr "展開視圖功能"

msgid "Contributed projects that support the Views module can be found in the <a href=\":node\">online documentation for Views-related contributed modules</a>."
msgstr "您可在<a href=\":node\">視圖相關提供模組的線上文件</a>中找到支援「視圖」模組的提供專案。"

msgid "Improving table accessibility"
msgstr "提高表格的可存取性"

msgid "Views tables include semantic markup to improve accessibility. Data cells are automatically associated with header cells through id and header attributes. To improve the accessibility of your tables you can add descriptive elements within the Views table settings. The <em>caption</em> element can introduce context for a table, making it easier to understand. The <em>summary</em> element can provide an overview of how the data has been organized and how to navigate the table. Both the caption and summary are visible by default and also implemented according to HTML5 guidelines."
msgstr "「視圖」表格包括語意標記，以提高可存取性。資料儲存格會透過 ID 和標頭屬性自動與標頭儲存格產生關聯。若要提升表格的可存取性，您可以在「視圖」表格設定內新增敘述性元素。<em>標題</em>元素可建立表格的環境定義，讓表格更容易瞭解。<em>摘要</em>元素可提供概觀，說明資料的分組方式以及導覽表格的方式。依預設，標題和摘要都會顯示，且都會根據 HTML5 準則實作。"

msgid "Working with multilingual views"
msgstr "使用多語言視圖"

msgid "If your site has multiple languages and translated entities, each result row in a view will contain one translation of each involved entity (a view can involve multiple entities if it uses relationships). You can use a filter to restrict your view to one language: without filtering, if an entity has three translations it will add three rows to the results; if you filter by language, at most one result will appear (it could be zero if that particular entity does not have a translation matching your language filter choice). If a view uses relationships, each entity in the relationship needs to be filtered separately. You can filter a view to a fixed language choice, such as English or Spanish, or to the language selected by the page the view is displayed on (the language that is selected for the page by the language detection settings either for Content or User interface)."
msgstr "如果您的網站有多種語言和翻譯實體，則視圖中的各個結果列將分別包含每一個相關實體的一種翻譯（使用關係的視圖可能會包含多個實體）。您可以使用過濾器將視圖限定為一種語言：未使用過濾時，如果一個實體有三種翻譯，結果中將會新增三列；如果依語言進行過濾，則最多只會出現一個結果（如果該特定實體沒有與您選擇的語言過濾器相符的翻譯，則可能沒有結果）。如果視圖使用關係，則關係中的每一個實體必須個別進行過濾。您可以將視圖過濾為所選擇的固定語言（例如英文或西班牙文），或過濾為顯示視圖的頁面所選取的語言（依據「內容」或「使用者介面」的語言偵測設定為頁面選取的語言）。"

msgid "Because each result row contains a specific translation of each entity, field-level filters are also relative to these entity translations. For example, if your view has a filter that specifies that the entity title should contain a particular English word, you will presumably filter out all rows containing Chinese translations, since they will not contain the English word. If your view also has a second filter specifying that the title should contain a particular Chinese word, and if you are using \"And\" logic for filtering, you will presumably end up with no results in the view, because there are probably not any entity translations containing both the English and Chinese words in the title."
msgstr "因為每一個結果列分別包含每一個實體的特定翻譯，因此欄位層次過濾器也會與這些實體翻譯有關。例如，如果您視圖的過濾器指定實體標題應包含某特定英文字，則您可能會過濾掉所有包含中文翻譯的列，因為這些翻譯不包含英文字。如果您的視圖有第二個過濾器，指定標題中應包含某特定中文字，而您使用了 \"And\" 邏輯進行過濾，則視圖中可能不會有任何結果，因為大概不會有任何實體翻譯在標題中同時包含英文字和中文字。"

msgid "Independent of filtering, you can choose the display language (the language used to display the entities and their fields) via a setting on the display. Your language choices are the same as the filter language choices, with an additional choice of \"Content language of view row\" and \"Original language of content in view row\", which means to display each entity in the result row using the language that entity has or in which it was originally created. In theory, this would give you the flexibility to filter to French translations, for instance, and then display the results in Spanish. The more usual choices would be to use the same language choices for the display language and each entity filter in the view, or to use the Row language setting for the display."
msgstr "在過濾之外，您可以透過顯示畫面的設定來選擇顯示語言（用來顯示實體及其欄位的語言）。語言選擇與過濾器語言選擇相似，只是前者還多出了「視圖列的內容語言」和「視圖列內容的原始語言」這些選擇；其作用是，以實體具備的語言或最初用來建立實體的語言顯示結果列中的每一個實體。理論上，舉例而言，您將因此有足夠的彈性可過濾出法文翻譯，然後以西班牙文顯示結果。更常見的選擇，是將相同的語言選擇用於顯示語言和視圖中的每一個實體過濾器，或是將列語言設定用於顯示畫面。"

