msgstr "使用此網站名稱"

msgid "This view will be displayed by visiting this path on your site. It is recommended that the path be something like \"path/%/%/feed\" or \"path/%/%/rss.xml\", putting one % in the path for each contextual filter you have defined in the view."
msgstr "在您的網站上造訪此路徑，即會顯示這個視圖。建議依照 \"path/%/%/feed\" 或 \"path/%/%/rss.xml\", 形式設定此路徑，在您定義於視圖中的每一個環境定義過濾器的路徑中加入一個 %。"

msgid "Feed"
msgstr "摘要"

msgid "Display the view as a feed, such as an RSS feed."
msgstr "以資訊來源形式顯示視圖，例如 RSS 資訊來源。"

msgid "No menu"
msgstr "沒有選單"

msgid "Normal: @title"
msgstr "正常： @title"

msgid "Tab: @title"
msgstr "頁籤：@title"

msgid "Parent menu link"
msgstr "母項功能表鏈結"

msgid "Change settings for the parent menu"
msgstr "變更父選單設定"

msgid "Yes (admin path)"
msgstr "是（管理路徑）"

msgid "Use the administration theme when rendering this display."
msgstr "呈現此顯示畫面時，請使用管理佈景主題。"

msgid "Menu link entry"
msgstr "功能表鏈結項目"

msgid "No menu entry"
msgstr "沒有功能表項目"

msgid "Normal menu entry"
msgstr "一般選單項目"

msgid "Menu tab"
msgstr "選單頁籤"

msgid "Default menu tab"
msgstr "預設的選單標籤"

msgid "If selected and this menu link has children, the menu will always appear expanded."
msgstr "如果選擇了展開，並且該選單項目還有下層選單，此選單將以展開的方式顯示。"

msgid "In the menu, the heavier links will sink and the lighter links will be positioned nearer the top."
msgstr "在功能表中，較重的鏈結會排在下方，較輕的鏈結則位於上方。"

msgid "Displays the link in contextual links"
msgstr "顯示環境定義鏈結中的鏈結"

msgid "Default tab options"
msgstr "預設欄標選項"

msgid "When providing a menu link as a tab, Drupal needs to know what the parent menu link of that tab will be. Sometimes the parent will already exist, but other times you will need to have one created. The path of a parent link will always be the same path with the last part left off. i.e, if the path to this view is <em>foo/bar/baz</em>, the parent path would be <em>foo/bar</em>."
msgstr "提供功能表鏈結作為標籤時，Drupal 需要知道何者將是該標籤的母項功能表鏈結。有時，母項原本即已存在，但有時則需要由您建立。母項鏈結的路徑一律會與去掉最後一部分的路徑相同，亦即，如果此視圖的路徑為 <em>foo/bar/baz</em>，則母項路徑會是 <em>foo/bar</em>。"

msgid "Already exists"
msgstr "已經存在"

msgid "Normal menu link"
msgstr "一般功能表鏈結"

msgid "If creating a parent menu link, enter the title of the link."
msgstr "如果要建立母項功能表鏈結，請輸入鏈結的標題。"

msgid "If creating a parent menu link, enter the description of the link."
msgstr "如果要建立母項功能表鏈結，請輸入鏈結的說明。"

msgid "Tab weight"
msgstr "標籤次序"

msgid "If the parent menu link is a tab, enter the weight of the tab. Heavier tabs will sink and the lighter tabs will be positioned nearer to the first menu link."
msgstr "如果母項功能表鏈結是標籤，請輸入標籤的加權。較重的標籤會排在下方，較輕的標籤則會較靠近第一個功能表鏈結。"

msgid "Use the administration theme"
msgstr "使用管理佈景主題"

msgid "Paths starting with \"@admin\" always use the administration theme."
msgstr "以 \"@admin\" 開頭的路徑一律使用管理佈景主題。"

msgid "Views cannot create normal menu links for paths with a % in them."
msgstr "視圖在建立一般功能表鏈結時，不可在路徑中加上 %。"

msgid "A display whose path ends with a % cannot be a tab."
msgstr "路徑結尾為 % 的顯示畫面不可以是欄標。"

msgid "Title is required for this menu type."
msgstr "此選單類型的標題為必填"

msgid "Display @display is set to use a menu but the menu link text is not set."
msgstr "@display 檢視頁設定為使用選單，但選單連結文字尚未設定。"

msgid "Display @display is set to use a parent menu but the parent menu link text is not set."
msgstr "@display 檢視頁設定為使用父選單，但父選單連結文字尚未設定。"

msgid "When the filter value is <em>NOT</em> in the URL"
msgstr "當過濾器數值<em>不</em>在網址"

msgid "When the filter value <em>IS</em> in the URL or a default is provided"
msgstr "當過濾器數值<em>是</em>在網址或是有提供預設值"

msgid "The contextual filter values are provided by the URL."
msgstr "環境定義過濾器值由 URL 提供。"

msgid "Display the view as a page, with a URL and menu links."
msgstr "以頁面形式顯示視圖，內含 URL 和功能表鏈結。"

msgid "Page settings"
msgstr "頁面設定"

msgid "No path is set"
msgstr "未設定任何路徑"

msgid "The menu path or URL of this view"
msgstr "此視圖的功能表路徑或 URL"

msgid "This view will be displayed by visiting this path on your site. You may use \"%\" or named route parameters like \"%node\" in your URL to represent values that will be used for contextual filters: For example, \"node/%node/feed\" or \"view_path/%\". Named route parameters are required when this path matches an existing path. For example, paths such as \"taxonomy/term/%taxonomy_term\" or \"user/%user/custom-view\"."
msgstr "在您的網站上造訪此路徑，即會顯示此視圖。 您可以在 URL 中使用 \"%\" 或具名路徑參數（例如 \"%node\"）來代表將用於環境定義過濾器的值：例如 \"node/%node/feed\" 或 \"view_path/%\"。 當此路徑符合現有路徑時，需要具名路徑參數。 例如，路徑，例如 \"taxonomy/term/%taxonomy_term\" 或 \"user/%user/custom-view\"。"

msgid "\"%\" may not be used for the first segment of a path."
msgstr "\"%\" 不可用於路徑的第一個區段。"

msgid "Path is empty."
msgstr "路徑是空的。"

msgid "No query allowed."
msgstr "不容許查詢。"

msgid "Invalid path. Valid characters are alphanumerics as well as \"-\", \".\", \"_\" and \"~\"."
msgstr "路徑無效。有效的字元包含英數字元以及 \"-\"、\".\"、\"_\" 和 \"~\"。"

msgid "Numeric placeholders may not be used. Please use plain placeholders (%)."
msgstr "不得使用數值位置保留元。請使用一般位置保留元 (%)。"

msgid "Empty display extender"
msgstr "空的顯示延伸器"

msgid "Basic exposed form"
msgstr "基本公開表單"

msgid "Asc"
msgstr "遞增"

msgid "Desc"
msgstr "遞減"

msgid "Include reset button (resets all applied exposed filters)"
msgstr "包括重設按鈕（重設所有已套用的公開過濾器）"

msgid "Text to display in the reset button of the exposed form."
msgstr "顯露 (exposed) 表單的重設按鈕文字。"

msgid "Allow people to choose the sort order"
msgstr "容許人員選擇排序"

msgid "If sort order is not exposed, the sort criteria settings for each sort will determine its order."
msgstr "如果排序未公開，則將由每一個排序的排序準則設定決定其順序。"

msgid "Label for ascending sort"
msgstr "遞增排序的標籤"

msgid "Label for descending sort"
msgstr "遞減排序的標籤"

msgid "Select any filter and click on Apply to see results"
msgstr "選擇任一篩選器並按下套用 (Apply) 以檢視結果"

msgid "Text to display instead of results until the user selects and applies an exposed filter."
msgstr "在使用者選取並套用公開過濾器之前代替結果顯示的文字。"

msgid "An exposed form that only renders a view if the form contains user input."
msgstr "在表單包含使用者輸入時，僅呈現一個視圖的公開表單。"

msgid "If checked, true will be displayed as false."
msgstr "如果已勾選，true 將會顯示為 false。"

msgid "The title shown above the actions dropdown."
msgstr "動作下拉清單上方顯示的標題。"

msgid "All actions, except selected"
msgstr "所有動作，除了已選擇的之外。"

msgid "Only selected actions"
msgstr "只有已選動作"

msgid "Selected actions"
msgstr "已選動作"

msgid "Update this item"
msgstr "更新此項目"

msgid "Apply to selected items"
msgstr "套用至選取的項目"

msgid "No access to execute %action on the @entity_type_label %entity_label."
msgstr "沒有存取權可對 @entity_type_label %entity_label 執行 %action。"

msgid "No %title option selected."
msgstr "未選取 %title 選項。"

msgid "%action was applied to @count item."
msgid_plural "%action was applied to @count items."
msgstr[0] "已對 @count 項目執行 %action。"
msgstr[1] "已對 @count 項目執行 %action。"

msgid "Specify the number the counter should start at."
msgstr "指定計數器的開始數值。"

msgid "Time ago (with \"ago\" appended)"
msgstr "多久前 (加上「前」)"

msgid "Time hence"
msgstr "之後時間"

msgid "Time hence (with \"hence\" appended)"
msgstr "之後時間（後面附加「之後」）"

msgid "Time span (future dates have \"-\" prepended)"
msgstr "時間跨距（在前面附加 \"-\" 的未來日期）"

msgid "Time span (past dates have \"-\" prepended)"
msgstr "時間跨距（在前面附加 \"-\" 的過去日期）"

msgid "Time span (with \"ago/hence\" appended)"
msgstr "時間跨距（後面附加「之前/之後」）"

msgid "If \"Custom\", see <a href=\"https://www.php.net/manual/datetime.format.php#refsect1-datetime.format-parameters\" target=\"_blank\">the PHP docs</a> for date formats. Otherwise, enter the number of different time units to display, which defaults to 2."
msgstr "如果「自訂」，請參閱 <a href=\"https://www.php.net/manual/datetime.format.php#refsect1-datetime.format-parameters\" target=\"_blank\">PHP 文件</a>中的日期格式。否則，請輸入要顯示的不同時間單位數值，預設值為 2。"

msgid "Timezone to be used for date output."
msgstr "要用於日期輸出的時區。"

msgid "- Default site/user timezone -"
msgstr "- 預設網站或使用者時區 -"

msgid "%time ago"
msgstr "%time 之前"

msgid "%time hence"
msgstr "%time 之後"

msgid "Used by Style: Table to determine the actual column to click sort the field on. The default is usually fine."
msgstr "依樣式使用：該表格用來決定要點按哪一個直欄以排序欄位。通常只要使用預設值即可。"

msgid "If checked, field api classes will be added by field templates. This is not recommended unless your CSS depends upon these classes. If not checked, template will not be used."
msgstr "如果已勾選，欄位範本將會新增欄位 API 類別。除非您的 CSS 取決於這些類別，否則不建議這麼做。如果未勾選，則不會使用範本。"

msgid "Checking this option will cause the group Display Type and Separator values to be ignored."
msgstr "勾選此選項時，系統會忽略「群組顯示類型」和「分隔字元」值。"

msgid "Multiple field settings"
msgstr "多重欄位設定"

msgid "If checked, multiple values for this field will be shown in the same row. If not checked, each value in this field will create a new row. If using group by, please make sure to group by \"Entity ID\" for this setting to have any effect."
msgstr "如果已勾選，會將此欄位的多個值顯示在同一列中。如果未勾選，則此欄位中的每一個值會建立新的一列。如果使用分組方式，請務必依「實體 ID」來分組，此設定才會生效。"

msgid "Display @count value(s)"
msgstr "顯示 @count 個值"

msgid "Unordered list"
msgstr "無序列清單"

msgid "Ordered list"
msgstr "編號列表"

msgid "Simple separator"
msgstr "簡單分隔符號"

msgid "starting from @count"
msgstr "由 @count 開始"

msgid "(first item is 0)"
msgstr "(第一個項目為0)"

msgid "(start from last values)"
msgstr "(從最後一個值開始)"

msgid "Group column"
msgstr "群組欄位"

msgid "Select the column of this field to apply the grouping function selected above."
msgstr "選取此欄位中要套用在上方選取之分組函數的直欄。"

msgid "Group columns (additional)"
msgstr "群組直欄（其他）"

msgid "Select any additional columns of this field to include in the query and to group on."
msgstr "選取此欄位中要內含在查詢中並作為分組依據的任何其他直欄。"

msgid "Raw @column"
msgstr "原始 @column"

msgid "Make entity label a link to entity page."
msgstr "讓實體標籤成為實體頁面的鏈結。"

msgid "Use absolute link (begins with \"http://\")"
msgstr "使用絕對鏈結（以 \"http://\" 開頭）"

msgid "Enable this option to output an absolute link. Required if you want to use the path as a link destination."
msgstr "啟用此選項可輸出絕對鏈結。如果要將路徑用作鏈結目的地，則此為必要選項。"

msgid "delete"
msgstr "刪除"

msgid "edit"
msgstr "編輯"

msgid "Enforce a <code>destination</code> parameter in the link to return the user to the original view upon completing the link action. Most operations include a destination by default and this setting is no longer needed."
msgstr "在鏈結中強制執行 <code>destination</code> 參數，以讓使用者在完成鏈結動作時返回原始視圖。大部分作業依預設皆包含目的地，因此不再需要此設定。"

msgid "- Use default -"
msgstr "- 使用預設值 -"

msgid "Enable to load this field as hidden. Often used to group fields, or to use as token in another field."
msgstr "啟用時，將此欄位載入為隱藏項目。經常用來分組欄位，或作為另一個欄位中的記號。"

msgid "Style settings"
msgstr "樣式設定"

msgid "Customize field HTML"
msgstr "自定欄位 HTML"

msgid "Choose the HTML element to wrap around this field, e.g. H1, H2, etc."
msgstr "選擇要環繞此欄位的 HTML 元素，例如 H1、H2 等。"

msgid "Add HTML class"
msgstr "新增 HTML 類別"

msgid "You may use token substitutions from the rewriting section in this class."
msgstr "您可以在此類別中使用重新撰寫區段中的記號替代項。"

msgid "Customize label HTML"
msgstr "自定標籤 HTML"

msgid "Choose the HTML element to wrap around this label, e.g. H1, H2, etc."
msgstr "選擇要環繞此標籤的 HTML 元素，例如 H1、H2 等。"

msgid "Customize field and label wrapper HTML"
msgstr "自訂欄位和標籤封套 HTML"

msgid "Choose the HTML element to wrap around this field and label, e.g. H1, H2, etc. This may not be used if the field and label are not rendered together, such as with a table."
msgstr "選擇要環繞此欄位和標籤的 HTML 元素，例如 H1、H2 等。如果欄位和標籤未一起呈現（例如在表格中），則不會使用此選項。"

msgid "Use default Views classes to identify the field, field label and field content."
msgstr "使用預設視圖類別來識別欄位、欄位標籤和欄位內容。"

msgid "The text to display for this field. You may enter data from this view as per the \"Replacement patterns\" below. You may include <a href=\"@twig_docs\">Twig</a> or the following allowed HTML tags: <code>@tags</code>"
msgstr "要為此欄位顯示的文字。您可以根據下面的「取代型樣」，從此視圖輸入資料。您可以包括 <a href=\"@twig_docs\">Twig</a> 或下列容許的 HTML 標籤：<code>@tags</code>"

msgid "The Drupal path or absolute URL for this link. You may enter data from this view as per the \"Replacement patterns\" below."
msgstr "這個連結的 Drupal 路徑或絕對網址。你可以輸入以下的「替換匹配模式」"

msgid "Links to an external server using a full URL: e.g. 'http://www.example.com' or 'www.example.com'."
msgstr "使用完整 URL 鏈結至外部伺服器：例如，'http://www.example.com' 或 'www.example.com'。"

msgid "When printing URL paths, how to transform the case of the filter value."
msgstr "在列印 URL 路徑時，如何轉換過濾器值的大小寫。"

msgid "The CSS class to apply to the link."
msgstr "套用至連結的 CSS 類別。"

msgid "Text to place as \"title\" text which most browsers display as a tooltip when hovering over the link."
msgstr "要設置為 \"title\" 文字，大部分瀏覽器在游標移至鏈結上方時會將該文字顯示為工具提示。"

msgid "Include Rel attribute for use in lightbox2 or other javascript utility."
msgstr "包括要在 lightbox2 或其他 JavaScript 公用程式中使用的 Rel 屬性。"

msgid "Any text to display before this link. You may include HTML."
msgstr "此連結之前顯示的所有文字，可包含 HTML。"

msgid "Any text to display after this link. You may include HTML."
msgstr "此連結之後顯示的所有文字，可包含 HTML。"

msgid "Target of the link, such as _blank, _parent or an iframe's name. This field is rarely used."
msgstr "鏈結的目標，例如 _blank、_parent 或 iframe 的名稱。此欄位很少使用。"

msgid "You must add some additional fields to this display before using this field. These fields may be marked as <em>Exclude from display</em> if you prefer. Note that due to rendering order, you cannot use fields that come after this field; if you need a field not listed here, rearrange your fields."
msgstr "在使用此欄位之前，您必須先在此顯示畫面中新增某些其他欄位。如果您願意，可以將這些欄位標示為<em>排除而不顯示</em>。請注意，由於呈現順序，您無法使用位於此欄位後面的欄位；如果您需要此處未列出的欄位，請重新排列您的欄位。"

msgid "The following replacement tokens are available for this field. Note that due to rendering order, you cannot use fields that come after this field; if you need a field not listed here, rearrange your fields."
msgstr "下列是可用於此欄位的取代記號。請注意，由於呈現順序，您無法使用位於此欄位後面的欄位；如果您需要此處未列出的欄位，請重新排列您的欄位。"

msgid "If checked, this field be trimmed only on a word boundary. This is guaranteed to be the maximum characters stated or less. If there are no word boundaries this could trim a field to nothing."
msgstr "如果已勾選，則只會在字組界限內修整此欄位。這一定等於或小於所指定的字元數目上限。如果沒有字組界限，則有可能將一個欄位全部修整掉。"

msgid "You may use the \"Replacement patterns\" above."
msgstr "您可以使用上述「取代型樣」。"

msgid "This can be an internal Drupal path such as node/add or an external URL such as \"https://www.drupal.org\". You may use the \"Replacement patterns\" above."
msgstr "這可以是內部 Drupal 路徑（如 node/add）或外部 URL（如 \"https://www.drupal.org\"）。您可以使用上述「取代型樣」。"

msgid "An HTML corrector will be run to ensure HTML tags are properly closed after trimming."
msgstr "系統會執行 HTML 校正器，以確保 HTML 標籤在修整後會正確關閉。"

msgid "List the tags that need to be preserved during the stripping process. example &quot;&lt;p&gt; &lt;br&gt;&quot; which will preserve all p and br elements"
msgstr "列出在刪除程序執行期間需要保留的標籤。例如，&quot;&lt;p&gt; &lt;br&gt;&quot; 將會保留所有的 p 和 br 元素"

msgid "Convert newlines to HTML &lt;br&gt; tags"
msgstr "將換行符號轉換為 HTML &lt;br&gt; 標籤"

msgid "Provide text to display if this field contains an empty result. You may include HTML. You may enter data from this view as per the \"Replacement patterns\" in the \"Rewrite Results\" section above."
msgstr "提供此欄位包含空白結果時所要顯示的文字。您可以包括 HTML。您可以根據上面的「重新撰寫結果」區段中的「取代型樣」，從此視圖輸入資料。"

msgid "Enable to display the \"no results text\" if the field contains the number 0."
msgstr "啟用時，可在欄位包含數字 0 時顯示「沒有結果文字」。"

msgid "Enable to hide this field if it is empty. Note that the field label or rewritten output may still be displayed. To hide labels, check the style or row style settings for empty fields. To hide rewritten content, check the \"Hide rewriting if empty\" checkbox."
msgstr "啟用時，可在此欄位空白時予以隱藏。請注意，欄位標籤或重新撰寫的輸出仍可能會顯示。若要隱藏標籤，請勾選空白欄位的樣式或列樣式設定。若要隱藏重新撰寫內容，請勾選「如果空白則隱藏重新撰寫內容」勾選框。"

msgid "Do not display rewritten content if this field is empty."
msgstr "如果此欄位空白，則不顯示重新撰寫的內容。"

msgid "more"
msgstr "更多"

msgid "…"
msgstr "…"

msgid "The view %id failed to load an entity of type %entity_type at row %index for field %field"
msgstr "視圖 %id 無法載入欄位 %field 的 %index 橫列中類型為 %entity_type 的實體"

msgid "Formatted (in KB or MB)"
msgstr "已格式化 (KB 或 MB)"

msgid "Raw bytes"
msgstr "原始位元組"

msgid "link"
msgstr "連結"

msgid "Fields to be included as links."
msgstr "要內含作為鏈結的欄位。"

msgid "Include a \"destination\" parameter in the link to return the user to the original view upon completing the link action."
msgstr "在鏈結中包括 \"destination\" 參數，讓使用者在完成鏈結動作後返回原始視圖。"

msgid "Display field as machine name."
msgstr "將欄位顯示為機器名稱。"

msgid "If checked, the number will be rounded."
msgstr "如果已勾選，數字將會四捨五入。"

msgid "Specify how many digits to print after the decimal point."
msgstr "指定多少位數位在小數點後列印。"

msgid "What single character to use as a decimal point."
msgstr "使用哪個字元作為小數點。"

msgid "Decimal"
msgstr "小數"

msgid "What single character to use as the thousands separator."
msgstr "使用哪個字元作為千位數分隔符號。"

msgid "If checked, special handling will be used for plurality."
msgstr "如果已勾選，將會對複數進行特殊處理。"

msgid "Text to use for this variant, @count will be replaced with the value."
msgstr "要用於此變式的文字，@count 將取代為此值。"

msgid "Text to use for the singular form, @count will be replaced with the value."
msgstr "要用於單數型的文字，@count 將取代為此值。"

msgid "Text to use for the plural form, @count will be replaced with the value."
